"\"Journey to the Northern\n"
"Continent of Angara\"{page_break}"
"and \"All About the\n"
"Southern Continent of\n"
"Gondowan.\"{page_break}"
"{actor_name:1} learned that\n"
"Mt. Aleph is on the\n"
"western edge of Angara."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05402"
msgstr ""
"There is a book entitled\n"
"\"The Laws of Vale,\" which\n"
"describes Vale's customs.{page_break}"
"\"Get permission to\n"
"leave the village.{page_break}"
"Never show Psynergy\n"
"to outsiders...\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05403"
msgstr ""
"There is a book entitled\n"
"\"The Mighty Power of\n"
"Nature.\"{page_break}"
"\"The power beyond human\n"
"understanding can be\n"
"seen in volcanic eruptions{page_break}"
"and great floods...\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05404"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"The Psynergy Stone.\"{page_break}"
"\"Psynergy is replenished\n"
"by touching a Psynergy\n"
"Stone...\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05405"
msgstr ""
"There's a notebook\n"
"belonging to {actor_name:6}'s\n"
"aunt...{page_break}"
"It contains sketches\n"
"{actor_name:6}'s aunt and mother\n"
"drew as children."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05406"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"Making a Great Village.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05407"
msgstr ""
"There's a notebook called\n"
"\"Study of Alchemy.\"{page_break}"
"\"To understand Alchemy,\n"
"one must understand the\n"
"Elemental Powers...\"{page_break}"
"That's where the script\n"
"ends..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05408"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"In Search of the Ancient\n"
"Lemurians.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05409"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"The Fountain\n"
"of Tolbi.\"{page_break}"
"\"The fountain of Tolbi\n"
"will test your luck...\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05410"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"Encyclopedia of Alchemy.\"{page_break}"
"\"All things are composed\n"
"of four elements: earth,\n"
"water, fire, and wind...\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05411"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"Legend of Mt. Aleph.\"{page_break}"
"It says the mountain's\n"
"name refers to the origin\n"
"of all things..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05412"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"Being an Adept.\"{page_break}"
"\"Hone your Psynergy. Do\n"
"not use it for evil...\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05413"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"Etiquette for\n"
"Travelers.\"{page_break}"
"\"It is rude not to\n"
"introduce yourself to\n"
"the town's mayor.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05414"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"History of Vault, Vol 1.\"{page_break}"
"The book says the name\n"
"comes from being \"cooped\n"
"up in tiny place.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05415"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"Gems of Angara.\"{page_break}"
"It says nothing\n"
"about the rock\n"
"on the table."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05416"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"Gems of Angara.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05417"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"The Holy Tree of\n"
"Kolima Forest.\"{page_break}"
"\"Tret and Laurel are the\n"
"spirits of the holy trees\n"
"protecting Kolima forest.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05418"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"Dictionary of Trees\n"
"and Flowers.\"{page_break}"
"The book describes every\n"
"species of tree and\n"
"flower in Angara."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05419"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"The Art of Logging.\"{page_break}"
"\"One must study trees\n"
"and train one's body\n"
"well before logging.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05420"
msgstr ""
"There's a silk\n"
"negligee.{page_break}"
"{actor_name:1}! Put that back!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05421"
msgstr ""
"There's a sheet of paper\n"
"entitled \"Sweetie's Gifts.\"{page_break}"
"It's a list of the gifts\n"
"Lord McCoy has bought\n"
"his wife. It's pretty long."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05422"
msgstr ""
"There's a turban.{page_break}"
"It's the symbol\n"
"of Kalay's soldiers."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05423"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"Business and You.\"{page_break}"
"\"Trust between two people\n"
"is all-important for\n"
"a successful business.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05424"
msgstr ""
"There's a book entitled\n"
"\"The Good Host.\"{page_break}"
"\"Attention to detail\n"
"is key to good\n"
"hospitality...\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05425"
msgstr ""
"You can hear water\n"
"rumbling down there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05426"
msgstr ""
"The bottom of the well\n"
"is not visible.\n"
"It looks very deep."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05427"
msgstr ""
"Upon closer inspection,\n"
"it seems the well is\n"
"dried up."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05428"
msgstr ""
"It is a very clean,\n"
"well-maintained well."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05429"
msgstr ""
"It's filled with\n"
"fresh, clean water."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05430"
msgstr ""
"You can hear the sound\n"
"of frogs coming from\n"
"inside."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05431"
msgstr ""
"Oh, Kraden... How long\n"
"will this island\n"
"continue to drift?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05432"
msgstr ""
"I don't know...\n"
"I wish you could\n"
"tell me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05433"
msgstr ""
"Sheesh... You're no help\n"
"in times like this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05434"
msgstr "Hey, I'm hungry..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05435"
msgstr ""
"How can you think\n"
"about food?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05436"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what\n"
"happened to my\n"
"brother..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05437"
msgstr ""
"I can't be certain,{pause_20_skippable} but\n"
"it looks like they lit\n"
"the Venus beacon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05438"
msgstr ""
"You don't have to tell me\n"
"that. That's how we wound\n"
"up adrift at sea, right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05439"
msgstr ""
"You are so cranky\n"
"today, {actor_name:6}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05440"
msgstr ""
"Well,{pause_20_skippable} I suppose you\n"
"must be worried about\n"
"{actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05441"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1} and his friends\n"
"must have been\n"
"nearby, too."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05442"
msgstr "They probably were..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05443"
msgstr ""
"I miss them...\n"
"{actor_name:1}...\n"
"{actor_name:5}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05444"
msgstr ""
"There is something I\n"
"wish to show you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
