msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseAreYouSureWeShouldBeLeaving"
msgid "05488"
msgstr ""
"Are you sure we should\n"
"be leaving like this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05489"
msgstr ""
"Once we go down those\n"
"stairs, we can't get back\n"
"into the lighthouse."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05490"
msgstr ""
"Maybe I should have\n"
"stopped my brother..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05491"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:6}, is something\n"
"troubling you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05492"
msgstr "I just..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05493"
msgstr "What is it? What's wrong?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05494"
msgstr ""
"I have a bad feeling...{page_break}"
"Like something terrible\n"
"is going to happen."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05495"
msgstr "How unlike you, {actor_name:6}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05496"
msgstr "Surprised to see me?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05497"
msgstr ""
"A-Alex...\n"
"Were you listening?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05498"
msgstr ""
"Where's {actor_name:5}? Why isn't\n"
"he here with you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05499"
msgstr ""
"My brother?\n"
"He left us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05500"
msgstr ""
"What can {actor_name:5} possibly\n"
"be thinking?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05501"
msgstr ""
"He was worried about {actor_name:7}.\n"
"He went to check on her."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05502"
msgstr ""
"He was supposed to be\n"
"leading you out of here!{page_break}"
"I thought you would have\n"
"been far from this lighthouse\n"
"by now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05503"
msgstr "Why are you still here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05504"
msgstr ""
"We tried to stop {actor_name:5} from\n"
"going back up to the aerie."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05505"
msgstr ""
"How like him. Once {actor_name:5}\n"
"gets an idea into his head,\n"
"he rarely changes his mind."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05506"
msgstr ""
"Alex, what were you talking\n"
"about just now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05507"
msgstr ""
"What did you mean when\n"
"you said...{page_break}"
"\"How unlike you\"?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05508"
msgstr ""
"I was{pause_20_skippable} merely surprised\n"
"to hear you expressing\n"
"such concern, {actor_name:6}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05509"
msgstr ""
"Nevertheless, I'm impressed\n"
"{actor_name:5} went back..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05510"
msgstr ""
"Don't change the subject,\n"
"Alex! What did you mean!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05511"
msgstr ""
"Are you saying that\n"
"I'm insensitive!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05512"
msgstr ""
"If that's what you heard,\n"
"then I must have misspoken.\n"
"Accept my apologies."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05513"
msgstr ""
"Well, {actor_name:6}, I think\n"
"Alex has said his piece\n"
"on the matter..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05514"
msgstr ""
"I'm not sure he has,\n"
"Kraden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05515"
msgstr ""
"Who do you think you are,\n"
"talking to me like that!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05516"
msgstr ""
"I retract my statement,\n"
"my dear. Forget all about\n"
"it, {actor_name:6}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05517"
msgstr ""
"So tell me about this\n"
"\"feeling,\" {actor_name:6}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05518"
msgstr ""
"I'm just...{pause_20_skippable} I'm not sure we\n"
"should be leaving Venus\n"
"Lighthouse yet..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05519"
msgstr "What are you saying?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05520"
msgstr ""
"You can't really mean\n"
"to remain here..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05521"
msgstr ""
"Alex is right. It's far too\n"
"dangerous, {actor_name:6}.{page_break}"
"We would only hinder\n"
"the others..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05522"
msgstr ""
"The others? Did {actor_name:1}\n"
"follow us to the\n"
"lighthouse?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05523"
msgstr "It would seem so."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05524"
msgstr ""
"He must be trying to stop\n"
"Saturos and Menardi!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05525"
msgstr ""
"If my brother goes back and\n"
"finds {actor_name:1}, they're going\n"
"to end up fighting."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05526"
msgstr ""
"If the Venus Lighthouse\n"
"has not yet been lit,\n"
"yes. They will fight."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05527"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} is a terribly rash\n"
"young man, is he not?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05528"
msgstr ""
"Why are boys\n"
"such fools?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05529"
msgstr ""
"He may be rash, but {actor_name:5}\n"
"is no fool.{page_break}"
"His good qualities outweigh\n"
"his bad..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05530"
msgstr ""
"That's why I think\n"
"{actor_name:1} would understand\n"
"if we just talked to him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05531"
msgstr ""
"Why didn't I think of this\n"
"before now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05532"
msgstr ""
"Please...\n"
"Can't we go back up\n"
"and talk to {actor_name:1}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05533"
msgstr ""
"I'm afraid that's\n"
"not possible."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05534"
msgstr "Alex, why?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05535"
msgstr "He is an enemy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05536"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}? An enemy?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05537"
msgstr ""
"Our methods may differ,\n"
"but you and I ultimately\n"
"want the same thing..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05538"
msgstr ""
"To light the elemental\n"
"lighthouses..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05539"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1} and his friends\n"
"would prevent this from\n"
"happening."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05540"
msgstr "So that makes them enemies?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05541"
msgstr ""
"But fear not...\n"
"They won't be able to defeat\n"
"Saturos and Menardi."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05542"
msgstr ""
"So... {actor_name:5} went back to\n"
"the top of the lighthouse?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05543"
msgstr ""
"Why do you seem so\n"
"pleased, Alex?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05544"
msgstr ""
"Why shouldn't I be? After all,\n"
"the lighthouse will soon shine\n"
"brightly once again!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05545"
msgstr ""
"Alex, why do you want\n"
"to see the beacon lit\n"
"so badly?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05546"
msgstr ""
"Oh, so it's my turn to answer\n"
"questions, is it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05547"
msgstr ""
"Once, Alchemy was commonplace\n"
"throughout this world..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05548"
msgstr ""
"With its power, mankind worked\n"
"wonders across the land..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05549"
msgstr "The lost age of man..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05550"
msgstr ""
"I want to see that world\n"
"restored once again, and..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05551"
msgstr "And what, Alex?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05552"
msgstr ""
"We've spoken long enough\n"
"already. Let us continue\n"
"this another time."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05553"
msgstr ""
"We should leave the\n"
"lighthouse now, before\n"
"the beacon is fired..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05554"
msgstr ""
"I concur... Let's meet at the\n"
"location we agreed on\n"
"and wait for {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05555"
msgstr ""
"All right, Kraden,\n"
"let's go."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05556"
msgstr ""
"No, {actor_name:6}, not\n"
"that way.{page_break}"
"We must get away from\n"
"the lighthouse."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05557"
msgstr ""
"The chest was already open.{page_break}"
"But it looks like there's\n"
"still {argument_item_name:2} inside!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05558"
msgstr ""
"You found {argument_item_name:2}.{page_break}"
"It looks like there's also\n"
"{argument_item_name:2} inside."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThereTheyAre"
msgid "05559"
msgstr ""
"There they are!\n"
"Get 'em!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05560"
msgstr ""
"Iodem sent us to stand\n"
"guard here, but..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05561"
msgstr ""
"I never thought we'd\n"
"actually run into them!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05562"
msgstr ""
"Scoundrels! What have you\n"
"done with {actor_name:7}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05563"
msgstr ""
"Return her now, or you're\n"
"really going to regret it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05564"
msgstr ""
"Um...{pause_20_skippable} Aren't there supposed\n"
"to be more of them?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05565"
msgstr ""
"Huh... Maybe they're just the\n"
"first ones to come out..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05566"
msgstr ""
"Great! That means we've\n"
"got 'em outnumbered!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05567"
msgstr ""
"We can probably take\n"
"'em, you think?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05568"
msgstr ""
"Go fetch the other Tolbi\n"
"soldiers still stationed\n"
"in Lalivero..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05569"
msgstr "Yes, sir!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05570"
msgstr ""
"And we'll go tell the guys\n"
"in the caves!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05571"
msgstr "Got it, Boss!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05572"
msgstr ""
"How unfortunate... It looks\n"
"like an ambush. What should\n"
"we do, {actor_name:6}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05573"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean? Look\n"
"around... We'll have to\n"
"fight them!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05574"
msgstr "Are you serious?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05575"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:6}, are you really prepared\n"
"to fight these men?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05576"
msgstr ""
"We don't have any other\n"
"choice. We have to..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05577"
msgstr ""
"Well, then. Allow me to\n"
"shoulder some of your\n"
"burden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05578"
msgstr "...Burden?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05579"
msgstr ""
"We regroup along the road\n"
"leading away from Lalivero.\n"
"Do you understand?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05580"
msgstr ""
"You don't need to remind us,\n"
"Alex. We know the place."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05581"
msgstr ""
"It's quite simple, {actor_name:6}.\n"
"The meeting place is in the\n"
"direction opposite Lalivero."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05582"
msgstr ""
"Follow this road west, and\n"
"take the path down through\n"
"the canyon to the cave."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05583"
msgstr ""
"On the other side of that\n"
"cave, you will find a small\n"
"peninsula called Idejima.{page_break}"
"We meet there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05584"
msgstr ""
"Thankfully, only those\n"
"workmen block your route."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05585"
msgstr "And fortunately..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05586"
msgstr "They don't look too tough..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05587"
msgstr "Hello! We can hear you!!!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05588"
msgstr "That's just plain rude!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05589"
msgstr ""
"Why don't the two of you\n"
"escape and leave the Tolbi\n"
"soldiers to me?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05590"
msgstr "The two of us? Alone?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05591"
msgstr ""
"You can use Psynergy,\n"
"can't you, {actor_name:6}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05592"
msgstr "Um... Yes."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05593"
msgstr "Then you'll be fine."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05594"
msgstr ""
"We shall reconvene\n"
"at the peninsula."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05595"
msgstr ""
"You think you can take on\n"
"Tolbi's finest on your own,\n"
"little man?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05596"
msgstr ""
"I do not wish to inflict\n"
"unnecessary bloodshed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05597"
msgstr ""
"Don't wish to...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"What's that supposed\n"
"to mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05598"
msgstr ""
"If you lay a hand on these\n"
"two, I assure you that you\n"
"will be made to regret it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05599"
msgstr ""
"By advancing, I assume you\n"
"mean to fight. Permit me\n"
"to strike the first blow."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05600"
msgstr "What was {text_effect:4}that{reset_text_style}!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05601"
msgstr ""
"I don't know, but whatever\n"
"he did, it's out of our\n"
"league!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05602"
msgstr ""
"You guys deal with him\n"
"until backup arrives!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05603"
msgstr "Oh, so you're next?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05604"
msgstr ""
"Hey, no need to\n"
"worry about us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05605"
msgstr ""
"We're not soldiers...\n"
"We're not anybody!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05606"
msgstr ""
"Seriously, there's no\n"
"way we're gonna face\n"
"off against you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05607"
msgstr "Let's get outta here!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05608"
msgstr ""
"How undignified...\n"
"and how shameful."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05609"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:6}, now is your\n"
"chance. Go to Idejima\n"
"and wait for me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05610"
msgstr ""
"I'm not finished\n"
"with you yet."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05611"
msgstr ""
"You mentioned backup\n"
"from Lalivero?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05612"
msgstr ""
"Let's go meet them\n"
"together, shall we?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05613"
msgstr ""
"Hey, pal! When they\n"
"get here, you'll really\n"
"be in for it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05614"
msgstr ""
"Do you honestly believe\n"
"that even a hundred of\n"
"you could stop me?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05615"
msgstr ""
"How amusing...\n"
"This I must see."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05616"
msgstr "They're gone..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05617"
msgstr ""
"Come on, {actor_name:6}...\n"
"Let's be going."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05618"
msgstr ""
"There's nothing standing\n"
"in our way now!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05619"
msgstr "But..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05620"
msgstr "What is it now?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05621"
msgstr ""
"Ah... You're worried about\n"
"hurting any innocents?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05622"
msgstr ""
"Well, just try to hold back\n"
"when you're fighting."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05623"
msgstr ""
"Oh. You must be concerned\n"
"about {actor_name:5}. We can't do\n"
"anything to help him here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05624"
msgstr ""
"Let's get going!\n"
"To the peninsula!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAreAreYou"
msgid "05625"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:6}... Are...\n"
"Are you all right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05626"
msgstr ""
"Ah, {actor_name:6}...\n"
"You're awake."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05627"
msgstr "Can you stand?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05628"
msgstr ""
"It's a good thing I came\n"
"back for you two..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05629"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps you ought to\n"
"come with us this time..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05630"
msgstr ""
"No. Someone has to keep\n"
"Tolbi's soldiers at bay."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05631"
msgstr ""
"I'll have to go to Lalivero\n"
"and confront them there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05632"
msgstr "We'll meet at Idejima."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05633"
msgstr "He's gone again."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05634"
msgstr ""
"And we'd best be\n"
"going as well..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05635"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:6}, escape\n"
"to the boat!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhyDoI"
msgid "05636"
msgstr ""
"Why do I gotta be the\n"
"one to wait for backup!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05637"
msgstr ""
"Yaaah! P-P-Please!\n"
"Just let me go, and...\n"
"Hey!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05638"
msgstr ""
"That scary guy with the\n"
"blue hair's not with you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05639"
msgstr ""
"Great! Now, you'll see\n"
"what I'm really made of!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgUggghICan"
msgid "05640"
msgstr ""
"Ugggh. I can't believe I\n"
"got beaten by a girl..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWaahhhItS"
msgid "05641"
msgstr "Waahhh! It's them!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05642"
msgstr ""
"Whoa there... Where'd the\n"
"blue-haired guy go?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05643"
msgstr ""
"Who cares! I can handle\n"
"some girl and her grandpa!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOoooogMaybeI"
msgid "05644"
msgstr ""
"Ooooog. Maybe I shouldn't\n"
"have underestimated her..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHaThatWas"
msgid "05645"
msgstr ""
"Ha! That was a good idea,\n"
"waiting here for 'em!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05646"
msgstr ""
"You two aren't going\n"
"anywhere!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05647"
msgstr ""
"Except with us, back\n"
"to Master Iodem!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMaybeIShould"
msgid "05648"
msgstr ""
"Maybe I should have\n"
"eaten a bigger breakfast."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAllRightSo"
msgid "05649"
msgstr ""
"All right, so maybe you\n"
"are going somewhere\n"
"after all..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOhManThere"
msgid "05650"
msgstr ""
"Oh, man... There goes\n"
"my big promotion..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyThatWas"
msgid "05651"
msgstr ""
"My! That was invigorating!\n"
"He wasn't too strong..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05652"
msgstr ""
"I never knew fighting could\n"
"be so fun!{pause_20_skippable} Ah, but we'd better\n"
"get on to the peninsula..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNotThatWayThe"
msgid "05653"
msgstr ""
"Not that way, {actor_name:6}!\n"
"The meeting spot\n"
"is west of here.{page_break}"
"We must go down that\n"
"road and into the hills."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNotThatWay"
msgid "05654"
msgstr ""
"Not that way, {actor_name:6}!\n"
"The meeting spot\n"
"is down this way.{page_break}"
"We must climb down here\n"
"and go into that cave."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseReliefWords"
msgid "05655"
msgstr ""
"There are words carved\n"
"into the relief...{page_break}"
"If ye seek to climb\n"
"Venus Lighthouse, first\n"
"seek the power within.{page_break}"
"To obtain this power, see\n"
"with the eyes of truth.\n"
"Then the way shall open.{page_break}"
"But the path I reveal is\n"
"not the beginning.{page_break}"
"The true beginning lies\n"
"down ancient pathways\n"
"on distant soils."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseTrueHeart"
msgid "05656"
msgstr ""
"The true road can only\n"
"be known by he who bears\n"
"a true heart."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgIdejimaIsThisThePlace"
msgid "05657"
msgstr ""
"This is the place,\n"
"isn't it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05658"
msgstr ""
"The peninsula at the end\n"
"of the road to the west...\n"
"That's what he told us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05659"
msgstr "This must be Idejima!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05660"
msgstr ""
"Hm... Menardi said a ship\n"
"would be here..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05661"
msgstr ""
"We ought to see if\n"
"we can find it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05662"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}, it's over here!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05663"
msgstr ""
"At first glance, it seems\n"
"like a normal ship, but..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05664"
msgstr ""
"There's something {pause_20_skippable}odd\n"
"about it..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05665"
msgstr ""
"Kraden, wait! Oh, I swear!\n"
"You're like a kid with a\n"
"new toy!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05666"
msgstr "Hurry up in there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05667"
msgstr "What's wrong?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05668"
msgstr "It's missing..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05669"
msgstr ""
"Hm? What are you\n"
"talking about?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05670"
msgstr ""
"The thingie...\n"
"that makes it go."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05671"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean? What's so\n"
"important about this...thingie?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05672"
msgstr "The boat can't move without it..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05673"
msgstr ""
"That Menardi!\n"
"She tricked us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05674"
msgstr "Tricked us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05675"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, by passing this\n"
"dud boat off on us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05676"
msgstr ""
"There's no trick. If this\n"
"boat is a dud, how did it\n"
"get here in the first place?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05677"
msgstr "Oh, right."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05678"
msgstr ""
"It must have been\n"
"the orb..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05679"
msgstr "What orb?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05680"
msgstr ""
"Don't you remember that\n"
"crystal Saturos was\n"
"carrying?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05681"
msgstr "That big, black pearl thing?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05682"
msgstr ""
"I'm certain he said he\n"
"could move the ship\n"
"with it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05683"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}, Kraden!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05684"
msgstr "There you are."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05685"
msgstr ""
"I see you've found\n"
"the boat."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05686"
msgstr ""
"We set sail as soon as the\n"
"beacon has been fired,\n"
"correct?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05687"
msgstr "Strange..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05688"
msgstr "What is it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05689"
msgstr ""
"The beacon...\n"
"It hasn't been lit yet."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05690"
msgstr ""
"You're right...\n"
"Why is it taking so long?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05691"
msgstr ""
"And why hasn't my\n"
"brother returned?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheyVeDone"
msgid "05692"
msgstr ""
"They've done it, {actor_name:6}!\n"
"They've lit the beacon!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05693"
msgstr ""
"What's happening, Kraden!?\n"
"Why won't the ground stop\n"
"shaking?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05694"
msgstr ""
"Strange... I think it might\n"
"actually be getting worse!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05695"
msgstr ""
"I think the lighthouse is\n"
"collapsing! Look! The ground\n"
"around it is crumbling!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05696"
msgstr ""
"Mercury Lighthouse didn't\n"
"react this way... What\n"
"makes Venus different?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05697"
msgstr ""
"That last tremor tore a\n"
"rift in the Suhalla Range!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05698"
msgstr ""
"How are we going to get\n"
"back to Gondowan now!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05699"
msgstr ""
"Idejima... It's drifting away\n"
"from the mainland!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05700"
msgstr ""
"But...what will\n"
"happen to us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIdejimaHowLongWillWeDrift"
msgid "05701"
msgstr ""
"Oh, Kraden... How long\n"
"will this island\n"
"continue to drift?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05702"
msgstr ""
"I don't know...\n"
"I wish you could\n"
"tell me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05703"
msgstr ""
"Sheesh... You're no help\n"
"in times like this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05704"
msgstr "Hey, I'm hungry..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05705"
msgstr ""
"How can you even\n"
"think about food?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05706"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what happened\n"
"to my brother..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05707"
msgstr ""
"I can't be certain,{pause_20_skippable} but\n"
"it looks like they lit\n"
"the Venus beacon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05708"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, I know. You don't have to\n"
"tell me that. That's how we\n"
"wound up adrift at sea, right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05709"
msgstr ""
"My, aren't you cranky\n"
"today, {actor_name:6}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05710"
msgstr ""
"Well,{pause_20_skippable} I suppose you're\n"
"just worried about\n"
"{actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05711"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1} and the others\n"
"must have been at the\n"
"lighthouse, too."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05712"
msgstr "I suspect you're right..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05713"
msgstr ""
"I miss them...\n"
"{actor_name:1}... {actor_name:5}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05714"
msgstr "Come with me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05715"
msgstr ""
"There is something I wish\n"
"to show you."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05716"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}... {actor_name:7}..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05717"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}! {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05718"
msgstr "They... {pause_20_skippable}They're alive..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05719"
msgstr "They're really alive!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05720"
msgstr ""
"What is this?\n"
"Alex, what happened?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIdejimaThoughtTheyWereInsideLighthouse"
msgid "05721"
msgstr ""
"I thought {actor_name:5} and\n"
"{actor_name:7} were still\n"
"inside the lighthouse."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05722"
msgstr "It's miraculous..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05723"
msgstr ""
"Miracle or no, I'm just\n"
"happy my brother's alive."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05724"
msgstr "What happened back there?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "05725"
msgstr "..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05726"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05727"
msgstr "{text_effect:4}Oh...{reset_text_style}"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05728"
msgstr ""
"Thank the elements,\n"
"she's awake!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05729"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7}, are you all right?\n"
"It's me, {actor_name:6}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05730"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05731"
msgstr "What...happened?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05732"
msgstr ""
"It seems you drifted\n"
"here with {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05733"
msgstr "With {actor_name:5}...?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05734"
msgstr ""
"Take your time... Do you\n"
"feel all right, {actor_name:7}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05735"
msgstr "Where are we?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05736"
msgstr ""
"Idejima. We were all to\n"
"meet here...{page_break}"
"But now, the island is\n"
"floating away from Gondowan."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05737"
msgstr "This island is{pause_20_skippable} moving?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05738"
msgstr ""
"I know it must be very\n"
"hard to believe, {actor_name:7}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05739"
msgstr ""
"When the Venus Lighthouse\n"
"was lit, a massive tremor\n"
"tore us off the continent..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05740"
msgstr ""
"The ground beneath the\n"
"lighthouse roiled, as though\n"
"it might crumble away."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05741"
msgstr ""
"I remember now...\n"
"And that's what carried\n"
"us away from Gondowan."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05742"
msgstr ""
"But what happened to\n"
"you, {actor_name:7}?{page_break}"
"You were in the sea,\n"
"and Saturos°"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05743"
msgstr ""
"Saturos and Menardi\n"
"are gone..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05744"
msgstr "What do you mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05745"
msgstr ""
"Another group came...\n"
"They fought Saturos and\n"
"Menardi and won."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05746"
msgstr "Was it {actor_name:1}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05747"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}...\n"
"Yes, I think that's what\n"
"they called him..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05748"
msgstr ""
"You expect me to believe\n"
"{actor_name:1} and his companions\n"
"defeated Saturos and Menardi?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05749"
msgstr ""
"Have they really grown\n"
"so powerful in so short\n"
"a time?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05750"
msgstr ""
"But how did you wind\n"
"up in the sea?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05751"
msgstr ""
"When the beacon was lit,\n"
"the earthquake knocked me\n"
"off the lighthouse tower."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05752"
msgstr ""
"Then what's my brother\n"
"doing here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05753"
msgstr ""
"He tried to save me\n"
"from drowning..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05754"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} jumped from the top\n"
"of the lighthouse!?\n"
"Dear me!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05755"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}...\n"
"are you awake?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05756"
msgstr "Ah! {actor_name:5}, you're awake!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05757"
msgstr "Brother..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05758"
msgstr ""
"Are you sure you should\n"
"be standing?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05759"
msgstr ""
"You don't seem very\n"
"surprised to find yourself\n"
"on a floating island."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05760"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}, once you'd saved\n"
"{actor_name:7}, you must have\n"
"swum out here, correct?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05761"
msgstr ""
"You must have seen that\n"
"this island was floating\n"
"when you were swimming."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05762"
msgstr "But what do we do now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05763"
msgstr ""
"I have no idea. Nobody\n"
"knows what lies beyond\n"
"the Eastern Sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05764"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately, I am a\n"
"student of Alchemy,\n"
"not geography..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05765"
msgstr "What is it...Alex?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05766"
msgstr "What's the matter?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05767"
msgstr "Can't you see it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05768"
msgstr "It's land! An island!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05769"
msgstr ""
"It's a little...\n"
"big for an island."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05770"
msgstr ""
"That's no island...\n"
"It's a new continent!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeReSaved"
msgid "05771"
msgstr "We're saved!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05772"
msgstr "So it would seem..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05773"
msgstr "Wait..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05774"
msgstr "What is it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05775"
msgstr ""
"We're going to pass north\n"
"of the continent..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05776"
msgstr "She's right!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05777"
msgstr ""
"I don't think we're going\n"
"to make it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05778"
msgstr ""
"Oh, Kraden... {actor_name:5}...\n"
"What are we going to do?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05779"
msgstr "???"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05780"
msgstr "Oh... This can't be good."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05781"
msgstr "What...is it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05782"
msgstr "It's...a tidal wave."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05783"
msgstr "A tidal wave?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05784"
msgstr ""
"The earthquake must\n"
"have caused it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05785"
msgstr ""
"Oh... Oh my... It's\n"
"coming right at us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05786"
msgstr ""
"Alex... How can you\n"
"stay so calm at a\n"
"time like this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05787"
msgstr ""
"At times like this, where\n"
"would be the good in\n"
"panicking?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05788"
msgstr "We'll be washed away!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05789"
msgstr "Help!!!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgIdejimaCheckForInjuries"
msgid "05790"
msgstr ""
"Do you want to check\n"
"yourself for injuries?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05791"
msgstr ""
"Looks like the arms are\n"
"still attached. That's a\n"
"good start."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05792"
msgstr ""
"The legs are working\n"
"fine, too.{pause_20_skippable} Yup. You're fine!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05793"
msgstr ""
"You walk around a bit,\n"
"and everything seems fine."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIdejimaGroan"
msgid "05794"
msgstr "Oooog..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05795"
msgstr "Oh... {actor_name:5}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05796"
msgstr "Ouch..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05797"
msgstr "That was quite a blow..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05798"
msgstr ""
"What happened when\n"
"that wave hit?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05799"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, look!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05800"
msgstr ""
"That wave carried us\n"
"to the continent!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05801"
msgstr ""
"We've hit solid land!\n"
"Let's go, {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05802"
msgstr ""
"Kraden has joined\n"
"your party."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIdejimaAwakeningExclamation"
msgid "05803"
msgstr "What..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05804"
msgstr ""
"What am I doing\n"
"down here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05805"
msgstr ""
"Oh... I must have blacked\n"
"out when the wave hit..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05806"
msgstr "Hey! We've hit land!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05807"
msgstr ""
"That wave must have\n"
"carried us here! What luck!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05808"
msgstr ""
"Have you checked everyone\n"
"else? Are they all right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05809"
msgstr "Great! Then let's go!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05810"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:6} has joined\n"
"your party."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05811"
msgstr ""
"Then let's go find them\n"
"and get off this island!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05812"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:6} has\n"
"joined your party."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIdejimaSecondGroan"
msgid "05813"
msgstr "Ohhh..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05814"
msgstr "Nnng."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05815"
msgstr "The wave!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05816"
msgstr ""
"What happened to\n"
"the tidal wave?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05817"
msgstr ""
"I thought we were done\n"
"for, but we're all fine..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05818"
msgstr "And we've run aground!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05819"
msgstr ""
"That tidal wave turned out\n"
"to be a stroke of luck!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05820"
msgstr "I wonder where we are..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05821"
msgstr "We should take a look around!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05822"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} has\n"
"joined your party."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIdejimaHeyFelix"
msgid "05823"
msgstr "Hey, {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05824"
msgstr ""
"You weren't planning on\n"
"leaving me, were you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05825"
msgstr "Hm?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05826"
msgstr "Well! It's land!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05827"
msgstr ""
"The wave carried us\n"
"back ashore!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05828"
msgstr ""
"I assume you merely...forgot\n"
"about me in your excitement?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05829"
msgstr ""
"Understandable, but you\n"
"should have waited for\n"
"me, {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05830"
msgstr ""
"Nevertheless, let us\n"
"be on our way!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05831"
msgstr ""
"Kraden has\n"
"joined your party."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIdejimaCantBelieveYouTwo"
msgid "05832"
msgstr "I can't believe you two!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05833"
msgstr "How could you!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05834"
msgstr ""
"Leaving me on that island\n"
"while you go off exploring\n"
"on your own!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05835"
msgstr ""
"And here I was, looking\n"
"everywhere for you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05836"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry, my dear...\n"
"Can you ever forgive us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05837"
msgstr ""
"Oh...{pause_20_skippable} All right. Just don't\n"
"leave me alone like that\n"
"again..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05838"
msgstr ""
"Anyway, look!\n"
"That wave must have carried\n"
"us to a new continent!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05839"
msgstr "Let's go exploring!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05840"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:6} has\n"
"joined your party."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIdejimaWaitForMe"
msgid "05841"
msgstr "Wa-Wait!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05842"
msgstr ""
"Aren't you worried about\n"
"me in the slightest?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05843"
msgstr ""
"Did you rescue me from the\n"
"lighthouse just to leave me\n"
"for dead on this island?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05844"
msgstr ""
"Now, I'm sure he meant\n"
"to do no such thing..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05845"
msgstr "I wonder..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05846"
msgstr ""
"Oh, don't give me that\n"
"sad face... You know I\n"
"can't stay mad at you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05847"
msgstr ""
"After all, you did save\n"
"me, {actor_name:5}. I won't\n"
"soon forget that..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05848"
msgstr ""
"But don't leave me behind\n"
"like that again, OK?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05849"
msgstr ""
"So that big wave pushed us\n"
"aground? Way to go, Nature!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05850"
msgstr "What's out here, anyway?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05851"
msgstr ""
"That's what we were\n"
"about to find out!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05852"
msgstr "Let's get started, then!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05853"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} has\n"
"joined your party."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIdejimaWhereHasAlexGone"
msgid "05854"
msgstr ""
"By the way...\n"
"Where has Alex gone?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05855"
msgstr ""
"He doesn't seem to be\n"
"anywhere on the island."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05856"
msgstr ""
"You don't think he set\n"
"out on his own, do you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05857"
msgstr ""
"Then I guess there's no\n"
"reason to look for him here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05858"
msgstr ""
"Well, he's no longer on\n"
"Idejima, at any rate."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05859"
msgstr ""
"He might have gone\n"
"to look for a ship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05860"
msgstr "Alex wants a ship?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05861"
msgstr ""
"Did you forget what\n"
"he was saying?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05862"
msgstr ""
"He wants to return Alchemy\n"
"to its former place in the world."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05863"
msgstr ""
"Then you know he wants\n"
"to restore Alchemy to the\n"
"world."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05864"
msgstr ""
"By lighting the four\n"
"elemental lighthouses, he\n"
"might just succeed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05865"
msgstr "But why the ship?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05866"
msgstr ""
"The remaining two\n"
"lighthouses are\n"
"unreachable by land."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05867"
msgstr ""
"None remain to be lit\n"
"across the Eastern Sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05868"
msgstr "So what should we°"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05869"
msgstr ""
"We must go to the Great\n"
"Western Sea..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05870"
msgstr "The Western Sea..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05871"
msgstr ""
"Is that where we're going,\n"
"{actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05872"
msgstr ""
"Well said, {actor_name:5}!\n"
"And go there, we shall!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05873"
msgstr ""
"Don't be foolish, {actor_name:5}.\n"
"We must pursue Alex.\n"
"We have to go there..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05874"
msgstr ""
"That's right! Our parents'\n"
"lives depend on it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05875"
msgstr "What about you, {actor_name:7}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05876"
msgstr "What do you mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05877"
msgstr ""
"It's...not going to be\n"
"an easy trip."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05878"
msgstr ""
"And there is no reason you\n"
"should have to face that\n"
"danger... Right, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05879"
msgstr ""
"Then you should know my\n"
"reason for traveling with\n"
"all of you, {actor_name:5}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05880"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} remembers...\n"
"I have a reason to be\n"
"traveling with you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05881"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean,\n"
"{actor_name:7}? What reason?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "05882"
