"collided with Osenia...\n"
"Everyone's talking about it.{page_break}"
"As if dealing with\n"
"invading pirate soldiers\n"
"wasn't enough!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSSoWeird"
msgid "06253"
msgstr ""
"It's so weird that we can\n"
"just walk to Osenia now.\n"
"Crazy, crazy world..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheseAreRough"
msgid "06254"
msgstr ""
"These are rough times...\n"
"We don't have nearly\n"
"enough people to help us."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgYouCominThrough"
msgid "06255"
msgstr "You comin' through here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYeahWellWe"
msgid "06256"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, well...{pause_20_skippable} We're workin'\n"
"in the hole right now, so...{page_break}"
"Until we're done here,\n"
"you're gonna have to enter\n"
"Madra through the gates."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06257"
msgstr ""
"That's good, 'cause we can't\n"
"let anyone through right now.{page_break}"
"If you're goin' to Madra, you're\n"
"gonna have to go through\n"
"the front gates."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheChampaDug"
msgid "06258"
msgstr ""
"The Champa dug this hole\n"
"when they raided our town,\n"
"but there's more to it...{page_break}"
"The hole they dug uncovered\n"
"a cave that runs all the way\n"
"under our town!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFieldCaveFoundByChampa"
msgid "06259"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe the Champa\n"
"just stumbled onto this\n"
"cave accidentally...{page_break}"
"That's like winning the\n"
"lottery or something!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFieldWhoDugCave"
msgid "06260"
msgstr ""
"Who dug this cave?{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"And why?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheTownElder"
msgid "06261"
msgstr ""
"The town elder took off\n"
"to deal with Briggs...\n"
"I wonder where he is now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouPickedThe"
msgid "06262"
msgstr ""
"You picked the wrong\n"
"time to come to Madra...{page_break}"
"We've had disasters, pirate\n"
"attacks, all sorts of\n"
"nonsense..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatBigWave"
msgid "06263"
msgstr ""
"That big wave moved the\n"
"whole continent of Indra\n"
"to the south.{page_break}"
"Now, we're sandwiched\n"
"between the two continents\n"
"of Gondowan and Osenia."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLetMeGuess"
msgid "06264"
msgstr ""
"Let me guess... You want\n"
"a boat, right?{page_break}"
"Look, like I told that last\n"
"guy, the tidal wave went\n"
"and ruined all our boats!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMaybeWeLl"
msgid "06265"
msgstr ""
"Maybe we'll learn Briggs's\n"
"whereabouts from that\n"
"captured Champa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfICould"
msgid "06266"
msgstr ""
"If I could walk to Osenia,\n"
"I'd like to see Air's Rock,\n"
"out near Garoh."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgDidYouCome"
msgid "06267"
msgstr ""
"Did you come here over\n"
"the Dehkan Plateau?{page_break}"
"Yeah? You must have\n"
"seen that boat grounded\n"
"near the cave, right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06268"
msgstr ""
"I hear it was a Champa\n"
"boat! And on it, they found\n"
"an unconscious Champa!{page_break}"
"So they nabbed him, of\n"
"course, and they tossed\n"
"him in our jail!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06269"
msgstr ""
"You didn't? Weird...{page_break}"
"I wonder if it\n"
"drifted away..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSLike"
msgid "06270"
msgstr ""
"It's like all three\n"
"continents got together to\n"
"form a supercontinent!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheChampaWere"
msgid "06271"
msgstr ""
"The Champa were swarming\n"
"over the village...{page_break}"
"But I screamed like the\n"
"dickens and scared 'em\n"
"off! It's true! Heh!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThoseChampaCurs"
msgid "06272"
msgstr ""
"Those Champa curs dug a\n"
"hole here to sneak into\n"
"Madra...{page_break}"
"And to think, it was just a\n"
"decoy so they could break into\n"
"the prison... What a crazy plan!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDoubtThe"
msgid "06273"
msgstr ""
"I doubt the Champa could\n"
"have come up with that\n"
"plan on their own...{page_break}"
"I'm not even sure that\n"
"strange boat we found up\n"
"north is even theirs..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIGotSomeone"
msgid "06274"
msgstr ""
"I got someone to show\n"
"me around inside... It's\n"
"just a really big hole.{page_break}"
"Nobody could dig that much\n"
"in such a short time without\n"
"us noticing, you'd think..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDonTCare"
msgid "06275"
msgstr ""
"I don't care what the elder\n"
"says... That prisoner is\n"
"filthy Champa scum!{page_break}"
"Until someone proves\n"
"otherwise, I say, let\n"
"him rot!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeTookThat"
msgid "06276"
msgstr ""
"We took that unconscious\n"
"guy from the boat and\n"
"tossed him in jail.{page_break}"
"He keeps saying that\n"
"he's not Champa, though."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyFriendWas"
msgid "06277"
msgstr ""
"My friend was on guard\n"
"duty when Briggs's\n"
"men attacked...{page_break}"
"Who would let a menace\n"
"like Briggs go free?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyPartnerWas"
msgid "06278"
msgstr ""
"My partner was guarding\n"
"the prison...{page_break}"
"When the Champa attacked,\n"
"he was so scared, he ran\n"
"off. Disgraceful!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEveryoneThinksBriggs"
msgid "06279"
msgstr ""
"Everyone thinks Briggs\n"
"fled to the east after the\n"
"breakout...{page_break}"
"I think that must be\n"
"where the elder went\n"
"with the others."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheTownElderIs"
msgid "06280"
msgstr ""
"The town elder is getting\n"
"pretty elderly. I hope he's\n"
"OK, traveling out there..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfABig"
msgid "06281"
msgstr ""
"If a big wave can move\n"
"the whole continent of\n"
"Indra...{page_break}"
"Does that mean that all\n"
"of Indra is just floating\n"
"on the water?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSABit"
msgid "06282"
msgstr ""
"It's a bit of a problem that\n"
"the tidal wave destroyed\n"
"our boats...{page_break}"
"But the tidal wave sort of\n"
"solved the problem, too...{page_break}"
"Now, all three continents\n"
"are wedged together, and\n"
"we don't really need boats."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatChampaIn"
msgid "06283"
msgstr ""
"That Champa in the cell\n"
"looks a bit pale for a\n"
"pirate...{page_break}"
"I thought pirates were\n"
"supposed to be all tan\n"
"and leathery..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIVeAlways"
msgid "06284"
msgstr ""
"I've always wanted to see\n"
"Air's Rock...but Garoh is\n"
"such a long way away..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhoWasIt"
msgid "06285"
msgstr ""
"Who was it who told me the\n"
"Champa boat was damaged?{page_break}"
"Doesn't matter... But I bet\n"
"Briggs went to Osenia\n"
"to find himself a new boat."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNowMadraIs"
msgid "06286"
msgstr ""
"Now, Madra is pinned\n"
"between two continents!{page_break}"
"People from Gondowan\n"
"can walk here to visit!\n"
"What fun!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhenISaw"
msgid "06287"
msgstr ""
"When I saw those Champa,\n"
"I was so surprised that\n"
"I let out a yelp...{page_break}"
"It must have startled\n"
"them, because they all\n"
"ran away!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheChampaMust"
msgid "06288"
msgstr ""
"The Champa must have\n"
"known exactly where\n"
"Briggs was...{page_break}"
"But how did they know\n"
"the layout of our town?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSNot"
msgid "06289"
msgstr ""
"It's not like the Champa\n"
"to plan out elaborate\n"
"strategies...{page_break}"
"I think the two raids were\n"
"entirely coincidental."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMNotSure"
msgid "06290"
msgstr ""
"I'm not sure the Champa\n"
"actually dug this hole..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgILlNever"
msgid "06291"
msgstr ""
"I'll never forgive those\n"
"dogs for what they've\n"
"done to our village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgILookedInto"
msgid "06292"
msgstr ""
"I looked into that man's\n"
"eyes. He looked so serene,\n"
"so calm...{page_break}"
"No one with such pretty\n"
"eyes could be a liar."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderHowMany"
msgid "06293"
msgstr ""
"I wonder how many\n"
"of the raiders were\n"
"actually Champa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMissMy"
msgid "06294"
msgstr ""
"I miss my partner...\n"
"It's a shame he turned\n"
"tail and ran like that...{page_break}"
"But who knows? Maybe I\n"
"would have done the same\n"
"thing in his place..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors01"
msgid "06295"
msgstr ""
"In all this chaos, everyone\n"
"here has clean forgotten\n"
"about Alhafra...{page_break}"
"Sure, it's all the way in\n"
"Osenia, but they're bound\n"
"to have a boat or two."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors02"
msgid "06296"
msgstr ""
"Madra and Alhafra, off in\n"
"Osenia, have a long\n"
"history together...{page_break}"
"Alhafra's a thriving\n"
"seaport, up on the\n"
"northern coast."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors03"
msgid "06297"
msgstr ""
"Wait a second... I'll bet\n"
"Briggs is heading to\n"
"Alhafra!{page_break}"
"Of course! That'd be the\n"
"place to go if you were\n"
"looking for a boat!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors04"
msgid "06298"
msgstr ""
"Alhafra has long been\n"
"a trade partner with Madra.{page_break}"
"I should go there one day...\n"
"It's such an easy trip\n"
"from North Osenia..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors05"
msgid "06299"
msgstr ""
"The lands to the south\n"
"of Gondowan are full of\n"
"barbarians, I'm told."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors06"
msgid "06300"
msgstr ""
"Indra is in direct contact\n"
"with southern Gondowan...\n"
"Will we be safe?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06301"
msgstr ""
"You're just trying to make\n"
"me feel better, but you\n"
"don't have a clue, do you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06302"
msgstr ""
"Listen, we don't need you\n"
"running around getting\n"
"folks worked up! Buzz off!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors07"
msgid "06303"
msgstr ""
"The Kibombo are warlike,\n"
"but they live far off in the\n"
"center of Gondowan...{page_break}"
"I can't imagine they'd\n"
"come all the way out\n"
"here..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors08"
msgid "06304"
msgstr ""
"They say there are people\n"
"who use a frightening kind of\n"
"magic in Gondowan...{page_break}"
"I don't know if it's\n"
"true, but it's absolutely\n"
"terrifying!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors09"
msgid "06305"
msgstr ""
"A wave big enough to\n"
"move a continent is\n"
"a terrible portent...{page_break}"
"Could the legendary\n"
"beast of the deep\n"
"have awakened?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors10"
msgid "06306"
msgstr ""
"Everything happened so\n"
"suddenly... The earth moved,\n"
"and everything fell down...{page_break}"
"It's going to take me\n"
"forever to clean up..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors11"
msgid "06307"
msgstr ""
"If the mythical sea\n"
"creature has awakened,\n"
"we're all in trouble...{page_break}"
"The legends say that only\n"
"one armed with an enchanted\n"
"trident can kill it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors12"
msgid "06308"
msgstr ""
"Everything's on the floor,\n"
"and all my dishes are\n"
"broken. What a chore!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors13"
msgid "06309"
msgstr ""
"They say that boat belongs\n"
"to the Champa...{page_break}"
"But I keep telling them,\n"
"that boat looks like no\n"
"Champa ship I've seen."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors14"
msgid "06310"
msgstr ""
"The boat that ran aground\n"
"in the cove out east looks\n"
"like a normal ship, almost...{page_break}"
"But I'm not sure a boat\n"
"like that can even sail."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors15"
msgid "06311"
msgstr ""
"That boat's far sturdier\n"
"and far more sleek than\n"
"any Champa could build."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors16"
msgid "06312"
msgstr ""
"It didn't even have\n"
"any oars! How does\n"
"it move? I don't get it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors17"
msgid "06313"
msgstr ""
"Milady and I have been\n"
"told to guard that\n"
"jewel on the mantel."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors18"
msgid "06314"
msgstr ""
"Don't touch that gem!\n"
"The elder gave us strict\n"
"orders to protect it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors19"
msgid "06315"
msgstr ""
"My father was opposed to\n"
"arresting the man we\n"
"found on the boat...{page_break}"
"But the townspeople were in\n"
"an uproar about the Champa,\n"
"and they locked him up..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors20"
msgid "06316"
msgstr ""
"When the elder gets back,\n"
"I'm sure he will prove\n"
"that young man innocent."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors21"
msgid "06317"
msgstr ""
"Dad and Grandpa have\n"
"gone to Osenia to look\n"
"for Briggs..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors22"
msgid "06318"
msgstr ""
"Whenever Dad goes on\n"
"trips, he brings back\n"
"presents!{page_break}"
"I wonder what he'll bring\n"
"back this time..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors23"
msgid "06319"
msgstr ""
"I wish I knew why\n"
"the elder wanted us\n"
"to protect this thing..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors24"
msgid "06320"
msgstr ""
"Until my father returns,\n"
"I'll protect this gem\n"
"with my life."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors25"
msgid "06321"
msgstr ""
"He intends to find Briggs\n"
"and prove that young man's\n"
"innocence."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors26"
msgid "06322"
msgstr ""
"If Dad has to fight,\n"
"I wonder if he'll go..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors27"
msgid "06323"
msgstr ""
"I hope he brings me a\n"
"nice doll. I want a\n"
"wooden one!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors28"
msgid "06324"
msgstr ""
"Admit it! You're one of\n"
"the Champa, aren't you,\n"
"{actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06325"
msgstr ""
"Speak! Or let your\n"
"silence condemn you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06326"
msgstr ""
"I told you already...\n"
"I'm not a Champa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06327"
msgstr ""
"Then where did you\n"
"come from?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06328"
msgstr ""
"The heart of the Eastern\n"
"Sea... If I told you where,\n"
"you'd never believe me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06329"
msgstr ""
"Look at me when I'm\n"
"talking to you! Are you\n"
"trying to mock me!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06330"
msgstr ""
"I implore you, do not\n"
"anger me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06331"
msgstr ""
"Oh, do you? So what's\n"
"going to happen if I\n"
"make you angry?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06332"
msgstr ""
"Hey, Shin...\n"
"Maybe you should go\n"
"easy on him..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06333"
msgstr ""
"Hey, it wasn't your\n"
"girlfriend who got hurt!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06334"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry she was\n"
"injured, but I cannot°"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06335"
msgstr ""
"I don't want your sympathy,\n"
"freak! I want you to get\n"
"angry for me!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06336"
msgstr ""
"Stop, please...\n"
"Even my patience\n"
"has its limits."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06337"
msgstr ""
"Hey, don't you want\n"
"to see what he'll do?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06338"
msgstr ""
"I think we should\n"
"just stop..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06339"
msgstr ""
"If my words will not\n"
"cool your temper, then..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06340"
msgstr "Oh! That was Psynergy!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06341"
msgstr "Waaaaaaaaaahh!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06342"
msgstr "Did you do that?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06343"
msgstr ""
"What did your friend\n"
"expect?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06344"
msgstr "You monster!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06345"
msgstr ""
"I...\n"
"I am no monster."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06346"
msgstr "Help!!!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06347"
msgstr ""
"This man... He must\n"
"be an Adept!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06348"
msgstr ""
"Of course! That was\n"
"clearly Psynergy he\n"
"just used..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06349"
msgstr ""
"You're right... We only\n"
"know what we just saw."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06350"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps we should\n"
"try to learn a little\n"
"more about him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors29"
msgid "06351"
msgstr ""
"Ah... When will that kindly\n"
"elder return and end my\n"
"imprisonment?{page_break}"
"I have no time to wait,\n"
"but I don't want to have\n"
"to hurt anyone..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors30"
msgid "06352"
msgstr ""
"Why did I use my Psynergy\n"
"in anger? I must maintain\n"
"control...{page_break}"
"My actions should\n"
"never cause regret°"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06353"
msgstr ""
"I...sense someone...\n"
"using Psynergy..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06354"
msgstr ""
"That person...\n"
"Could he be°no, he is\n"
"not of my people..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06355"
msgstr "When will I be freed?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEvenIfWe"
msgid "06356"
msgstr ""
"Even if we tried to\n"
"tell someone what\n"
"we saw...{page_break}"
"Who would believe us!?\n"
"I think I'll just guard him\n"
"from out here, where it's safe."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgWasIJust"
msgid "06357"
msgstr ""
"Was I just dreaming\n"
"when that shaft of ice\n"
"appeared?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06358"
msgstr ""
"Yeah! That's what it was...\n"
"It was all just a dream..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06359"
msgstr ""
"What!?{pause_20_skippable} Oh! Oh... You're just...\n"
"You're joking with me,\n"
"right? Yeah...joking..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMySoreBottom"
msgid "06360"
msgstr ""
"My sore bottom tells\n"
"me it was all real...{page_break}"
"But I'm not about to\n"
"say that out loud..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItWasAll"
msgid "06361"
msgstr ""
"It was all just a dream...\n"
"If I keep on saying it,\n"
"maybe I'll believe it..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAfterTheChampa"
msgid "06362"
msgstr ""
"After the Champa opened\n"
"the jail cells, they came\n"
"over here...{page_break}"
"All of us merchants\n"
"grabbed our own swords\n"
"and started fighting..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheItemVendor"
msgid "06363"
msgstr ""
"The item vendor got\n"
"wounded in the attack...\n"
"She's still recovering.{page_break}"
"I don't think her boyfriend\n"
"will ever forgive that man\n"
"in the jail cell..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOwOwOw"
msgid "06364"
msgstr ""
"Ow. Ow. Ow...\n"
"I think I got a bone\n"
"bruise. I hate those..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThoseLousyChampa"
msgid "06365"
msgstr ""
"Those lousy Champa...{page_break}"
"Next time I see them,\n"
"they'll be the ones with\n"
"the bruises!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMySisterWas"
msgid "06366"
msgstr ""
