"I just get so angry!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors32"
msgid "06369"
msgstr ""
"Eyes... Shining in the\n"
"darkness... No! Go away!!!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors33"
msgid "06370"
msgstr ""
"Surely this town is\n"
