"as was my husband."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors03"
msgid "06450"
msgstr ""
"Hey, mister! Are you\n"
"an explorer?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06451"
msgstr ""
"Awesome! Don't tell\n"
"anyone, but I want to be\n"
"an explorer too someday!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06452"
msgstr ""
"My grandpa used to\n"
"travel all over the\n"
"whole world!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors04"
msgid "06453"
msgstr ""
"It must be nice to get\n"
"out and see the world...{page_break}"
"But staying in one place\n"
"is nice, too.{page_break}"
"Maybe that's why my\n"
"dad founded this village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors05"
msgid "06454"
msgstr ""
"That boy sure admires\n"
"his grandpa, but I get\n"
"really worried about him.{page_break}"
"I'm afraid he'd get hurt\n"
"if he became an explorer\n"
"like his grandfather."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors06"
msgid "06455"
msgstr ""
"I love exploring out\n"
"behind the house...\n"
"It's my secret place!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFieldBukBukBuk"
msgid "06456"
msgstr "Buk buk buk..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFieldBahBaaaaaaa"
msgid "06457"
msgstr "Bah! {text_effect:4}Baaaaaaa!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFieldTheGroundHereIsSo"
msgid "06458"
msgstr ""
"The ground here is so\n"
"soft! I just want to\n"
"scratch and dig, buhKAWK!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFieldOhYeahMmmIJust"
msgid "06459"
msgstr ""
"Oh, yeah! Mmm!\n"
"I just loves to eat\n"
"me some grass! Yum!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors07"
msgid "06460"
msgstr ""
"Those who have climbed\n"
"Air's Rock claim that they\n"
"can see the unseeable..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors08"
msgid "06461"
msgstr ""
"My husband has tried\n"
"to climb Air's Rock\n"
"many times...{page_break}"
"I wish I knew what he\n"
"saw in that big hunk\n"
"of rock."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors09"
msgid "06462"
msgstr ""
"What does the unseeable\n"
"even look like?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors10"
msgid "06463"
msgstr ""
"I can't let him try to\n"
"climb it again. What\n"
"if he were injured?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors11"
msgid "06464"
msgstr ""
"We only have a small\n"
"shop here. I used to\n"
"specialize in items...{page_break}"
"But now, I sell armor\n"
"and weapons, too."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors12"
msgid "06465"
msgstr ""
"I don't know much about\n"
"weapons and stuff...{page_break}"
"I hope they don't ask me\n"
"any questions. Maybe\n"
"they only want items..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors13"
msgid "06466"
msgstr ""
"There aren't any towns\n"
"between here and Garoh.{page_break}"
"You should rest here and\n"
"maybe reequip yourselves\n"
"before heading out."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors14"
msgid "06467"
msgstr ""
"You've come a long way,\n"
"friends. Stay a while, and\n"
"rest your feet."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors15"
msgid "06468"
msgstr ""
"There's no reason to go\n"
"to Garoh unless you were\n"
"heading to Air's Rock..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors16"
msgid "06469"
msgstr ""
"Why are travelers always\n"
"in such a hurry?{page_break}"
"Like my mum used to\n"
"say, \"Fools rush in...\""

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors17"
msgid "06470"
msgstr ""
"Have you been\n"
"to Garoh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06471"
msgstr ""
"They're all werewolves\n"
"there... They hide away\n"
"from those who fear them.{page_break}"
"But their cursed forms\n"
"come with great powers..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06472"
msgstr ""
"Do not fear their outward\n"
"appearance...{page_break}"
