"they are gentle, and they\n"
"have kind hearts."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors18"
msgid "06473"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if there are\n"
"werewolves beyond\n"
"those in Garoh...{page_break}"
"I also wonder if they\n"
"might not be as gentle\n"
"as Garoh's folk."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors19"
msgid "06474"
msgstr "Forgive my manners..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06475"
