"danger most grievous...{page_break}"
"Even now, Satrage,\n"
"Navampa, and Azart\n"
"are looking for him...{page_break}"
"They wish to avenge\n"
"the loss he gave them\n"
"at Colosso."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06478"
msgstr ""
"A pity... The one I seek\n"
"won a battle at Colosso,\n"
"in Tolbi.{page_break}"
"He won...and too easily,\n"
"perhaps. Now, his opponents\n"
"are eager for revenge."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors20"
msgid "06479"
msgstr ""
"I think {actor_name:1} must\n"
"be somewhere in the\n"
"Eastern Sea right now..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors21"
