#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06493"
msgstr "A lycanthwhat?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06494"
msgstr ""
"Just think of them as\n"
"a race of people born with\n"
"special powers..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06495"
msgstr ""
"Kind of like Adepts,\n"
"you mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06496"
msgstr ""
"Yes, that sounds right.\n"
"{actor_name:7}, you've put it\n"
"quite well."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06497"
msgstr ""
"Adepts borrow their\n"
"abilities from the power\n"
"of the elements..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06498"
msgstr ""
"While lycanthropes borrow\n"
"theirs from the power\n"
"of beasts..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06499"
msgstr ""
"This is why they\n"
"take the forms of\n"
"animals..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06500"
msgstr ""
"They may look\n"
"frightening...{page_break}"
"But we must try to\n"
"communicate with them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06501"
msgstr ""
"Lycanthropes...\n"
"Werewolves... A whole\n"
"village in hiding..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06502"
msgstr ""
"Is it just me...{page_break}"
"Or does Kraden seem a\n"
