"found werewolves?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06503"
msgstr ""
"What? Me? Happy to\n"
"find werewolves? You\n"
"must be joking!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06504"
msgstr ""
"I would love to study\n"
"them, but still...they\n"
"do frighten me..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06505"
msgstr ""
"I guess I'm just curious\n"
"about all of the secrets\n"
"of these new lands..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06506"
msgstr ""
"Any real scholar would be\n"
"thrilled to explore a new land\n"
"full of mystery, huh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06507"
msgstr ""
"So, are there werewolves\n"
"only on Osenia?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06508"
msgstr "Ummm..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06509"
msgstr ""
"If so, how could you\n"
"even have known about\n"
"them, Kraden?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06510"
msgstr "Er... I, uh..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06511"
msgstr "Yeah... That is weird."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06512"
msgstr "All right, so I lied!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06513"
msgstr ""
"I'm glad we found\n"
"werewolves! There!\n"
"Are you happy!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06514"
msgstr ""
"And you know what!?\n"
"I even want to get a\n"
"closer look if I can!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06515"
msgstr ""
"So let's go! Let's find\n"
"us some werewolves!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgGaroh02"
msgid "06516"
msgstr ""
"So, uh...you say you\n"
"saw a werewolf?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06517"
msgstr ""
"Don't be ridiculous...\n"
"There's no such\n"
"thing as werewolves!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06518"
msgstr ""
"Of course not...\n"
"You should know there's\n"
"no such thing! Not here!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh03"
msgid "06519"
msgstr ""
"Good evening. Forgive\n"
"me for not taking my\n"
"hood off...{page_break}"
"I just...don't care much\n"
"for the full moon's light."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh04"
msgid "06520"
msgstr "Gaaaroooooo!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06521"
msgstr "Gah! Whoops..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06522"
msgstr ""
"Heh heh hrrr...\n"
"I was just calling my\n"
"dog... Sounded good, huh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh05"
msgid "06523"
msgstr ""
"You there...\n"
"Strangers should not\n"
