#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06525"
msgstr ""
"Yes, I agree...\n"
"But it brings me grief.{page_break}"
"We here cannot\n"
"enjoy the sight\n"
"of it directly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06526"
msgstr ""
"Heh hrr hrrr... Don't feel\n"
"like you must watch your\n"
"words on my account.{page_break}"
"The full moon's light gives\n"
"birth to many strange\n"
"sights on nights like this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh07"
msgid "06527"
msgstr ""
"It's grim luck that brings\n"
"strangers here in the\n"
"gloom of the full moon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh08"
msgid "06528"
msgstr ""
"Such gorgeous moonlight...\n"
"If only I could take\n"
"off this hood..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh09"
msgid "06529"
msgstr ""
"Which one of us was it\n"
"who removed his hood in\n"
"front of these strangers?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh10"
msgid "06530"
msgstr ""
"Foreigners only come\n"
"here en route to Air's Rock.{page_break}"
"Only a chosen few\n"
"can reach the peak."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh11"
msgid "06531"
msgstr ""
"The night of the full\n"
"moon is usually so\n"
"festive...{page_break}"
"It's boring having to\n"
"wear these hoods\n"
"when strangers come..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh12"
msgid "06532"
msgstr "What!? Outsiders, here?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors01"
msgid "06533"
msgstr ""
"Good evening, wanderers!\n"
"Are you looking for\n"
"something?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06534"
msgstr ""
"Just...staying up late,\n"
"eh? Can't say I blame\n"
"you, on a night like this.{page_break}"
"We here know the glory\n"
"of night of the full moon."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06535"
msgstr ""
"Searching for\n"
"werewolves, eh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06536"
msgstr ""
"You don't really\n"
"believe they exist,\n"
"do you?{page_break}"
"If so, you'd best keep\n"
"it to yourself...{page_break}"
"That is, if you don't\n"
"want to have folks here\n"
"howling with laughter..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06537"
msgstr ""
"Hehrrr... Sorry.\n"
"Just thought I'd ask.{page_break}"
"We get some crazy folk\n"
"coming through here,\n"
"and I had to ask..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors02"
msgid "06538"
msgstr ""
"Our oldest son is always\n"
"scampering off late\n"
"at night... Where is he?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors03"
msgid "06539"
msgstr ""
"No fair! My brother\n"
"always gets to go\n"
"out late!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors04"
msgid "06540"
msgstr ""
"Outsiders could never\n"
"understand the gift the\n"
"moon has given us..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors05"
msgid "06541"
msgstr ""
"That pup of mine just\n"
"won't listen. He went out\n"
"when he shouldn't have...{page_break}"
"He just wanted to see the\n"
"moonlight, and now his\n"
"father blames me for it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors06"
msgid "06542"
msgstr ""
"What made Master\n"
"Maha take my brother\n"
"into the rock?{page_break}"
"I want to see\n"
"what's in there..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors07"
msgid "06543"
msgstr ""
"Garoh exists to\n"
"protect Air's Rock.{page_break}"
"In exchange, we gain\n"
"its power ourselves..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors08"
msgid "06544"
msgstr ""
"So you've heard of Whirlwind?\n"
"Most people haven't...{page_break}"
"Even in Garoh, only a\n"
"chosen few can use it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors09"
msgid "06545"
msgstr ""
"I've heard about the\n"
"Wind Stone...{page_break}"
