"makes...something happen."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors10"
msgid "06546"
msgstr ""
"We have other powers\n"
"than just Whirlwind...{page_break}"
"I wonder which of us\n"
"will inherit the powers\n"
"of Master Maha?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors11"
msgid "06547"
msgstr ""
"And different people use\n"
"Whirlwind different ways.{page_break}"
"Master Maha's mastery\n"
"of Whirlwind would put\n"
"anyone to shame."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors12"
msgid "06548"
msgstr ""
"I wish I knew what\n"
"would happen...\n"
"Something weird, I guess."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors13"
msgid "06549"
msgstr ""
"When our people grow\n"
"older, they generate\n"
"strange powers...{page_break}"
"Of course, I'm just a\n"
"wee pup, in people years..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors14"
msgid "06550"
msgstr ""
"My mate is close to\n"
"obtaining the power\n"
"he's been seeking..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors15"
msgid "06551"
msgstr ""
"I cast Whirlwind on the\n"
