"have any use for those,\n"
"would you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors18"
msgid "06554"
msgstr ""
"I should be outside,\n"
"howling with the pack,\n"
"not stuck in here!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors19"
msgid "06555"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunate that you\n"
"should come on a night\n"
"of the full moon, sir...{page_break}"
