"to see our full range\n"
"of wares..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors20"
msgid "06556"
msgstr ""
"These strangers seem\n"
"normal enough...{page_break}"
"Except that they're\n"
"up late for outsiders..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors21"
msgid "06557"
msgstr ""
"Did you come here\n"
"from Alhafra?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06558"
msgstr ""
"Really? You must have\n"
"gone through the cave...{page_break}"
"You can't go back that\n"
"way, you know... The\n"
"return trip is longer."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06559"
msgstr ""
"Oh, so you must have\n"
"come by way of Mikasalla.{page_break}"
"If you're going to Air's\n"
"Rock, take the crossroads\n"
"west of Alhafra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors22"
msgid "06560"
msgstr ""
"I never change my stock,\n"
"unlike the weapons and\n"
"armor shopkeeps..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors23"
msgid "06561"
msgstr ""
"A clear night around here\n"
"always means fair weather\n"
"on the morrow...{page_break}"
"You've come all this\n"
"way, so you might as\n"
"well go to Air's Rock, too..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors24"
msgid "06562"
msgstr ""
"Air's Rock can get quite\n"
"desolate. After all, it's in\n"
"the middle of a desert..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors25"
msgid "06563"
msgstr ""
"Zzzz... Zzzz...\n"
"What a waste...\n"
"Just a big rock..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors26"
msgid "06564"
msgstr ""
"Zzz... Whuzza? Whirlwind?\n"
"Wind Stone? Zzzzrrrgg..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors27"
msgid "06565"
msgstr ""
"It only rains a few\n"
"times a year there...{page_break}"
"Air's Rock is in a desert,\n"
"so what else would\n"
"you expect?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors28"
msgid "06566"
msgstr ""
"Most people see nothing\n"
