"saw only the wind\n"
"and the dust..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors29"
msgid "06567"
msgstr ""
"...Climbed all over\n"
"that stupid rock, and\n"
"for what? Nothing!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors30"
msgid "06568"
msgstr ""
"That rock was huge.\n"
"How was I supposed\n"
"to make it spin?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors31"
msgid "06569"
msgstr ""
"The people here may\n"
"be different, but they\n"
"certainly are nice...{page_break}"
"And those abilities of\n"
"theirs are amazing!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors32"
msgid "06570"
msgstr ""
"No matter what it takes,\n"
"I will save the souls of\n"
"those poor villagers..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh13"
msgid "06571"
