"unhappy if we did..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06581"
msgstr "Grrrr..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06582"
msgstr "What was that?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06583"
msgstr ""
"It sounded like a wolf\n"
"growling, didn't it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06584"
msgstr ""
"My hearing is not\n"
"so very good, but...\n"
"there was something."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06585"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps we should\n"
"search this area more\n"
"thoroughly..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06586"
msgstr "There is no need..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06587"
msgstr "Look... He's using Psynergy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06588"
msgstr "Garrrrooow..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06589"
msgstr ""
"Fear not...\n"
"This child is harmless."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06590"
msgstr ""
"He does look kind\n"
"of...small..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06591"
msgstr "Grrrrrrr..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06592"
msgstr ""
"Tell me, who are you? How\n"
"did you come to be here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06593"
msgstr ""
"I should like to ask you\n"
"the same question."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06594"
msgstr ""
"Could it be? Do you\n"
"outsiders possess the\n"
"power to reveal the unseen?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06595"
msgstr ""
"Impossible...\n"
"Without Reveal, you could\n"
"not have entered this cave."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06596"
msgstr ""
"Of course... I was certain\n"
"that you must."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06597"
msgstr "Grawooo..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06598"
msgstr ""
"Yes, you are correct. They\n"
"must have passed the\n"
"challenge of Air's Rock."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06599"
msgstr ""
"Er... How come that kid\n"
"doesn't talk, like you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06600"
msgstr ""
"When we become werewolves,\n"
"speaking the human tongue\n"
"becomes more difficult."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06601"
msgstr ""
"But you can... You must\n"
"be someone special, then..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06602"
msgstr ""
"Hurh hurr hrrr... \"Special\"?\n"
"Perhaps.{pause_20_skippable} Why don't you just\n"
"call me Maha..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06603"
msgstr ""
"So... I assume you also\n"
"can use Whirlwind..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06604"
msgstr ""
"If you learned Reveal on\n"
"Air's Rock, you must also\n"
"know Whirlwind."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06605"
msgstr ""
"I don't think we need to hide\n"
"the fact that we're Adepts\n"
"from Maha..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06606"
msgstr ""
"That's right...\n"
"I think we can tell Maha\n"
"that we're Adepts."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06607"
msgstr "Awooo..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06608"
msgstr ""
"What did he say?\n"
"I don't understand..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06609"
msgstr ""
"He wanted to know what\n"
"an Adept is... A question I\n"
"would like answered as well."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06610"
msgstr ""
"Adepts tap the power of\n"
"elemental energies to generate\n"
"forces like Whirlwind..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06611"
msgstr ""
"Elementals... You mean the\n"
"four elements, the powers of\n"
"earth and fire, water and wind?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06612"
msgstr ""
"That is correct. These elements\n"
"together comprise everything\n"
"in our world..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06613"
msgstr ""
"Interesting.\n"
"Very interesting..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06614"
msgstr "Awooo..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06615"
msgstr ""
"Um... What did he\n"
"say that time?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06616"
msgstr ""
"He asked if there were\n"
"no longer any need to hide\n"
"from you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06617"
msgstr ""
"...Why did he have to\n"
"hide in here in the\n"
"first place?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06618"
msgstr ""
"Aaah-Ah-Awoooh!\n"
"Hawawoooh!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06619"
msgstr ""
"No doubt, most would find\n"
"the sight of a werewolf\n"
"rather unnerving..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06620"
msgstr ""
"You are, sadly, correct.\n"
"Many consider ours an\n"
"accursed race."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06621"
msgstr ""
"And if they found you\n"
"in your werewolf form?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06622"
msgstr ""
"...Once, our people were\n"
"burned at the stake as\n"
"abominations...{page_break}"
"They called this\n"
"\"purification.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06623"
msgstr "Horrible..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06624"
msgstr ""
"But...this little one...\n"
"He won't get excited\n"
"and try to bite, will he?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06625"
msgstr ""
"Child, return to\n"
"your home."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06626"
msgstr "Arrooo?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06627"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry.\n"
"We can trust them...\n"
"Go back home now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06628"
msgstr "Aarrrooo?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06629"
msgstr ""
"They are Adepts, not unlike\n"
"us werewolves... They guard\n"
"an ancient secret."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06630"
msgstr ""
"We can trust them. They\n"
"will not betray us to\n"
"the world."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06631"
msgstr "Woof."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06632"
msgstr "It has grown quite late."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06633"
msgstr ""
"Why don't you go to\n"
"the inn and rest..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06634"
msgstr "But then..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06635"
msgstr ""
"I will not leave\n"
"this place."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06636"
msgstr "You aren't going home?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06637"
msgstr ""
"When I learned Reveal,\n"
"I lost my human form. The\n"
"wild is my home now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06638"
msgstr ""
"So, Master Maha, you\n"
"always look this way?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06639"
msgstr "And the little one?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06640"
msgstr ""
"The child changed because\n"
"he looked directly at the\n"
"full moon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06641"
msgstr ""
"So, by tomorrow morning,\n"
"he will have returned\n"
"to his human form again?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06642"
msgstr ""
"Correct.\n"
"Now, let us retire."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06643"
msgstr ""
"I will tell the people of\n"
"Garoh that they need not\n"
"hide our secret from you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06644"
msgstr ""
"One who can master Reveal\n"
"in human form... An Adept...\n"
"What a remarkable thing..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors33"
msgid "06645"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} and party\n"
"stayed the night\n"
"at the inn."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors34"
msgid "06646"
msgstr ""
"You folks didn't sleep much\n"
"last night... You don't look\n"
"like you got any rest at all."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06647"
msgstr ""
"Master Maha told us all\n"
"about you. Don't you worry\n"
"about the bill. It's on us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06648"
msgstr "Farewell, friends."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh15"
msgid "06649"
msgstr ""
"I hear tell from Master\n"
"Maha that you guys are\n"
"special, too...{page_break}"
"We don't have to hide\n"
"our secret from you\n"
"any longer!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh16"
msgid "06650"
msgstr ""
"Last night when you saw\n"
"me, I was wearing a hood.{page_break}"
"I guess I won't have to\n"
"do that anymore!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh17"
msgid "06651"
msgstr "Awoooooh!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06652"
msgstr ""
"Heh heh... Sorry about that!\n"
"I'm so happy I don't have\n"
"to hide that I howled out loud!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgGaroh18"
msgid "06653"
msgstr ""
"Maha said that you were the\n"
"only outsiders we could\n"
"share our secret with...{page_break}"
"So...does it bother you that\n"
"we're all werewolves?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06654"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, I thought so...\n"
"That's too bad.{page_break}"
"I was so happy when Maha\n"
"told us. Now, I'm just\n"
"really disappointed. Arooo."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06655"
msgstr ""
"Wow! You guys really are\n"
"different from the others!{page_break}"
"Most people run away\n"
"screaming or even grab\n"
"their weapons..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh19"
msgid "06656"
msgstr ""
"I heard there were other\n"
"werecreatures in Osenia,\n"
"in a few places...{page_break}"
"...People who can turn\n"
"into other things than\n"
"wolves..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh20"
msgid "06657"
msgstr ""
"Hey, it's you guys!\n"
"Thanks for last night!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06658"
msgstr ""
"Oh, yeah... That's right...\n"
"You probably don't recognize\n"
"me in my human form!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06659"
msgstr ""
"I was in the cave with Maha!\n"
"I was that little werewolf!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh21"
msgid "06660"
msgstr ""
"I'm the reason you can\n"
"stay in our village and we\n"
"don't have to wear hoods!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh22"
msgid "06661"
msgstr ""
"How could these outsiders\n"
"have learned Reveal?{page_break}"
"These guys must be\n"
"pretty unusual."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh23"
msgid "06662"
msgstr ""
"I thought we'd never be\n"
"able to talk to outsiders\n"
"about our secret...{page_break}"
"I feel so free!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh24"
msgid "06663"
msgstr ""
"I never thought I'd be\n"
"so happy to have our\n"
"secret out in the open!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh25"
msgid "06664"
msgstr ""
"Maha said these travelers\n"
"were like us...{page_break}"
"Does that mean they're\n"
"werewolves, too?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh26"
msgid "06665"
msgstr ""
"I would love to meet\n"
"other werecreatures\n"
"someday."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh27"
msgid "06666"
msgstr ""
"My dad told me I put the\n"
"whole village at risk...\n"
"He was really mad...{page_break}"
"He said this whole thing\n"
"was just dumb luck... But\n"
"why would luck be dumb?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors35"
msgid "06667"
msgstr ""
"Hey! It's you!\n"
"Thanks for looking out\n"
"for our son last night!{page_break}"
"But I'm curious... Did you\n"
"believe in werewolves\n"
"before you came here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors36"
msgid "06668"
msgstr ""
"Everyone is amazed that\n"
"you learned Reveal\n"
"at Air's Rock!{page_break}"
"If you have some time,\n"
"could you teach it\n"
"to our children?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors37"
msgid "06669"
msgstr ""
"My brother should have\n"
"gotten in trouble, but they\n"
"barely even got mad at him!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors38"
msgid "06670"
msgstr ""
"The younger the werewolf,\n"
"the less control he has\n"
"over his wolf form...{page_break}"
"These travelers must have\n"
"been very brave to follow him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors39"
msgid "06671"
msgstr ""
"Oh, thank goodness!\n"
"Everything worked out,\n"
"and my husband's not mad..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors40"
msgid "06672"
msgstr ""
"And dad said he was\n"
"really going to tan his hide\n"
"this time, too...{page_break}"
"And now everyone's treating\n"
"him like he did some\n"
"amazingly good deed!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors41"
msgid "06673"
msgstr ""
"So you're something special?\n"
"An Adept, or something like\n"
"that?{page_break}"
"Does that mean that you\n"
"can turn into a wolf or,\n"
"something, like us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors42"
msgid "06674"
msgstr ""
"You learned Reveal at\n"
"Air's Rock and lived to\n"
"tell the tale...{page_break}"
"So that must mean...\n"
"you can use Whirlwind."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors43"
msgid "06675"
msgstr ""
"I just can't believe that\n"
"someone outside the\n"
"village learned Reveal..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors44"
msgid "06676"
msgstr ""
"Did Maha mean that they\n"
"could change forms, like\n"
"we can?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors45"
msgid "06677"
msgstr ""
"So these people can use\n"
"both Reveal and Whirlwind...{page_break}"
"They must be powerful,\n"
"like Master Maha is."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors46"
msgid "06678"
msgstr ""
"Normally, outsiders never\n"
"get in to see Maha, but\n"
"these people...{page_break}"
"They can see him\n"
"whenever they want..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors47"
msgid "06679"
msgstr ""
"You... Is it true that\n"
"you learned Reveal?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06680"
msgstr ""
"Hmm...I thought Air's\n"
"Rock belonged to my\n"
"people alone...{page_break}"
"But you young outsiders\n"
"have mastered it so quickly...\n"
"I might as well quit trying."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06681"
msgstr ""
"No, I can tell it was you\n"
"they're talking about... I can\n"
"smell Air's Rock on you...{page_break}"
"Ah, but you're so young!\n"
"And I am so very old...\n"
"I might as well quit trying."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors48"
msgid "06682"
msgstr ""
"To think I've wasted so much of\n"
"my life on something you\n"
"did in a single afternoon..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors49"
msgid "06683"
msgstr ""
"He's worked so hard...\n"
"But now, I don't know...\n"
"He seems so sad..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors50"
msgid "06684"
msgstr ""
"I thought I could become a\n"
"leader if I learned Reveal.\n"
"How foolish of me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors51"
msgid "06685"
msgstr ""
"So now, even outsiders\n"
"are learning Reveal...{page_break}"
"How do we decide who\n"
"will lead Garoh now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors52"
msgid "06686"
msgstr ""
"What do you think? I'll bet\n"
"these weapons suit you\n"
"better than any fangs would!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors53"
msgid "06687"
msgstr ""
"I prefer the tooth and claw,\n"
"myself, but whatever..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors54"
msgid "06688"
msgstr ""
"When we change form,\n"
"it's best to be unclothed.{page_break}"
"But when you're human,\n"
"armor always comes in handy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors55"
msgid "06689"
msgstr ""
"Maha says that when we're\n"
"wolves, we don't need to\n"
"wear armor...{page_break}"
"He says our instincts\n"
"will protect us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors56"
msgid "06690"
msgstr ""
"I've heard stories about\n"
"other mountains like our\n"
"own Air's Rock...{page_break}"
"Like on this island that\n"
"lies across the Eastern\n"
"Sea, far from Osenia..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors57"
msgid "06691"
msgstr ""
"I heard that one that's\n"
"across the Eastern Sea\n"
"is really pretty, too.{page_break}"
"It's got water spilling down\n"
"the sides in huge torrents.\n"
"Sounds lovely..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors58"
msgid "06692"
msgstr ""
"If you can pass the tests\n"
"of Air's Rock, you can do\n"
"anything!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors59"
msgid "06693"
msgstr ""
"Maha came along\n"
"and said the nicest\n"
"things about you all."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors60"
msgid "06694"
msgstr ""
"Those wolves were\n"
"really noisy last\n"
"night, too."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors61"
msgid "06695"
msgstr ""
"Maybe we should stay\n"
"and try climbing Air's Rock\n"
"one more time."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors62"
msgid "06696"
msgstr ""
"I've heard stories about\n"
"other places like Air's\n"
"Rock...{page_break}"
"If they can handle Air's\n"
"Rock, they can probably\n"
"handle those too."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors63"
msgid "06697"
msgstr ""
"He said if they were\n"
"werewolves, he'd want them\n"
"to take his place...{page_break}"
"They must have made\n"
"quite an impression on\n"
"Maha for him to say that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors64"
msgid "06698"
msgstr ""
"I'm scared of wolves,\n"
"so I don't go out much\n"
"at night..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors65"
msgid "06699"
msgstr ""
"If I used a lever, I\n"
"could probably make\n"
"that rock spin...{page_break}"
"But I still don't get what\n"
"the point of it is..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors66"
msgid "06700"
msgstr ""
"I've heard about you.\n"
"They say you're special,\n"
"like the people in this town."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGarohInteriors67"
msgid "06701"
msgstr ""
"Am I the only one here\n"
"who isn't special!?{page_break}"
"Please, won't somebody\n"
"answer my wishes and\n"
"make me special, too?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh28"
msgid "06702"
msgstr "Ah, you came..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06703"
msgstr "I've been waiting for you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06704"
msgstr ""
"Would you mind telling me a\n"
"little more about werewolves?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06705"
msgstr ""
"You want to know the reason\n"
"we possess the power to\n"
"transform into beasts?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06706"
msgstr ""
"Ah... Well, {pause_20_skippable}I, er...\n"
"Actually, yes."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06707"
msgstr ""
"Do you find it strange\n"
"that we can change our\n"
"shapes?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06708"
msgstr "Well, ummm... Yes."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06709"
msgstr ""
"But surely changing one's\n"
"shape is not really all that\n"
"unusual."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06710"
msgstr "What are you getting at?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06711"
msgstr ""
"Think about the caterpillar\n"
"for a moment.{page_break}"
"When the time is right,\n"
"does it not transform into\n"
"a beautiful butterfly?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06712"
msgstr "Well, yes. It's only natural..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06713"
msgstr ""
"And the pill bug and hedgehog?\n"
"Do they not change their\n"
"shapes to protect themselves?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06714"
msgstr ""
"I have heard of these\n"
"creatures, yes..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06715"
msgstr ""
"And many amphibians possess\n"
"the power to change color\n"
"at will, correct?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06716"
msgstr ""
"In light of all this, do you\n"
"mean to tell me you find\n"
"werewolves so abnormal?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06717"
msgstr ""
"Hrmm, well... To be honest,\n"
"I hadn't thought of it that\n"
"way before..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06718"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps you simply did not\n"
"give it enough thought."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06719"
msgstr ""
"How insulting! I, sir...\n"
"am a SCIENTIST!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06720"
msgstr ""
"Indeed! A scientist?\n"
"That {text_effect:2}is{reset_text_style} impressive."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06721"
msgstr ""
"I have spent a great\n"
"deal of time thinking\n"
"about werewolves."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06722"
msgstr ""
"For a time, I even felt\n"
"cursed to have been\n"
"born a werewolf..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06723"
msgstr ""
"But after taking a more\n"
"objective look at nature..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06724"
msgstr ""
"I realized that weaker\n"
"species have survived by\n"
"evolving...by transforming.{page_break}"
"Don't you agree?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06725"
msgstr ""
"Think about it for a moment.\n"
"Without changing their bodies\n"
"with weapons and armor...{page_break}"
"Humans would be very\n"
"weak creatures indeed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06726"
msgstr ""
"I believe that evolving into\n"
"werewolves is just one way\n"
"for humanity to survive..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06727"
msgstr "But that's..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06728"
msgstr ""
"Of course, there's\n"
"no way I can prove\n"
"this theory."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06729"
msgstr ""
"But I felt that our ability\n"
"to use Whirlwind was\n"
"evidence of this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06730"
msgstr "Whirlwind? Why?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06731"
msgstr ""
"I had thought only the\n"
"people of Garoh could\n"
"use Whirlwind."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06732"
msgstr ""
"It was a gift known\n"
"only to werewolves, to\n"
"Garoh's pack..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06733"
msgstr ""
"And that only a chosen few\n"
"could use Reveal..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06734"
msgstr ""
"But now I find that you,\n"
"too, can use these... What\n"
"does it all mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06735"
msgstr ""
"Why are you able to use\n"
"Whirlwind, and what is\n"
"an Adept?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06736"
msgstr ""
"Master Maha, do you know of\n"
"a continent called Angara? It\n"
"lies far north of the Eastern Sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06737"
msgstr "Angara?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06738"
msgstr ""
"In the middle of Angara, there\n"
"is a peak called Mt. Aleph."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06739"
msgstr ""
"Mt. Aleph? ...Then it's true!\n"
"Our legends say this peak has\n"
"stood since this world began!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06740"
msgstr ""
"If Mt. Aleph does exist, then\n"
"perhaps our legends are true!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06741"
msgstr "It does exist..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06742"
msgstr ""
"These two hail from the\n"
"village at the base of Mt. Aleph,\n"
"a village called Vale."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06743"
msgstr ""
"They come from Mt. Aleph!?\n"
"Incredible!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06744"
msgstr ""
"And they are both Adepts.\n"
"And while their powers\n"
"may vary...{page_break}"
"Everyone from Vale is an\n"
"Adept to a certain degree."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06745"
msgstr ""
"Then, does that not make\n"
"them like us in Garoh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06746"
msgstr ""
"In Vale, the myths say that\n"
"Mt. Aleph itself gave birth\n"
"to the Adepts..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06747"
msgstr ""
"This is not what the legends\n"
"of Garoh tell us..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06748"
msgstr ""
"As a people, they are\n"
"quite gifted...but it goes\n"
"far beyond that..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06749"
msgstr ""
"The mystical stones on\n"
"Mt. Aleph... The Psynergy\n"
"Stones...{page_break}"
"They are closely linked to\n"
"the powers of the townsfolk."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06750"
msgstr "\"Psynergy Stones,\" you say?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06751"
msgstr ""
"If there were similar stones\n"
"in Garoh, it might explain\n"
"your powers as well."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06752"
msgstr ""
"And what manner of stones\n"
"are these Psynergy Stones?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06753"
msgstr ""
"You've seen them, Maha!\n"
"The shining stone at the\n"
"heart of Air's Rock."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06754"
msgstr ""
"I know the stone you\n"
"speak of, but..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06755"
msgstr ""
"Air's Rock is quite far\n"
"from Garoh."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06756"
msgstr ""
"I don't see how it could\n"
"affect the people here."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06757"
msgstr ""
"I wonder... Could it be\n"
"the wind?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06758"
msgstr ""
"You probably figured\n"
"it out for yourself already,\n"
"{actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06759"
msgstr ""
"I guess I couldn't have\n"
"expected you to understand,\n"
"{actor_name:5}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06760"
msgstr ""
"There were strong winds blowing\n"
"within Air's Rock... Those winds\n"
"would carry far..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06761"
msgstr "Carry? Carry what?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06762"
msgstr ""
"Ugh! You're so dense!\n"
"The power of the Psynergy\n"
"Stone!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06763"
msgstr ""
"How is that possible? How\n"
"could the stone's power\n"
"be carried on the wind?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06764"
msgstr ""
"Do not belittle the\n"
"power of the wind!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06765"
msgstr ""
"Given time, the wind can\n"
"grind great mountains down\n"
"to sand!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06766"
msgstr ""
"I mean, the wind at Air's\n"
"Rock was strong enough\n"
"to blow us off the ground!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06767"
msgstr ""
"So why couldn't the wind\n"
"carry particles of the stone\n"
"all the way to Garoh?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06768"
msgstr "She's right!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "06769"
msgstr "She's right!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06770"
msgstr ""
"Those particles from the\n"
"Psynergy Stone must be\n"
"charged with its power!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06771"
msgstr ""
"This explains why your\n"
"Psynergy is weaker than\n"
"that of Vale's people...{page_break}"
"You've been exposed\n"
"to smaller particles."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06772"
msgstr ""
"The wind patterns might\n"
"also affect who among us\n"
"in Garoh can use Whirlwind."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06773"
msgstr ""
"Of course, this is all mere\n"
"conjecture, but it does offer\n"
"us some clues..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06774"
msgstr "Thank you, umm..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06775"
msgstr ""
"It's {actor_name:7}.\n"
"I'm pleased to meet you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06776"
msgstr ""
"Oh! Haven't we given you\n"
"our names, Master Maha?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06777"
msgstr "I am Kraden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06778"
msgstr "This is {actor_name:6}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06779"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06780"
msgstr "And {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06781"
msgstr ""
"You must permit me to thank\n"
"you for all you've done."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06782"
msgstr ""
"No, no, please... We don't\n"
"need any thanks..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06783"
msgstr ""
"That's too bad... I was\n"
"going to give you this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06784"
msgstr "It's a Djinni!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06785"
msgstr ""
"A \"Djinni\"? Is that\n"
"what you call them?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06786"
msgstr ""
"When he is with you,\n"
"he adds to your power.\n"
"He is very helpful."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06787"
msgstr ""
"I suppose you'll be continuing\n"
"your journey now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06788"
msgstr ""
"So you intend to travel by\n"
"sea? That is a long journey..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06789"
msgstr ""
"So, you still can't tell just\n"
"what sort of journeys\n"
"await you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06790"
msgstr ""
"In that case, I think you\n"
"will get more use out of\n"
"this \"Djinni\" than I will."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06791"
msgstr ""
"{argument_actor_name:1} got the\n"
"Djinni ~."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06792"
msgstr ""
"Another Djinni!\n"
"Talk about lucky!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06793"
msgstr ""
"This is a great gift.\n"
"We are quite thankful."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06794"
msgstr ""
"You don't need to thank\n"
"me. Just take care on\n"
"your travels."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06795"
msgstr ""
"Good luck with the...\n"
"werewolf thing, Maha..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06796"
msgstr ""
"Well, {actor_name:5}, we must\n"
"be going now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh29"
msgid "06797"
msgstr ""
"Take care in your\n"
"travels, {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaroh30"
msgid "06798"
msgstr ""
"I wish that I were free\n"
"to travel the world, like\n"
"{actor_name:5} and his friends."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgCheckedTheTablet"
msgid "06799"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} checked the\n"
"tablet. It has strange\n"
"characters written on it.{page_break}"
"Wielder of Wind's might...\n"
"Lay your hands upon this stone.{page_break}"
"We bestow upon thee\n"
"the power to see the\n"
"truth unclouded..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06800"
msgstr ""
"Do you think I ought\n"
"to touch it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06801"
msgstr "{actor_name:7} touched the tablet."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgCheckedThePsynergy"
msgid "06802"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} checked the\n"
"Psynergy Stone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06803"
msgstr ""
"Everyone's PP\n"
"was replenished!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFieldWindStoneWarning"
msgid "06804"
msgstr ""
"Beware the Wind Stones.{page_break}"
"The stones magnify the power\n"
"of the wind. Use caution when\n"
"approaching Air's Rock."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThereSSomething"
msgid "06805"
msgstr ""
"There's something inside\n"
"the cracked ice..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgWeFollowedThe"
msgid "06806"
msgstr ""
"We followed the pirates\n"
"here from Madra...{page_break}"
"Are you going to\n"
"Alhafra, too?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06807"
msgstr ""
"I don't think you can\n"
"get there through\n"
"the desert...{page_break}"
"You probably should've\n"
"crossed the bridge you\n"
"passed on the way here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06808"
msgstr ""
"You guys are lucky. We've\n"
"gotta find some way\n"
"through this desert."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfThatAccursed"
msgid "06809"
msgstr ""
"If that accursed pirate Briggs\n"
"hadn't smashed the bridge,\n"
"we wouldn't be here!{page_break}"
"Maybe we won't find him,\n"
"but I promise you {actor_name:8}\n"
"will pay the price for him!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOooohThisDesert"
msgid "06810"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Ooooh...{reset_text_style} This desert...\n"
"It's so hot out here!\n"
"I feel dizzy!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWaterMyThroat"
msgid "06811"
msgstr ""
"Water... My throat is\n"
"so parched! *Gasp!*\n"
"...It's no use..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgCanTWe"
msgid "06812"
msgstr ""
"Can't we just forget\n"
"about Briggs?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06813"
msgstr ""
"No. I'm not about to\n"
"quit looking for him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06814"
msgstr ""
"There must be some\n"
"way through this desert!\n"
"We must press onward!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAsYouCan"
msgid "06815"
msgstr ""
"As you can see, the\n"
"elder is quite insistent\n"
"on finding a way through.{page_break}"
"He feels the only way\n"
"to Alhafra is through\n"
"this desert..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThisIsWhere"
msgid "06816"
msgstr ""
"This is where my son\n"
"must prove himself\n"
"as mayor...{page_break}"
"So, Son. How are you\n"
"planning to get us\n"
"through this desert{page_break}"
"and on to Alhafra?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFatherHowAm"
msgid "06817"
msgstr ""
"Father, how am I supposed\n"
"to get us through the\n"
"desert?{page_break}"
"I think you're over-\n"
"estimating my abilities."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsAndThe"
msgid "06818"
msgstr ""
"Briggs and the Champa\n"
"are nowhere to be seen.{end_wait}I wonder if they actually\n"
"made it to Alhafra..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatIsSo"
msgid "06819"
msgstr ""
"That {actor_name:8} is SO one of\n"
"the Champa... We don't need\n"
"Briggs to prove it.{page_break}"
"When we get back home,\n"
"he's gonna pay for\n"
"helping Briggs."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSureItS"
msgid "06820"
msgstr ""
"Sure, it's hot. But it's\n"
"a dry heat...{pause_20_skippable}and\n"
"I can't stand it!{page_break}"
"I want to go somewhere\n"
"cool and just relax!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThereSA"
msgid "06821"
msgstr ""
"There's a spring over\n"
"there, but we can't\n"
"reach it...{page_break}"
"I can hear Fate\n"
"mocking us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeVeReached"
msgid "06822"
msgstr ""
"We've reached a\n"
"dead end...{page_break}"
"I just want to go\n"
"home to Madra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMySonIs"
msgid "06823"
msgstr ""
"My son is in quite\n"
"a fix, but I'm not\n"
"going to help him.{page_break}"
"Only by overcoming\n"
"adversity can he ever\n"
"become a strong leader."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyFatherS"
msgid "06824"
msgstr ""
"My father's always telling\n"
"me to overcome adversity,\n"
"but he never tells me how!{page_break}"
"I don't understand why\n"
"we can't just go home and\n"
"forget about Alhafra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeyLookUp"
msgid "06825"
msgstr "Hey! Look! Up there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06826"
msgstr ""
"How did those guys\n"
"get up there?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06827"
msgstr ""
"Maybe there's a path\n"
"up ahead that we\n"
"missed..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06828"
msgstr ""
"Maybe... Maybe we can\n"
"get through the desert\n"
"after all!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06829"
msgstr ""
"We can find a way\n"
"through to Alhafra!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06830"
msgstr ""
"I don't care where we\n"
"go, as long as it's cool."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06831"
msgstr ""
"Hey! I found it!\n"
"I found a way through!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAtLastWe"
msgid "06832"
msgstr ""
"At last, we can get\n"
"through this accursed\n"
"desert!{page_break}"
"Except that the elder\n"
"and the others need\n"
"to rest before we go."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWasCertain"
msgid "06833"
msgstr ""
"I was certain this was a\n"
"dead end. What's wrong\n"
"with this desert?{page_break}"
"This is only delaying\n"
"{actor_name:8}'s punishment..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMJust"
msgid "06834"
msgstr ""
"I'm just glad we're\n"
"finally able to rest.{page_break}"
"It doesn't feel like\n"
"my brain is on fire\n"
"anymore..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOhManThis"
msgid "06835"
msgstr ""
"Oh, man! This is the\n"
"best water I've ever\n"
"tasted! Yowza!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOseniaIsSo"
msgid "06836"
msgstr ""
"Osenia is so much\n"
"larger than I'd thought...{page_break}"
"I wonder how much\n"
"farther it is to Alhafra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMySonHas"
msgid "06837"
msgstr ""
"My son...has passed his\n"
"first test as mayor.{page_break}"
"I'll have to congratulate\n"
"him. Eventually. Now, to\n"
"see if his luck holds up."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfWeRemain"
msgid "06838"
msgstr ""
"If we remain here much\n"
"longer, Briggs will be\n"
"beyond our reach...{page_break}"
"We have to press on\n"
"just a little farther..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOhNotAgain"
msgid "06839"
msgstr ""
"Oh, not again!\n"
"Don't tell me they\n"
"want to rest again!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyJobIs"
msgid "06840"
msgstr ""
"My job is to find\n"
"evidence that {actor_name:8}\n"
"is a Champa.{page_break}"
"The elder is with us,\n"
"so I wouldn't dream\n"
"of lying..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMaybeWeShould"
msgid "06841"
msgstr ""
"Maybe we should have\n"
"the mayor go on ahead\n"
"while we rest here..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDonTWant"
msgid "06842"
msgstr ""
"I don't want to leave!\n"
"At least let me fill up\n"
"on water before we go."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHowMuchLonger"
msgid "06843"
msgstr ""
"How much longer will\n"
"we be walking, anyway?{page_break}"
"I feel like we've walked\n"
"off the edge of the\n"
"world as it is..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgRegardlessOfWhat"
msgid "06844"
msgstr ""
"Regardless of what\n"
"happens next, know that\n"
"you have done well, my son."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHoooICan"
msgid "06845"
msgstr ""
"Hooo... I can't believe\n"
"we're going to all this\n"
"trouble for a stranger...{page_break}"
"I'm still not convinced that\n"
"{actor_name:8} isn't one of\n"
"Briggs's henchmen..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNorthAlhafraSouth"
msgid "06846"
msgstr ""
"North: Alhafra\n"
"South: Air's Rock{page_break}"
"Warning: Beyond this\n"
"point, there is no\n"
"route back."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra01"
msgid "06847"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Alhafra. This is\n"
"the largest town in western\n"
"Osenia...{page_break}"
"You can find anything you\n"
"need here! ...Unless you\n"
"need a boat, that is..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra02"
msgid "06848"
msgstr ""
"A massive tidal wave\n"
"hit us and destroyed\n"
"every ship in Alhafra."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra03"
msgid "06849"
msgstr ""
"I hear the tidal wave\n"
"knocked Indra into Osenia.\n"
"Is that true?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06850"
msgstr ""
"Really? It's just so hard\n"
"to believe, you know?{page_break}"
"Still, that would explain the\n"
"massive jolt we felt right\n"
"after the tidal wave hit."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06851"
msgstr ""
"I was hoping a traveler like\n"
"you might have a better idea\n"
"of what happened... Oh well..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra04"
msgid "06852"
msgstr ""
"I guess what those men\n"
"told me was true...{page_break}"
"I'd figured they were just\n"
"playing a joke on me, so I\n"
"ignored them all..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra05"
msgid "06853"
msgstr ""
"Right after my boat got crushed,\n"
"a group of men came by asking\n"
"if I had one for sale.{page_break}"
"They were pretty swarthy,\n"
"like they might have been\n"
"sailors or something."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra06"
msgid "06854"
msgstr ""
"This guy's probably wondering\n"
"about that boat sitting down\n"
"at the pier...{page_break}"
"It still floats, but I don't\n"
"think the thing can move..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra07"
msgid "06855"
msgstr ""
"Losing our boats was awful...{page_break}"
"But I feel so bad for all the\n"
"people whose houses were\n"
"destroyed by the tidal wave."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra08"
msgid "06856"
msgstr ""
"I just can't believe a single tidal\n"
"wave could cause an entire\n"
"continent to move like that.{page_break}"
"But I used to be able to see\n"
"Indra to the north of us, and\n"
"it's definitely not there..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra09"
msgid "06857"
msgstr ""
"Those guys looking for a\n"
"boat sure were in a hurry.\n"
"I wonder why...{page_break}"
"Hey, at least I was able\n"
"to unload that boat with\n"
"the busted mast on them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra10"
msgid "06858"
msgstr "Finally! We made it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06859"
msgstr "We-We're here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06860"
msgstr "Where's the Elder?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06861"
msgstr "He's coming now..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06862"
msgstr ""
"Haaa hoo hooo...\n"
"Are we...here? I feel like\n"
"I just walked 500 miles."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06863"
msgstr ""
"I'm fine... I feel like I\n"
"could walk 500 more!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06864"
msgstr "So...is this Alhafra?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06865"
msgstr ""
"Madra's a pretty big place,\n"
"but this town is huge!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06866"
msgstr ""
"We didn't come to Alhafra\n"
"to shop, Mister Mayor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06867"
msgstr ""
"We're here to bring in\n"
"Briggs the Champa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06868"
msgstr "I know that!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06869"
msgstr ""
"Then we should go\n"
"straight to speak with\n"
"Alhafra's mayor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06870"
msgstr ""
"We're in no shape to go\n"
"present ourselves to\n"
"the mayor right now!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06871"
msgstr ""
"Look, Briggs is obviously\n"
"not here, and besides, we\n"
"already know {actor_name:8} is°"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06872"
msgstr "Silence!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06873"
msgstr ""
"It seems Alhafra has felt\n"
"the effects of the tidal\n"
"wave as well..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06874"
msgstr ""
"It looks like they suffered\n"
"a good deal of damage..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06875"
msgstr ""
"That would explain why\n"
"Alhafra doesn't seem to have\n"
"any boats for sale, either!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06876"
msgstr ""
"You know, just looking around,\n"
"I get the impression they only\n"
"had one boat to begin with!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06877"
msgstr ""
"So if you really needed a\n"
"boat, the only way to get\n"
"one would be to steal it.{page_break}"
"Hmmm... But wouldn't that\n"
"cause quite an uproar?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06878"
msgstr ""
"...Which means the pirates\n"
"must still be here, trying\n"
"to get a boat!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06879"
msgstr ""
"So, you think we've actually\n"
"caught up with Briggs?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06880"
msgstr "No doubt about it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06881"
msgstr ""
"That's why I want to meet\n"
"the mayor of Alhafra before\n"
"the Champa steal a ship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06882"
msgstr ""
"Oh yeah... I get it now.\n"
"In that case, let's go see\n"
"Alhafra's mayor right away."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06883"
msgstr "Um... Say, excuse me..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06884"
msgstr ""
"Where would we find the\n"
"mayor of Alhafra?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06885"
msgstr "Uh... The mayor?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06886"
msgstr ""
"Just keep going down\n"
"this road. It's the last\n"
"house. You can't miss it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra11"
msgid "06887"
msgstr ""
"Those men didn't look like\n"
"they were from Osenia...{page_break}"
"I wonder what business\n"
"they have in Alhafra..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra12"
msgid "06888"
msgstr ""
"Those people that just\n"
"came through looked\n"
"totally exhausted.{page_break}"
"You don't suppose they passed\n"
"through the Yampi Desert to get\n"
"here, do you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra13"
msgid "06889"
msgstr ""
"We've had a lot of\n"
"strangers coming\n"
"through here lately."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra14"
msgid "06890"
msgstr ""
"Our port was ruined by the\n"
"tidal wave, so kids aren't\n"
"allowed there anymore...{page_break}"
"But all I want to do is just\n"
"see what kind of wind is\n"
"blowing in off the sea..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra15"
msgid "06891"
msgstr ""
"The only boat spared by the\n"
"tidal wave is that newfangled\n"
"ship that catches wind in a sail.{page_break}"
"The thing is...the mast that\n"
"holds up the sail got snapped\n"
"apart!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra16"
msgid "06892"
msgstr ""
"Let me guess... You're here\n"
"because you want to buy\n"
"a canoe, right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06893"
msgstr ""
"Sorry, but I'm totally backlogged\n"
"with preorders. I'm gonna be up\n"
"late finishing these as it is..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06894"
msgstr ""
"That's good, because\n"
"I've got a ton of work\n"
"to do already...{page_break}"
"And then I have to head\n"
"down to the wharf and\n"
"help clean up the wreck..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra17"
msgid "06895"
msgstr ""
"That boat at the wharf uses\n"
"a sail, so it's more efficient\n"
"than any galley.{page_break}"
"But since the mast is broken,\n"
"it's not going anywhere.\n"
"What a waste."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra18"
msgid "06896"
msgstr ""
"Why would the mayor go and\n"
"sell our boat to a bunch of\n"
"foreigners?{page_break}"
"I know it's got a broken\n"
"mast, but come on!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra19"
msgid "06897"
msgstr "..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra20"
msgid "06898"
msgstr ""
"If this guy's looking to buy\n"
"a boat, he's looking in the\n"
"wrong town...{page_break}"
"I already sold the last boat in\n"
"town, and it had a broken mast!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra21"
msgid "06899"
msgstr ""
"Who would come to Alhafra\n"
"across the Yampi Desert? It's\n"
"way too dangerous!{page_break}"
"Anyone with half a brain\n"
"would've just taken the\n"
"bridge to the northwest..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra22"
msgid "06900"
msgstr ""
"This tidal wave's actually been\n"
"good for Alhafra. The town is\n"
"bustling with activity...{page_break}"
"I think I'll steer clear of those\n"
"swarthy men at the wharf,\n"
"though... They're a scary lot!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra23"
msgid "06901"
msgstr ""
"I don't know why they won't\n"
"let us kids go down to see\n"
"the dock...{page_break}"
"I wanna see what kind of\n"
"damage the tidal wave did!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra24"
msgid "06902"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if my partner has\n"
"finished up that canoe yet...{page_break}"
"The sooner he finishes, the\n"
"sooner we can clean things\n"
"up down at the jetty."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra25"
msgid "06903"
msgstr ""
"We can't raise the mast\n"
"until we get rid of the debris.{page_break}"
"But I can't help get rid of\n"
"the debris until I finish at\n"
"least this one last canoe!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra26"
msgid "06904"
msgstr ""
"I still can't believe those\n"
"guys wanted to buy my\n"
"busted boat! One man's junk..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra27"
msgid "06905"
msgstr ""
"It may be newfangled, but\n"
"it's no good if it's broken.{page_break}"
"Forget technology! I'm\n"
"sticking with boats with\n"
"oars! No masts for me!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra28"
msgid "06906"
msgstr "Ooo... This ain't good!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06907"
msgstr ""
"That guy looked like the\n"
"mayor of Madra..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06908"
msgstr ""
"He must have come here\n"
"looking for Briggs."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06909"
msgstr "I'd better go tell the others!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06910"
msgstr ""
"What's your problem?\n"
"What are you, some\n"
"kind of freak?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06911"
msgstr ""
"Well? What!? You got\n"
"a problem with me?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06912"
msgstr ""
"Ah, who cares what you\n"
"think? I've got stuff to do,\n"
"so scram, kid!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06913"
msgstr ""
"So where do you get off\n"
"invading my personal space,\n"
"huh? Scram, stinkbreath!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06914"
msgstr ""
"Where was I? Oh yeah,\n"
"I was going to tell them\n"
"about the mayor of Madra!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors01"
msgid "06915"
msgstr ""
"I don't care if it WAS broken!\n"
"The mayor shouldn't have up\n"
"and sold the town's only boat!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors02"
msgid "06916"
msgstr ""
"Those guys who bought the\n"
"boat looked kinda shabby...{page_break}"
"But I hear they paid the\n"
"mayor a whole wad of cash\n"
"for it..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors03"
msgid "06917"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if the mayor\n"
"will use that money to\n"
"repair our poor town..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors04"
msgid "06918"
msgstr ""
"Why would anyone pay so\n"
"much for a broken old boat?{page_break}"
"I know I shouldn't be so\n"
"suspicious, but there's\n"
"something odd about them..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors05"
msgid "06919"
msgstr ""
"We're taking care of some\n"
"people whose house was\n"
"destroyed by the tidal wave.{page_break}"
"But...they're just so demanding!\n"
"My wife feels so overwhelmed\n"
"that she can't take it anymore!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors06"
msgid "06920"
msgstr ""
"Augh! With all these demanding\n"
"houseguests, I feel like I've\n"
"lost control of my own house!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors07"
msgid "06921"
msgstr ""
"Aren't you thirsty,\n"
"my dear?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06922"
msgstr ""
"Oh, you're right, dear.\n"
"I am!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06923"
msgstr ""
"Sorry to bother you, but\n"
"we'd like some tea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06924"
msgstr "Are you talking to me?!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06925"
msgstr ""
"If you want tea, you can go\n"
"right ahead and fix it yourself!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors08"
msgid "06926"
msgstr ""
"Well! I say! It seems the lady\n"
"of the house is no lady at all!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors09"
msgid "06927"
msgstr ""
"When we lost our house in the\n"
"tidal wave, the master of this\n"
"house offered his home to us.{page_break}"
"But living with another family\n"
"isn't easy. Hahhh... They're\n"
"absolutely exhausting!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors10"
msgid "06928"
msgstr ""
"I just wish that old man\n"
"would stop pestering my\n"
"wife all the time!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors11"
msgid "06929"
msgstr ""
"I don't mind helping people\n"
"in need, but I won't be taken\n"
"advantage of..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors12"
msgid "06930"
msgstr ""
"All I ask is for a little tea,\n"
"and that's the behavior I get!?{page_break}"
"I just want to get out of this\n"
"inhospitable house and back\n"
"into my own sweet home..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors13"
msgid "06931"
msgstr ""
"Is this how a young bride\n"
"treats her husband these\n"
"days?{page_break}"
"Back in my day, we were\n"
"never like that!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra29"
msgid "06932"
msgstr ""
"We were hit by a wave so\n"
"strong that it swept homes\n"
"off their foundations!{page_break}"
"What's worse is, all my best\n"
"weapons were washed out\n"
"to sea!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra30"
msgid "06933"
msgstr ""
"Losing all my most expensive\n"
"items may well ruin my business\n"
"entirely..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra31"
msgid "06934"
msgstr ""
"That tidal wave may well wash\n"
"out both my business and the\n"
"weapon shopkeeper's!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra32"
msgid "06935"
msgstr ""
"It doesn't matter how well-\n"
"crafted a suit of armor is... If\n"
"you soak it in seawater, it's junk.{page_break}"
"All my furs are ruined... All my\n"
"steel is rusted. It's nothing but\n"
"garbage now..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors14"
msgid "06936"
msgstr ""
"Don't mention the tidal wave\n"
"to the other merchants...{page_break}"
"It did a lot of damage, and\n"
"we'd really just rather not\n"
"talk about it, you know?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors15"
msgid "06937"
msgstr ""
"If all my goods were damaged\n"
"by seawater, they'd be useless.\n"
"I'd have to throw them all away...{page_break}"
"I'm lucky the wave\n"
"missed my shop."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors16"
msgid "06938"
msgstr ""
"Maybe you've noticed, but a lot\n"
"of folk here lost their homes in\n"
"the wave, but don't mind them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors17"
msgid "06939"
msgstr ""
"You see how full our inn is?\n"
"You'd think we'd be making\n"
"money hand over fist...{page_break}"
"But that's not true... We just\n"
"don't have the heart to charge\n"
"the people who lost their homes."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors18"
msgid "06940"
msgstr ""
"The town ought to give money\n"
"to all the people who suffered\n"
"from the tidal wave...{page_break}"
"That way, maybe the innkeeper\n"
"could afford to make us\n"
"better food..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors19"
msgid "06941"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe the innkeeper\n"
"is renting out more rooms\n"
"when we're as busy as this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors20"
msgid "06942"
msgstr ""
"The innkeeper told me to use\n"
"only the cheapest ingredients\n"
"to help save money."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors21"
msgid "06943"
msgstr ""
"The innkeeper serves his\n"
"paying guests better meals\n"
"than we Alhafrans get.{page_break}"
"That's so cheap! I want\n"
"gourmet meals, too!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors22"
msgid "06944"
msgstr ""
"We're all guests in the same\n"
"inn, so why is my meal\n"
"so awful?{page_break}"
"At the very least, they should\n"
"let us go back for seconds\n"
"of that stinking slop!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors23"
msgid "06945"
msgstr ""
"Ohhh... I'm hungry...\n"
"My tummy hurts...\n"
"When's dinnertime?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors24"
msgid "06946"
msgstr ""
"I don't think I've had a bite\n"
"of meat or fish ever since\n"
"setting foot in this inn."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors25"
msgid "06947"
msgstr ""
"I'll never forgive the mayor\n"
"for failing to come to our aid\n"
"when we were all suffering...{page_break}"
"I wonder what I can do to\n"
"make him suffer..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors26"
msgid "06948"
msgstr ""
"Our guests are very upset\n"
"with the mayor. I just hope\n"
"they don't do anything...rash..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors27"
msgid "06949"
msgstr ""
"My pop's been lookin' around,\n"
"an' he says the mayor keeps\n"
"all his treasure underground.{page_break}"
"He says it's south of the\n"
"palace, but that's all\n"
"I know about it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors28"
msgid "06950"
msgstr ""
"Why do we all have\n"
"to be cooped up in\n"
"such a small room?{page_break}"
"How am I supposed to sleep\n"
"with Grandpa grinding his\n"
"teeth all night?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors29"
msgid "06951"
msgstr ""
"We all have to bear the\n"
"discomfort of this place until\n"
"our homes are repaired."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors30"
msgid "06952"
msgstr ""
"I heard there's only one person\n"
"staying in the room next door.{page_break}"
"Can't they just move one more\n"
"person into that room? Like me?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors31"
msgid "06953"
msgstr "So, you've finally come."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06954"
msgstr ""
"I had suspected we might run\n"
"into each other again, since\n"
"we both are looking for boats."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06955"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately, the only boat\n"
"this town possesses has\n"
"already been sold."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06956"
msgstr ""
"I will be resting here in Alhafra\n"
"a bit longer. I have traveled long\n"
"and hard, and I am weary."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06957"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps we can get along\n"
"at least until we both depart."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors32"
msgid "06958"
msgstr ""
"The broken mast on the\n"
"ship they sold won't be\n"
"easily fixed.{page_break}"
"That is, as long as we Adepts\n"
"don't do anything about it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors33"
msgid "06959"
msgstr ""
"I never imagined anyone from\n"
"Alhafra would ever stay at\n"
"my inn."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors34"
msgid "06960"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps the mayor will cover\n"
"the cost of lodging everyone so\n"
"we can feed them a decent meal.{page_break}"
"We're just trying to be helpful,\n"
"but we're the ones who end up\n"
"looking cheap."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors35"
msgid "06961"
msgstr ""
"I bet the master of the inn\n"
"could afford to give us better\n"
"food than he's been giving us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors36"
msgid "06962"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe the innkeeper\n"
"is cramming all those poor\n"
"people into that tiny room.{page_break}"
"He certainly can't badmouth\n"
"the mayor...they're both stingy!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors37"
msgid "06963"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe I'm only\n"
"supposed to feed the\n"
"villagers vegetable dishes."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors38"
msgid "06964"
msgstr ""
"Maybe it's 'cause all we've\n"
"been eating is vegetables, but\n"
"I just never seem to fill up."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors39"
msgid "06965"
msgstr ""
"I think I've lost weight from\n"
"all these vegetables!{page_break}"
"Sure, I'm looking skinnier than\n"
"ever, but something tells me\n"
"this just isn't healthy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors40"
msgid "06966"
msgstr ""
"Maybe I'm just hungry, but\n"
"everything they put in front\n"
"of me looks delicious.{page_break}"
"I'm so hungry I could eat\n"
"my own hand..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors41"
msgid "06967"
msgstr ""
"*Sniff sniff*\n"
"That smell! That's the smell\n"
"of fish... No! Now I'm drooling!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors42"
msgid "06968"
msgstr ""
"I hope the mayor's treasure\n"
"room doesn't run too close\n"
"to the prison...{page_break}"
"If those thieves found out\n"
"about it, they'd dig their way\n"
"out in no time flat!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors43"
msgid "06969"
msgstr ""
"I know our mayor's bad, but\n"
"he wouldn't stoop to stealing\n"
"from his own people, would he?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors44"
msgid "06970"
msgstr ""
"Everyone says the hill beneath\n"
"the mayor's mansion is full of\n"
"tunnels. I wonder if that's true."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors45"
msgid "06971"
msgstr ""
"I think they put me next to\n"
"Grandpa so they wouldn't have\n"
"to listen to him grind his teeth."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors46"
msgid "06972"
msgstr ""
"When you're living packed in\n"
"together like this, you're bound\n"
"to get on each other's nerves.{page_break}"
"I just hope everything goes\n"
"back to normal once we move\n"
"back into our own homes."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors47"
msgid "06973"
msgstr ""
"That warrior next door\n"
"is so suave and handsome,\n"
"just how I like 'em.{page_break}"
"I hope we can be friends."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors48"
msgid "06974"
msgstr ""
"Really, I do wish you would\n"
"quit using your Mind Read\n"
"on me...{page_break}"
"Trust me, my thoughts will\n"
"become all too clear in\n"
"due time..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06975"
msgstr "!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors49"
msgid "06976"
msgstr ""
"In the middle of Osenia, there's\n"
"a terrible village where they\n"
"worship a foul and vengeful god."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors50"
msgid "06977"
msgstr ""
"The people of Garoh brought\n"
"the curse upon themselves for\n"
"worshipping their wicked god..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEverythingSSo"
msgid "06978"
msgstr ""
"Everything's so boring here...\n"
"Why doesn't anybody do\n"
"anything...criminal?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDonTKnow"
msgid "06979"
msgstr ""
"I don't know why there are so\n"
"many outsiders in Alhafra now,\n"
"but it's bound to mean trouble."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra33"
msgid "06980"
msgstr "Did you want to see the mayor?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06981"
msgstr ""
"Sorry, but he's meeting with\n"
"some visitors from Madra\n"
"right now...{page_break}"
"Maybe you can see him once\n"
"he's finished with them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06982"
msgstr ""
"The mayor is very open to\n"
"meeting visitors, but he's in\n"
"an important meeting now...{page_break}"
"So it's probably good that\n"
"you're not here to see him..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra34"
msgid "06983"
msgstr ""
"Listen, you look like an OK\n"
"guy, and I'd love to let you\n"
"through, but I just can't...{page_break}"
"I mean, if I let you in, then I'd\n"
"have to let everyone in, right?\n"
"I'm sorry, but it wouldn't be fair."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra35"
msgid "06984"
msgstr ""
"I hate my job. I always\n"
"have to be so tough and\n"
"secretive around people.{page_break}"
"Deep down inside, all I\n"
"really want to do is read\n"
"them some of my poetry..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra36"
msgid "06985"
msgstr ""
"My partner's always in such\n"
"a bad mood... Maybe I should\n"
"bake him a cake..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra37"
msgid "06986"
msgstr ""
"No one is allowed beyond this point.\n"
"Don't even think about it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra38"
msgid "06987"
msgstr ""
"The mayor said no one goes\n"
"through, and I mean to make\n"
"sure no one goes through!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSIt"
msgid "06988"
msgstr "It's... It's no use!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06989"
msgstr ""
"The mast just won't budge,\n"
"no matter how many people\n"
"we get to help us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06990"
msgstr ""
"We're going to have to get\n"
"all this junk off the mast\n"
"first."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06991"
msgstr ""
"If we could just get some\n"
"decent footing, we could have\n"
"this thing clear in no time!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06992"
msgstr ""
"There's more to it than\n"
"that, though..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06993"
msgstr ""
"We still have to do something\n"
"about that rope over there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06994"
msgstr ""
"Untangling that'll be a piece\n"
"of cake, once we get a boat\n"
"we can use..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06995"
msgstr ""
"Oh, yeah... A piece of cake...\n"
"Except for that huge\n"
"rock over there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06996"
msgstr "Oh yeah... The rock..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06997"
msgstr ""
"How are we supposed to\n"
"get the mast out from\n"
"under that thing? It's huge!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06998"
msgstr ""
"There's no way we're gonna\n"
"move it by ourselves..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "06999"
msgstr ""
"Well, either way, we can't\n"
"do anything until Zack\n"
"finishes the canoe."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatSYour"
msgid "07000"
msgstr "What's your problem?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07001"
msgstr ""
"You're new in town,\n"
"aren't you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07002"
msgstr ""
"Well, I've never seen you\n"
"before, but whatever..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07003"
msgstr ""
"You're probably curious\n"
"about this here ship, huh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07004"
msgstr ""
"Masted ships like this were\n"
"originally built by the Champa...\n"
"Oh, forget it. It's lost on you."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07005"
msgstr ""
"They call this a \"sailing\"\n"
"ship... Wind is the only\n"
"thing that'll make it move...{page_break}"
"Isn't that incredible?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07006"
msgstr ""
"You kids today, with your\n"
"\"been there, done that\"\n"
"attitudes... It's a shame..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07007"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, well, think how surprised\n"
"we were to find that Alhafra\n"
"had learned to build sailing ships!{page_break}"
"I suppose the age when anyone\n"
"could sail the seas was\n"
"bound to come someday."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWePaidBig"
msgid "07008"
msgstr ""
"We paid big money for this\n"
"ship. It's ours now, so don't\n"
"you go cryin' about it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeSentMy"
msgid "07009"
msgstr ""
"We sent my pal into town\n"
"to get some supplies, but\n"
"he came back looking pale...{page_break}"
"He went straight down\n"
"to talk to Briggs, and\n"
"I haven't seen him since..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfWeCould"
msgid "07010"
msgstr ""
"If we could just raise the\n"
"mast, we could head back\n"
"to Champa..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgPeopleCallUs"
msgid "07011"
msgstr ""
"People call us Champa a\n"
"seafaring people because\n"
"we make sailboats...{page_break}"
"And sure, maybe we\n"
"do a little pillaging on\n"
"the side...{page_break}"
"But now that Alhafra can\n"
"build sailboats, Briggs's\n"
"pirating days may be ending."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIThoughtIt"
msgid "07012"
msgstr ""
"I thought it would be easy\n"
"to right the mast, but I think\n"
"I must have been crazy..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatLousyRat"
msgid "07013"
msgstr ""
"That lousy rat... If something\n"
"happened back there, he\n"
"should have told all of us!{page_break}"
"Now I can't stop worrying...\n"
"What's taking him so long!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhenIThink"
msgid "07014"
msgstr ""
"When I think about how long it\n"
"will be until we go home,\n"
"I miss Champa all the more.{page_break}"
"I'm just glad nobody in\n"
"Champa knows we're pirates."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheMayorOf"
msgid "07015"
msgstr "The mayor of Madra? Here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07016"
msgstr "You're certain?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07017"
msgstr ""
"How did he know we\n"
"came to Alhafra?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07018"
msgstr ""
"He knew we needed a ship,\n"
"and he knew we went east.\n"
"It seems pretty easy to me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07019"
msgstr ""
"Arr... Well, yeah... When you put\n"
"it that way, it does make sense..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07020"
msgstr ""
"He was looking to find\n"
"the mayor of Alhafra..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07021"
msgstr ""
"He must be hoping the mayor\n"
"will tell him where we are..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07022"
msgstr ""
"He'll probably tell the Alhafrans\n"
"we're pirates, too, huh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07023"
msgstr ""
"Pirates!? That seems a\n"
"little unfair!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07024"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean? "
"We{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.are\n"
"pirates, aren't we?{page_break}"
"I mean, we've taken all sorts\n"
"of stuff that didn't belong to us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07025"
msgstr ""
"That's only because everyone in\n"
"Champa would starve otherwise!\n"
"We don't have any choice."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07026"
msgstr "Ah..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07027"
msgstr "And even then, it's never a lot."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07028"
msgstr "Wha-What's not?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07029"
msgstr ""
"The stuff we take. We never\n"
"take too much from any one\n"
"town."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07030"
msgstr "Yeah, I guess not..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07031"
msgstr "And why do you think that is?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07032"
msgstr "Er... Why?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07033"
msgstr ""
"Because you never can tell\n"
"how these wealthy towns will\n"
"react. It's too risky, right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07034"
msgstr ""
"Hey, yeah! Which is why we\n"
"didn't steal anything from\n"
"Alhafra..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07035"
msgstr ""
"Right! That's why we avoid the\n"
"risky towns and just take what\n"
"we need from the others!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07036"
msgstr ""
"See? That's why you're our\n"
"captain, Briggs! You've got\n"
"brains coming out your ears!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07037"
msgstr ""
"Hmph! There's nothing\n"
"brainy about that!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07038"
msgstr ""
"Did you hear that? It sounded\n"
"like a girl! Who's out there!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07039"
msgstr "What do you think you're doing?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07040"
msgstr ""
"Don't you know that someone\n"
"has been falsely imprisoned\n"
"for your crimes?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07041"
msgstr "Er... What's your point?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07042"
msgstr ""
"You have to come with\n"
"us and attest to that\n"
"man's innocence!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07043"
msgstr ""
"And...why would I want to\n"
"do something like that?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07044"
msgstr ""
"Oh-ho! I was hoping we could\n"
"avoid any ugliness, but you\n"
"leave us no choice!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07045"
msgstr ""
"We'll bring you in against your\n"
"will if we must, but either way,\n"
"you're coming with us!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07046"
msgstr "Isn't that right, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07047"
msgstr ""
"Good for you! Let's teach\n"
"these guys a lesson!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07048"
msgstr ""
"After what they've done?\n"
"Come on, we need to\n"
"make them fess up!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07049"
msgstr ""
"You don't stand a chance! We're\n"
"hardened criminal types! We eat\n"
"punks like you for breakfast!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07050"
msgstr ""
"Watch yourselves, you self-\n"
"righteous little brats! You're\n"
"the ones with a lesson to learn!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWellThatTakes"
msgid "07051"
msgstr "Well, that takes care of that!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07052"
msgstr ""
"And I'm willing to bet everyone\n"
"Briggs has been harassing\n"
"will be quite happy to hear it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07053"
msgstr ""
"This should set everyone in\n"
"Indra at ease... They all seemed\n"
"to fear the pirate Briggs..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07054"
msgstr "We lost..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07055"
msgstr ""
"Even pirates have honor...\n"
"I'll go quietly. I won't make a\n"
"scene just because I lost..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07056"
msgstr ""
"Go on... Hand us over to\n"
"Madra or Alhafra or whoever..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07057"
msgstr ""
"Good... First off, you can tell\n"
"the Madrans that the man called\n"
"{actor_name:8} is innocent."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07058"
msgstr ""
"Fine. So, what, I just have to\n"
"say that {actor_name:8} isn't\n"
"one of my men?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07059"
msgstr ""
"That's right. You tell the\n"
"Madrans that, and they can\n"
"release their prisoner."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07060"
msgstr ""
"Saying {actor_name:8} is\n"
"innocent won't clear you\n"
"of your own crimes..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07061"
msgstr ""
"We've secured Briggs's\n"
"vow... We should take him\n"
"to the Madrans..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07062"
msgstr "Wait!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07063"
msgstr ""
"Can't you find it in your\n"
"hearts to forgive Briggs\n"
"and his men?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07064"
msgstr "And who are you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07065"
msgstr ""
"My name is Chaucha.\n"
"I am Briggs's wife."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07066"
msgstr "So you're a pirate, too?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07067"
msgstr ""
"No! Chaucha hasn't done\n"
"a thing! Let her be!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07068"
msgstr ""
"I know Briggs and his men\n"
"have caused some great\n"
"trouble with their piracy..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07069"
msgstr ""
"And I know their crimes\n"
"cannot be ignored..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07070"
msgstr ""
"If you know all that, then\n"
"how can you ask us just\n"
"to forgive him?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07071"
msgstr ""
"The only reason Briggs\n"
"became a pirate was to help\n"
"the people of Champa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07072"
msgstr ""
"We Champa are a seafaring folk.\n"
"Our livelihood depends entirely\n"
"upon the sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07073"
msgstr ""
"But in recent years, the sea\n"
"has changed... We can't live\n"
"the life we once could."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07074"
msgstr ""
"The oceans have warmed, and\n"
"the fish have vanished from\n"
"our waters."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07075"
msgstr ""
"The soil in Champa is rocky\n"
"and barren. No crops can\n"
"grow there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07076"
msgstr ""
"No crops? So you have no\n"
"grains? And no meat? It sounds\n"
"like life in Champa is hard..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07077"
msgstr ""
"It's not hard! It's unbearable!\n"
"Our children can't eat! Our\n"
"village is dying!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07078"
msgstr ""
"These men promised to return\n"
"with food enough for all our\n"
"people, but they found none..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07079"
msgstr "So you became pirates...thieves..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07080"
msgstr ""
"We don't know where\n"
"Champa is..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07081"
msgstr ""
"It sits on the southeast\n"
"corner of Angara..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07082"
msgstr ""
"Southeast Angara? Isn't that\n"
"near Xian and Lama Temple?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07083"
msgstr ""
"You have a good memory! If\n"
"you were to head south through\n"
"the mountains, you'd find it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07084"
msgstr "That's so far away..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07085"
msgstr ""
"Well, yeah! You think we\n"
"could be successful pirates\n"
"so close to home?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07086"
msgstr ""
"If they raided any towns near\n"
"Champa, it would be obvious\n"
"to all who the attackers were..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07087"
msgstr ""
"And no one back home could\n"
"forgive me if they knew.\n"
"Not even my grandmother..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07088"
msgstr ""
"But where does that leave us?\n"
"Are we simply to accept your\n"
"looting here on Indra?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07089"
msgstr "I'm shocked, I tell you. Shocked!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07090"
msgstr "What's so shocking?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07091"
msgstr ""
"It looks like they really\n"
"are pirates, just like you\n"
"said..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07092"
msgstr ""
"Mister Mayor, I am appalled\n"
"that you could not take\n"
"our word for it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07093"
msgstr ""
"He probably wouldn't even\n"
"have believed we were from\n"
"Madra if the mayor hadn't come!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07094"
msgstr ""
"Am I supposed to believe\n"
"the accusations of a\n"
"complete stranger?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07095"
msgstr "Is this your position, Mayor?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07096"
msgstr ""
"How can I be expected to\n"
"believe a tidal wave could\n"
"wash Indra into Osenia?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07097"
msgstr ""
"Or that a group of men\n"
"could walk°on foot!°from\n"
"Madra all the way to Alhafra?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07098"
msgstr ""
"It sounds to me like you had\n"
"forgotten about us altogether!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07099"
msgstr ""
"I'm not sure you remember\n"
"the last time we met. Do you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07100"
msgstr ""
"We met when I was just a child...\n"
"It must have been more than\n"
"ten years ago now..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07101"
msgstr ""
"Twenty years! It's been twenty\n"
"years since I last saw you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07102"
msgstr "Has it really been so long?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07103"
msgstr "It's been a long time indeed!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07104"
msgstr ""
"I guess we can't blame you\n"
"for forgetting his face."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07105"
msgstr ""
"Don't be silly! I didn't forget\n"
"his face! His face merely...\n"
"changed!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07106"
msgstr ""
"Ahem! Forgive my interrupting\n"
"your interruption, but..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07107"
msgstr ""
"Would I be correct in assuming\n"
"that I am speaking to the leaders\n"
"of Madra and Alhafra?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07108"
msgstr ""
"You are correct!\n"
"I am the mayor of Madra."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07109"
msgstr "And I..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07110"
msgstr "I am..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07111"
msgstr "I am the mayor of Alhafra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07112"
msgstr "I am Madra's town elder."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07113"
msgstr ""
"And I am a close personal\n"
"friend of Shin, whose lover\n"
"was injured by the Champa!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07114"
msgstr "I am the scholar Kraden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07115"
msgstr ""
"He is {actor_name:5}, the\n"
"leader of our group."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07116"
msgstr ""
"I am {actor_name:6}, {actor_name:5}'s\n"
"sister."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07117"
msgstr ""
"I am called {actor_name:7}.\n"
"I come from the town\n"
"of Lalivero."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07118"
msgstr ""
"Now, what errand has\n"
"brought you all here?"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07119"
msgstr "We came for Briggs..."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07120"
msgstr "The mayor of Madra claims°"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07121"
msgstr ""
"We followed Briggs here\n"
"from Madra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07122"
msgstr ""
"Of course, we have good\n"
"reason to suspect them\n"
"of being pirates."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07123"
msgstr ""
"Ahem! And I was honestly\n"
"taken aback to hear a\n"
"businessman being slandered!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07124"
msgstr ""
"If they truly are pirates, then\n"
"why would they go to the trouble\n"
"of buying a ship from us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07125"
msgstr ""
"Because the very funds they\n"
"used to purchase the ship\n"
"were pillaged from our homes!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07126"
msgstr ""
"If the ship was bought with\n"
"Madran gold, then it belongs\n"
"to the Madrans!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07127"
msgstr ""
"What do you say? If you give\n"
"them the ship, will that fix\n"
"everything?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07128"
msgstr "Then where will you go?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07129"
msgstr ""
"I won't run, and I won't hide.\n"
"...Actually, I don't feel up for\n"
"much of anything right now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07130"
msgstr ""
"Then you probably won't mind\n"
"being locked up, will you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07131"
msgstr "Briggs..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07132"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry, Chaucha!\n"
"I'll be back!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07133"
msgstr "Take care of Eoleo!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07134"
msgstr ""
"Your strange powers surprised\n"
"me, but even without them, you\n"
"would have overwhelmed us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07135"
msgstr "We'll be taking that boat, then."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07136"
msgstr ""
"You're taking our ship!? You're\n"
"worse than we ever were!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07137"
msgstr ""
"Aren't you at least going\n"
"to pay us for the boat!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07138"
msgstr "Quiet! All of you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07139"
msgstr ""
"Do as you must, but I\n"
"have one request..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07140"
msgstr ""
"You have to let Chaucha and\n"
"Eoleo stay in the boat\n"
"until it's repaired."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07141"
msgstr ""
"You haven't done Alhafra any\n"
"harm, Briggs..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07142"
msgstr ""
"At least keep him locked up\n"
"until the boat is repaired..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07143"
msgstr ""
"And our prisoner, {actor_name:8}...\n"
"Is he one of your men?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07144"
msgstr ""
"I don't know any {actor_name:8}!\n"
"Sounds to me like you've\n"
"made a pretty big mistake!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07145"
msgstr ""
"See! It's just as I said!\n"
"{actor_name:8} is innocent!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07146"
msgstr ""
"You must return to Madra\n"
"and free him immediately!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07147"
msgstr "...Me? What, alone?!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07148"
msgstr ""
"Only two of us will remain\n"
"here. You can return to\n"
"Madra with the others."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07149"
msgstr ""
"Understood! We'll return\n"
"immediately!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07150"
msgstr ""
"Can you come with us?\n"
"...Please?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07151"
msgstr ""
"It looks like that wraps\n"
"this whole mess up..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07152"
msgstr ""
"Let us return to my mansion\n"
"for a nice cup of tea..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07153"
msgstr ""
"You say your name\n"
"is Kraden?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07154"
msgstr ""
"Thank you very much for\n"
"the help with Briggs."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07155"
msgstr ""
"If you have the time, please\n"
"come see me at my mansion\n"
"before you go..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07156"
msgstr ""
"It's nothing special, but I\n"
"would like to thank you for\n"
"everything you've done."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07157"
msgstr ""
"Why do I get the feeling the\n"
"mayor of Alhafra prefers to\n"
"deal with my father over me?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07158"
msgstr ""
"Thank all of you\n"
"very much."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07159"
msgstr ""
"Due to your efforts,\n"
"{actor_name:8} is going\n"
"to be released."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07160"
msgstr ""
"And now, this fine ship\n"
"belongs to Madra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07161"
msgstr ""
"None of this would have\n"
"come to pass were it not\n"
"for you. Thank you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07162"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately, I don't have any\n"
"reward I can offer you here..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07163"
msgstr ""
"Oh, pish posh! We don't need\n"
"any reward, do we,\n"
"{actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07164"
msgstr ""
"Ha! Your honesty is\n"
"refreshing, {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07165"
msgstr ""
"That's as may be, but I still\n"
"feel quite indebted to you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07166"
msgstr "So, what shall we do?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07167"
msgstr ""
"I know... Come to Madra\n"
"after our boat has been\n"
"fixed and we've sailed home."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07168"
msgstr ""
"We are still recovering from\n"
"the effects of the tidal wave,\n"
"so it won't be much...{page_break}"
"But we do want to give\n"
"you some kind of reward."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07169"
msgstr "Well, shall we be going?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07170"
msgstr "I see, so..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07171"
msgstr "Oh! N-Nothing. Never mind..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07172"
msgstr ""
"I do get to stay on the\n"
"boat, right? At least until\n"
"it's repaired?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07173"
msgstr ""
"Yes. That's where I'll be if\n"
"you need me. ...With Eoleo..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07174"
msgstr "I feel kind of bad for Chaucha."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07175"
msgstr ""
"What can we do about it?\n"
"After all, she's the one\n"
"married to a pirate."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07176"
msgstr "So, what should we do now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07177"
msgstr ""
"I suggest that we try to\n"
"find {actor_name:8}. He could\n"
"prove enlightening!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07178"
msgstr ""
"That's true... He seems to\n"
"be a Water Adept.{page_break}"
"He might be able to tell us\n"
"a little about these lands..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07179"
msgstr ""
"Do you think we should\n"
"help them fix the boat?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07180"
msgstr ""
"Say, if we help with the boat,\n"
"maybe they'll give us a ride\n"
"back to Madra! Good idea!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07181"
msgstr "What do you say, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07182"
msgstr ""
"All right! Let's go see\n"
"what we can do to get\n"
"this thing sailing again!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07183"
msgstr ""
"You're opposed to it? Well,\n"
"since you seem to have your\n"
"own ideas, let's get going!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGooGooGa"
msgid "07184"
msgstr "Goo goo ga ga!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07185"
msgstr ""
"Eoleo's only just recently\n"
"started doing that... After that\n"
"gem fell from the sky and hit him.{page_break}"
"He was overcome by a\n"
"terrible fever, and when he\n"
"recovered, he had this power."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEoleoAndI"
msgid "07186"
msgstr ""
"Eoleo and I are going to\n"
"visit Briggs every day."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMGonna"
msgid "07187"
msgstr ""
"I'm gonna use my magic\n"
"to free Papa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfEoleoGets"
msgid "07188"
msgstr ""
"If Eoleo gets the hang\n"
"of it, then maybe Briggs can..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra39"
msgid "07189"
msgstr ""
"We're all going to work together\n"
"to rebuild the homes that were\n"
"destroyed by the tidal wave.{page_break}"
"It may have hurt us, but if\n"
"we put our backs into it, we\n"
"can overcome this hardship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra40"
msgid "07190"
msgstr ""
"Once things are back to\n"
"normal, we're all going to\n"
"build another sailboat.{page_break}"
"If we all work together,\n"
"we'll have it done in no time!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra41"
msgid "07191"
msgstr ""
"So, the guys who bought the\n"
"boat are the pirates who\n"
"were terrorizing Madra?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra42"
msgid "07192"
msgstr ""
"Everyone is talking about\n"
"how you captured the pirates\n"
"in the prison.{page_break}"
"Wow! Taking care of that\n"
"salty bunch is something else!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra43"
msgid "07193"
msgstr ""
"The mayor is the only one from\n"
"Madra who stayed in town.{page_break}"
"They said something about\n"
"freeing an innocent man..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra44"
msgid "07194"
msgstr ""
"The mayor of Madra apparently\n"
"seized the boat from the pirates\n"
"and plans to sail it back home.{page_break}"
"I think he's got quite a\n"
"wait in store before that\n"
"mast gets fixed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra45"
msgid "07195"
msgstr ""
"I never thought a fine house\n"
"could be crushed in the blink\n"
"of an eye by plain old water.{page_break}"
"I guess that's what makes tidal\n"
"waves true natural disasters."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra46"
msgid "07196"
msgstr ""
"I can help build houses,\n"
"too. ...At least for a little\n"
"while, right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra47"
msgid "07197"
msgstr ""
"We've put off fixing the boat\n"
"for now so we can work\n"
"on repairing the town first.{page_break}"
"Which is exactly the\n"
"opposite of what the mayor\n"
"of Alhafra said would happen."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra48"
msgid "07198"
msgstr ""
"Once repairs are done here,\n"
"we have to fix the bridge in\n"
"the northwest of Osenia.{page_break}"
"I guess Briggs destroyed it.\n"
"If you're going that way, I'd\n"
"wait until the bridge is fixed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra49"
msgid "07199"
msgstr ""
"They told me they'd help\n"
"get that mast fixed up.{page_break}"
"Would someone please explain\n"
"to me why suddenly they all\n"
"decided to fix houses instead?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra50"
msgid "07200"
msgstr ""
"What does a sailor like\n"
"me know about building\n"
"houses, anyway?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07201"
msgstr ""
"Hey! You there! Sailor boy!\n"
"Get back to work!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07202"
msgstr ""
"Hey! Give me a break!\n"
"I'm on it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra51"
msgid "07203"
msgstr ""
"It's so nice of everyone\n"
"to chip in and help rebuild\n"
"Alhafra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra52"
msgid "07204"
msgstr ""
"Everyone in town is so much\n"
"happier now that we've started\n"
"rebuilding the town...{page_break}"
"I hope things stay this nice\n"
"once all the work is done."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra53"
msgid "07205"
msgstr ""
"You know, pirates who pay\n"
"for stuff instead of stealing\n"
"must be pretty weird pirates."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra54"
msgid "07206"
msgstr ""
"Those pirates have\n"
"the coolest outfits!{page_break}"
"Someday, I wanna be a\n"
"pirate, so I can dress\n"
"up all fancy like that!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra55"
msgid "07207"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe they left\n"
"their mayor behind! Those\n"
"Madrans are so coldhearted."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra56"
msgid "07208"
msgstr ""
"If our mayor thinks I'm going\n"
"to work on a boat for him,\n"
"he's got another think coming.{page_break}"
"Madra's mayor can wait\n"
"here forever for all I care."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra57"
msgid "07209"
msgstr ""
"You know, sitting here fixing\n"
"houses really makes you think\n"
"about how unsafe the sea is."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra58"
msgid "07210"
msgstr ""
"Helping people out feels\n"
"really good."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra59"
msgid "07211"
msgstr ""
"The fact that Madra took\n"
"our boat from us can't be\n"
"sitting well with the mayor.{page_break}"
"That's probably why he\n"
"put off fixing their mast."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra60"
msgid "07212"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if the crew from\n"
"Madra went back through\n"
"Yampi Desert...{page_break}"
"If they weren't in such a\n"
"rush, they could just wait\n"
"for the bridge to be fixed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra61"
msgid "07213"
msgstr ""
"It's strange... The quarters\n"
"down in the belly of that\n"
"ship feel pretty cramped...{page_break}"
"It seems like there should\n"
"be a lot more space down\n"
"there somewhere..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra62"
msgid "07214"
msgstr ""
"Working on deck with the\n"
"cool ocean breeze on your\n"
"face feels great.{page_break}"
"Working on land doesn't."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors51"
msgid "07215"
msgstr ""
"I'm amazed those guys who\n"
"bought the ship were pirates...{page_break}"
"But then again, they didn't\n"
"much look like your average,\n"
"run-of-the-mill merchants..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors52"
msgid "07216"
msgstr ""
"I thought it was weird that\n"
"someone would pay that\n"
"much for a broken ship...{page_break}"
"They probably had some\n"
"secret plan to steal from us...\n"
"That's why they were so quiet!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors53"
msgid "07217"
msgstr ""
"Pirates? Here in Alhafra?\n"
"That's a scary thought. I'm\n"
"so glad they were caught!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors54"
msgid "07218"
msgstr ""
"Those guys were just trying\n"
"to win our trust so they could\n"
"take advantage of us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors55"
msgid "07219"
msgstr ""
"We've all started working\n"
"together to repair the houses!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors56"
msgid "07220"
msgstr ""
"Oooh... Not much longer, and\n"
"then I can kick these folks\n"
"out of my house!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors57"
msgid "07221"
msgstr ""
"Once my old neighbors' house\n"
"is repaired, my life can finally\n"
"get back to normal."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors58"
msgid "07222"
msgstr ""
"Once everyone started working\n"
"to rebuild the town, our hostess\n"
"started being much nicer."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors59"
msgid "07223"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what happened\n"
"that's making the lady of the\n"
"house smile so much..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors60"
msgid "07224"
msgstr ""
"Ahh... It's so relieving to see\n"
"my wife smiling again.{page_break}"
"I don't think there will be\n"
"any more arguments with\n"
"our elderly guests..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors61"
msgid "07225"
msgstr ""
"It won't be long until our\n"
"guests go back home...{page_break}"
"It's a lot of work to help\n"
"a friend in need, but it does\n"
"feel good to be nice."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors62"
msgid "07226"
msgstr ""
"The lady of this house is so\n"
"temperamental. She gets angry\n"
"at the smallest things...{page_break}"
"It was just a little tomato\n"
"juice. How was I to know\n"
"that was her wedding gown?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors63"
msgid "07227"
msgstr ""
"The lady of the house is\n"
"so adorable when she's\n"
"in a good mood.{page_break}"
"It would be nice if she\n"
"were always in a good mood..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra63"
msgid "07228"
msgstr ""
"Once they fix the old folks'\n"
"home, it'll be our turn to get\n"
"some repairs done.{page_break}"
"We're all doing our part\n"
"to get things fixed, even if\n"
"it's just a little cleaning up."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra64"
msgid "07229"
msgstr ""
"I was afraid my house\n"
"would never get repaired,\n"
"but everything's fine now.{page_break}"
"With everyone working\n"
"together, maybe our new\n"
"houses will be a little sturdier."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra65"
msgid "07230"
msgstr ""
"I'm so hungry I can't\n"
"even move..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra66"
msgid "07231"
msgstr ""
"If we don't get out of\n"
"this inn soon, I'll die of\n"
"starvation!{page_break}"
"The sooner Dad gets the\n"
"house fixed, the sooner I\n"
"get a good meal!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra67"
msgid "07232"
msgstr ""
"You know, since we're rebuilding\n"
"the house, maybe I'll ask for\n"
"my own room!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra68"
msgid "07233"
msgstr ""
"I wish someone would\n"
"just bring me some food..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra69"
msgid "07234"
msgstr "Thanks, mister."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07235"
msgstr "The kid ate the bread."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07236"
msgstr ""
"Oh, wow, I feel so much better!\n"
"Look at how much energy\n"
"I've got now!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra70"
msgid "07237"
msgstr ""
"Geez, mister, I don't know\n"
"how I can repay you..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07238"
msgstr ""
"Wait, I've got it! Do you\n"
"like...adventures?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07239"
msgstr ""
"Then you totally have to go\n"
"check out the caves under\n"
"the mayor's mansion!{page_break}"
"Go find my dad... He's up\n"
"along the path near there.\n"
"The entrance is just past him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07240"
msgstr ""
"Really? Wow... You're so boring.\n"
"Well, if you change your\n"
"mind, just let me know."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra71"
msgid "07241"
msgstr ""
"I'm feeling a lot better now\n"
"thanks to you, mister.{page_break}"
"If you get any more food,\n"
"could you bring it to me, too?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra72"
msgid "07242"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if I should have\n"
"shared some with my sister."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra73"
msgid "07243"
msgstr ""
"All my neighbors are going\n"
"to work together to help\n"
"rebuild my house.{page_break}"
"A friend in need really\n"
"is a friend indeed!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra74"
msgid "07244"
msgstr "Why, look at this!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07245"
msgstr ""
"Wow, honey! You found\n"
"some gold coins!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07246"
msgstr ""
"Way to go, Mom! So...\n"
"How much did you find?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07247"
msgstr ""
"Oh! Well, it's not too much...\n"
"It's only 5 coins."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07248"
msgstr ""
"That's great, though! We can\n"
"use it to buy some food!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07249"
msgstr "I'm going to start looking, too!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra75"
msgid "07250"
msgstr ""
"What a stroke of luck! Right\n"
"when we really needed it, too!{page_break}"
"There might be more, so\n"
"let's keep looking!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra76"
msgid "07251"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if there's any more\n"
"money hidden around here...{page_break}"
"Oh, and I'll help with\n"
"the cleaning up, too!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra77"
msgid "07252"
msgstr ""
"My dad lost the draw, so\n"
"our house is going to be\n"
"the last one to get fixed..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra78"
msgid "07253"
msgstr ""
"Losing the lottery and being\n"
"the last house to get fixed\n"
"takes some pretty bad luck.{page_break}"
"At least no one is\n"
"complaining about how\n"
"bad our luck is...except me..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra79"
msgid "07254"
msgstr ""
"I thought the hard part of\n"
"cleaning up would be fixing\n"
"the houses...{page_break}"
"But that's a piece of cake\n"
"next to having to pick up\n"
"all these pots and jars..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra80"
msgid "07255"
msgstr ""
"I really shouldn't be peeking\n"
"into other people's pots,\n"
"should I?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra81"
msgid "07256"
msgstr ""
"All because of my dad's\n"
"stupid luck, our house is\n"
"the very last one fixed.{page_break}"
"Maybe he can make up\n"
"for it by finding some cash."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra82"
msgid "07257"
msgstr ""
"What? Briggs was the\n"
"leader of a crew of pirates?\n"
"Aw, but he was so nice!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra83"
msgid "07258"
msgstr ""
"Briggs was very generous.\n"
"He bought plenty of weapons.\n"
"Wait a minute...{page_break}"
"I wonder what he was\n"
"going to DO with all\n"
"those weapons..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra84"
msgid "07259"
msgstr ""
"That group from Madra\n"
"was incredibly lucky!{page_break}"
"They didn't do a thing, but\n"
"they get a great boat because\n"
"someone else caught Briggs."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra85"
msgid "07260"
msgstr ""
"Getting a boat for nothing\n"
