"dreams coming to fruition."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors84"
msgid "07283"
msgstr ""
"That cute boy next door\n"
"left already. What a shame."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors85"
msgid "07284"
