"the most amazing view of\n"
"Air's Rock from there."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor02"
msgid "07340"
msgstr ""
"What do you think of Alhafra?\n"
"Have you taken a fancy to it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07341"
msgstr ""
"Then you are welcome to\n"
"stay here and relax for\n"
"as long as you please.{page_break}"
