"be happy to hear it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07342"
msgstr ""
"Then why don't you follow\n"
"your feet to the south?{page_break}"
"There are plenty of delights\n"
"for warriors such as you in\n"
"the middle of Osenia."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor03"
msgid "07343"
msgstr ""
"Our town was rife with\n"
"pirates until just recently.{page_break}"
"Your efforts have removed\n"
"a scourge from our town. We\n"
"truly owe you our gratitude."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor04"
msgid "07344"
msgstr ""
"The mountains to the east\n"
