"many people think there must\n"
"be something in hiding there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor06"
msgid "07346"
msgstr ""
"Why do they always tell me\n"
"to send adventure-seekers\n"
"to South Osenia?{page_break}"
"All you do is go to the\n"
"desert and head south. Where's\n"
"the adventure in that?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor07"
msgid "07347"
msgstr ""
"Those pirates never did us\n"
"any harm, but that's because\n"
"they were up to something."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor08"
msgid "07348"
msgstr ""
"There's no way to cross the\n"
"Balloo Range from here.{page_break}"
