"when you see it is \"Now\n"
"that's one serious rock!\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07351"
msgstr ""
"Oh... I guess today is a bit\n"
"cloudier than usual.{page_break}"
"Air's Rock has another name.\n"
"They call it the Windy Peak. You\n"
"almost never see clouds near it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor11"
msgid "07352"
msgstr ""
"The longer I sit here gazing\n"
"at Air's Rock, the more I grow\n"
"to love it.{page_break}"
"All it takes is one glance,\n"
"and you're convinced it holds\n"
"some mystery deep within."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor12"
msgid "07353"
msgstr ""
"I'd been saying Indra wasn't\n"
