"continent should and\n"
"shouldn't be, I tell you!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor14"
msgid "07355"
msgstr ""
"Are you the brave hero\n"
"who defeated the pirates?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07356"
msgstr ""
