"and the strength and\n"
"cunning of a beast.{page_break}"
"If you don't think any such\n"
"creatures exist, then head\n"
"south and see for yourself."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07357"
msgstr ""
"I know you're the one who\n"
"beat the pirates... Don't try\n"
"to act humble...{page_break}"
"You should have a little\n"
"more faith in your deeds."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor15"
msgid "07358"
msgstr ""
"I heard the pirates talking\n"
