"There must be a way to fix\n"
"that boat without relying on\n"
"Alhafra's help..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor22"
msgid "07366"
msgstr ""
"The money Briggs used to\n"
"pay for that boat was stolen\n"
"from our people...{page_break}"
