"stolen from them. Nothing more..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07369"
msgstr ""
"But now, it seems the Madrans\n"
"are getting the better end of\n"
"the deal..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07370"
msgstr ""
"The mayor thinks it unfair\n"
"that Madra should benefit\n"
"while Alhafra suffers."

