msgctxt "message"
msgid "07371"
msgstr ""
"That's why he's keeping the\n"
"pirates' money and using it\n"
"to repair Alhafra, not the boat."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07372"
msgstr ""
"If Madra wants their boat\n"
"fixed, then they can just\n"
"pay us to have it fixed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor24"
msgid "07373"
msgstr ""
"Briggs tells me there are\n"
"huge towns on a continent\n"
"that lies across the Eastern Sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07374"
msgstr ""
"He tells me that, by trading\n"
"with one another, all of these\n"
"towns prosper and grow..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07375"
msgstr ""
"I've made a decision... If Alhafra\n"
"is to prosper, then we must\n"
"trade, too! Trade and grow!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07376"
msgstr ""
"I'm going to build an entire\n"
"trade fleet and make lots\n"
"of money!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07377"
msgstr ""
"Still...there must be other\n"
"pirates and freebooters\n"
"still roaming the high seas."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07378"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}, Briggs told\n"
"me you and your friends\n"
"fought with great strength."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07379"
msgstr ""
"If you could lend me that\n"
"strength, we would need\n"
"not fear any pirates."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07380"
msgstr ""
"So if you'd just be willing\n"
"to help us out, our town could\n"
"begin trading...and prospering..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07381"
msgstr ""
"What do you say?\n"
"Do we have a deal?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07382"
msgstr ""
"Great! Why don't you just\n"
"stay here in Alhafra until we're\n"
"ready for our first trade run?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07383"
msgstr ""
"Ah, such a pity that you\n"
"don't see the potential of\n"
"this partnership...{page_break}"
"I certainly hope you will\n"
"reconsider... We stand to\n"
"make a lot of money..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor25"
msgid "07384"
msgstr ""
"I am planning a glorious new\n"
"sailing ship so that we can\n"
"begin trading immediately...{page_break}"
"I'm certain this will go well,\n"
"and we will both become\n"
"very, very wealthy indeed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor26"
msgid "07385"
msgstr ""
"The mayor won't help fix the\n"
"boat until he feels he's getting\n"
"a fair payment in exchange.{page_break}"
"If Madra's mayor wants the\n"
"boat fixed, he's going to have\n"
"to shell out more cash."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor27"
msgid "07386"
msgstr ""
"This is such a fantastic\n"
"idea, and I'm the one who\n"
"thought of it...{page_break}"
"So, naturally, it need only be\n"
"me alone who profits from it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor28"
msgid "07387"
msgstr ""
"The mayor hates seeing anyone\n"
"else make money, so I'm sure\n"
"he'll make this tough on Madra.{page_break}"
"Heh heh heh... The mayor\n"
"doesn't play fair."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouDoPlan"
msgid "07388"
msgstr ""
"You do plan to help with\n"
"the mast, right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07389"
msgstr ""
"Not even Briggs and his\n"
"pirates could fix that mast.\n"
"How are we supposed to?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07390"
msgstr ""
"They need our help... We\n"
"at least have to try..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07391"
msgstr "Isn't that right, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07392"
msgstr ""
"Well then, we'd better get\n"
"right to it, hadn't we?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgAreYouFinished"
msgid "07393"
msgstr ""
"Are you finished here,\n"
"{actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07394"
msgstr ""
"Wait, you wanted to do this,\n"
"and now you're telling me\n"
"we should just give up?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07395"
msgstr ""
"I just don't see how\n"
"much more help we\n"
"can be here, {actor_name:7}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07396"
msgstr ""
"Oh, don't be ridiculous! We've\n"
"already done so much."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07397"
msgstr ""
"I know how you feel, but\n"
"there's nothing else we\n"
"can do right now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07398"
msgstr ""
"So... Maybe we should\n"
"start searching for\n"
"another ship then..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07399"
msgstr ""
"...Not that I was planning on\n"
"\"borrowing\" the Madran's ship!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07400"
msgstr ""
"Although...I did plan on asking\n"
"them if we could use it once\n"
"we got back to Madra..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07401"
msgstr ""
"But it doesn't look like\n"
"the ship will be leaving\n"
"anytime soon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSoIThink"
msgid "07402"
msgstr ""
"So I think maybe we should\n"
"just forget about that and start\n"
"on our way again, {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra94"
msgid "07403"
msgstr ""
"It looks like the mayor of\n"
"Madra went home to fetch\n"
"some workers for the boat..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra95"
msgid "07404"
msgstr ""
"I guess our mayor didn't even\n"
"offer Madra any help at all...\n"
"What a crummy thing to do."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra96"
msgid "07405"
msgstr ""
"I hear the mayor of Madra\n"
"went back through the desert\n"
"and home to Madra..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra97"
msgid "07406"
msgstr ""
"He seems like an honest,\n"
"hardworking young man...\n"
"nothing at all like our mayor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDonTKnowWhatWe"
msgid "07407"
msgstr ""
"I don't know what we're\n"
"going to do about this\n"
"rock...{page_break}"
"I think we've done all we can\n"
"do here... Let's get going..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeyYouLot"
msgid "07408"
msgstr ""
"Hey! You lot! Hold\n"
"it right there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07409"
msgstr ""
"Hang on, there's no need to\n"
"stop them. They couldn't be\n"
"involved in this mess..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07410"
msgstr ""
"If you're talking about the pirate\n"
"incident, I believe we resolved\n"
"that to everyone's satisfaction."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07411"
msgstr ""
"This has nothing to do with the\n"
"Champa this time, old man! This\n"
"time, the Kibombo attacked us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07412"
msgstr "\"Old man\"?!? Hmph!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07413"
msgstr ""
"Wait... Did you say you were\n"
"attacked again? By the Kibombo?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07414"
msgstr ""
"Do you know about\n"
"the Kibombo?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07415"
msgstr ""
"You must be pretty worldly,\n"
"considering that they rarely\n"
"leave the heart of Gondowan."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07416"
msgstr ""
"Not many people do... They're\n"
"a barbaric tribe from central\n"
"Gondowan! Watch out for them!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07417"
msgstr "When did all this happen?!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07418"
msgstr "Not too long ago..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07419"
msgstr ""
"Right after the mayor\n"
"left, actually..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgItWasThem"
msgid "07420"
msgstr ""
"It was them, wasn't\n"
"it, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07421"
msgstr ""
"Of course! They did seem to be\n"
"acting awfully strange when we\n"
"saw them in that cave..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07422"
msgstr ""
"Surely you remember, {actor_name:5}!\n"
"The cave? Those strange men\n"
"we saw in there?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWasAnythingStolen"
msgid "07423"
msgstr "Was anything stolen?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07424"
msgstr ""
"Only a single black orb...\n"
"Everything else was untouched."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07425"
msgstr "A black orb..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07426"
msgstr ""
"I'm afraid we don't have much\n"
"more information than that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07427"
msgstr ""
"You helped us with the Champa,\n"
"so, I'll tell you what...{page_break}"
"Maybe you could look around\n"
"at the mayor's house. It's the\n"
"only one that was robbed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFirstPiratesRaid"
msgid "07428"
msgstr ""
"First, pirates raid our town,\n"
"then the Kibombo come\n"
"storming in...{page_break}"
"Things have been going\n"
"horribly for Madra lately..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyGuessIs"
msgid "07429"
msgstr ""
"My guess is the Kibombo\n"
"have long since fled the\n"
"area.{page_break}"
"Still, considering the way things\n"
"have been going, we still want\n"
"to have guards at the gates."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheWayThings"
msgid "07430"
msgstr ""
"The way things have been\n"
"going, I'm so scared I can\n"
"hardly sleep at night...{page_break}"
"Is there no way to appease\n"
"the gods? Is our town cursed?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIVeBeenStanding"
msgid "07431"
msgstr ""
"I've been standing for so\n"
"long, I wish they would give us\n"
"little stools we could sit on."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgOhUhYou"
msgid "07432"
msgstr "Oh, uh... You coming through?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYeahUhWe"
msgid "07433"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, uh... We're sealing the\n"
"hole up right now, so you, uh,\n"
"can't get through this way.{page_break}"
"If you're trying to get into\n"
"Madra, why don't you head\n"
"around to the main entrance?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07434"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, well, that's good, 'cause\n"
"we wouldn't let you down here\n"
"anyway...{page_break}"
"Besides, anyone who's going\n"
"to Madra can just go through\n"
"the main gates, like normal folk."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeSealedUp"
msgid "07435"
msgstr ""
"We sealed up the hole, but\n"
"nobody seems to feel any\n"
"better...{page_break}"
"Maybe we should just fill up\n"
"the catacombs completely..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeThinkThe"
msgid "07436"
msgstr ""
"We think the Kibombo came\n"
"into Indra across the new\n"
"land bridge...{page_break}"
"But just because they {text_effect:2}could{reset_text_style}\n"
"attack Madra doesn't mean\n"
"they had to..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSoTheKibombo"
msgid "07437"
msgstr ""
"So... The Kibombo got into\n"
"Madra from Gondowan, right?{page_break}"
"Well, doesn't that mean that\n"
"we can cross into Gondowan\n"
"from Madra, too?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheKibomboCame"
msgid "07438"
msgstr ""
"The Kibombo came in through\n"
"the broken wall to the west."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHeardThatThe"
msgid "07439"
msgstr ""
"I heard that the elder got\n"
"us a boat in Alhafra...\n"
"I wonder if that's true..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIGuessThat"
msgid "07440"
msgstr ""
"I guess that guy we had\n"
"in prison wasn't one of\n"
"Briggs's cronies after all..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGondowanSoundsLike"
msgid "07441"
msgstr ""
"Gondowan sounds like a\n"
"frightening place. I don't\n"
"think I'll ever go there."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgHeyMisterAre"
msgid "07442"
msgstr ""
"Hey, mister! Are you the guy\n"
"who beat up Briggs?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07443"
msgstr ""
"So does that mean you'll\n"
"go thump the Kibombo, too?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07444"
msgstr ""
"You're not? Someone told\n"
"me it was a young warrior...\n"
"That sounded a bit like you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgICanTBelieveSomeone"
msgid "07445"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe someone\n"
"stomped on those pirates...\n"
"That's incredible!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNowThatWe"
msgid "07446"
msgstr ""
"Now that we're sealing off the\n"
"other end of this hole, maybe we\n"
"won't have any more surprises!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThereAreStill"
msgid "07447"
msgstr ""
"There are still plenty of\n"
"things I want to investigate\n"
"in this cave.{page_break}"
"And until I do, there's no way I'm\n"
"going to seal the entire thing off."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsDidnT"
msgid "07448"
msgstr ""
"Briggs didn't have nearly\n"
"as many pirates under him\n"
"as we thought he did.{page_break}"
"He did an amazing job of\n"
"flanking the town, considering\n"
"how few men he had."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheseCavesWere"
msgid "07449"
msgstr ""
"These caves were my\n"
"secret hiding place.{page_break}"
"I wish they weren't going\n"
"to seal it all up."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatGuyWasn"
msgid "07450"
msgstr ""
"That guy {actor_name:8} wasn't\n"
"one of Briggs's men\n"
"after all.{page_break}"
"I can't believe we locked him\n"
"up without any evidence..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOhWeReleased"
msgid "07451"
msgstr ""
"Oh, {actor_name:8}? We released\n"
"him as soon as we heard.{page_break}"
"He stopped by the mayor's\n"
"house and then left town."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEveryoneYelledAt"
msgid "07452"
msgstr ""
"Everyone yelled at me for\n"
"running away this last time,\n"
"so next time, I'm gonna fight!{page_break}"
"But the thing is, last time,\n"
"I took such a beating I got\n"
"lumps on my head. Ouch!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouShouldaSeen"
msgid "07453"
msgstr ""
"You shoulda seen my partner\n"
"in that fight!{page_break}"
"He was in the mix right up\n"
"until they took him down...\n"
"Man... That takes courage!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfItWerenT"
msgid "07454"
msgstr ""
"If it weren't for that tidal\n"
"wave, none of this awful stuff\n"
"would have happened..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfGondowanIs"
msgid "07455"
msgstr ""
"If Gondowan is really that\n"
"much bigger than Indra,\n"
"then I should go check it out."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSStrangeIt"
msgid "07456"
msgstr ""
"It's strange... It's almost as\n"
"though the Kibombo knew that\n"
"the wall was broken...{page_break}"
"But there's no way they\n"
"could have known...unless\n"
"the pirates told them..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheMayorIs"
msgid "07457"
msgstr ""
"The mayor is supposed to be\n"
"coming back with that boat...\n"
"I wonder when that will be..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeToldUs"
msgid "07458"
msgstr ""
"He told us he was innocent,\n"
"but we jailed him anyway. Is\n"
"that justice? Is that right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgInGondowanThey"
msgid "07459"
msgstr ""
"In Gondowan, they have\n"
"evil magic curses they can\n"
"put on you in an instant!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHeardThe"
msgid "07460"
msgstr ""
"I heard the guys who captured\n"
"Briggs were just a bunch of\n"
"feeble-looking kids..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfTheyWere"
msgid "07461"
msgstr ""
"If they were strong enough\n"
"to beat Briggs, they must\n"
"be huge!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItWasSo"
msgid "07462"
msgstr ""
"It was so convenient, being\n"
"able to sneak out through\n"
"the cave to the other side."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderWhoDug"
msgid "07463"
msgstr ""
"I wonder who dug those\n"
"underground passages\n"
"and why they're there..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWaitIfBriggs"
msgid "07464"
msgstr ""
"Wait, if Briggs only has four\n"
"crew members, then they\n"
"couldn't have outflanked us...{page_break}"
"They must have had help\n"
"from someone else..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIVeNeverSeenAny"
msgid "07465"
msgstr ""
"I've never seen any\n"
"monsters around the\n"
"cave entrance...{page_break}"
"I want to go inside and see\n"
"if there are any monsters\n"
"inside, but I can't..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgDidnTSeem"
msgid "07466"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8} didn't seem like\n"
"he was in a very good\n"
"mood when he left town.{page_break}"
"I guess he was still angry about\n"
"having been imprisoned like that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWasSoHappy"
msgid "07467"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8} was so happy\n"
"to get out of jail...{page_break}"
"But after he spoke to the\n"
"mayor's wife, he looked unhappy.\n"
"I wonder what she told him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDidnT"
msgid "07468"
msgstr ""
"I didn't have a chance to\n"
"run away during the fight. The\n"
"Kibombo were everywhere!{page_break}"
"That's the only reason I stayed\n"
"to fight them. But I'm not about\n"
"to tell anyone that!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgICanTBelieveNobody"
msgid "07469"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe nobody seems\n"
"impressed that my partner\n"
"fought the Kibombo so bravely.{page_break}"
"Don't tell me they don't think\n"
"it takes guts to stand up\n"
"against them, because it does!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors49"
msgid "07470"
msgstr ""
"So Briggs and his pirates\n"
"must have gone to Alhafra\n"
"looking for a boat.{page_break}"
"I'm impressed that they\n"
"were captured before\n"
"they could escape."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors50"
msgid "07471"
msgstr ""
"It was sure sneaky of Briggs\n"
"to destroy the bridge to\n"
"Osenia after they crossed.{page_break}"
"It made it really hard for\n"
"the mayor to reach Alhafra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors51"
msgid "07472"
msgstr ""
"Now that Briggs has\n"
"been captured, I have\n"
"nothing to fear!{page_break}"
"Yes! That means I can head\n"
"to Osenia for some business!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors52"
msgid "07473"
msgstr ""
"It sounds like Osenia is a\n"
"huge place. They took forever\n"
"to catch up with Briggs!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors53"
msgid "07474"
msgstr ""
"The Kibombo are a very\n"
"warlike tribe.{page_break}"
"That last attack was enough\n"
"to warn me to stay away\n"
"from central Gondowan!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors54"
msgid "07475"
msgstr ""
"I'm glad the Kibombo's attack\n"
"wasn't too terrible this time,\n"
"but what if they come back?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors55"
msgid "07476"
msgstr ""
"Our best guess is that the\n"
"Kibombo come from the\n"
"central part of Gondowan...{page_break}"
"Why would they turn around\n"
"so quickly after coming all\n"
"this way?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors56"
msgid "07477"
msgstr ""
"What can we do to stop the\n"
"Kibombo from attacking us\n"
"again?{page_break}"
"Maybe we have to find a way\n"
"to separate our continents,\n"
"like before the tidal wave..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors57"
msgid "07478"
msgstr ""
"The Kibombo apparently used\n"
"ropes to climb down the cliffs.{page_break}"
"But we can't climb back up\n"
"the cliffs from this side."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors58"
msgid "07479"
msgstr ""
"My husband pursued the\n"
"Kibombo after the attack,\n"
"but he had to turn back..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors59"
msgid "07480"
msgstr ""
"If I were just a little bit younger,\n"
"I think I might have been able\n"
"to catch those Kibombo."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors60"
msgid "07481"
msgstr ""
"In his youth, my husband was\n"
"a very fast runner. They called\n"
"him \"The Cheetah.\"{page_break}"
"I guess he's learned that he\n"
"can't race against old age."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors61"
msgid "07482"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8} left that boat\n"
"of his behind when he took off...{page_break}"
"That thing wasn't going\n"
"anywhere, so I guess he had\n"
"no choice but to give up."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors62"
msgid "07483"
msgstr ""
"I can't stop thinking about\n"
"that ship {actor_name:8} left\n"
"by the eastern shore."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors63"
msgid "07484"
msgstr ""
"Some people in town saw\n"
"{actor_name:8} heading toward\n"
"the Gondowan cliffs."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors64"
msgid "07485"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if that ship grounded\n"
"by the eastern shore is still\n"
"broken.{page_break}"
"It seems like a well-built\n"
"ship. It'd be a shame to\n"
"just leave it there..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors65"
msgid "07486"
msgstr ""
"All the Kibombo wanted when\n"
"they attacked was the black orb\n"
"that sat above the fireplace.{page_break}"
"We're just lucky\n"
"no one was hurt."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors66"
msgid "07487"
msgstr ""
"My father was holding on to\n"
"that orb for {actor_name:8}, and\n"
"the Kibombo stole it...{page_break}"
"No matter how much he\n"
"apologizes for losing it,\n"
"it won't make things right."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors67"
msgid "07488"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8} went to Kibombo\n"
"to get his orb back.{page_break}"
"We told him that central\n"
"Gondowan is very dangerous,\n"
"but he wouldn't listen."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors68"
msgid "07489"
msgstr ""
"If my father'd been in town,\n"
"I wouldn't have been scared\n"
"when the Kibombo attacked."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors69"
msgid "07490"
msgstr ""
"My father hasn't come home yet,\n"
"even though Briggs has\n"
"been captured.{page_break}"
"I'm scared that something\n"
"happened to him..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors70"
msgid "07491"
msgstr ""
"When my husband hears that\n"
"the orb he was keeping was\n"
"stolen, he'll be quite angry..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors71"
msgid "07492"
msgstr ""
"I won't ever forget the look\n"
"on {actor_name:8}'s face when he\n"
"heard his orb was stolen.{page_break}"
"He was so sad... It was like\n"
"he'd lost a part of himself..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors72"
msgid "07493"
msgstr ""
"When {actor_name:8} left, he said\n"
"he was going to pursue the\n"
"Kibombo, but I wonder...{page_break}"
"What if he reached the cliffs\n"
"and then couldn't climb them.\n"
"I hope he's not stuck..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors73"
msgid "07494"
msgstr ""
"Dad always knows what to\n"
"do... He'd never have let those\n"
"Kibombo barge in here..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors74"
msgid "07495"
msgstr ""
"I hope he's just late because\n"
"he's looking for a good\n"
"souvenir to bring me..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors75"
msgid "07496"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8} wasn't one of\n"
"the Champa... That's\n"
"why they let him go.{page_break}"
"You shouldn't just keep an\n"
"innocent man in prison for\n"
"no reason."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors76"
msgid "07497"
msgstr ""
"So, that {actor_name:8} guy\n"
"wasn't a pirate after all, huh?{page_break}"
"That still doesn't answer\n"
"where that ice came from...\n"
"That freaked me out..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors77"
msgid "07498"
msgstr ""
"There was something really\n"
"frightening about {actor_name:8}...\n"
"I'm glad to be rid of him...{page_break}"
"He went after the Kibombo,\n"
"but I doubt he'll make it\n"
"back from Gondowan alive."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors78"
msgid "07499"
msgstr ""
"That {actor_name:8} was a\n"
"strange fellow.{page_break}"
"Shin was terrified of him.\n"
"He let him go as soon as we\n"
"learned he was innocent."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheArmorerAnd"
msgid "07500"
msgstr ""
"The armorer and I are busy\n"
"researching the equipment\n"
"the Kibombo left behind.{page_break}"
"They dropped a lot of strange\n"
"weapons that might reveal\n"
"more about the attacks..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheChampaWeapons"
msgid "07501"
msgstr ""
"The Champa weapons we found\n"
"before are identical to the\n"
"Kibombo weapons we just found.{page_break}"
"It can't be a coincidence..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIKnewThere"
msgid "07502"
msgstr ""
"I knew there was something\n"
"strange about the pirates\n"
"attacking us like that...{page_break}"
"I think those weapons we\n"
"found are going to be the\n"
"key to the mystery..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheGroupThat"
msgid "07503"
msgstr ""
"The group that attacked from\n"
"the east used different weapons\n"
"from the group to the west.{page_break}"
"If they really were from the\n"
"same crew, then why would\n"
"they use different weapons?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAllMyInjuries"
msgid "07504"
msgstr ""
"All my injuries have healed\n"
"up pretty nicely...{page_break}"
"It made for a nice vacation,\n"
"but now, it's time to get back\n"
"to work."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors79"
msgid "07505"
msgstr ""
"I'm so happy that my sister's\n"
"all better now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatShinIs"
msgid "07506"
msgstr ""
"That Shin is always bugging\n"
"me just to relax and take\n"
"a break. He's a real pain.{page_break}"
"I like working more than\n"
"I like sleeping."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors80"
msgid "07507"
msgstr ""
"I was so scared that my\n"
"sister wouldn't get better...\n"
"What would I do without her?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors81"
msgid "07508"
msgstr ""
"The Kibombo are a tribe from\n"
"Gondowan... They're searching\n"
"for some great and evil power.{page_break}"
"Do not allow yourselves to\n"
"be corrupted by them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors82"
msgid "07509"
msgstr ""
"If that tidal wave hadn't hit\n"
"us, the Kibombo would never\n"
"have been able to attack."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors83"
msgid "07510"
msgstr ""
"Them Kibombo possess\n"
"{text_effect:4}evil powers.{reset_text_style} They sure\n"
"are a weird bunch."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors84"
msgid "07511"
msgstr ""
"I hope the power of our faith\n"
"will prevent the Kibombo\n"
"from attacking us again..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors85"
msgid "07512"
msgstr ""
"Everyone says them Kibombo\n"
"were mostly nekkid...\n"
"They sound so...savage!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors86"
msgid "07513"
msgstr ""
"We're lucky the Kibombo didn't\n"
"use their evil powers... There\n"
"were enough injuries as it was."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors87"
msgid "07514"
msgstr ""
"I've heard that the Kibombo\n"
"wield an evil, wicked magic...{page_break}"
"But...why didn't they use any\n"
"of it when they attacked us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors88"
msgid "07515"
msgstr ""
"Things have been busy here...\n"
"First, the pirates, then the\n"
"Kibombo... What a week!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors89"
msgid "07516"
msgstr ""
"I hid under my bed on\n"
"the night of the attack.\n"
"I was really scared!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors90"
msgid "07517"
msgstr ""
"I watched the entire attack of\n"
"the Kibombo with my own eyes.{page_break}"
"I'll never forget it... I was\n"
"paralyzed with fear..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors91"
msgid "07518"
msgstr ""
"If you want to know about\n"
"the attack, talk to my partner.\n"
"He saw the whole thing."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors92"
msgid "07519"
msgstr ""
"There's nothing worse than\n"
"wicked, evil magic. I don't want\n"
"to see it, much less use it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors93"
msgid "07520"
msgstr ""
"If it were me, I would have\n"
"attacked a wealthier town.\n"
"...If it were me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors94"
msgid "07521"
msgstr ""
"After I crawled under the\n"
"bed, I fell asleep, so I was\n"
"pretty achy the next morning."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors95"
msgid "07522"
msgstr ""
"I had to go to the bathroom in\n"
"the middle of the night, but\n"
"when I went...{page_break}"
"I saw all these eyes in the\n"
"darkness. I got so scared...\n"
"I didn't have to go anymore."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors96"
msgid "07523"
msgstr ""
"The Kibombo attacked in the\n"
"wee hours of the morning...{page_break}"
"Why weren't they asleep, like\n"
"all us respectable people?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIsTheWay"
msgid "07524"
msgstr "Is the way clear?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07525"
msgstr ""
"This area is clear! The strange\n"
"one has not been seen!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07526"
msgstr "And there?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07527"
msgstr ""
"We have not seen the\n"
"stranger near the village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07528"
msgstr ""
"Do you believe he was truly\n"
"headed toward Kibombo?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07529"
msgstr ""
"The guards here were only\n"
"recently knocked unconscious."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07530"
msgstr ""
"Correct. We were under orders\n"
"to maintain a strict watch\n"
"over the mountain pass."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07531"
msgstr ""
"No one must be permitted into\n"
"Kibombo until Akafubu has\n"
"completed his ceremony."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07532"
msgstr ""
"Then we had better hurry to\n"
"find the one who attacked\n"
"our guards."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07533"
msgstr ""
"Keep a good watch. Do not\n"
"permit anyone to pass."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07534"
msgstr ""
"If anyone interrupts Akafubu's\n"
"ceremony, he will hold you\n"
"responsible..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGuardsAnIntruder"
msgid "07535"
msgstr "Guards! An intruder!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07536"
msgstr ""
"Someone is trying to\n"
"pass! To arms, Kibombo\n"
"warriors! To arms!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHereTheIntruder"
msgid "07537"
msgstr "Here! The intruder is here!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07538"
msgstr ""
"Kibombo does not\n"
"permit visitors!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07539"
msgstr ""
"You just follow this road right\n"
"back to where you came from!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07540"
msgstr "Guard! Get him out of here!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07541"
msgstr "{text_effect:4}Grrrrr...{reset_text_style} Rrrruff!!!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07542"
msgstr ""
"Ah-roooo! Ah-roooo!\n"
"HAWOOOO!!!!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07543"
msgstr ""
"Outsiders are not allowed\n"
"to enter Kibombo. Begone!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGrrrrrRrrruffRrufff"
msgid "07544"
msgstr ""
"Grrrrr!\n"
"Rrrruff! Rrufff!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07545"
msgstr ""
"An intruder! Repel the intruder\n"
"immediately!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeyWhoS"
msgid "07546"
msgstr ""
"Hey! Who's there!? Get\n"
"me out of this crate!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSniffSniffLick"
msgid "07547"
msgstr ""
"Sniff sniff...\n"
"Lick lick lick!!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSDark"
msgid "07548"
msgstr ""
"It's dark! It's cramped!\n"
"Somebody get me out!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgABoneThat"
msgid "07549"
msgstr ""
"A bone! That's my favruff!\n"
"Lick lick... It's deruffcious!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThisRockIs"
msgid "07550"
msgstr ""
"This rock is in my way.\n"
"I want to get to the other side."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgRrruffRrruff2"
msgid "07551"
msgstr "Rrruff! Rrruff!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgDigHereYou"
msgid "07552"
msgstr "Dig here, you dig? Rrruff!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIKnewIt"
msgid "07553"
msgstr ""
"I knew it! I knew there was\n"
"something there, and he\n"
"dug it up! Look at that!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgITriedTo"
msgid "07554"
msgstr ""
"I tried to go to Gondowan to\n"
"find my fellow tribesmen, but\n"
"the ropes were taken down.{page_break}"
"I can't go back to Kibombo\n"
"until someone realizes that\n"
"I'm missing and comes for me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderWho"
msgid "07555"
msgstr ""
"I wonder who removed the\n"
"rope from the other side..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfTheOther"
msgid "07556"
msgstr ""
"If the other warriors knew we\n"
"could not return to Kibombo,\n"
"they would be distraught."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgILongTo"
msgid "07557"
msgstr ""
"I long to see my homeland\n"
"again. This Indra lacks the\n"
"savage beauty of Gondowan."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhereDoYou"
msgid "07558"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}! Where do you\n"
"intend to go?{page_break}"
"We should try to help\n"
"{actor_name:8} recover his\n"
"black orb."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07559"
msgstr ""
"Kraden's right. I think we should\n"
"try to help {actor_name:8}, too."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07560"
msgstr ""
"I completely agree\n"
"with Kraden and {actor_name:6}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07561"
msgstr ""
"It looks like the majority wins!\n"
"Let's go back to Kibombo\n"
"and help {actor_name:8}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe01"
msgid "07562"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Naribwe.\n"
"It's really hot out...\n"
"You should relax a while."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe02"
msgid "07563"
msgstr ""
"The Kibombo went on an\n"
"expedition to the east, but\n"
"they've already returned.{page_break}"
"Do you know what kind of\n"
"expedition it was?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07564"
msgstr ""
"What? They crossed over to\n"
"Indra and attacked a town!?{page_break}"
"The Kibombo are a reckless\n"
"and dangerous people."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07565"
msgstr ""
"Oh, you don't? The Kibombo\n"
"rarely journey far abroad.\n"
"It's very worrisome..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe03"
msgid "07566"
msgstr ""
"The Kibombo never move in\n"
"such large numbers without\n"
"orders from Akafubu...{page_break}"
"Without that witch doctor,\n"
"the Kibombo would be a\n"
"much more peaceful tribe..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe04"
msgid "07567"
msgstr ""
"I would not venture far north\n"
"of here if I were you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe05"
msgid "07568"
msgstr ""
"It's been dangerous out ever\n"
"since the day the gems fell\n"
"from the sky.{page_break}"
"After that day, all local\n"
"creatures suddenly grew\n"
"more powerful and terrifying."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe06"
msgid "07569"
msgstr ""
"When Oeia was their witch\n"
"doctor, the Kibombo were much\n"
"more peaceful.{page_break}"
"Akafubu took over when Oeia\n"
"passed on, and he is responsible\n"
"for their warlike ways."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe07"
msgid "07570"
msgstr ""
"Can you tell me where you\n"
"have come from?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07571"
msgstr ""
"Angara? That is a land far to\n"
"the north, is it not?{page_break}"
"I've heard that when it is hot\n"
"here, it is cold in Angara.\n"
"The world is a strange place."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07572"
msgstr ""
"Why won't you tell me?\n"
"What are you trying to hide?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe08"
msgid "07573"
msgstr ""
"It's always hot here in Naribwe.\n"
"It doesn't matter if it's summer,\n"
"winter, or spring. It's always hot."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe09"
msgid "07574"
msgstr ""
"You don't plan on going to\n"
"Kibombo, do you, mister?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07575"
msgstr ""
"Well, you'll have to find a path\n"
"through the Kibombo Mountains\n"
"to get there.{page_break}"
"The Kibombo warriors keep\n"
"a close watch on the pass.\n"
"They won't let you through."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07576"
msgstr ""
"That's a wise choice. Nothing\n"
"good would come to you in\n"
"a place like that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe10"
msgid "07577"
msgstr ""
"On the far side of the river\n"
"lies a huge mountain we call\n"
"Magma Rock.{page_break}"
"It is a sacred place that\n"
"the gods created long ago."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe11"
msgid "07578"
msgstr ""
"I can hardly stand the heat\n"
"in Naribwe, and I've lived here\n"
"my whole life!{page_break}"
"I can't imagine what travelers\n"
"must think of it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe12"
msgid "07579"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu is almost certainly\n"
"looking for jewels.{page_break}"
"I cannot understand\n"
"why a witch doctor\n"
"needs so many jewels."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe13"
msgid "07580"
msgstr ""
"It is awful to the north of\n"
"Naribwe... It is hotter, and\n"
"the creatures are fierce...{page_break}"
"And worst of all, that's\n"
"where the Kibombo are!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe14"
msgid "07581"
msgstr ""
"That was the day the wind\n"
"blew so hard and the dark\n"
"clouds came from the north.{page_break}"
"That's when those strange\n"
"gems fell from above."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe15"
msgid "07582"
msgstr ""
"Kibombo magic was once\n"
"widely respected. Now, it\n"
"is merely feared.{page_break}"
"That is the way of things\n"
"since Oeia appointed Akafubu\n"
"as his successor before dying."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe16"
msgid "07583"
msgstr ""
"The warrior who passed through\n"
"here earlier said he came from\n"
"an isle in the middle of the sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe17"
msgid "07584"
msgstr ""
"To get to Kibombo, you have\n"
"to cross over the Kibombo\n"
"Mountains.{page_break}"
"I seem to recall my\n"
"grandfather telling me about\n"
"a way past the guards."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe18"
msgid "07585"
msgstr ""
"Sometimes, you can hear\n"
"explosions from across the\n"
"river near Magma Rock.{page_break}"
"I wonder what's going on\n"
"over there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe19"
msgid "07586"
msgstr ""
"When I climbed the Kibombo\n"
"Mountains, I had to find a path\n"
"the Kibombo didn't know about..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe20"
msgid "07587"
msgstr ""
"I remember when I found that\n"
"path above the pass... Not even\n"
"the Kibombo knew about it!{page_break}"
"I'm not even sure I could\n"
"find the way to the higher\n"
"pass anymore..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheFortuneTeller"
msgid "07588"
msgstr ""
"The fortune-teller lives\n"
"at the highest house in\n"
"Naribwe...{page_break}"
"He's the closest thing\n"
"we have to a mayor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeReA"
msgid "07589"
msgstr ""
"We're a small village, but if\n"
"we all cooperate, we can get\n"
"almost anything done."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheFortuneTellerIn"
msgid "07590"
msgstr ""
"The fortune-teller in Naribwe\n"
"has quite a reputation...\n"
"His predictions are so accurate!{page_break}"
"He's always done them for us\n"
"alone, so I don't understand\n"
"how he got so famous."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAsLongAs"
msgid "07591"
msgstr ""
"As long as we listen to the\n"
"words of the fortune-teller,\n"
"we won't have any worries..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouDesire"
msgid "07592"
msgstr ""
"If you desire a reading,\n"
"stand before the table..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgPlacedOnThe"
msgid "07593"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} placed {argument_item_name:2}\n"
"on the table."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgIAmA"
msgid "07594"
msgstr ""
"I am a teller of fortunes.\n"
"Would you have a reading?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThenStandBack"
msgid "07595"
