#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe38"
msgid "07706"
msgstr ""
"The fortune-teller has never\n"
"been wrong...{page_break}"
"But I can't imagine that\n"
"the Kibombo would ever\n"
"really calm down."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe39"
msgid "07707"
msgstr ""
"If the man they were looking\n"
"for has gone to Kibombo,\n"
"they're better off waiting.{page_break}"
"Kibombo is a dangerous\n"
"place for outsiders right now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe40"
msgid "07708"
msgstr ""
"I don't think anyone can\n"
"reach Magma Rock now.\n"
"The river is too deep."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe41"
msgid "07709"
msgstr ""
"Ouch... Some big brute came\n"
"through here looking for a\n"
"woman named Menardi.{page_break}"
"I told him I'd never heard of\n"
"her, and he shoved me to the\n"
"ground and stormed off!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe42"
msgid "07710"
msgstr ""
"What has gone wrong with\n"
"the world? People have no\n"
"respect for their elders!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIGuessThose"
msgid "07711"
msgstr ""
"I guess those warriors learned\n"
"much about their future from\n"
"the fortune-teller.{page_break}"
"You should do the same.\n"
"Bring your items to him,\n"
"just as they did."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOurFortuneTeller"
msgid "07712"
msgstr ""
"Our fortune-teller has been\n"
"saying some horrible things\n"
"lately.{page_break}"
"He's been telling everyone\n"
"that \"our peace shall soon\n"
"sleep.\" It's not very comforting."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThePowerOf"
msgid "07713"
msgstr ""
"The power of the fortune-teller\n"
"is great. Anyone who listens to\n"
"his advice benefits greatly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheFortuneTellerSaid"
msgid "07714"
msgstr ""
"The fortune-teller said that the\n"
"power of nature would rekindle\n"
"the advance of civilization.{page_break}"
"But which is better, an\n"
"advanced civilization, or\n"
"a peaceful one?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfTroubleResides"
msgid "07715"
msgstr ""
"If trouble resides in your\n"
"heart, I suggest you speak\n"
"with my father."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgReadingFortunesIn"
msgid "07716"
msgstr ""
"Reading fortunes in people's\n"
"items takes a lot of energy, so\n"
"he's not always willing to do it.{page_break}"
"But if you have 20 coins on\n"
"you, he might be a little more\n"
"willing."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItemsPlacedBefore"
msgid "07717"
msgstr ""
"Items placed before me are filled\n"
"with the desires of those\n"
"who place them there.{page_break}"
"If I can sense those desires, I\n"
"can answer that which they seek."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFatherShouldCharge"
msgid "07718"
msgstr ""
"Father should charge\n"
"more for his readings.{page_break}"
"People profit from what he\n"
"tells them. Why shouldn't\n"
"he profit from telling them?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAfterFatherS"
msgid "07719"
msgstr ""
"After Father's been reading\n"
"all day, he sleeps like a baby.\n"
"A really loud, snoring baby."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWheneverIGet"
msgid "07720"
msgstr ""
"Whenever I get customers\n"
"from out of town, I always\n"
"tell them the same thing...{page_break}"
"\"The fortune-teller sees all.\"\n"
"Nobody can resist trying\n"
"it at least once."

msgctxt "MsgWhenILook"
msgid "07721"
msgstr ""
"When I look at weapons, I\n"
"can instantly tell what\n"
"monsters they have fought.{end_wait} "

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouWish"
msgid "07722"
msgstr ""
"If you wish to know anything,\n"
"go to the fortune-teller. He's\n"
"fast, accurate, and affordable."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgILikeOffering"
msgid "07723"
msgstr ""
"I like offering armor to the\n"
"fortune-teller. It usually\n"
"gets me good results."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe43"
msgid "07724"
msgstr ""
"Strangers to our town\n"
"would do well to visit the\n"
"fortune-teller's hut."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe44"
msgid "07725"
msgstr ""
"Those who become lost should\n"
"offer the fortune-teller one\n"
"of their hard-earned items."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfIsTraveling"
msgid "07726"
msgstr ""
"If {actor_name:8} is traveling\n"
"in your group, please give\n"
"him this message:{page_break}"
"{actor_name:1} and his companions\n"
"would like to speak\n"
"with him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgISeeSo"
msgid "07727"
msgstr ""
"I see so many travelers...\n"
"How am I supposed to\n"
"remember who {actor_name:8} is?{page_break}"
"And why would anyone come\n"
"all the way to Gondowan to\n"
"find him? What does {actor_name:1} want?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHePaidMe"
msgid "07728"
msgstr ""
"He paid me a lot of money\n"
"to pass this message on, but\n"
"how would he know if I didn't?{page_break}"
"Ah, I'm too honest for my own\n"
"good. I'll keep passing {actor_name:1}'s\n"
"message on to my guests."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhyWouldTravel"
msgid "07729"
msgstr ""
"Why would {actor_name:1} travel\n"
"all this way in search of a\n"
"man he has never met?{page_break}"
"What could it be that drives\n"
"him to look for this\n"
"{actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07730"
msgstr "!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe45"
msgid "07731"
msgstr ""
"It's strange. As hot as it is\n"
"here in Gondowan, if you head\n"
"south, it's bitter cold...{page_break}"
"The land of Tundaria is\n"
"a frozen wasteland that\n"
"deserves its name."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNaribwe46"
msgid "07732"
msgstr ""
"The cold of Tundaria stifles\n"
"virtually all living things.{page_break}"
"Compared to that barren land,\n"
"Gondowan's heat is comforting."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAkafubuSCeremony"
msgid "07733"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu's ceremony is set to\n"
"begin soon. I wonder if he'll\n"
"succeed this time."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgDuringTheLast"
msgid "07734"
msgstr ""
"During the last ceremony,\n"
"Akafubu made the jewel\n"
"float in the air...{page_break}"
"But the mouth of the Great\n"
"Gabomba did not open."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMAfraid"
msgid "07735"
msgstr ""
"I'm afraid of what Akafubu\n"
"will do if he fails the\n"
"ceremony a second time."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07736"
msgstr ""
"During the last ceremony,\n"
"the Great Gabomba didn't\n"
"move. It just stared silently."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSStrange"
msgid "07737"
msgstr ""
"It's strange that Akafubu\n"
"decided to try again tonight.\n"
"What bolstered his confidence?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheGreatGabombaIs"
msgid "07738"
msgstr ""
"The Great Gabomba is\n"
"supposed to open his\n"
"mouth if Akafubu is worthy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhenHeFails"
msgid "07739"
msgstr ""
"When he fails the ceremony,\n"
"Akafubu gets so angry...{page_break}"
"I hope he doesn't turn his\n"
"anger on to me... I'm afraid\n"
"of his powerful magic."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07740"
msgstr ""
"It would be great to see the\n"
"Gabomba open its mouth. Please,\n"
"Akafubu... Do it right this time!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHopeThe"
msgid "07741"
msgstr ""
"I hope the Great Gabomba is\n"
"satisfied by Akafubu's jewel\n"
"and opens his mouth this time."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIsMakingThe"
msgid "07742"
msgstr ""
"Is making the jewel float\n"
"with the power of his mind\n"
"all there is to it?{page_break}"
"I would have thought a ceremony\n"
"like this would have required\n"
"a little more effort."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07743"
msgstr ""
"Rumor has it that after failing the\n"
"last time, Akafubu sat alone in\n"
"the shadows, crying to himself."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhenTheGabomba"
msgid "07744"
msgstr ""
"When the Gabomba is angered,\n"
"his eyes glow with rage and\n"
"fire shoots out of his mouth."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfTheGreat"
msgid "07745"
msgstr ""
"If the Great Gabomba opens\n"
"his mouth, he will have\n"
"acknowledged Akafubu's power.{page_break}"
"When the Great Gabomba\n"
"accepts the jewel,\n"
"the door will open."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeSFailed"
msgid "07746"
msgstr ""
"He's failed so many times\n"
"already...{page_break}"
"Won't the same thing happen\n"
"again if he tries it another time?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07747"
msgstr ""
"As Oeia's disciple, Akafubu\n"
"had a bad reputation for always\n"
"crying and complaining."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHopeAkafubu"
msgid "07748"
msgstr ""
"I hope Akafubu hasn't angered\n"
"the Great Gabomba. I would be\n"
"sorry to see him die like that..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07749"
msgstr ""
"I think Akafubu will speak of the\n"
"great witch doctor Oeia's fate."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAkafubuWasA"
msgid "07750"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu was a good man\n"
"when he was training with\n"
"Oeia...{page_break}"
"After Oeia died, Akafubu was\n"
"simply no longer the same."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAkafubuLooksReally"
msgid "07751"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu looks really confident\n"
"tonight. I think he just might\n"
"succeed this time!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfTheGreatGabomba"
msgid "07752"
msgstr ""
"If the Great Gabomba likes\n"
"the jewel, his mouth will open\n"
"and his tongue will stick out.{page_break}"
"It sounds weird, but it's a\n"
"sign that the Gabomba\n"
"accepts the offering."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07753"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu is so different\n"
"from Oeia, so impatient.{page_break}"
"Why did Oeia have to\n"
"leave us so suddenly?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAkafubuHasNot"
msgid "07754"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu has not yet attained\n"
"the magical skill that Oeia\n"
"possessed...{page_break}"
"I worry for our future if\n"
"Akafubu's character is as\n"
"weak as his magic."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeTravelsTo"
msgid "07755"
msgstr ""
"He travels to Madra and returns\n"
"with a stolen gem, and now he\n"
"expects us to call him a hero?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfTheGreatGabombaActually"
msgid "07756"
msgstr ""
"If the Great Gabomba actually\n"
"moves and sticks out his tongue...\n"
"I might just faint!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAkafubuHasTried"
msgid "07757"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu has tried this before,\n"
"but he has always failed.{page_break}"
"Tonight is different, though. With\n"
"this new gem, he may succeed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeyNoPushing"
msgid "07758"
msgstr ""
"Hey, no pushing! You're not\n"
"going to get any closer, with\n"
"all these people packed in here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07759"
msgstr ""
"The heat is terrible tonight...\n"
"Of course, it's not so much the\n"
"heat as it is the humidity...{page_break}"
"At this point, I don't care if\n"
"Akafubu ever succeeds, just\n"
"so long as he's quick about it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07760"
msgstr ""
"My grandfather spoke of a time\n"
"when the Gabomba was so\n"
"angry that its eyes popped out!{page_break}"
"After that, he says, nothing good\n"
"ever happened in Kibombo.\n"
"Nothing. It was a bad omen."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAsAChildAkafubu"
msgid "07761"
msgstr ""
"As a child, Akafubu was every\n"
"bit as horrible. He always cried\n"
"when he had to share his toys.{page_break}"
"When he was good, he was\n"
"very, very good...but when\n"
"he was bad, he was AWFUL."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThereAreSo"
msgid "07762"
msgstr ""
"There are so many people here!\n"
"If I want to see the ceremony,\n"
"I'll have to climb the posts!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07763"
msgstr ""
"If Akafubu hopes to become\n"
"our witch doctor, he'll have\n"
"to enter the Great Gabomba.{page_break}"
"He's a slow child... It'll take him\n"
"a while, I can tell."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07764"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what Oeia did to\n"
"make the Great Gabomba's\n"
"eyes pop out..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAkafubuIsAttempting"
msgid "07765"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu is attempting the\n"
"ceremony again tonight.{page_break}"
"Oeia performed the same\n"
"ceremony with no problems.\n"
"What's holding Akafubu back?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07766"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu seems perturbed\n"
"lately. I think his failures are\n"
"weighing heavily on him.{page_break}"
"He seems pompous, but it's\n"
"only his lack of confidence\n"
"showing through."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeWhoIs"
msgid "07767"
msgstr ""
"He who is the witch doctor of\n"
"Kibombo holds the most revered\n"
"office in our whole town."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOeiaSSudden"
msgid "07768"
msgstr ""
"Oeia's sudden death brought\n"
"pressure and responsibility on\n"
"Akafubu, well before his time."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07769"
msgstr ""
"Oeia was a great witch doctor\n"
"and a compassionate leader.{page_break}"
"Poor Akafubu... He may be a good\n"
"man, but he will never match Oeia."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07770"
msgstr ""
"Once, these ceremonies were\n"
"guided by both the witch doctor\n"
"and his apprentice.{page_break}"
"Akafubu is little more than an\n"
"apprentice himself... It's no\n"
"surprise that he struggles so."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfOnlyOeia"
msgid "07771"
msgstr ""
"If only Oeia had taught his\n"
"magic to someone else...{page_break}"
"If he had another pupil, this\n"
"would go more easily on poor\n"
"Akafubu. He would not be alone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07772"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if Akafubu even wanted\n"
"to study magic or to become\n"
"Oeia's sucessor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAkafubuBlamesHis"
msgid "07773"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu blames his failures\n"
"on the jewel he originally used.\n"
"He claims it was no good.{page_break}"
"That's why he led a team of\n"
"soldiers to find a new one."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07774"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu used his abilities to see\n"
"the future. That's how he knew\n"
"to find the jewel in Madra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfTheGreatGabombaS"
msgid "07775"
msgstr ""
"If the Great Gabomba's mouth\n"
"doesn't open, Akafubu must not\n"
"yet be a true witch doctor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07776"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what will happen tonight.\n"
"I'm so anxious, I can't stand it.\n"
"When will everything start?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheyAttackedSome"
msgid "07777"
msgstr ""
"They attacked some town\n"
"to get the jewel he needed.\n"
"I hope no one was injured."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07778"
msgstr ""
"I wonder how accurate Akafubu's\n"
"predictions are...{page_break}"
"I mean, if he were any good,\n"
"shouldn't he be able to predict\n"
"the outcome of this ceremony?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIFeelSo"
msgid "07779"
msgstr ""
"I feel so much excitement...\n"
"At last, will the Great Gabomba\n"
"recognize Akafubu's strength?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07780"
msgstr ""
"I can't explain it, but I have a\n"
"feeling that, tonight, Akafubu's\n"
"ceremony will be different."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAtLastThe"
msgid "07781"
msgstr ""
"At last, the sacred night\n"
"has come!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07782"
msgstr ""
"Tonight, Akafubu becomes the\n"
"Kibombo's new witch doctor!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07783"
msgstr ""
"All of you, pray in the\n"
"depths of your hearts\n"
"for my success!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07784"
msgstr ""
"It looks like the initiation\n"
"ceremony is beginning."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07785"
msgstr ""
"I'm not sure what will happen,\n"
"but we'd better hurry, {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhWhoAre"
msgid "07786"
msgstr "Wh-Who are you?!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07787"
msgstr "What... What are your intentions?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgItLooksLikeHas"
msgid "07788"
msgstr ""
"It looks like {actor_name:8} has\n"
"already forgotten us, huh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07789"
msgstr ""
"I know! We met {actor_name:8} when\n"
"he was in JAIL! And it's not like\n"
"he had lots of visitors, either!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07790"
msgstr ""
"What, is he so obsessed with\n"
"his black orb that he can't\n"
"even remember us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07791"
msgstr "Wait a second... I know you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07792"
msgstr ""
"You're the travelers who came\n"
"seeking me when I was in jail."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07793"
msgstr "So, you {text_effect:2}do{reset_text_style} remember!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07794"
msgstr ""
"What are you doing\n"
"in this place?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07795"
msgstr ""
"Actually, that's what we\n"
"wanted to ask you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07796"
msgstr ""
"We were worried about you,\n"
"{actor_name:8}, so we followed\n"
"you here..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07797"
msgstr ""
"And that's what brings you\n"
"to this dangerous place?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07798"
msgstr "What's that supposed to mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07799"
msgstr ""
"We came here to help you,\n"
"{actor_name:8}. Why are you being\n"
"like that about it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07800"
msgstr ""
"Tell me something...\n"
"Exactly when did I ask\n"
"you for your help?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07801"
msgstr "SILENCE!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07802"
msgstr ""
"I shall now present our jewel\n"
"to the Great Gabomba!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07803"
msgstr "!!!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07804"
msgstr ""
"O Great Gabomba!\n"
"Please accept this,\n"
"our humble gift!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07805"
msgstr ""
"Please, Great Gabomba!\n"
"Accept this jewel!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07806"
msgstr ""
"Look! The Great Gabomba has\n"
"noticed the light of the jewel!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07807"
msgstr "Why, Great Gabomba?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07808"
msgstr ""
"Your prayers were weak!\n"
"Open your hearts to the\n"
"Great Gabomba!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07809"
msgstr ""
"Sing your praises and dance for\n"
"the Great Gabomba until your\n"
"prayers reach his ears!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07810"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu is no witch doctor!\n"
"He's an Adept!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07811"
msgstr ""
"I may have to confront\n"
"him to get my orb back...\n"
"I may have to fight."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07812"
msgstr ""
"I will do whatever it takes,\n"
"but I will have my black\n"
"orb back again."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07813"
msgstr ""
"It's no use. We can't get to\n"
"Akafubu from here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07814"
msgstr ""
"This won't work, either...\n"
"What are we going to do?\n"
"We can't get over there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07815"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}'s in trouble.\n"
"Shouldn't we try to help him?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07816"
msgstr ""
"Maybe if we could do something\n"
"about that stump, we could reach\n"
"the backside of Gabomba."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07817"
msgstr ""
"We've got to help {actor_name:8}.\n"
"Right, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07818"
msgstr "Then hop to it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07819"
msgstr ""
"What's all this now, {actor_name:5}?\n"
"Is it too much to ask that you\n"
"help {actor_name:8} in his time of need?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeSeemsTo"
msgid "07820"
msgstr ""
"He seems to believe\n"
"we are enemies..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07821"
msgstr ""
"I hope he doesn't think\n"
"we're with the Kibombo."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07822"
msgstr ""
"I must admit, you don't\n"
"look much like Kibombo..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07823"
msgstr ""
"But that begs the question, if\n"
"you're not Kibombo, then who are\n"
"you, and why have you come here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07824"
msgstr ""
"They are...warriors.\n"
"But how did you\n"
"get in here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07825"
msgstr ""
"Why are these warriors\n"
"in a place like this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07826"
msgstr "I'm not sure how to answer that..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07827"
msgstr ""
"Actually, we've been looking for\n"
"a boat... We kinda need one."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07828"
msgstr ""
"You're looking for a boat...\n"
"in the middle of the continent?\n"
"That seems like a bad idea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07829"
msgstr ""
"Hey, this wasn't exactly\n"
"our first choice, you know?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07830"
msgstr ""
"A tidal wave destroyed all the\n"
"boats in the coastal towns."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07831"
msgstr ""
"You're asking me to believe\n"
"rather a lot, don't you think?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07832"
msgstr "SILENCE!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07833"
msgstr ""
"I shall now present our jewel\n"
"to the Great Gabomba!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07834"
msgstr "!!!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07835"
msgstr ""
"O Great Gabomba!\n"
"Please accept this,\n"
"our humble gift!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07836"
msgstr ""
"Please, Great Gabomba!\n"
"Accept this jewel!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07837"
msgstr ""
"Look! The Great Gabomba has\n"
"noticed the light of the jewel!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07838"
msgstr "Gabomba, why?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07839"
msgstr ""
"Your prayers were weak!\n"
"Open your hearts to the\n"
"Great Gabomba!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07840"
msgstr ""
"Sing your praises and dance for\n"
"the Great Gabomba until your\n"
"prayers reach his ears!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07841"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu is no witch doctor!\n"
"He's an Adept!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07842"
msgstr ""
"I may have to confront\n"
"him to get my orb back...\n"
"I may have to fight."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07843"
msgstr ""
"I will do whatever it takes,\n"
"but I will have my black\n"
"orb back again."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07844"
msgstr ""
"It's no use. We can't get to\n"
"Akafubu from here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07845"
msgstr ""
"This won't work, either...\n"
"What are we going to do?\n"
"We can't get over there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07846"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}'s in trouble.\n"
"Shouldn't we try to help him?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07847"
msgstr ""
"Maybe if we could do something\n"
"about that stump, we could reach\n"
"the backside of Gabomba."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07848"
msgstr ""
"We've got to help {actor_name:8}.\n"
"Right, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07849"
msgstr "Then hop to it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07850"
msgstr ""
"What's all this now, {actor_name:5}?\n"
"Is it too much to ask that you\n"
"help {actor_name:8} in his time of need?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07851"
msgstr ""
"Well, if you're going to help him,\n"
"you'd better do something about\n"
"the stump blocking the path..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheOrbIs"
msgid "07852"
msgstr ""
"The orb is right before me,\n"
"and yet I cannot reach it..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIAmCertain"
msgid "07853"
msgstr ""
"I am certain I just sensed the\n"
"power of Psynergy, but that\n"
"can't possibly be..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBlank7"
msgid "07854"
msgstr "?!?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07855"
msgstr ""
"That power... Was that\n"
"Psynergy?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07856"
msgstr "I knew it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07857"
msgstr ""
"Please, don't try to complicate\n"
"things by lying... It must have\n"
"been Psynergy..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07858"
msgstr ""
"I should have spotted it at once!\n"
"You're Adepts!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07859"
msgstr "Wait, so does that mean you're°"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07860"
msgstr ""
"Yes, my name is {actor_name:8},\n"
"and I too am an Adept."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07861"
msgstr ""
"To be honest, everyone in\n"
"Lemuria is an Adept, and\n"
"not just me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07862"
msgstr "What's Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07863"
msgstr ""
"Lemuria is an island that lies\n"
"in the center of the Eastern Sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07864"
msgstr ""
"Wait a second... You said Lemuria?\n"
"I've heard that name before..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07865"
msgstr ""
"Of course! It was Lord Babi!\n"
"He often spoke to me of Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07866"
msgstr ""
"He said it was so advanced that\n"
"we can scarcely begin to imagine\n"
"what it must have been like..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07867"
msgstr ""
"You are correct. My home was and\n"
"is all that you say. Whoever told\n"
"you this knows much of Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07868"
msgstr ""
"But wait, if it's so far away in\n"
"the middle of the ocean, how come\n"
"anyone knows so much about it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07869"
msgstr ""
"It is not easily reached, and\n"
"we Lemurians seldom leave...{page_break}"
"I cannot imagine how anyone\n"
"could have learned anything at\n"
"all about us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07870"
msgstr ""
"Except... Hold on a moment...\n"
"Babi... I've heard that name\n"
"somewhere before..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07871"
msgstr ""
"Well, yeah... Everyone knows\n"
"about Lord Babi... He's the ruler\n"
"of Tolbi..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07872"
msgstr ""
"I've never heard of Tolbi. Until\n"
"recently, I had never left my\n"
"home of Lemuria..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07873"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}, are you just\n"
"playing games with us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07874"
msgstr ""
"Don't be foolish. What would\n"
"I gain from lying to you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07875"
msgstr "I'm being quite serious."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07876"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8} is not playing\n"
"games, {actor_name:6}. You can\n"
"trust him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07877"
msgstr ""
"Thank you for believing\n"
"me, master sage!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07878"
msgstr ""
"Please, call me Kraden,\n"
"{actor_name:8} of Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07879"
msgstr ""
"And I am the one who should\n"
"be thanking you!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07880"
msgstr ""
"You look puzzled, {actor_name:5}.\n"
"You are probably wondering\n"
"what I'm talking about..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07881"
msgstr ""
"Oh, good! Then I probably\n"
"don't need to tell you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07882"
msgstr ""
"Wait, just because my brother\n"
"knows what you're talking about\n"
"doesn't mean we do! Tell us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07883"
msgstr "I thought as much..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07884"
msgstr ""
"If what Babi told me is true,\n"
"Lemuria is all that remains of\n"
"a once great civilization."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07885"
msgstr "Your friend is correct."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07886"
msgstr ""
"In fact, the reason I was sent to\n"
"Vale was somewhat related to my\n"
"inability to find Lemuria itself..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07887"
msgstr ""
"I don't understand... What was\n"
"in Vale that had anything to\n"
"do with Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07888"
msgstr ""
"Babi believed that, in Lemuria\n"
"alone, the power of Alchemy\n"
"remains unbound."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07889"
msgstr ""
"Lord Babi had need of Lemuria's\n"
"Alchemy, but despite our effort,\n"
"we could not find the lost city."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07890"
msgstr ""
"Since we could not find Lemuria,\n"
"Lord Babi sent me to unlock the\n"
"secrets of Alchemy myself."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07891"
msgstr ""
"Ah, yes! Babi! If I recall correctly,\n"
"a man named Babi came to\n"
"Lemuria long ago..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07892"
msgstr ""
"He stole one of our ships\n"
"and fled the isle..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07893"
msgstr ""
"Yes! That must indeed be the\n"
"same Lord Babi who know\n"
"leads the people of Tolbi."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07894"
msgstr ""
"Now, I'm even more confused.\n"
"This is making my head hurt..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07895"
msgstr ""
"I mean, if Babi really stole a ship\n"
"from your home, why would he be\n"
"trying so hard to find it again?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07896"
msgstr ""
"I can't expect you to understand,\n"
"my dear. Lord Babi's reasons for\n"
"finding Lemuria are...complex."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07897"
msgstr ""
"But if he already found Lemuria\n"
"once, why doesn't he just go\n"
"back the same way?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07898"
msgstr ""
"Once you have left Lemuria,\n"
"finding it again is quite difficult,\n"
"even if you know where to look."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07899"
msgstr "Well...why?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07900"
msgstr ""
"The waters around Lemuria are\n"
"wrapped in a perpetual fog...\n"
"It is very difficult to navigate."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07901"
msgstr ""
"I remember Lord Babi once\n"
"saying something to that effect."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07902"
msgstr ""
"Even if one locates Lemuria,\n"
"getting through the fog itself\n"
"remains quite a challenge."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07903"
msgstr ""
"I don't get it... Why can't you\n"
"just sail straight through it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07904"
msgstr ""
"The ocean currents around\n"
"Lemuria are swift and\n"
"treacherous...{page_break}"
"Only one who can sail\n"
"a Lemurian ship can\n"
"complete the journey."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07905"
msgstr ""
"But...Babi stole a Lemurian ship\n"
"from you, right? That means that\n"
"he can sail it...{page_break}"
"You said yourself that he used\n"
"it to flee the island!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07906"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately, Babi was the only\n"
"one of us who could use the ship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07907"
msgstr ""
"You see, Lemurian ships can only\n"
"be helmed by Adepts..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07908"
msgstr ""
"Which is why I have to get my\n"
"black orb back! I must be able\n"
"to captain my ship!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07909"
msgstr ""
"There may be something up\n"
"ahead on this path."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07910"
msgstr "Then let's go..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07911"
msgstr "Wait a moment, {actor_name:8}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07912"
msgstr ""
"We want to help you\n"
"get your orb back."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07913"
msgstr ""
"You intend to help\n"
"me, Kraden?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07914"
msgstr ""
"I am on this quest for many\n"
"reasons...one of them being\n"
"that I wish to see Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07915"
msgstr ""
"If you would allow me, that is...\n"
"I'd like to visit Lemuria myself."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07916"
msgstr ""
"If this is something you would do\n"
"for Babi, then I cannot permit it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07917"
msgstr "What? Why not?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07918"
msgstr ""
"Babi is a thief. He is not\n"
"well loved in Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07919"
msgstr ""
"It is partially on behalf of Babi...\n"
"...but there's more to it than that!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07920"
msgstr ""
"I want to go to Lemuria so\n"
"that I can see the full power\n"
"of Alchemy!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07921"
msgstr ""
"I want to aid {actor_name:8} so that\n"
"he will take us to Lemuria...\n"
"What do you say, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07922"
msgstr ""
"You'll do it!?\n"
"Splendid!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07923"
msgstr ""
"Why, {actor_name:5}? Why?\n"
"Please, we simply have to!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07924"
msgstr ""
"What's the matter with you,\n"
"{actor_name:5}? I don't see why\n"
"we can't help {actor_name:8}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07925"
msgstr ""
"Yeah. I'm with {actor_name:6}\n"
"on this one."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07926"
msgstr ""
"I appreciate your offer,\n"
"but..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07927"
msgstr ""
"I understand, {actor_name:8}...\n"
"You're not sure if you'll be able\n"
"to take us to Lemuria, is that it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07928"
msgstr "Can't we talk about this later?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07929"
msgstr ""
"Yes, yes, of course! For now,\n"
"let's just get that orb back\n"
"for {actor_name:8}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNowThatIKnow"
msgid "07930"
msgstr ""
"Now that I know the orb is here,\n"
"I won't leave this village without\n"
"it! I will go alone if I must!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouVeCome"
msgid "07931"
msgstr ""
"You've come to help me get my\n"
"orb back? Thank you, all of you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOhOhMy"
msgid "07932"
msgstr ""
"Oh... Oh my... I've heard of\n"
"ceremonies like these... Foreign\n"
"deities are so frightening..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07933"
msgstr "Hmm?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07934"
msgstr ""
"So, the ceremony is finally\n"
"over. Well! Isn't that...nice..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderIfA"
msgid "07935"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if a man in my\n"
"position should really be\n"
"in a place like this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSADead"
msgid "07936"
msgstr "It's a dead end..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07937"
msgstr "But this was the only path..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07938"
msgstr ""
"Isn't it a little strange that\n"
"there would be a path that\n"
"just goes nowhere like this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07939"
msgstr "Hmm..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07940"
msgstr "I see..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07941"
msgstr "So that's how it works..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07942"
msgstr "Listen up, {actor_name:5}..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07943"
msgstr "Dig there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07944"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry. Just use Scoop...\n"
"You'll see why in just a\n"
"few seconds..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07945"
msgstr "I see..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07946"
msgstr "What's this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07947"
msgstr ""
"Someone has put something\n"
"in the ground here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07948"
msgstr "And this statue..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07949"
msgstr "Well, take a look..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07950"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}! Try using Scoop\n"
"around there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07951"
msgstr "Ah... I thought so..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07952"
msgstr "You thought what?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07953"
msgstr ""
"These marks are here to\n"
"indicate an entrance there,\n"
"in the center of the design..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07954"
msgstr ""
"You mean we can go\n"
"inside this statue?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07955"
msgstr "You could at one point..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07956"
msgstr ""
"The entrance was probably\n"
"beneath that stone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07957"
msgstr "I wonder... Was this the only one?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07958"
msgstr "It seems that way..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07959"
msgstr ""
"Man, if this was the only entrance,\n"
"then I feel bad for the people\n"
"who built this statue."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07960"
msgstr "Why is that?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07961"
msgstr ""
"Well, if this is the only hole,\n"
"then there's no way for air to\n"
"get in or out...{page_break}"
"It must have been really\n"
"hot when they were working\n"
"in there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07962"
msgstr "I...hadn't even thought of that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07963"
msgstr ""
"We must inspect this area\n"
"carefully, {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07964"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:6} has raised\n"
"an interesting point..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07965"
msgstr ""
"If people did indeed build this,\n"
"they would not have been able\n"
"to do it without an air supply."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07966"
msgstr ""
"They might have opened a vent\n"
"somewhere nearby."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07967"
msgstr ""
"And if so, then there may have\n"
"been a ladder to enter the vent.\n"
"We should try to find it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07968"
msgstr ""
"Kraden, there doesn't seem\n"
"to be anything of the sort here!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07969"
msgstr "What were we just looking at?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07970"
msgstr ""
"If there is a vent shaft, it\n"
"would probably be quite old,\n"
"maybe even buried...{page_break}"
"Exactly like those marks we\n"
"just uncovered!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07971"
msgstr ""
"And if that's the case, we\n"
"should search more thoroughly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07972"
msgstr "OK, {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGabombaFocusEnergies"
msgid "07973"
msgstr "Focus your energies!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "07974"
