#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08002"
msgstr "Just Pound them in!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08003"
msgstr "Won't that do the trick?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08004"
msgstr ""
"We must watch the path his\n"
"Psynergy takes and move\n"
"the blocks accordingly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOhTheMagic"
msgid "08005"
msgstr ""
