"the witch doctor fills my body!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08006"
msgstr ""
"At the count of twenty, I\n"
"shall present our jewel to\n"
"the Great Gabomba!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08007"
msgstr ""
"Make your hearts as one,\n"
"and dance for the Great\n"
"Gabomba!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGabombaAcceptOffering"
msgid "08008"
msgstr ""
"O Great Gabomba!\n"
"Please accept this,\n"
"our humble gift!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouAreStillNot"
msgid "08009"
msgstr "You are still not pleased?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08010"
msgstr ""
"No! This time, he seemed\n"
"almost like he might..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08011"
msgstr ""
"We must continue!\n"
"Drums! More drums!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLookLookThe"
