"I am Akafubu, the chosen\n"
"witch doctor of Kibombo!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGabombaSawEnergyFlow"
msgid "08052"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, we know... We saw your\n"
"magic energy flowing past us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08053"
msgstr ""
"See how this channel runs\n"
"along the floor?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08054"
msgstr ""
"Here, look... It runs all the\n"
"way over there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08055"
msgstr ""
"But the thing is, the circuit\n"
"was broken right there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08056"
msgstr ""
"So we completed the circuit so\n"
"that your magic energy could\n"
"go where it needed to go."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08057"
msgstr ""
"But...if you truly did this,\n"
"then why? Why did you\n"
"help me?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08058"
msgstr ""
"We were sort of hoping that\n"
"we could take the orb if your\n"
"ceremony succeeded..."

