"It's been hard on Akafubu."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAkafubuSeesThe"
msgid "08097"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu sees the future...\n"
"That's how he knew to\n"
"find the jewel in Madra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIBelieveIn"
msgid "08098"
