"Please, oh please, just\n"
"get it right tonight!!!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWillTheGreat"
msgid "08101"
msgstr ""
"Will the Great Gabomba finally\n"
"accept Akafubu and make him\n"
"our new witch doctor?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgKibomboWasSo"
msgid "08102"
msgstr ""
"Kibombo was so much better\n"
"when Oeia was our leader.{page_break}"
"I wish we could return to that\n"
"life once again..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMSoFar"
msgid "08103"
msgstr ""
"I'm so far away from the action...\n"
