"Akafubu and Oeia are so\n"
"different... How can he ever\n"
"hope to replace Oeia?{page_break}"
"Ah, why did Oeia have\n"
"to die? What are we to do?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHaveFollowed"
msgid "08111"
msgstr ""
"I have followed Oeia's\n"
"instructions and entered\n"
"the final chamber!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08112"
msgstr ""
"He told me that if I reached\n"
"this chamber, I would become\n"
"Kibombo's witch doctor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08113"
msgstr ""
"But what must I do here to\n"
"become a witch doctor?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08114"
msgstr "I do not know..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYourBlackOrb"
msgid "08115"
msgstr ""
"Your black orb rests in the hands\n"
"of the statue before you. Go on,\n"
"take it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOeiaWhatAm"
msgid "08116"
msgstr "Oeia... What am I to do now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOhYoungWitch"
msgid "08117"
msgstr ""
"Oh, young witch doctor... You\n"
"have succeeded in your task.\n"
"You have found this chamber."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08118"
msgstr "Wh-Who speaks?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08119"
msgstr ""
"It sounded like it was the\n"
"statue of the Great Gabomba."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08120"
msgstr "That's ridiculous..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08121"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu! Your magic has grown\n"
"strong! At last, you are worthy\n"
"of the title witch doctor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08122"
msgstr ""
"I give you the feathers and\n"
"gown that are the badges\n"
"of your office!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08123"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu, from this day\n"
"forward, you shall be\n"
"Kibombo's witch doctor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08124"
msgstr ""
"I've done it! I've finally earned\n"
"the right to be witch doctor!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08125"
msgstr "At last!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08126"
msgstr "Yes!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08127"
msgstr ""
"And there is one thing that\n"
"remains for me to give you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08128"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu... You hasty fool... I had\n"
"something else to give you, and\n"
"in your haste, you left too soon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08129"
msgstr "Say, you there..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08130"
msgstr ""
"Yes! You! You, looking\n"
"around there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08131"
msgstr ""
"I have magic for Akafubu,\n"
"magic that he will soon need,\n"
"...but he is not ready for it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08132"
msgstr ""
"As a result, I have decided that\n"
"I shall not pass this magic on\n"
"to anyone just yet."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08133"
msgstr ""
"Tell this to Akafubu:\n"
"If he desires this new magic,\n"
"then he must earn it himself!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08134"
msgstr ""
"If Akafubu does not refine his\n"
"magical arts, then he will never\n"
"earn this new power."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08135"
msgstr ""
"This power shall not be realized\n"
"until he ceases living only for\n"
"himself...{page_break}"
"And instead lives his\n"
"life to benefit others."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08136"
msgstr "Tell him so!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08137"
msgstr ""
"I don't suppose you could\n"
"just...give that magic to us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08138"
msgstr "What do you mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08139"
msgstr ""
"I'm just asking if maybe we\n"
"could earn that magic before\n"
"Akafubu."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08140"
msgstr ""
"The power can be claimed by\n"
"another, but only if Akafubu\n"
"lacks the will to earn it himself."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08141"
msgstr "Aha! So we CAN get it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08142"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps if he must compete\n"
"for his power, he will focus\n"
"and take his office seriously."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08143"
msgstr ""
"But before you do this thing,\n"
"you must convey to Akafubu\n"
"all that I have told you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08144"
msgstr ""
"Oh, of course! We wouldn't\n"
"dream of cheating him... We will\n"
"tell him all you have told us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08145"
msgstr ""
"Follow that path, and you\n"
"will find a cavern..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08146"
msgstr ""
"But now, I shall sleep...until\n"
"the time comes when I must\n"
"anoint a new witch doctor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08147"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}... Go get {actor_name:8}'s\n"
"precious orb."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08148"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}... Do you have any\n"
"idea exactly what this \"Great\n"
"Gabomba\" really is?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08149"
msgstr ""
"If you have unraveled that\n"
"which I cannot, then perhaps\n"
"you are the greater scholar."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08150"
msgstr ""
"You do not understand either?\n"
"Then I do not feel quite so\n"
"foolish..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08151"
msgstr ""
"But doesn't this witch doctor\n"
"magic seem not unlike some\n"
"kind of Psynergy?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08152"
msgstr ""
"Wouldn't it be quite fortunate\n"
"if we were to get our hands\n"
"on that power ourselves?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08153"
msgstr ""
"Oh! You didn't need\n"
"much convincing at\n"
"all, did you, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08154"
msgstr ""
"Hrmm... You would feel guilty\n"
"about taking it, eh, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08155"
msgstr ""
"I needn't remind you, but...{page_break}"
"We're going to need every\n"
"kind of Psynergy we can muster\n"
"to complete this quest..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08156"
msgstr ""
"Either way, {actor_name:5}, we are,\n"
"at the very least, obligated to\n"
"deliver the Gabomba's message."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08157"
msgstr ""
"We must fulfill our promise\n"
"to the Gabomba."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08158"
msgstr ""
"Then, maybe we can come back\n"
"inside this Gabomba statue\n"
"some other time to get it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgCarriedTheMessage"
msgid "08159"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} carried the message\n"
"of the Gabomba to Akafubu.{page_break}"
"By the time {actor_name:5} finished\n"
"his story, dawn had broken."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGabombaChannelTiming"
msgid "08160"
msgstr ""
"It looks like just fixing the\n"
"channel should do the trick...{page_break}"
"Maybe we need to look at\n"
"when the two magical charges\n"
"reach the statue in the middle."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgByReachingThis"
msgid "08161"
msgstr ""
"By reaching this place, you\n"
"have proven your power."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08162"
msgstr ""
"By rights, Akafubu should bear\n"
"this power...{page_break}"
"But I shall keep my promise\n"
"and bestow it upon the one\n"
"to reach this place first!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08163"
msgstr ""
"I am grateful for your promise...{page_break}"
"But I am worried that we have\n"
"done Akafubu and the Kibombo\n"
"a great wrong."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08164"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu has not honed his own\n"
"powers, and the fault lies with\n"
"him alone...{page_break}"
"And yet, there is a hint of\n"
"truth to what you say..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08165"
msgstr ""
"Then what are we to do?\n"
"Does this mean we won't\n"
"receive your magic?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08166"
msgstr ""
"As I have said, I will give\n"
"the power to you. Your\n"
"concern is misplaced."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08167"
msgstr ""
"But I must add some small\n"
"conditions to our agreement..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08168"
msgstr "Wh-What kind of conditions?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08169"
msgstr ""
"You must not...mention\n"
"this to Akafubu."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08170"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu was plainly ill prepared\n"
"for this test. He will lose heart\n"
"if he hears what you have done.{page_break}"
"And yet...the Kibombo have need\n"
"of this ill-prepared leader..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08171"
msgstr ""
"If Akafubu ever reaches this\n"
"place, I shall teach him the\n"
"magic as well.{page_break}"
"Promise me that you will not\n"
"tell Akafubu that you earned\n"
"this magic. Can you do this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08172"
msgstr "Of course!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08173"
msgstr ""
"And now I shall sleep.\n"
"Farewell, successor to the\n"
"witch doctor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgRightWellI"
msgid "08174"
msgstr ""
"Right... Well, I guess\n"
"that's that!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08175"
msgstr ""
"You are virtuous men,\n"
"coming here to deliver this\n"
"message. My son and I thank you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08176"
msgstr ""
"What do we have\n"
"to be thankful of?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08177"
msgstr ""
"If they had just stopped me\n"
"from leaving the Great Gabomba,\n"
"this wouldn't have happened!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08178"
msgstr ""
"What!? If you had been more\n"
"interested in your duty, you\n"
"would not have left so quickly..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08179"
msgstr ""
"But, Father! These people are\n"
"trying to steal the magic of our\n"
"people! It should be mine!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08180"
msgstr ""
"Mine, I tell you! That power\n"
"belongs to me!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMGoing"
msgid "08181"
msgstr ""
"I'm going to be the one to\n"
"get the Great Gabomba's\n"
"magic! You'll see!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08182"
msgstr ""
"My son, you have much to learn.\n"
"He may look like a man, but\n"
"before me, he acts like a child."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08183"
msgstr ""
"See how he behaves when\n"
"he gets excited?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08184"
msgstr ""
"No matter what I say, he won't\n"
"listen to me right now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIThinkThat"
msgid "08185"
msgstr ""
"I think that he has had\n"
"enough for today..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08186"
msgstr "I see your point."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08187"
msgstr ""
"Well! I suppose we should\n"
"be leaving then."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08188"
msgstr ""
"After all, our journey has only\n"
"just begun. We cannot remain\n"
"idle much longer."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgDangWhyDid"
msgid "08189"
msgstr ""
"Dang! Why did I leave that\n"
"stupid room so quickly?\n"
"Stupid, stupid, stupid Akafubu!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAfterHeBecame"
msgid "08190"
msgstr ""
"After he became a witch\n"
"doctor, Akafubu had no more\n"
"reason to focus himself...{page_break}"
"It is good that he now has a new\n"
"goal. He will have to work hard to\n"
"earn the Great Gabomba's magic."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIJustCan"
msgid "08191"
msgstr ""
"I just can't quite grasp the\n"
"Great Gabomba's magic.{page_break}"
"Still, I'm trying really hard\n"
"to help everyone, just like\n"
"the Great Gabomba said..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMySonHasBeen"
msgid "08192"
msgstr ""
"My son has been so kind\n"
"and compassionate since the\n"
"ceremony. He's a changed man.{page_break}"
"He has focused on bettering\n"
"himself and earning the\n"
"Great Gabomba's magic."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAkafubuHasFinally"
msgid "08193"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu has finally completed\n"
"his ceremony, and things are\n"
"starting to calm down.{page_break}"
"Maybe now, our warriors can\n"
"set aside their spears and\n"
"return to their peaceful lives."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgItLooksLikeThere"
msgid "08194"
msgstr ""
"It looks like there are fewer\n"
"warriors in Kibombo now, huh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08195"
msgstr ""
"All of our warriors were just\n"
"local farm boys...{page_break}"
"Now that he's the witch doctor,\n"
"Akafubu let them all return\n"
"to their farming work."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08196"
msgstr ""
"You couldn't tell? I thought\n"
"you might have been a little\n"
"more observant, but oh well..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheGreatGabomba"
msgid "08197"
msgstr ""
"The Great Gabomba's mouth will\n"
"remain open until Akafubu has\n"
"earned the gift of the Gabomba.{page_break}"
"Maybe I ought to sneak in there\n"
"and get a look around while I\n"
"have the chance."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNowThatThe"
msgid "08198"
msgstr ""
"Now that the ceremony is over,\n"
"I feel a touch depressed.{page_break}"
"I wish we could have more big\n"
"events like that soon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgICouldnT"
msgid "08199"
msgstr ""
"I couldn't for the life of me\n"
"figure out how our warriors\n"
"got to Indra without a boat.{page_break}"
"But I just found out that\n"
"something has pushed Indra\n"
"into contact with Gondowan!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOhISmell"
msgid "08200"
msgstr ""
"Oh... I smell something\n"
"delectable. We'll be eating\n"
"some good meat soon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGoodOlMeat"
msgid "08201"
msgstr ""
"Good ol' meat... I love meat.\n"
"I can't wait until we get some."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeGetTo"
msgid "08202"
msgstr ""
"We get to eat normal animals\n"
"again! They taste so much better\n"
"than those monsters we've had!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgYouDidnT"
msgid "08203"
msgstr ""
"You didn't come to Kibombo\n"
"to get revenge on us for that\n"
"raid, did you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08204"
msgstr ""
"How many of you are there?\n"
"We've got some pretty\n"
"fierce warriors, you know...{page_break}"
"You don't really think you\n"
"can defeat all of us, do you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08205"
msgstr ""
"Whew! That's good to hear.\n"
"We're supposed to protect the\n"
"village, but I feel bad for the raid."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheOtherWarriors"
msgid "08206"
msgstr ""
"The other warriors are busy\n"
"hunting right now.{page_break}"
"The food supply for the whole\n"
"village depends entirely on the\n"
"animals they catch."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNowThatAkafubu"
msgid "08207"
msgstr ""
"Now that Akafubu is our new\n"
"witch doctor, we shall embark\n"
"on a path to peace.{page_break}"
"The neighboring villages have\n"
"no reason to fear our warriors\n"
"any longer."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08208"
msgstr ""
"This is a signal fire. We use\n"
"these to send messages to\n"
"neighboring villages.{page_break}"
"I hope these messages set\n"
"our neighbors' minds at ease."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEveryoneWasTerribly"
msgid "08209"
msgstr ""
"Everyone was terribly worried\n"
"about Akafubu's ceremony.\n"
"We're all relieved it's over now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgCoveringOurWarriors"
msgid "08210"
msgstr ""
"Covering our warriors in paint\n"
"makes them scarier, and it makes\n"
"them more intimidating.{page_break}"
"Most of our warriors aren't\n"
"that strong, so they need\n"
"every trick they can use."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWantTo"
msgid "08211"
msgstr ""
"I want to look inside the Great\n"
"Gabomba at least once.{page_break}"
"You don't suppose just peeking\n"
"will get me cursed, do you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNowThatTheWitch"
msgid "08212"
msgstr ""
"Now that the witch doctor\n"
"ceremony is over, I've decided\n"
"that...it was kind of fun!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBecauseKibomboLies"
msgid "08213"
msgstr ""
"Because Kibombo lies hidden\n"
"deep in the continent, we rarely\n"
"hear news of the Eastern Sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouDonTThink"
msgid "08214"
msgstr ""
"You don't think anyone will notice\n"
"if I sneak a little nibble while I'm\n"
"cooking, do you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGulpTheSmell"
msgid "08215"
msgstr ""
"Gulp! The smell of that sauce over\n"
"the fire is making me so hungry...\n"
"How long until we can eat!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLatelyTheMonsters"
msgid "08216"
msgstr ""
"Lately the monsters have been\n"
"increasing, and the animals are\n"
"becoming more and more scarce.{page_break}"
"That's why everyone's so\n"
"excited that we get to have\n"
"nice, normal steaks tonight!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNoOneInKibombo"
msgid "08217"
msgstr ""
"No one in Kibombo really wants\n"
"war with our neighbors.{page_break}"
"We want everyone who shares\n"
"this land to share peace as well."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWithAllOur"
msgid "08218"
msgstr ""
"With all our battles behind\n"
"us, we warriors spend our time\n"
"refilling the village food supply."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderIfI"
msgid "08219"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if I can keep going until\n"
"another village sees our signal\n"
"and comes to meet with us...{page_break}"
"I don't care which village it is,\n"
"just send a delegation! Fast!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHaveHeard"
msgid "08220"
msgstr ""
"I have heard that if you head\n"
"west from southern Gondowan,\n"
"you'll see the Eastern Sea.{page_break}"
"There are two continents\n"
"in the middle of that ocean:\n"
"Hesperia and Atteka."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgAreYouGoing"
msgid "08221"
msgstr ""
"Are you going to head\n"
"to western Gondowan?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08222"
msgstr ""
"That's unfortunate. The recent\n"
"rains have swollen the rivers.{page_break}"
"It is too dangerous for\n"
"us to allow anyone to pass."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08223"
msgstr ""
"That's for the best. It is far\n"
"too dangerous for anyone\n"
"to be going out west.{page_break}"
"Perhaps a boat would lessen\n"
"the danger to a degree..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouCanSee"
msgid "08224"
msgstr ""
"You can see Atteka from the\n"
"bridge in western Gondowan.\n"
"My grandfather told me so.{page_break}"
"Someday, I'll be a warrior like my\n"
"grandfather, and I'll be able\n"
"to see it for myself!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIKnowI"
msgid "08225"
msgstr ""
"I know I could find more animals\n"
"and grain on the far side of the\n"
"river. If only I could go...{page_break}"
"These seasonal monsoon rains\n"
"have swollen the river and made\n"
"it too dangerous to cross."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgCrossingTheRiver"
msgid "08226"
msgstr ""
"Crossing the river by canoe\n"
"is much too dangerous.\n"
"I'd need a ship to get across."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfIM"
msgid "08227"
msgstr ""
"If I'm ever going to be a warrior,\n"
"I must build more muscle and\n"
"master the art of the spear."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouAreLooking"
msgid "08228"
msgstr ""
"If you are looking for treasure,\n"
"look west of the river.{page_break}"
"The rocky peaks there are\n"
"called the belly of the continent.\n"
"Great treasure hides there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEachYearWhen"
msgid "08229"
msgstr ""
"Each year, when the rains stop,\n"
"our warriors look for treasure\n"
"in the belly of the continent.{page_break}"
"Maybe the belly is hidden, or\n"
"the treasure is also. I don't know,\n"
"but they all return empty-handed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSureOurLegends"
msgid "08230"
msgstr ""
"Sure, our legends speak of much\n"
"treasure, but no one ever seems\n"
"to have found it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderWhatOeia"
msgid "08231"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what Oeia meant when\n"
"he said that our magic is deeply\n"
"tied to the belly of the continent..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOhMyBack"
msgid "08232"
msgstr ""
"Oh, my back... It's been aching\n"
"ever since that ceremony.{page_break}"
"I guess I really am too old\n"
"to dance the night away."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAsSoonAs"
msgid "08233"
msgstr ""
"As soon as Akafubu became\n"
"our recognized witch doctor,\n"
"he became so much nicer."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgISwearThat"
msgid "08234"
msgstr ""
"I swear, that's the\n"
"last time I'll ever let\n"
"loose like that again!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAkafubuGetsSo"
msgid "08235"
msgstr ""
"Akafubu gets so grouchy.\n"
"I wonder if it's just his\n"
"frustration taking over..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgManyInGondowan"
msgid "08236"
msgstr ""
"Many in Gondowan fear the\n"
"might of the Kibombo warriors.\n"
"But we don't want to be feared.{page_break}"
"Now is the time for Kibombo\n"
"to change its image."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeThinkIt"
msgid "08237"
msgstr ""
"We think it is time to inform\n"
"other villages that Akafubu\n"
"has completed the ceremony.{page_break}"
"I think they'll be glad to know\n"
"that we no longer pose any\n"
"threat to them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItWonT"
msgid "08238"
msgstr ""
"It won't be easy, convincing\n"
"them that we've turned over\n"
"a new leaf...but we'll try."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIAmAMighty"
msgid "08239"
msgstr ""
"I am a mighty warrior, trained\n"
"from birth to be fierce. If you\n"
"are feared, you are powerful!{page_break}"
"I'm...supposed to start my\n"
"\"being nice to people\" training\n"
"on Monday."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheWeaponsI"
msgid "08240"
msgstr ""
"The weapons I sell in this shop are\n"
"ones we do not use in Kibombo.{page_break}"
"You find it strange that I\n"
"do not sell the weapons\n"
"we make here, don't you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOurWarriorsAppear"
msgid "08241"
msgstr ""
"Our warriors appear so strong\n"
"because of the deadly poison\n"
"on their spears.{page_break}"
"In a war, Kibombo spears\n"
"would make a powerful ally."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheOnlyDefenses"
msgid "08242"
msgstr ""
"The only defenses we Kibombo\n"
"need are our shields and our\n"
"war paint.{page_break}"
"Our warriors think armor\n"
"is for cowards."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBecauseOurPaint"
msgid "08243"
msgstr ""
"Because our paint is infused\n"
"with the witch doctor's magic,\n"
"we're safe from attacks.{page_break}"
"I would opt for paint in any\n"
"battle...no matter how much\n"
"iron my enemy wore."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMSorryBut"
msgid "08244"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry, but the Kibombo\n"
"spearhead poison is a tribal\n"
"secret, used for hunting only.{page_break}"
"We can't let outsiders have\n"
"it, because they might try\n"
"to turn it toward evil uses."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfIHad"
msgid "08245"
msgstr ""
"If I had a coin for every time\n"
"some stranger came up and\n"
"asked me to sell them poison...{page_break}"
"If only they'd let me sell it,\n"
"I could make millions!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgDonTWorryAbout"
msgid "08246"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry about the beds\n"
"here... We used to have insect\n"
"problems, but not anymore.{page_break}"
"We use a special bug powder\n"
"on our beds. It's quite harmless\n"
"to humans, I'll bet."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgICanTRemember"
msgid "08247"
msgstr ""
"I can't remember how long\n"
"it's been since we've had\n"
"any guests.{page_break}"
"Tell you what... If you stay at\n"
"our inn, you can have all the\n"
"freshly grilled steak you want!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatBedMakes"
msgid "08248"
msgstr ""
"That bed makes me itch\n"
"so badly! It feels like bugs\n"
"are crawling all over me!{page_break}"
"Whenever I get itchy, I just\n"
"rub some of that bug powder\n"
"all over myself!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgILoveKibombo"
msgid "08249"
msgstr ""
"I love Kibombo's famous\n"
"BBQ monster steak...with\n"
"extra-spicy Herb sauce!{page_break}"
"It's a local treat that's fun\n"
"to eat! ...But it's not nearly\n"
"as fun catching the monsters..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgKibomboSPeace"
msgid "08250"
msgstr ""
"Kibombo's peace is restored\n"
"now that the ceremony has\n"
"reached its end...{page_break}"
"Now, the fate of Kibombo's\n"
"people depends on how\n"
"Akafubu leads them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgICanTBelieve"
msgid "08251"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe that Akafubu\n"
"would change simply because\n"
"he completed the ceremony."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheMayorFinally"
msgid "08252"
msgstr ""
"The mayor finally returned\n"
"from Alhafra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeyItS"
msgid "08253"
msgstr ""
"Hey! It's you guys! It's good\n"
"to see you again!{page_break}"
"You want to enter Madra?\n"
"Yeah, sure! Go ahead!\n"
"Feel free!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeWasGone"
msgid "08254"
msgstr ""
"He was gone so long, I was\n"
"starting to worry that the\n"
"mayor would never come back."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHowMuchLongerDo"
msgid "08255"
msgstr ""
"How much longer do we\n"
"have to stand guard here?{page_break}"
"Seriously, there's nothing to\n"
"guard against! We've already\n"
"been attacked by everyone!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDonTThink"
msgid "08256"
msgstr ""
"I don't think the mayor ever\n"
"got that boat of his fixed,\n"
"either... Got tired of waiting.{page_break}"
"I guess he's going back out again\n"
"as soon as he finds enough people\n"
"to fix it himself."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeGoTo"
msgid "08257"
msgstr ""
"We go to all that work getting\n"
"the ship from Briggs, and now\n"
"we can't get it to work?{page_break}"
"I guess the mayor's holding\n"
"a council to see if they can\n"
"figure out what's wrong."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHeardTheBoat"
msgid "08258"
msgstr ""
"I heard the boat the mayor got\n"
"is much better than the battered\n"
"raft we used to have!{page_break}"
"I also heard that the new ship can\n"
"even sail far across the sea!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgIsThereBy"
msgid "08259"
msgstr ""
"Is there by any chance a girl\n"
"named {actor_name:6} with you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08260"
msgstr ""
"Ah! Those people must have\n"
"been looking for you!{page_break}"
"There were four of them, and\n"
"they looked weatherworn, but\n"
"they had an amazing ship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08261"
msgstr ""
"Oh... Well, if you run across anyone\n"
"named {actor_name:6}, let her know\n"
"{actor_name:1} is looking for her.{page_break}"
"You look like you travel a lot.\n"
"Maybe you'll run across this\n"
"{actor_name:6} somewhere."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThoseTravelersLooked"
msgid "08262"
msgstr ""
"Those travelers looked\n"
"worried about you.{page_break}"
"You should find them, so that\n"
"they can know you are safe."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderIfThe"
msgid "08263"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if the legends are\n"
"true... If there really is a great\n"
"society on a far-off island...{page_break}"
"Because if they are true, I\n"
"want to see this island."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDonTKnowWhatWill"
msgid "08264"
msgstr ""
"I don't know what will happen\n"
"when they all head out to sea.\n"
"They know nothing about sailing!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAGroupOfSharp"
msgid "08265"
msgstr ""
"A group of sharp-looking\n"
"travelers came through\n"
"here recently.{page_break}"
"They said they were looking for\n"
"an island called Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouHaveA"
msgid "08266"
msgstr ""
"If you have a big enough ship,\n"
"you can sail anywhere in the\n"
"world! Isn't that amazing?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWasAt"
msgid "08267"
msgstr ""
"I was at the mayor's house,\n"
"watching them argue about\n"
"why the boat won't move.{page_break}"
"What's so important about\n"
"a mast, and what does it have\n"
"to do with sailing?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSNotThat"
msgid "08268"
msgstr ""
"It's not that I don't want to go to\n"
"Alhafra... But what's the point if\n"
"we can't fix the mast?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheMayorAsked"
msgid "08269"
msgstr ""
"The mayor asked me to go to\n"
"Alhafra with him, but I'm not\n"
"sure I should...{page_break}"
"If that ship runs on the power\n"
"of the wind, how reliable could\n"
"it really be?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSeemsNo"
msgid "08270"
msgstr ""
"It seems no one is really happy\n"
"that the mayor got this grand,\n"
"new ship. The poor mayor..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSayThereWas"
msgid "08271"
msgstr ""
"Say, {actor_name:8}, there was\n"
"another group of travelers with\n"
"powers similar to your own.{page_break}"
"What are the odds that we\n"
"should meet two groups\n"
"with these amazing abilities?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIThoughtShin"
msgid "08272"
msgstr ""
"I thought Shin and the others\n"
"were lying, but after seeing\n"
"what I saw, I'd believe anything.{page_break}"
"They called it Psynergy and said\n"
"it can change water into ice."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhenAndHis"
msgid "08273"
msgstr ""
"When {actor_name:1} and his party\n"
"heard about {actor_name:8}, they\n"
"seemed shocked.{page_break}"
"They said they were going to\n"
"follow you to Gondowan."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgUhhhnnnUhhhnnn2"
msgid "08274"
msgstr "Uhhhnnn... UHHHNNN!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08275"
msgstr ""
"They told me that you make\n"
"Psynergy by focusing your\n"
"mind...{page_break}"
"I've been focusing nonstop\n"
"for days, but do you see\n"
"any ice? No!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors97"
msgid "08276"
msgstr ""
"How can anyone just create\n"
"ice by thinking about it?{page_break}"
"I mean, imagine how much\n"
"power you'd have if you could\n"
"just think, and things happened!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhyWouldAnyoneBe"
msgid "08277"
msgstr ""
"Why would anyone be happy\n"
"to have a broken boat?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheyVeBeenHaving"
msgid "08278"
msgstr ""
"They've been having so many\n"
"meetings lately! I guess that\n"
"boat must be in miserable shape!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEveryoneGetsThe"
msgid "08279"
msgstr ""
"Everyone gets the urge to\n"
"explore, to go out into the\n"
"wild and see new lands...{page_break}"
"I'd love to see the world. I'd\n"
"love to have an adventure\n"
"of my own!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderWhy"
msgid "08280"
msgstr ""
"I wonder why those travelers\n"
"were in such a hurry...{page_break}"
"They looked so severe... You'd\n"
"think they carried the fate of\n"
"the world on their shoulders."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatWasThat"
msgid "08281"
msgstr ""
"What was that island again?\n"
"Come on, brain... Work with me...\n"
"Lemoria? Lemurland? Lulu?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThePeopleOf"
msgid "08282"
msgstr ""
"The people of Madra know our\n"
"own lands well...but we know\n"
"little of the world beyond.{page_break}"
"What kind of fool would think\n"
"himself ready to sail into a\n"
"world he knew nothing about?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatIslandThat"
msgid "08283"
msgstr ""
"That island that group\n"
"was asking about sounded\n"
"familiar for some reason...{page_break}"
"Grandpa used to tell me stories\n"
"about a treasure island when I\n"
"was young. Was that the place?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHowBigWould"
msgid "08284"
msgstr ""
"How big would a ship that\n"
"could go anywhere be?\n"
"Probably bigger than a whale!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgEveryoneHereIn"
msgid "08285"
msgstr ""
"Everyone here in Madra is afraid\n"
"of the Kibombo now. Do they\n"
"scare you, too?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08286"
msgstr ""
"I saw the fear in your eyes\n"
"the instant I said \"Kibombo.\"\n"
"Don't get worked up, though.{page_break}"
"We caught sight of a Kibombo\n"
"smoke signal that said they had\n"
"given up their warlike ways."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08287"
msgstr ""
"You must have heard\n"
"their proclamation...{page_break}"
"We only just caught sight\n"
"of their smoke signals... They\n"
"have announced a truce!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeReStill"
msgid "08288"
msgstr ""
"We're still recovering from\n"
"the Kibombo raid...{page_break}"
"It's no small wonder people\n"
"are still afraid..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheseNewBoats"
msgid "08289"
msgstr ""
"These new boats apparently\n"
"use the power of wind to cross\n"
"the seas...{page_break}"
"I just don't understand how\n"
"a big pole in the boat can\n"
"help to capture the wind..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfABuilding"
msgid "08290"
msgstr ""
"If a building has broken\n"
"columns, we tear it down...{page_break}"
"Shouldn't a boat with a\n"
"broken column be torn\n"
"down as well?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSailorsAreSupposed"
msgid "08291"
msgstr ""
"Sailors are supposed to\n"
"use oars and pull the boat\n"
"through the water...{page_break}"
"So, what's a sailor supposed\n"
"to do on a boat that's\n"
"powered by wind?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOurMayorS"
msgid "08292"
msgstr ""
"Our mayor's done so little for\n"
"us up until now... We should at\n"
"least thank him for the boat."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIsTurningWater"
msgid "08293"
msgstr ""
"Is turning water to ice really\n"
"such a special power?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraIsAlways"
msgid "08294"
msgstr ""
"Madra is always so hot. If\n"
"there were some way to create\n"
"ice, it would be so...cool."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSoThisFellow"
msgid "08295"
msgstr ""
"So, this {actor_name:8} fellow must\n"
"be a friend of {actor_name:1}...{page_break}"
"Why else would they go all the\n"
"way to Gondowan for him?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIKnewI"
msgid "08296"
msgstr ""
"I knew I should have asked\n"
"them how to make ice..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors98"
msgid "08297"
msgstr ""
"There's talk of mighty travelers\n"
"who passed by here recently.\n"
"I wish I could have met them.{page_break}"
"It seems they had powers no one\n"
"has ever seen before. I bet those\n"
"powers could be profitable."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors99"
msgid "08298"
msgstr ""
"Since things are finally calming\n"
"down in Madra, our people are\n"
"ready to get down to business.{page_break}"
"They seem to have thought up\n"
"a business plan that makes use\n"
"of {actor_name:1}'s power."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors100"
msgid "08299"
msgstr ""
"What if we just traveled with\n"
"{actor_name:1} to show off his powers...\n"
"We could make loads of cash!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors101"
msgid "08300"
msgstr ""
"The business plan our people\n"
"have come up with is supposed\n"
"to make us rich.{page_break}"
"I guess it must be\n"
"a brilliant plan."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors102"
msgid "08301"
msgstr ""
"Our salesman said Kibombo's\n"
"ceremony is done, and he claims\n"
"that they're peaceful again.{page_break}"
"I'll be so relieved if what he\n"
"said turns out to be true."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors103"
msgid "08302"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if the Kibombo have\n"
"truly set aside their spears\n"
"and returned to peace..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors104"
msgid "08303"
msgstr ""
"The continent shift makes it feel\n"
"like we're sharing backyards\n"
"with the Kibombo...{page_break}"
"We'd be so happy if we could\n"
"live in peace without having to\n"
"fear their spears."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors105"
msgid "08304"
msgstr ""
"The salesman that just came back\n"
"from Gondowan claims the\n"
"Kibombo are peaceful now...{page_break}"
"But if we relax, we won't be\n"
"ready for their next attack."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors106"
msgid "08305"
msgstr ""
"How are we to climb the cliffs\n"
"between here and Gondowan?{page_break}"
"If someone would just drop\n"
"some ropes down from the\n"
"top, it wouldn't be a problem."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors107"
msgid "08306"
msgstr ""
"My husband relishes those rare\n"
"mushrooms growing in the\n"
"Gondowan cliffs.{page_break}"
"I wish someone would\n"
"bring some back for him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors108"
msgid "08307"
msgstr ""
"I'm dying for some of those\n"
"Gondowan mushrooms, but I\n"
"can't ever reach them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors109"
msgid "08308"
msgstr ""
"My poor husband's getting old...\n"
"Those cliffs scare him now.{page_break}"
"In his prime, he'd have\n"
"scrambled up those cliffs\n"
"in no time for a mushroom."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors110"
msgid "08309"
msgstr "Oh, my... Is... Is that..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08310"
msgstr ""
"Is that one of his most\n"
"favorite mushrooms!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08311"
msgstr ""
"Did you climb all the way up\n"
"those cliffs just to get that\n"
"mushroom for us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08312"
msgstr ""
"That's the nicest thing anyone\n"
"has ever done for me. I have\n"
"to thank you for this!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08313"
msgstr ""
"But what could I have that a\n"
"warrior like you would want?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08314"
msgstr "That's a tricky one..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08315"
msgstr ""
"I don't know if you want\n"
"a pet, but this is all we\n"
"can offer. Take care of it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08316"
msgstr ""
"{protagonist_name} got\n"
"{argument_actor_name:1}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors111"
msgid "08317"
msgstr ""
"I can't wait for dinner tonight.\n"
"Batter-fried mushrooms! Mmm!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors112"
msgid "08318"
msgstr ""
"This here's enough of a\n"
"mushroom that we'll be\n"
"eating it for days!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors113"
msgid "08319"
msgstr ""
"The more I think about dinner\n"
"tonight, the more I drool..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors114"
msgid "08320"
msgstr ""
"These mushrooms will make\n"
"any meal taste amazing!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors115"
msgid "08321"
msgstr ""
"No, dear... They look similar,\n"
"but these aren't quite right."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors116"
msgid "08322"
msgstr ""
"Thanks for bringing this by,\n"
"but it's just not the type of\n"
"mushroom we like..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors117"
msgid "08323"
msgstr ""
"Please... Won't you please\n"
"try to find the mushrooms\n"
"my husband loves so much?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors118"
msgid "08324"
msgstr ""
"That mushroom was great,\n"
"but I ate way too much. I\n"
"don't ever want to see it again!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors119"
msgid "08325"
msgstr ""
"Actually, I didn't cook the\n"
"mushrooms properly that night.{page_break}"
"But, uh...please don't tell\n"
"my husband that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors120"
msgid "08326"
msgstr ""
"I don't remember mushrooms\n"
"like that ever tasting bad..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors121"
msgid "08327"
msgstr ""
"If my husband finds out I\n"
"messed up the recipe, he'll\n"
"be so sad..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors122"
msgid "08328"
msgstr ""
"Same sailors came through\n"
"recently with a ship similar\n"
"to {actor_name:8}'s.{page_break}"
"I'd never seen one before,\n"
"but now they're everywhere.\n"
"Are they new?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors123"
msgid "08329"
msgstr ""
"One of the sailors, {actor_name:1}, was\n"
"very curious about {actor_name:8}'s\n"
"ship. A little {text_effect:2}too{reset_text_style} curious.{page_break}"
"It looked like he had a\n"
"similar boat, almost identical\n"
"to {actor_name:8}'s."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors124"
msgid "08330"
msgstr ""
"Oars, I understand. Hey,\n"
"I'll even give a sailboat\n"
"a try...{page_break}"
"But there's no way I'm setting\n"
"foot on a ship powered by\n"
"some fool magic thingie."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors125"
msgid "08331"
msgstr ""
"We've had a lot of strange\n"
"visitors ever since\n"
"{actor_name:8} showed up."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgHaveYouBy"
msgid "08332"
msgstr ""
"Have you by chance seen\n"
"a girl named Menardi?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08333"
msgstr ""
"You have? And... And you're telling\n"
"me that my sister is...dead?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08334"
msgstr ""
"If you continue these lies, I\n"
"might take it upon myself to\n"
"shut you up. Get out of my sight!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouDon"
msgid "08335"
msgstr ""
"If you don't know my sister,\n"
"then I have nothing to say\n"
"to you. Get out of my sight!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgUsingPsynergyOn"
msgid "08336"
msgstr ""
"Using Psynergy on me?\n"
"Are you so dense that you\n"
"don't know when to be afraid?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08337"
msgstr ""
"I don't have time to play\n"
"games with you. Now, leave\n"
"me to my thoughts!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhereCouldMenardi"
msgid "08338"
msgstr ""
"Where could Menardi have\n"
"gone? Where are you, my\n"
"sister?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors126"
msgid "08339"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! You're back!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08340"
msgstr ""
"And you've brought\n"
"{actor_name:8} with you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08341"
msgstr "Oh! {actor_name:8}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08342"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}, I must apologize for\n"
"the trouble we've caused you.\n"
"I'm sorry we lost your jewel..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08343"
msgstr ""
"Don't be. Everything worked\n"
"out for the best."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08344"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}, you said you were\n"
"going to go to Gondowan.\n"
"Did you make it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08345"
msgstr ""
"Yes. In fact, we have\n"
"just returned."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08346"
msgstr "And your jewel..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08347"
msgstr ""
"You actually got it back from\n"
"the Kibombo? Incredible..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08348"
msgstr ""
"I was able to recover it\n"
"with the help of {actor_name:5}\n"
"and his friends."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08349"
msgstr ""
"That's wonderful! I'm so relieved!\n"
"I was worried that you might\n"
"never get it back!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08350"
msgstr ""
"You didn't recover it\n"
"from the Kibombo?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08351"
msgstr ""
"That's not true, sir. {actor_name:5}\n"
"and his companions helped\n"
"me recover it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08352"
msgstr ""
"Please! Don't startle me like\n"
"that! I was afraid you might\n"
"never get it back!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08353"
msgstr ""
"That's why we came back...\n"
"To let you know that we've\n"
"recovered it. Worry no more."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors127"
msgid "08354"
msgstr ""
"Ah, so you'll be leaving\n"
"again, will you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08355"
msgstr ""
"Are you sure you must leave\n"
"so soon, {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08356"
msgstr ""
"I may yet return here again, but\n"
"I'm afraid I must be going soon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08357"
msgstr "You seem to be quite busy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08358"
msgstr ""
"It is their youth that allows\n"
"them to be so busy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08359"
msgstr ""
"But we'll be back, I promise.\n"
"Maybe we'll be able to visit\n"
"at a more leisurely pace..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08360"
msgstr "I'd like that..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08361"
msgstr "So would I!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors128"
msgid "08362"
msgstr ""
"If you've already recovered\n"
"your jewel, why don't you\n"
"stay here for a bit longer?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08363"
msgstr "Unfortunately, we can't..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08364"
msgstr ""
"Hey, have you seen\n"
"the girl out front?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08365"
msgstr ""
"We must go...to the island\n"
"that is my home."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08366"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}, are you...\n"
"Are you sure?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08367"
msgstr ""
"After what we've been\n"
"through, I feel I've learned\n"
"a few things."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08368"
msgstr "Like what!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08369"
msgstr ""
"Like...the fact that you\n"
"truly are good people."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08370"
msgstr ""
"And that you have gone to\n"
"great lengths for no other\n"
"reason than to help those in need."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08371"
msgstr ""
"I have come to realize that\n"
"I, too, must do something\n"
"to help where I can."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08372"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08373"
msgstr "I have made my decision."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08374"
msgstr ""
"And the sooner we depart,\n"
"the better, right, Kraden?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08375"
msgstr ""
"We shall set sail, {actor_name:5}!\n"
"To my ship! To the Eastern Sea!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08376"
msgstr ""
"Do you truly mean to leave\n"
"so soon, {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08377"
msgstr ""
"I may yet again have reason\n"
"to visit your town, but...\n"
"yes, I must go."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08378"
msgstr "You seem quite busy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08379"
msgstr ""
"It is their youth that allows\n"
"them to be so busy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08380"
msgstr ""
"But we'll be back, I promise.\n"
"Maybe we'll be able to visit\n"
"at a more leisurely pace..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08381"
msgstr "I'd like that..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08382"
msgstr "So would I!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors129"
msgid "08383"
msgstr ""
"I know you went to a lot of trouble\n"
"to get us that boat, but we just\n"
"had to give up on it.{page_break}"
"We couldn't just sit and wait in\n"
"Alhafra until the thing got fixed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors130"
msgid "08384"
msgstr ""
"We just have to finish repairs\n"
"on that boat we left in Alhafra...{page_break}"
"We've had several meetings\n"
"already, discussing our next\n"
"course of action."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors131"
msgid "08385"
msgstr ""
"I'm so relieved {actor_name:8}\n"
"got his jewel back."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors132"
msgid "08386"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe {actor_name:8}\n"
"actually went all the way to\n"
"Kibombo to get his jewel back.{page_break}"
"That's so...dashing!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors133"
msgid "08387"
msgstr ""
"Gondowan is such an\n"
"awful, dangerous place...{page_break}"
"I never imagined for a second\n"
"that {actor_name:8} would make\n"
"it back here safely."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors134"
msgid "08388"
msgstr ""
"I like you guys a lot. I'm\n"
"sad that you're leaving."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors135"
msgid "08389"
msgstr ""
"My daddy went to Gondowan,\n"
"and all I got was nothing."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors136"
msgid "08390"
msgstr ""
"All of this could have been avoided\n"
"if the people of Alhafra's offer to\n"
"repair the boat was genuine.{page_break}"
"Now, I refuse to let that boat\n"
"fall into the hands of Alhafra\n"
"and its mayor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors137"
msgid "08391"
msgstr ""
"Why won't the mayor of\n"
"Alhafra repair our boat?{page_break}"
"If we could get that ship,\n"
"Madra would embark on a\n"
"voyage to prosperity..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors138"
msgid "08392"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe it... Despite all\n"
"my worrying, they got that\n"
"jewel back like it was nothing."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors139"
msgid "08393"
msgstr ""
"I felt a little responsible for\n"
"{actor_name:8} losing his jewel.\n"
"I'm so happy he got it back!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors140"
msgid "08394"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8} said he was going\n"
"to Gondowan alone, but now he\n"
"has some friends with him.{page_break}"
"That's nice. If he'd been all\n"
"alone, I'm sure he would have\n"
"been eaten by monsters."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors141"
msgid "08395"
msgstr ""
"I wish they'd tell me all\n"
"about their adventures!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors142"
msgid "08396"
msgstr ""
"I'm so glad Daddy\n"
"got home safely."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWait3"
msgid "08397"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, wait!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08398"
msgstr ""
"I believe I promised you\n"
"a reward for helping with\n"
"the boat, didn't I?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08399"
msgstr ""
"Imagine! You came all this way\n"
"to put us at ease, and I totally\n"
"forget to give this to you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08400"
msgstr ""
"Well, you may have forgotten,\n"
"{actor_name:5}, but I have not."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08401"
msgstr ""
"Regardless, I told you that I\n"
"would reward you when the\n"
"boat was fixed...{page_break}"
"That may take quite a\n"
"while now, it seems..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08402"
msgstr ""
"That being the case, I'd like\n"
"to give you that reward now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08403"
msgstr ""
"We can't accept it now,\n"
"though, could we, {actor_name:6}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08404"
msgstr ""
"Madra is still in shambles\n"
"from the disaster... We couldn't\n"
"possibly accept any gifts..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08405"
msgstr ""
"Nonsense! Misfortune or no,\n"
"a promise is a promise!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08406"
msgstr ""
"{protagonist_name} got\n"
"{argument_item_name:2}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08407"
msgstr ""
"I am glad that I was able to\n"
"give it to you before you left."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08408"
msgstr ""
"Your travels seem to take you\n"
"from danger into greater\n"
"danger. Please be careful."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08409"
msgstr "Thank you, Mr. Mayor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08410"
msgstr "...{actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08411"
msgstr ""
"You... He just called you\n"
"{actor_name:5}, didn't he?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08412"
msgstr ""
"Why didn't I see it before?\n"
"You are {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08413"
msgstr ""
"Then Menardi should be\n"
"somewhere around here,\n"
"too... And yet..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08414"
msgstr ""
"You won't see Menardi or\n"
"Saturos ever again.\n"
"{actor_name:1} killed them.{page_break}"
"They're probably at the bottom\n"
"of the sea by now..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08415"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}! Quiet!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08416"
msgstr ""
"Hmph! I heard that, you\n"
"wretched little thing!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08417"
msgstr ""
"Can it be true? Is my\n"
"sister dead?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08418"
msgstr ""
"No? Then where is she!?\n"
"Show me my sister!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08419"
msgstr ""
"What is the matter? Is it so\n"
"very hard? You were traveling\n"
"with her°bring her to me!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08420"
msgstr ""
"She would never have left\n"
"you behind...and yet you are\n"
"alone...{pause_20_skippable} So it's true? She's..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgICanTBelieveIt"
msgid "08421"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe it... No one has\n"
"the power to defeat Saturos\n"
"and my sister..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08422"
msgstr ""
"Yet you all avoid my gaze...\n"
"And that look on your faces...\n"
"It...is true..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhoIsThis"
msgid "08423"
msgstr "Who is this {actor_name:1}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08424"
msgstr ""
"What? You feign ignorance?\n"
"Why? Would you protect him\n"
"from my fury!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08425"
msgstr ""
"Never mind. I believe I've heard\n"
"some rumors of a traveler\n"
"named {actor_name:1} lately."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08426"
msgstr ""
"Is this {actor_name:1} the same\n"
"one they've been speaking of?\n"
"Is he pursuing you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08427"
msgstr ""
"If that is the case, then this\n"
"{actor_name:1} should show up\n"
"here sooner or later."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08428"
msgstr ""
"How do you know it wasn't\n"
"{actor_name:5} who defeated\n"
"your sister?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08429"
msgstr ""
"What do you take me for?\n"
"I'm a warrior, like my sister...{page_break}"
"I can gauge a man's strength\n"
"at a single glance."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08430"
msgstr ""
"Even if you doubled {actor_name:5}'s\n"
"power, he would still be no\n"
"match for my sister."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08431"
msgstr ""
"And besides, I doubt {actor_name:5}\n"
"could find it in himself to\n"
"betray my sister."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08432"
msgstr ""
"He knows that the lives of\n"
"those he holds dear would\n"
"hang in the balance."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08433"
msgstr ""
"But I must congratulate you on\n"
"your successes at both the\n"
"Mercury and Venus Lighthouses."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08434"
msgstr ""
"Although your success there\n"
"now prevents us from\n"
"returning to the Western Sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08435"
msgstr ""
"You would have failed, of course,\n"
"had we not researched how to\n"
"climb those lighthouses..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08436"
msgstr "Oh, didn't Menardi tell you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08437"
msgstr ""
"Regardless, {actor_name:1} won't be\n"
"getting in my way."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08438"
msgstr ""
"You will have to find your own\n"
"way to the Western Sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08439"
msgstr ""
"And if you make the journey,\n"
"you'll have to light Jupiter on\n"
"your own as well!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08440"
msgstr ""
"We have our own work to do,\n"
"and number one on the list is\n"
"taking care of {actor_name:1}!{page_break}"
"Are we clear on this, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08441"
msgstr ""
"Aren't you an obedient boy...\n"
"If you're worried you can't get\n"
"it done, we could help you a bit."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08442"
msgstr ""
"What's the matter? Afraid\n"
"you can't perform your duties?\n"
"We could help you a bit..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08443"
msgstr ""
"No, thank you. I believe we'll\n"
"just find Jupiter Lighthouse on\n"
"our own, if it's all the same."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08444"
msgstr ""
"I see. Just don't let\n"
"us down."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08445"
msgstr ""
"We're going to find\n"
"that {actor_name:1}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08446"
msgstr ""
"I'm going to find this\n"
"{actor_name:1}...{page_break}"
"And I swear that the last thing\n"
"he sees will be Karst avenging\n"
"the death of her dear sister!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08447"
msgstr ""
"Wow. And I thought Saturos\n"
"and Menardi had issues."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08448"
msgstr ""
"We shouldn't take Karst\n"
"too lightly..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08449"
msgstr ""
"Wait a moment... Karst did say\n"
"\"we,\" didn't she?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08450"
msgstr ""
"Yes. Saturos and Menardi\n"
"traveled as a pair. Perhaps\n"
"she has a partner as well."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08451"
msgstr ""
"We ought to warn {actor_name:1}\n"
"that Karst is after him. Maybe\n"
"we should try to find him first."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08452"
msgstr ""
"Believe me, I'd love to see\n"
"{actor_name:1} again, but we just don't\n"
"have time to look for him. Plus..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08453"
msgstr ""
"Even if we did find them, I\n"
"think there is a good chance\n"
"we'd end up fighting them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08454"
msgstr "Why?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08455"
msgstr ""
"What we are trying to achieve,\n"
"they are trying to prevent...\n"
"And they will fight to stop us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08456"
msgstr ""
"But, {actor_name:6}... Aren't you and\n"
"{actor_name:1} an item? Couldn't\n"
"you, you know, do something?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08457"
msgstr ""
"A... An item? No! I mean...\n"
"It's not like that! Not...really..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08458"
msgstr "...Stupid {actor_name:7}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08459"
msgstr ""
"Ah! Well! Er, yes. For now, we\n"
"should press onward to Jupiter\n"
"Lighthouse, like we'd planned."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08460"
msgstr ""
"But...what about {actor_name:2}\n"
"and the others?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08461"
msgstr "Don't you mean...{actor_name:1}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08462"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}! Be quiet! Sheesh..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08463"
msgstr ""
"*Ahem!* Are you ready\n"
"to listen yet?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08464"
msgstr ""
"They were strong enough to\n"
"defeat Saturos and Menardi.\n"
"They won't be beaten easily."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08465"
msgstr ""
"We should continue on ahead,\n"
"just as Saturos and Menardi\n"
"would have, OK, {actor_name:6}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08466"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7}? {actor_name:8}?\n"
"Are you ready?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08467"
msgstr ""
"Then we should be going,\n"
"right, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors143"
msgid "08468"
msgstr ""
"Oh! {actor_name:8}! After the way\n"
"we treated you, I thought you'd\n"
"never come to Madra again!{page_break}"
"I know we were not very nice\n"
"to you before... I hope you can\n"
"forgive us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors144"
msgid "08469"
msgstr ""
"Shin's developed a terrible\n"
"fear of the cold. He's afraid of\n"
"being turned into a block of ice.{page_break}"
"Tell {actor_name:8} to cool it\n"
"with the ice routine, OK?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors145"
msgid "08470"
msgstr ""
"Even the sound of the name\n"
"\"{actor_name:8}\" sends a chill\n"
"down my spine."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors146"
msgid "08471"
msgstr ""
"I understand why Shin's scared\n"
"of {actor_name:8}, but I think\n"
"he might be overdoing it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItLooksLikeThe"
msgid "08472"
msgstr ""
"It looks like the Kibombo must\n"
"have been involved in the raids\n"
"on our town...{page_break}"
"Kibombo weapons are too\n"
"distinct... We found a bunch\n"
"of them after the attacks."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThePiratesAnd"
msgid "08473"
msgstr ""
"The pirates and the Kibombo\n"
"must have been working together.\n"
"What an astounding discovery!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgPeopleAreSaying"
msgid "08474"
msgstr ""
"People are saying the Champa\n"
"and the Kibombo formed an\n"
"alliance... I don't buy it, myself."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatNightThe"
msgid "08475"
msgstr ""
"That night, the Champa came from\n"
"the east, and the Kibombo, from\n"
"the west. That's not an alliance."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyBoyfriendShin"
msgid "08476"
msgstr ""
"My boyfriend, Shin, seems so\n"
"downtrodden lately...\n"
"I hope he's all right."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors147"
msgid "08477"
msgstr ""
"I've told my sister not to\n"
"worry about Shin. He's tough.\n"
"At least...he usually is..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShinSeemsTerrified"
msgid "08478"
msgstr ""
"Shin seems terrified of\n"
"{actor_name:8}. I wonder what\n"
"happened between them.{page_break}"
"Still, I guess that explains\n"
"why he's been so on edge\n"
"lately."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors148"
msgid "08479"
msgstr ""
"Shin's normally so kind and\n"
"gentle. I hope he gets over\n"
"whatever's bothering him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors149"
msgid "08480"
msgstr ""
"I've noticed lately that the\n"
"temperature of the ocean has\n"
"been slowly rising.{page_break}"
"It is a bad omen, I say.\n"
"Be wary if you plan to\n"
"set sail soon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors150"
msgid "08481"
msgstr ""
"The ocean's been warming up\n"
"a lot, and we're seeing lots of\n"
"dead fish washing up on shore.{page_break}"
"At this rate, there aren't going\n"
"to be any fish left for us to\n"
"catch for food."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors151"
msgid "08482"
msgstr ""
"When the ocean warms, the\n"
"Eastern Sea beckons... Seek for\n"
"the center, the legends say.{page_break}"
"These legends are known to\n"
"nearly every sailor. It would be\n"
"wise for you to remember it, too."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors152"
msgid "08483"
msgstr ""
"I knew the temperatures were\n"
"rising slowly over time...{page_break}"
"But now, it's plain to see that\n"
"the temperatures are rising at\n"
"a dramatically higher rate."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors153"
msgid "08484"
msgstr ""
"Our new ship is spectacular, but\n"
"if we can't find some new fishing\n"
"spots, it does us no good at all.{page_break}"
"Tidal waves, raids on our town,\n"
"and now the warming ocean\n"
"waters... What's going on?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors154"
msgid "08485"
msgstr ""
"Seafaring towns know many\n"
"more legends of the sea...{page_break}"
"But a few of the sailors passing\n"
"through here have told their\n"
"share of stories of the salty sea."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors155"
msgid "08486"
msgstr ""
"Are you worried about all the\n"
"fish that have been washing\n"
"up dead on the shore?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08487"
msgstr ""
"No need to worry. Those fish\n"
"all died farther out in the bay.{page_break}"
"The fish we cook here at\n"
"the inn are caught fresh\n"
"from our pier."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08488"
msgstr ""
"No?! I suppose you'd be happy\n"
"if the fish up and vanished, huh?{page_break}"
"They're dying because the ocean\n"
"temperatures are rising, but no\n"
"one is doing anything about it..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors156"
msgid "08489"
msgstr ""
"Has someone been telling you\n"
"that we've been serving up the\n"
"dead fish found on the beaches?{page_break}"
"Outrageous! We go to great pains\n"
"to serve only the finest fresh\n"
"fish to our customers."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors157"
msgid "08490"
msgstr ""
"One of our guests kept asking\n"
"for a weapon that he could use\n"
"to slay a great sea monster...{page_break}"
"He kept mentioning this trident\n"
"thing, but we couldn't help him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors158"
msgid "08491"
msgstr ""
"I guess that a lot of dead\n"
"fish have been washing ashore\n"
"all over the eastern seacoast.{page_break}"
"It's kind of sad... Imagine how\n"
"much money we could have\n"
"made if we'd caught them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors159"
msgid "08492"
msgstr ""
"I've heard that rising ocean\n"
"temperatures mean that a\n"
"volcano is forming under the sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors160"
msgid "08493"
msgstr ""
"I've never seen a single customer\n"
"get sick from our fish! Not a\n"
"single one...{page_break}"
"I've never served rotten old fish\n"
"in my life! I only use the finest,\n"
"freshest ingredients in my cuisine."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors161"
msgid "08494"
msgstr ""
"Someone must have seen me\n"
"burying the dead fish. I'll bet\n"
"that's where the rumor started."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors162"
msgid "08495"
msgstr ""
"It must be a very strange\n"
"monster if one needs such\n"
"a unique weapon to fight it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors163"
msgid "08496"
msgstr ""
"If I had a boat we could\n"
"use, now would be a great\n"
"time to make some money.{page_break}"
"We'd just need to take our\n"
"nets and scoop up whatever\n"
"we find..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMadraInteriors164"
msgid "08497"
msgstr ""
"Hm... I wonder if the tidal\n"
"wave might have been caused\n"
"by an undersea eruption..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyShipAt"
msgid "08498"
msgstr ""
"My ship! At long last...\n"
"I have returned to my ship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08499"
msgstr "Well, {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08500"
msgstr ""
"I'm thrilled... I'm just happy\n"
"to be back with my ship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08501"
msgstr ""
"Uh, that's not what\n"
"Kraden's asking..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08502"
msgstr ""
"You forgot, didn't you, {actor_name:8}?\n"
"When we talked in Kibombo?\n"
"Remember what Kraden asked?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08503"
msgstr ""
"He wanted you to take us\n"
"to your home... To Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08504"
msgstr ""
"Remember how we said we'd\n"
"talk about it later?\n"
"Well, it's later now, {actor_name:8}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08505"
msgstr ""
"Oh... Is it? I suppose we have\n"
"to talk about it sooner or later.\n"
"You shall have your answer."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08506"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}...if you do not\n"
"wish to take us, you do not have\n"
"to. Just tell me honestly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08507"
msgstr ""
"And if not, well, we'll just have\n"
"to get ourselves a boat and find\n"
"our own way to Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08508"
msgstr "Right, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08509"
msgstr ""
"What's with the guilt trip?\n"
"{actor_name:8} hasn't even given\n"
"us his answer yet!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08510"
msgstr ""
"Kraden! {actor_name:5}! Stop trying\n"
"to pressure {actor_name:8}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08511"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} is right! You guys\n"
"just let {actor_name:8} give\n"
"us his answer!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08512"
msgstr ""
"I agree with {actor_name:5}. We\n"
"shouldn't try to pressure\n"
"{actor_name:8}, Kraden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08513"
msgstr "But that's not what I was°"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08514"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry, {actor_name:7}...\n"
"I've actually been thinking\n"
"about this quite a bit."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08515"
msgstr ""
"I just never got the opportunity\n"
"to mention it before."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08516"
msgstr "Well? Well!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08517"
msgstr ""
"It's not nice to test the\n"
"patience of an old man.\n"
"Will you take us or not?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08518"
msgstr "We will go to Lemuria, Kraden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08519"
msgstr "I figured it was too much to..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08520"
msgstr "What did you just say!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08521"
msgstr "I will take you to Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08522"
msgstr "Kraden? Are you OK?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08523"
msgstr "Is he OK!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08524"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}! Are you...\n"
"Are you serious?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08525"
msgstr ""
"After what we've been through,\n"
"it would be wrong to deny you.\n"
"That's what made up my mind."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08526"
msgstr "What's what made up your mind?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08527"
msgstr ""
"The fact that you are\n"
"truly good people."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08528"
msgstr ""
"You have gone to great trouble\n"
"to help one whose problems\n"
"needn't have concerned you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08529"
msgstr ""
"Witnessing that kindness...\n"
"It made me want to help, too."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08530"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}, you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08531"
msgstr ""
"No, {actor_name:6}. Please, don't say\n"
"a word. I've made up my mind."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08532"
msgstr ""
"I shall be leaving immediately,\n"
"but I want you to come, Kraden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08533"
msgstr ""
"Let us set sail, {actor_name:5}!\n"
"To my ship! And the Eastern Sea!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08534"
msgstr ""
"So at long last, I will finally\n"
"reach Lemuria..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08535"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what kind of advanced\n"
"civilization we'll find in Lemuria..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08536"
msgstr "I'm actually excited to find out!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08537"
msgstr "What's wrong, {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08538"
msgstr ""
"It just occurred to me... The\n"
"mayor of Madra and his wife\n"
"must be worried about me.{page_break}"
"I'd feel bad if I didn't let\n"
"them know I was all right\n"
"before leaving Indra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08539"
msgstr ""
"We should go tell them that\n"
"I've retrieved my orb. Then\n"
"they wouldn't have to worry."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08540"
msgstr ""
"Is that acceptable, {actor_name:5}?\n"
"Can we stop by Madra briefly\n"
"before we leave for Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08541"
msgstr ""
"What do you say, {actor_name:5}?\n"
"Shall we go see the mayor?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08542"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry about me. I've waited\n"
"this long. I can wait a little longer.\n"
"Let's go see the mayor!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08543"
msgstr ""
"I have no objection, so why\n"
"not? Let's go."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08544"
msgstr ""
"But we must depart as soon\n"
"as we're done at the mayor's\n"
"house, {actor_name:8}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08545"
msgstr "Oh, thank you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThenLetS"
msgid "08546"
msgstr ""
"Then let's waste no time!\n"
"We should set out for\n"
"Madra at once!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAtLastI"
msgid "08547"
msgstr "At last, I'm back on my ship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08548"
msgstr ""
"Finally, I can return to\n"
"my beloved Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08549"
msgstr "Wait there a moment."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08550"
msgstr ""
"To set sail, we must\n"
"go down to the power\n"
"chamber belowdecks."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08551"
msgstr "Let's head down."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemurianShip01"
msgid "08552"
msgstr ""
"How did all these monsters\n"
"get on board? I could swear I\n"
"locked the door when I left..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08553"
msgstr ""
"It doesn't matter. Once we get\n"
"this ship moving, I'm sure they'll\n"
"all jump ship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08554"
msgstr ""
"OK, now, I must set the\n"
"black orb in this pedestal."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTakeTheTiller"
msgid "08555"
msgstr "Take the tiller, {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08556"
msgstr "?!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08557"
msgstr ""
"If you hope to reach Lemuria,\n"
"you'll have to learn a few\n"
"things about handling a ship.{page_break}"
"I think we ought to sail\n"
"the Eastern Sea until you\n"
"get the hang of it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08558"
msgstr ""
"Kraden, shouldn't we be heading\n"
"straight for Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08559"
msgstr ""
"Well, I suppose if we have to\n"
"learn to sail, it's better to do\n"
"it sooner than later..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08560"
msgstr ""
"Then I want to go to Lalivero!\n"
"And Tolbi!{pause_20_skippable} Oh! And Vale!\n"
"Can we go to Vale?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08561"
msgstr ""
"I'd love to see your hometown,\n"
"{actor_name:6}! Shall we? Let's\n"
"do it! To Vale we go!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08562"
msgstr "I don't think that's a good idea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08563"
msgstr ""
"I'm with {actor_name:5}.\n"
"I don't think that would be\n"
"a wise course of action."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08564"
msgstr "Come, now! Why not?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08565"
msgstr ""
"Think about the roads we have\n"
"traveled to get where we are..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08566"
msgstr ""
"I can't... I was never any\n"
"good at geography."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08567"
msgstr ""
"Then allow me to explain...{page_break}"
"The coastline of Angara, the\n"
"continent in which Vale lies,\n"
"is surrounded by rocky cliffs."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08568"
msgstr ""
"Oh... You don't think {actor_name:8}'s\n"
"boat could land there?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08569"
msgstr ""
"And as for Gondowan, I would\n"
"guess the people from Lalivero\n"
"are...looking for us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08570"
msgstr ""
"He's right. Saturos and Menardi\n"
"went a little wild in Lalivero,\n"
"and you were all with them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08571"
msgstr ""
"Oh... But {actor_name:7} can explain\n"
"the situation for us.{page_break}"
"Faran and the Laliverans\n"
"would understand, I'm sure."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08572"
msgstr ""
"And then they'd make me stay\n"
"in Lalivero! Would you just leave\n"
"me there, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08573"
msgstr ""
"Oh yeah... Maybe that wouldn't be\n"
"such a good idea after all..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08574"
msgstr "Then it's decided!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08575"
msgstr "What's decided?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08576"
msgstr ""
"The sea is vast... We can go\n"
"wherever we please! So, let's\n"
"explore a bit, {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08577"
msgstr ""
"That's a great idea! We've\n"
"already met werewolves and\n"
"discovered new Psynergy.{page_break}"
"I'm sure there's even more\n"
"out there waiting for us\n"
"to find it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08578"
msgstr "Wow! This is going to be great!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08579"
msgstr ""
"Hmm... The seas can be quite\n"
"dangerous. It won't be my fault\n"
"if something happens, Kraden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08580"
msgstr "To the open sea, {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemurianShip02"
msgid "08581"
msgstr ""
"There's no reaction...\n"
"It doesn't seem to be running."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheMayorTried"
msgid "08582"
msgstr ""
"The mayor tried to give {actor_name:5}\n"
"{argument_item_name:2}, but {actor_name:5} can't\n"
"carry any more items."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08583"
msgstr ""
"I couldn't possibly allow you to\n"
"leave with out giving you the\n"
"reward I promised."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08584"
msgstr ""
"The mayor put the {argument_item_name:1}\n"
"in a pot."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08585"
msgstr ""
"I'll put it in here. You can\n"
"come pick it up anytime."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08586"
msgstr ""
"Rocks are poking out above\n"
"the waves. Pass them with care..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08587"
msgstr ""
"These shoals would not make\n"
"a good place to land."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEverSinceThe"
msgid "08588"
msgstr ""
"Ever since the tidal wave moved\n"
"Indra, we haven't been able to go\n"
"to Gondowan's western shores."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgDidYouKnow"
msgid "08589"
msgstr ""
"Did you know Indra moved?\n"
"It was quite a shock to all\n"
"of us here...{page_break}"
"We haven't been able to use\n"
"the waterways to the south\n"
"ever since."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyPopS"
msgid "08590"
msgstr ""
"My pop's the best sailor in\n"
"all the Eastern Sea!{page_break}"
"That's why he can go anywhere,\n"
"even in that tiny boat of his!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouReLucky"
msgid "08591"
msgstr ""
"You're lucky, mister. You get to\n"
"ride your boat out on the open\n"
"sea all you want...{page_break}"
"My dad'll be done with his boat\n"
"soon, and together, we'll be able\n"
"to sail anywhere we want..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheWaterwaysNorth"
msgid "08592"
msgstr ""
"The waterways north of Tundaria\n"
"would have been the perfect\n"
"place to teach my sons to sail..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMSoGrateful"
msgid "08593"
msgstr ""
"I'm so grateful our little island\n"
"wasn't damaged in the tidal\n"
"wave... It was a miracle."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgICanTWaitUntil"
msgid "08594"
msgstr ""
"I can't wait until Dad teaches\n"
"me how to sail..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgICanTWaitUntilThe"
msgid "08595"
msgstr ""
"I can't wait until the day\n"
"I can sail far away with\n"
"Dad and Kirt..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors23"
msgid "08596"
msgstr ""
"Used to be, you could sail to\n"
"the other side of Gondowan by\n"
"skirting the coast of Tundaria.{page_break}"
"Now, the whole area's got these\n"
