"Swamp has dried up."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors14"
msgid "08720"
msgstr ""
"We're supposed to be right in\n"
"the middle of the rainy season,\n"
"but I don't see any rain..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors15"
msgid "08721"
msgstr ""
"When Taopo Swamp dries up,\n"
"we're in for some serious\n"
"drought problems this year."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors16"
msgid "08722"
msgstr ""
"I can't stand this drought!\n"
"How long is the weather\n"
"going to be like this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors17"
msgid "08723"
msgstr ""
"Sunshine has started complaining\n"
"that he can't work lately. He\n"
"blames it on the lack of rain."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors18"
msgid "08724"
msgstr ""
"Our blacksmith, Sunshine, makes\n"
"the kinds of items you can't\n"
"find anywhere else.{page_break}"
"You wouldn't know it to look\n"
"at him...or to talk to him...but\n"
"he's an amazing worker..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors19"
msgid "08725"
msgstr ""
"What kind of person only wants\n"
"to work when it's raining?{page_break}"
"I know Sunshine likes to enjoy\n"
"his days off, but he needs to\n"
"find a better excuse not to work."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors20"
msgid "08726"
msgstr ""
"Sunshine's a little eccentric. He\n"
"disappears into Taopo Swamp\n"
"for days at a time..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors21"
msgid "08727"
msgstr ""
"If the blacksmith isn't willing to\n"
"work, then how am I supposed\n"
"to get fine weapons to sell?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors22"
msgid "08728"
msgstr ""
"If Sunshine set his mind to it,\n"
"he could make a lot of money!\n"
"What a waste of talent..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors23"
msgid "08729"
msgstr ""
"If you want plain old, boring\n"
"armor, have a look around.{page_break}"
"If you're looking for some\n"
"of Sunshine's work, you'll\n"
"have to come back later."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors24"
msgid "08730"
msgstr ""
"I shouldn't tell him how boring\n"
"all this stuff is. I wish Sunshine\n"
"would get back to work!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors25"
msgid "08731"
msgstr ""
"If you're looking for Taopo\n"
"Swamp, head west around\n"
"the northern mountain range.{page_break}"
"Sunshine sometimes goes\n"
"up there by himself on long\n"
"trips. It's a dangerous place."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors26"
msgid "08732"
msgstr ""
"What does Sunshine want\n"
"in Taopo Swamp?{page_break}"
"There's nothing up there\n"
"but bugs and some odd\n"
"mountain fish."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors27"
msgid "08733"
msgstr ""
"It's a bit strange trying to\n"
"run an inn in a city that\n"
"never gets tourists, isn't it?{page_break}"
"Well, sometimes, the locals\n"
"like to stay here. It's like a\n"
"little vacation for them, I guess."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors28"
msgid "08734"
msgstr ""
"Taopo Swamp has dried up, and\n"
"now it's inaccessible.{page_break}"
"What's worse, with no water,\n"
"we can no longer get any more\n"
"delicious Yallam mountain fish."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors29"
msgid "08735"
msgstr ""
"Yallam was always such a\n"
"poor town. We had to work\n"
"hard just to break even."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYallamInteriors30"
msgid "08736"
msgstr ""
"There weren't a lot of mountain\n"
"fish after the swamp dried up.\n"
"We probably won't catch many."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors27"
msgid "08737"
msgstr ""
