"in. At least they're not fighting."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIAbsolutelyRefuse"
msgid "08835"
msgstr ""
"I absolutely refuse to let\n"
"my son swim in the ocean\n"
"until he is an adult."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheCurrentsAround"
msgid "08836"
msgstr ""
"The currents around Apojii\n"
"are just too strong to let\n"
"children swim on their own.{page_break}"
"They're too strong for a lot\n"
"of the adults, too... They can\n"
"just wash a person away!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMNotAllowed"
msgid "08837"
msgstr ""
"I'm not allowed to go\n"
"into the ocean."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeyMisterDid"
msgid "08838"
msgstr ""
"Hey, mister! Did you know\n"
"that all the kids are calling\n"
"you their hero?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgISinkLike"
msgid "08839"
msgstr ""
"I sink like a rock. It always\n"
"embarrasses my son to see\n"
"me try to swim.{page_break}"
"I'm afraid he's no better than\n"
"I am, but he still wants to\n"
"practice and get better!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgPoorBoyHis"
msgid "08840"
msgstr ""
"Poor boy... His father sinks like\n"
"a rock, and I know it's genetic.\n"
"So he's not allowed to swim!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSStupid"
msgid "08841"
msgstr ""
"It's stupid that I'm not\n"
"allowed to swim just because\n"
"Dad doesn't know how...{page_break}"
"Someday, I'll show him...\n"
"I'll show them all!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWowHeSwam"
msgid "08842"
msgstr ""
"Wow! He swam in the ocean\n"
"and survived the currents!\n"
"And he's looking at me!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatOldAqua"
msgid "08843"
msgstr ""
"That old Aqua Stone is\n"
"supposed to be the key to\n"
"getting onto Aqua Island."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeSToo"
msgid "08844"
msgstr ""
"He's too old to try now,\n"
"but my husband used to\n"
"dream of scaling Aqua Rock."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouUnlockThe"
msgid "08845"
msgstr ""
"You unlock the Aqua Stone by\n"
"making it damp, but splashing\n"
"springwater on it won't work."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeAlwaysWanted"
msgid "08846"
msgstr ""
"He always wanted to climb\n"
"to the peak of the mountain\n"
"on Aqua Island.{page_break}"
"But he spent all his time\n"
"studying that Aqua Stone\n"
"instead. I always wondered why."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItDBe"
msgid "08847"
msgstr ""
"It'd be nice if we could\n"
"import some items that\n"
"our visitors would like."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNoOneShips"
msgid "08848"
msgstr ""
"No one ships to Garapas so\n"
"I wonder if wares are scarce.{page_break}"
"On the other hand, I suppose some\n"
"wares are unique to Garapas."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWowYouLook"
msgid "08849"
msgstr ""
"Wow! You look just like the guy\n"
"who showed up in the fancy boat.{page_break}"
"He slept for a long time... He\n"
"must've had a really long trip."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgYouGuysAren"
msgid "08850"
msgstr ""
"You guys aren't the warriors\n"
"who came in that boat, are you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08851"
msgstr ""
"Hmm... A while ago, some\n"
"others came in a boat much\n"
"like yours...{page_break}"
"I'm sure back on the mainland\n"
"that those boats are all very\n"
"popular, aren't they?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08852"
msgstr ""
"It's not nice to tease an old\n"
"lady! If that's not your boat,\n"
"then how did you get here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMSure"
msgid "08853"
msgstr ""
"I'm sure that boat is\n"
"quite comfortable...{page_break}"
"But no matter how nice your\n"
"boat is, you can't beat sleeping\n"
"in a nice, dry bed on land."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThoseGuysOn"
msgid "08854"
msgstr ""
"Those guys on the other\n"
"boat must have been pretty\n"
"well off..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors29"
msgid "08855"
msgstr ""
"This little island must seem\n"
"quite boring to you\n"
"sophisticated mainlander types.{page_break}"
"But we have our share of\n"
"hardships and trials."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors30"
msgid "08856"
msgstr ""
"I'm sick of living on this\n"
"boring island paradise!{page_break}"
"Ah! Does thinking that\n"
"make me a bad person?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors31"
msgid "08857"
msgstr ""
"I'd love to go to the mainland.\n"
"I want to go somewhere\n"
"without any ocean!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors32"
msgid "08858"
msgstr ""
"Whenever visitors come\n"
"out, the islanders start to\n"
"complain about their lives.{page_break}"
"But they don't realize that\n"
"they live better here than\n"
"they ever could in Osenia."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors33"
msgid "08859"
msgstr ""
"Maybe they'll take me with\n"
"them if I ask for a job! I can\n"
"swab a mean deck!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMikasallaInteriors34"
msgid "08860"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what it's like,\n"
"standing in the middle of a\n"
"vast ocean of grass or sand."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgCheckedTheTabletIt"
msgid "08861"
msgstr ""
"{protagonist_name} checked the tablet.\n"
"It looks like there are strange\n"
"characters carved on it.{page_break}"
"Wielder of Water's strength...\n"
"Lay your hands upon this stone.{page_break}"
"If th'art worthy, the power\n"
"to drain away the standing\n"
"water shall be yours."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08862"
msgstr ""
"Water's strength, huh? That sounds\n"
"like my sort of thing, doesn't it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08863"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8} tried to touch\n"
"the stone slate."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatWentWrong"
msgid "08864"
msgstr ""
"What went wrong? What are\n"
"we going to do, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08865"
msgstr ""
"Maybe our power\n"
"is being tested."

msgctxt "MsgCheckedTheColumn"
msgid "08866"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} checked the column.{page_break}"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08867"
msgstr ""
"It's a column with a spot where\n"
"you can place something."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08868"
msgstr "You placed the {argument_item_name:1}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeVeHad"
msgid "08869"
msgstr ""
"We've had a lot of trouble\n"
"here in Izumo lately.{page_break}"
"I don't want to scare you,\n"
"but...you should leave, and fast.\n"
"Right now. Seriously. Run."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyNameS"
msgid "08870"
msgstr ""
"My name's Okuni. I'm a great\n"
"dancer... Except I don't feel\n"
"much like dancing these days."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLadyUzumeDoesn"
msgid "08871"
msgstr ""
"Lady Uzume doesn't want\n"
"to sacrifice Kushinada.{page_break}"
"But that's the only way\n"
"to appease the serpent..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSusaSGoing"
msgid "08872"
msgstr ""
"Susa's going to try to kill the\n"
"serpent and save his beloved\n"
"Kushinada. He's so fearless!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAsAChild"
msgid "08873"
msgstr ""
"As a child, Susa was as wild as\n"
"could be and brought his elder\n"
"sibling, Lady Uzume, much strife.{page_break}"
"Kushinada is the one who tamed\n"
"his wild ways. Of course, no one\n"
"wants to see her sacrificed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChoosingTheNext"
msgid "08874"
msgstr ""
"Choosing the next sacrifice\n"
"by lottery seems such a\n"
"harsh method.{page_break}"
"I am far too old to understand\n"
"the ideas of these modern times.\n"
"They seem far too extreme."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheDaughtersOf"
msgid "08875"
msgstr ""
"The daughters of the family in\n"
"that home requested that we use\n"
"a lottery to choose the victims."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgABraveWarrior"
msgid "08876"
msgstr ""
"A brave warrior will appear to\n"
"defeat the serpent by the next\n"
"full moon...{page_break}"
"It's just a legend, though. No one\n"
"believes that. No one."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgSeeThisRing"
msgid "08877"
msgstr ""
"See this ring of giant stones?\n"
"They've been here for ages.\n"
"No one knows who put them here.{page_break}"
"See how they make\n"
"this beautiful circle?\n"
"Except for that one, right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08878"
msgstr ""
"Susa moved it... He didn't even\n"
"use his hands. He surely holds\n"
"the secrets to a great power."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08879"
msgstr ""
"You're...not terribly\n"
"observant, are you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheMisalignedStone"
msgid "08880"
msgstr ""
"The misaligned stone! It's\n"
"back in its original position!\n"
"How did this happen!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08881"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm... Either Susa or Kushinada\n"
"must have moved it when\n"
"I wasn't looking."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgCanYouImagine"
msgid "08882"
msgstr ""
"Can you imagine what it must\n"
"be like to have the power to move\n"
"stones without touching them?{page_break}"
"That anyone should possess\n"
"that power is truly amazing."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheGreatSerpent"
msgid "08883"
msgstr ""
"The Great Serpent of Mikage\n"
"has awakened... What does it all\n"
"mean?{page_break}"
"That dragon is the guardian of\n"
"the island, so why is it treating\n"
"us so cruelly?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMNotGoing"
msgid "08884"
msgstr ""
"I'm not going to be sacrificed,\n"
"but that doesn't mean I'm happy.{page_break}"
"My dear friend Kushinada\n"
"doesn't deserve this, either..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMSureThat"
msgid "08885"
msgstr ""
"I'm sure that kindhearted\n"
"Lady Uzume doesn't want\n"
"to sacrifice anyone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatIfLosing"
msgid "08886"
msgstr ""
"What if losing Kushinada makes\n"
"Susa return to his wild ways?\n"
"I hope he fights the serpent...{page_break}"
"If he loses, at least he won't\n"
"have to bear living without\n"
"Kushinada."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLadyUzumeLoves"
msgid "08887"
msgstr ""
"Lady Uzume loves her brother\n"
"dearly... I'm sure she'd take\n"
"Kushinada's place if she could."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSacrificesAsGreat"
msgid "08888"
msgstr ""
"Sacrifices as great as this\n"
"should not be determined by\n"
"chance alone..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgKushinadaSAlways"
msgid "08889"
msgstr ""
"Kushinada's always had bad\n"
"luck at games of chance. I'll bet\n"
"those girls were counting on it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhyWonT"
msgid "08890"
msgstr ""
"Why won't anybody listen\n"
"to Lady Uzume?{page_break}"
"They've always trusted her,\n"
"at least up until now..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhyDoesLady"
msgid "08891"
msgstr ""
"Why does Lady Uzume have\n"
"me guarding these ruins?\n"
"What a waste of time..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOkuniKushinadaAnd"
msgid "08892"
msgstr ""
"Okuni, Kushinada, and Lady Uzume\n"
"all drew in the lottery to choose\n"
"the next sacrifice with us...{page_break}"
"I can't believe we drew\n"
"Kushinada. Is that chance? Fate?\n"
"I guess you never know..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfLadyUzume"
msgid "08893"
msgstr ""
"If Lady Uzume's name had been\n"
"drawn in the lottery, would she\n"
"have been the next sacrifice?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMSoRelieved"
msgid "08894"
msgstr ""
"I'm so relieved that I'm not\n"
"this year's sacrifice, but what\n"
"happens next year?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSusaSBeen"
msgid "08895"
msgstr ""
"Susa's been so sad all the\n"
"time, ever since Kushinada\n"
"was named the next sacrifice.{page_break}"
"I never liked the old, wild Susa,\n"
"but he's so different now. Maybe\n"
"I can be his new girlfriend."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLadyUzumeS"
msgid "08896"
msgstr ""
"Lady Uzume's been able to focus\n"
"on governing Izumo lately. I think\n"
"it's because Susa's calmed down."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIOnlySuggested"
msgid "08897"
msgstr ""
"I only suggested this lottery\n"
"idea because I didn't want to\n"
"be sacrificed.{page_break}"
"It looks like Kushinada really\n"
"does have bad luck, like\n"
"everyone says..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatIWant"
msgid "08898"
msgstr ""
"What I want to know is, what\n"
"caused our legendary guardian\n"
"to awaken?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAWhileBack"
msgid "08899"
msgstr ""
"A while back, a volcano erupted\n"
"on the mainland. We saw brilliant\n"
"flashes of light to the west.{page_break}"
"The great dragon awoke shortly\n"
"afterward. It caused a terrible\n"
"panic through the island."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatDragonsbaneSeems"
msgid "08900"
msgstr ""
"That Dragonsbane seems to\n"
"have put the serpent under...\n"
"but for how long?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgICanTFind"
msgid "08901"
msgstr ""
"I can't find my dagger...\n"
"I had it earlier... Where did it°\n"
"I wonder if Susa..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIAmOld"
msgid "08902"
msgstr ""
"I am old, and I've had enough of\n"
"this world. Why wouldn't I make\n"
"a good sacrifice for the dragon?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheSerpentCan"
msgid "08903"
msgstr ""
"The serpent can't stand sunlight,\n"
"so it only shows up in the village\n"
"at night. Just as the legend says."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheSerpentIs"
msgid "08904"
msgstr ""
"The serpent is only supposed\n"
"to awaken if the island is in\n"
"grave danger.{page_break}"
"I wonder what calamity\n"
"is going to befall us..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderIfAll"
msgid "08905"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if all the recent\n"
"disasters aroused the dragon\n"
"from his slumber on the mountain."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheSerpentWill"
msgid "08906"
msgstr ""
"The serpent will drink as much\n"
"Dragonsbane as it can find,\n"
"right down to the last drop.{page_break}"
"Nobody knows why they like\n"
"it so much, considering how\n"
"much it weakens them...{page_break}"
"It must be like catnip to them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAccordingToLegend"
msgid "08907"
msgstr ""
"According to legend, that's the\n"
"only thing that can put the\n"
"serpent back to sleep.{page_break}"
"As for the dagger...\n"
"I'll bet Susa's planning on\n"
"using it to save Kushinada."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOurGuardianSerpent"
msgid "08908"
msgstr ""
"Our guardian serpent is really\n"
"just a dragon. Why do dragons\n"
"always want maiden sacrifices?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThereSNo"
msgid "08909"
msgstr ""
"There's no way to get sunlight\n"
"into the serpent's cave on\n"
"Mt. Mikage. Just no way..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYeahSusaCame"
msgid "08910"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, Susa came through\n"
"here on his way to save\n"
"Kushinada.{page_break}"
"The jerk knocked me flat\n"
"and just kept on going...\n"
"He was totally wild..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEvenIfSusa"
msgid "08911"
msgstr ""
"Even if Susa tried to rescue\n"
"Kushinada, she wouldn't just\n"
"run away with him.{page_break}"
"I think she still believes that\n"
"a hero will appear and defeat\n"
"the serpent. That must be it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouKnowI"
msgid "08912"
msgstr ""
"You know, I can't stand Susa,\n"
"but I understand how he feels.\n"
"Kushinada's a really sweet girl."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLadyUzumeSays"
msgid "08913"
msgstr ""
"Lady Uzume says that a hero\n"
"would appear, but I don't know...\n"
"There's no hero coming...{page_break}"
"If Susa came running past\n"
"me with Kushinada, I wouldn't\n"
"stop them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08914"
msgstr "*Sniff*"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSusaDonT"
msgid "08915"
msgstr ""
"Susa, don't come\n"
"for me..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08916"
msgstr ""
"If I see you, I'll surely lose\n"
"the courage to sacrifice\n"
"myself for Izumo."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08917"
msgstr ""
"If I run, Lady Uzume and all\n"
"of Izumo will suffer greatly...\n"
"Please... Don't come for me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08918"
msgstr ""
"Lady Uzume has foretold\n"
"the coming of a hero,\n"
"and I believe her..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08919"
msgstr ""
"And so I shall remain here,\n"
"until the coming of the next\n"
"full moon...{pause_20_skippable}and the hero."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSusaPleaseDon"
msgid "08920"
msgstr ""
"Susa, please...\n"
"Don't try to save me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSusaSNot"
msgid "08921"
msgstr ""
"Susa's not here. I believe\n"
"he went to Mt. Mikage."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08922"
msgstr ""
"He believes he can save\n"
"Kushinada, and so he has\n"
"gone to fight the serpent."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08923"
msgstr ""
"He truly believes he can\n"
"defeat the Great Serpent\n"
"of Mikage."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08924"
msgstr ""
"It's all for naught, though, as\n"
"a hero will certainly appear and\n"
"destroy the great serpent."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfTheSerpent"
msgid "08925"
msgstr ""
"If the serpent defeats Susa,\n"
"I'll...be alone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThereSNoPoint"
msgid "08926"
msgstr ""
"There's no point dancing\n"
"if Okuni's not here..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheSerpentAttacked"
msgid "08927"
msgstr ""
"The serpent attacked the\n"
"town one night during a\n"
"festival.{page_break}"
"It didn't leave until it had\n"
"eaten all of the food we'd\n"
"prepared for our feast..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheSerpentAte"
msgid "08928"
msgstr ""
"The serpent ate all our food\n"
"and vanished into the darkness.\n"
"It ruined the festival."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheSerpentLives"
msgid "08929"
msgstr ""
"The serpent lives on Mt. Mikage.\n"
"In our tongue, its original name\n"
"meant \"the undying mountain.\"{page_break}"
"As long as the serpent\n"
"lives on its peak, I doubt the\n"
"serpent will ever die, either."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIPrayThat"
msgid "08930"
msgstr ""
"I pray that our guardian's\n"
"anger is not aroused and\n"
"that Susa will be protected..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOkuniSSuch"
msgid "08931"
msgstr ""
"Okuni's such a great dancer.\n"
"It's just so much more fun when\n"
"she's here to dance with us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheSerpentWould"
msgid "08932"
msgstr ""
"The serpent would eat up\n"
"anything we put in front of\n"
"it! Its hunger knows no bounds."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBeforeTheSerpent"
msgid "08933"
msgstr ""
"Before the serpent ate all\n"
"our food, it was a terror\n"
"to behold...{page_break}"
"But afterwards?\n"
"He wasn't so bad.{page_break}"
"No doubt about it, that\n"
"serpent sure knows good\n"
"food when he eats it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLegendHasIt"
msgid "08934"
msgstr ""
"Legend has it that Mt. Mikage\n"
"is enshrouded by a mysterious\n"
"power.{page_break}"
"I wonder if that's the source\n"
"of the serpent's eternal life."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIzumoSLeaders"
msgid "08935"
msgstr ""
"Izumo's leaders have always\n"
"possessed certain special\n"
"powers. Always.{page_break}"
"And let me tell you, the\n"
"combined power of Susa and\n"
"Lady Uzume is stunning to see."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOneDayKushinada"
msgid "08936"
msgstr ""
"One day, Kushinada put on\n"
"a display of power so great\n"
"that it almost rivaled Susa's!{page_break}"
"It's such a shame...\n"
"I really wanted to see how\n"
"strong she might have become."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThePowerThat"
msgid "08937"
msgstr ""
"The power that Lady Uzume\n"
"and Susa possess comes\n"
"from their ancestors.{page_break}"
"It cannot be learned, and it\n"
"cannot be imitated."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItWasThe"
msgid "08938"
msgstr ""
"It was the day those bright rocks\n"
"fell from the sky... That's when\n"
"Kushinada gained her powers."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOfCourseI"
msgid "08939"
msgstr ""
"Of course, I knew the legend of\n"
"the great serpent... Everyone\n"
"does! But I didn't believe it!{page_break}"
"Sacrificing a young girl to the\n"
"serpent year after year?\n"
"It's too cruel to be true!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfIWere"
msgid "08940"
msgstr ""
"If I were younger, I might\n"
"have been the sacrifice...\n"
"Ahh... It's so horrible!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThingsLikeThis"
msgid "08941"
msgstr ""
"Things like this are really\n"
"going to hurt the inn... We get\n"
"few enough travelers as it is!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatDoesThat"
msgid "08942"
msgstr ""
"What does that serpent plan\n"
"on doing with those young\n"
"women?{page_break}"
"Surely, it doesn't intend\n"
"to marry all of them!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhyWouldOur"
msgid "08943"
msgstr ""
"Why would our guardian\n"
"spirit demand a sacrifice?\n"
"It's inexcusable!{page_break}"
"A true guardian would never\n"
"require such a cruel tribute."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSniffHowCould"
msgid "08944"
msgstr ""
"*Sniff* How could we\n"
"sacrifice our beloved\n"
"Kushinada? It's not fair!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhenIGet"
msgid "08945"
msgstr ""
"When I get older, I might\n"
"have to be a sacrifice, too...\n"
"...What's a sacrifice?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfOnlyI"
msgid "08946"
msgstr ""
"If only I possessed the power\n"
"to prevent this from happening.\n"
"Please grant me strength..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDonTWantThe"
msgid "08947"
msgstr ""
"I don't want the serpent of\n"
"Mt. Mikage to eat Kushinada.\n"
"Oh, won't somebody help her?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNobodyWantsTo"
msgid "08948"
msgstr ""
"Nobody wants to be a sacrifice,\n"
"so a sacrifice must be something\n"
"pretty scary."

msgctxt "MsgCheckedTheAltar"
msgid "08949"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} checked the altar.{page_break}"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08950"
msgstr "There wasn't anything special."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08951"
msgstr ""
"It looks like something\n"
"can be placed here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaiaRockInside01"
