"Who are you?\n"
"How did you get here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08955"
msgstr ""
"Only Uzume, Kushinada, and I\n"
"possess the ability to come here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08956"
msgstr ""
"Never mind. I don't have time\n"
"to talk. I have my hands full\n"
"getting the serpent to drink this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08957"
msgstr ""
"Once it's groggy,\n"
"that's when I'll strike..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaiaRockInside03"
msgid "08958"
msgstr ""
"If you understand, then get\n"
"out of my way.\n"
"Stand over there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaiaRockInside04"
msgid "08959"
msgstr ""
"How many casks does it take\n"
"to weaken this stupid serpent?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaiaRockInside05"
msgid "08960"
msgstr "Move out of the way there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaiaRockInside11"
msgid "08961"
msgstr ""
"The cups are overflowing\n"
"with a river of Dragonsbane."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFieldYouYouCannotFightThe"
msgid "08962"
