"You! You cannot fight the\n"
"serpent! Not while it's still in\n"
"full possession of its senses!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFieldAtLastTheSerpentHas"
msgid "08963"
msgstr ""
"At last... The serpent has\n"
"finally had its fill. This is\n"
"the chance I'd hoped for."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08964"
msgstr ""
"I will defeat you before the\n"
"next full moon and rescue\n"
"Kushinada myself!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08965"
msgstr ""
"All right, you so-called guardian!\n"
"Let's see what you've got!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08966"
msgstr ""
"That's weird... It didn't\n"
"even react..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08967"
msgstr ""
"Feeding the serpent Dragonsbane\n"
"isn't weakening it enough for\n"
"me to beat it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaiaRockInside06"
msgid "08968"
msgstr ""
"The serpent is still too strong.{page_break}"
