"weaken it further..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08969"
msgstr ""
"The cups are overflowing\n"
"with a river of Dragonsbane."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaiaRockInside07"
msgid "08970"
msgstr ""
"Who do they think they are?\n"
"I'm the only one who\n"
"can save Kushinada."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFieldLikeISaidTheSerpent"
msgid "08971"
