#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMNot"
msgid "08980"
msgstr ""
"I'm not dying...\n"
"I'm just so tired... I'm going\n"
"to lie down for a bit."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouRe"
msgid "08981"
msgstr ""
"If you're going to Izumo,\n"
