"still alive."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgYouReGoing"
msgid "08982"
msgstr ""
"You're going to tell Kushinada\n"
"that you defeated the serpent,\n"
"aren't you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08983"
msgstr ""
"Ha ha ha! Of course! That's\n"
"exactly what happened!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08984"
msgstr ""
"Please, you were the ones to\n"
"defeat it, so you should be\n"
"honest and accept credit."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIReallyGot"
msgid "08985"
