"safe, it was worth it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgKushinadaSSafe"
msgid "08986"
msgstr ""
"Kushinada's safe...\n"
"She's safe!\n"
"Nothing else matters."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThoseScreamsFrom"
msgid "08987"
msgstr ""
"Those screams from\n"
"Mt. Mikage... They must\n"
"have come from the serpent.{page_break}"
"That means Susa must\n"
"have saved Kushinada!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeRePlanning"
msgid "08988"
msgstr ""
"We're planning a festival\n"
"to celebrate the end of the\n"
"serpent's reign of terror!{page_break}"
"Lady Uzume is paying\n"
"for the whole thing, so\n"
"bring your dancin' feet!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSusaHasChanged"
msgid "08989"
msgstr ""
"Susa has changed so much\n"
"from the wild youth we once\n"
"feared. He's saved our village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgKushinadaHasBeen"
msgid "08990"
msgstr ""
"Kushinada has been spared?\n"
"I'm thrilled beyond words! She\n"
"did not deserve such a fate..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIVeHeardPeople"
msgid "08991"
msgstr ""
"I've heard people saying that\n"
"Susa had the help of other\n"
"heroes... Are you they?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSusaHasGrown"
msgid "08992"
msgstr ""
"Susa has grown so much\n"
"to fight for his beloved\n"
"Kushinada so gallantly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSusaHasPut"
msgid "08993"
msgstr ""
"Susa has put the serpent\n"
"back to rest, but not everyone\n"
"seems happy..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLadyUzumePredicted"
msgid "08994"
msgstr ""
"Lady Uzume predicted that\n"
"a great hero would appear\n"
"to save Kushinada.{page_break}"
"Nobody thought that hero\n"
"would be Susa!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgSeeThisRingOf"
msgid "08995"
msgstr ""
"See this ring of giant stones?\n"
"They've been here for ages.\n"
"No one knows who put them here.{page_break}"
"See how they make\n"
"this beautiful circle?\n"
"Except for that one, right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08996"
msgstr ""
"Susa moved it... He didn't even\n"
"use his hands. He surely holds\n"
"the secrets to a great power."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08997"
msgstr ""
"You're...not terribly\n"
"observant, are you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08998"
msgstr ""
"The misaligned stone! It's\n"
"back in its original position!\n"
"How did this happen!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "08999"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm... Either Susa or Kushinada\n"
"must have moved it when\n"
"I wasn't looking."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgButItS"
msgid "09000"
msgstr ""
"But it's a festival!\n"
"Why do I have to keep\n"
"guarding the stone circle?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHadAlways"
msgid "09001"
msgstr ""
"I had always thought Susa was\n"
"nothing but a troublemaker, but\n"
"he's proven himself a hero now!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThisCelebrationWill"
msgid "09002"
msgstr ""
"This celebration will rival the\n"
"one that woke the serpent in\n"
"the first place!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSOdd"
msgid "09003"
msgstr ""
"It's odd to think that so\n"
"many in the village once\n"
"despised Susa..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgKushinadaIsSuch"
msgid "09004"
msgstr ""
"Kushinada is such a sweet\n"
"girl. She should never have\n"
"been chosen in the lottery."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatWouldMake"
msgid "09005"
