"What would make anyone\n"
"want to race up Mt. Mikage\n"
"and into the serpent's lair?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAllTheGirls"
msgid "09006"
msgstr ""
"All the girls must be so relieved\n"
"now that that awful lottery\n"
"has been ended forever."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEveryoneSBeen"
msgid "09007"
msgstr ""
"Everyone's been wondering\n"
"why the serpent wanted\n"
"a sacrifice... Was he lonely?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSoSusaReally"
msgid "09008"
msgstr ""
"So...Susa really was as much\n"
"of a hero as Lady Uzume\n"
"claimed... How disappointing."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSusaDidA"
msgid "09009"
msgstr ""
"Susa did a momentous thing,\n"
"battling the serpent. So why do\n"
"I not want to congratulate him?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderIf"
msgid "09010"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if there's someone out\n"
"there who would sacrifice his\n"
"life for me. Will I ever find him?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgDancingLikeThis"
msgid "09011"
msgstr ""
"Dancing like this\n"
"is pure bliss."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEveryoneSaysThat"
msgid "09012"
msgstr ""
"Everyone says that Susa is\n"
"the one to thank for returning\n"
"peace to our small village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeMayNever"
msgid "09013"
msgstr ""
"We may never know what\n"
"was responsible for waking\n"
"the serpent from its slumber..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOurIslandIs"
msgid "09014"
msgstr ""
"Our island is safe at last!\n"
"It's time for us to celebrate\n"
"and enjoy ourselves again!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheSerpentTaught"
msgid "09015"
msgstr ""
"The serpent taught us one\n"
"thing: Celebrate while you\n"
"can, but keep your eyes open!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgLadyUzumeAnd"
msgid "09016"
msgstr ""
"Lady Uzume and the others\n"
"aren't really blood relatives.\n"
"Does that surprise you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09017"
msgstr ""
"Well, they do possess a power no\n"
"one else has... Maybe that means\n"
"they are siblings after all."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09018"
msgstr ""
"I'm just glad that Lady\n"
"Uzume used her powers\n"
"for the good of us all."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAllAnyoneTalks"
msgid "09019"
msgstr ""
"All anyone talks about is how Susa\n"
"risked his life to save Kushinada.\n"
"I'm so jealous..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgADragonA"
msgid "09020"
msgstr ""
"A dragon, a hero, a damsel\n"
"in distress... That's got all the\n"
"makings for a fairy tale..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSusaSaidThe"
msgid "09021"
msgstr ""
"Susa said the serpent wasn't\n"
"all that tough... He makes quite\n"
"a dashing hero!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeNeedTo"
msgid "09022"
msgstr ""
"We need to figure out what woke\n"
"the serpent...\n"
"After the festival, maybe..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgDancingIsGood"
msgid "09023"
msgstr ""
"Dancing is good for the soul!{page_break}"
"Oooog... But too much\n"
"dancing...makes...me...\n"
"dizzy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatSusaUsed"
msgid "09024"
msgstr ""
"That Susa used my dagger to\n"
"defeat the serpent.{page_break}"
"He would never have won\n"
"if not for my dagger! And\n"
"he gets all the credit!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAsLongAsWe"
msgid "09025"
msgstr ""
"As long as we have Lady\n"
"Uzume, Kushinada, and Susa\n"
"here, Izumo will be safe."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouReLooking"
msgid "09026"
msgstr ""
"If you're looking for Kushinada,\n"
"Lady Uzume escorted her to\n"
"the mansion.{page_break}"
"Now that Susa has defeated\n"
"the serpent, Kushinada is no\n"
"longer being held as a sacrifice."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgDidYouHear"
msgid "09027"
msgstr ""
"Did you hear how Susa\n"
"defeated the serpent and\n"
"rescued Kushinada?{page_break}"
"How come she doesn't\n"
"seem any happier now\n"
"that she's free?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLadyUzumeAndKushinada"
msgid "09028"
msgstr ""
"Lady Uzume and Kushinada\n"
"are as close as sisters.\n"
