#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgKushinadaMustBe"
msgid "09029"
msgstr ""
"Kushinada must be upset that\n"
"Susa defied his sister and\n"
"risked his life for her.{page_break}"
"She worries about him\n"
"so much."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWarriorsAppearedFrom"
msgid "09030"
msgstr ""
"Warriors appeared from within\n"
"Mt. Mikage?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09031"
msgstr ""
"Yes... After the serpent's roar,\n"
"these warriors appeared."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09032"
msgstr ""
"So, it wasn't Susa who defeated\n"
"the serpent, but those heroes..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09033"
msgstr "It might have been..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09034"
msgstr ""
"Lady Kushinada, please\n"
"forgive me..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09035"
msgstr ""
"I don't care who defeated\n"
"the serpent... I'm more worried\n"
"about what happened to Susa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09036"
msgstr ""
"So, Susa never came down\n"
"from Mt. Mikage?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09037"
msgstr ""
"He returned to the village after\n"
"the heroes appeared, and he\n"
"knew the serpent was defeated."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09038"
msgstr "Oh, Susa..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09039"
msgstr "Who are you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09040"
msgstr ""
"This is my home, and I am\n"
"having a private conversation.\n"
"Leave at once!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09041"
msgstr "What is it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09042"
msgstr ""
"There can be no doubt...\n"
"These are the heroes who\n"
"appeared on Mt. Mikage."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09043"
msgstr ""
"Are you the ones who\n"
"defeated the serpent?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09044"
msgstr "So it was you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09045"
msgstr ""
"My apologies...\n"
"You are welcome here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09046"
msgstr "Who are you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09047"
msgstr ""
"I'm Kraden, and this\n"
"is {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09048"
msgstr "Behind him is {actor_name:8}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09049"
msgstr "Pleased to meet you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09050"
msgstr ""
"I'm {actor_name:6}, and\n"
"this is {actor_name:7}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09051"
msgstr ""
"We're on a quest. Our travels\n"
"across the Great Eastern\n"
"Sea brought us here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09052"
msgstr ""
"You were seen coming down\n"
"from Mt. Mikage. What brought\n"
"you to such a dangerous place?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09053"
msgstr ""
"To complete our quest, we\n"
"need many types of Psynergy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09054"
msgstr "Psynergy?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09055"
msgstr "What is Psynergy?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09056"
msgstr ""
"Psynergy is many things... The\n"
"power to move things with\n"
"one's mind, to heal, to create."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09057"
msgstr "All with one's mind?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09058"
msgstr ""
"Tell me, is it something\n"
"like...this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09059"
msgstr ""
"Is that the power you're\n"
"talking about?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09060"
msgstr ""
"That power?\n"
"Lady Uzume?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09061"
msgstr ""
"It's not mine alone.\n"
"Kushinada and Susa\n"
"possess it as well."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09062"
msgstr ""
"This is the power we possess.\n"
"I assume you have something\n"
"like it yourselves?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIThoughtSo"
msgid "09063"
msgstr ""
"I thought so. Only those who\n"
"can wield the power can see\n"
"it. And you did see it, didn't you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09064"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}, there's no need\n"
"to hide our abilities from them,\n"
"is there?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSoYouCall"
msgid "09065"
msgstr ""
"So, you call what we do\n"
"\"Psynergy,\" and you can\n"
"do it, too?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09066"
msgstr ""
"If you already have Psynergy,\n"
"why do you need more of\n"
"this power?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09067"
msgstr ""
"Their powers are different\n"
"from our own. There seem to\n"
"be many forms of Psynergy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09068"
msgstr "Susa!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09069"
msgstr "Susa..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09070"
msgstr "So, you lived after all, Susa..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09071"
msgstr ""
"Yes, I've survived, and I've\n"
"made it home to you both."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09072"
msgstr "Thanks to them, actually..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09073"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}, our gratitude to\n"
"you and your friends grows\n"
"deeper each passing moment."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09074"
msgstr ""
"Susa, you spoke of different\n"
"types of power. Tell me, what\n"
"did you mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09075"
msgstr ""
"I can only describe what\n"
"I saw, my sister. Ask\n"
"{actor_name:5} here about it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09076"
msgstr ""
"Ah, yes. Psynergy... I have\n"
"dedicated most of my life\n"
"to its study..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09077"
msgstr ""
"The power of Psynergy comes\n"
"from the four basic forces of\n"
"earth, fire, water, and wind.{page_break}"
"These energies, the foundations\n"
"of Alchemy, are called\n"
"\"Elementals.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09078"
msgstr ""
"You don't know Alchemy?\n"
"The four elements?{page_break}"
"Why, they're the very\n"
"building blocks of all\n"
"matter on Weyard."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09079"
msgstr ""
"All existing matter comes from\n"
"Alchemy and this Psynergy?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09080"
msgstr ""
"Yes, that's right. Everything\n"
"you see around you is some\n"
"combination of these elements."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09081"
msgstr ""
"Does this mean that there\n"
"are as many types of Psynergy\n"
"as there are types of elements?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09082"
msgstr ""
"That's right, Kushinada.\n"
"You're a smart lass."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09083"
msgstr ""
"Mt. Mikage was a place of\n"
"great earth powers. I'd imagine\n"
"your powers are earth based."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09084"
msgstr ""
"That's right, but how did\n"
"you know this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09085"
msgstr ""
"Kraden... Mt. Mikage is\n"
"Gaia Rock, isn't it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09086"
msgstr ""
"...Gaia Rock? Mt. Mikage is\n"
"the sacred mount of our people!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09087"
msgstr ""
"Yes, but there are many mountains\n"
"like your Mt. Mikage all across\n"
"the Eastern Sea.{page_break}"
"Mt. Mikage is a source of earth\n"
"power, and therefore, it must\n"
"be Gaia Rock."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09088"
msgstr ""
"You have seen other mountains\n"
"like our Mt. Mikage?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09089"
msgstr ""
"Yes! In fact, it seems that\n"
"each of these rocks contains\n"
"a different elemental power."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09090"
msgstr ""
"And now, you are questing to\n"
"gather the power of these\n"
"elements, yes?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09091"
msgstr ""
"And you only defeated the\n"
"Great Serpent of Mikage to\n"
"accomplish this goal?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgRegardlessOfYour"
msgid "09092"
msgstr ""
"Regardless of your motives,\n"
"you have saved us all."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouTookPity"
msgid "09093"
msgstr ""
"You took pity on Kushinada?\n"
"You are very kind to help\n"
"Susa, {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouReNotImplying"
msgid "09094"
msgstr ""
"You're...not implying that we\n"
"defeated the serpent, are you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09095"
msgstr ""
"It's true that we did fight\n"
"the creature..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09096"
msgstr ""
"But without Susa's power,\n"
"the battle might not have\n"
"ended so happily."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09097"
msgstr "What... What are you°"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09098"
msgstr ""
"Susa had given the beast a\n"
"lot of Dragonsbane in order\n"
"to weaken it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09099"
msgstr ""
"We could never have beaten\n"
"the beast if it had not been in\n"
"a...weakened state."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09100"
msgstr ""
"We were victorious only\n"
"because Susa risked everything\n"
"to weaken the dragon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09101"
msgstr "Susa, perhaps, after all, you are..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09102"
msgstr "No, I didn't..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09103"
msgstr ""
"Don't forget, Susa dealt the\n"
"finishing blow, didn't he?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09104"
msgstr ""
"Finishing blow? All I\n"
"did was stab it with\n"
"the Cloud Brand."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09105"
msgstr ""
"That's right. Piercing it\n"
"with the Cloud Brand was\n"
"hardly a finishing blow."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDisagree2"
msgid "09106"
msgstr "I disagree..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09107"
msgstr ""
"You weakened the serpent.\n"
"You dealt the final blow.\n"
"I'd say you were essential."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09108"
msgstr ""
"So, Lady Uzume, wouldn't you\n"
"say that Susa deserves\n"
"the reward for this feat?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09109"
msgstr ""
"Even {actor_name:5} agrees,\n"
"don't you, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09110"
msgstr "I do, too."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09111"
msgstr ""
"We weren't fighting in hopes\n"
"of getting a reward, were we?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09112"
msgstr ""
"We'll be satisfied just learning\n"
"your Psynergy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09113"
msgstr ""
"Are you asking for a reward?\n"
"That's just plain greedy!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09114"
msgstr ""
"We couldn't possibly take\n"
"any sort of reward."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09115"
msgstr ""
"Learning new Psynergy\n"
"will be reward enough."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAsYouCanSee"
msgid "09116"
msgstr "As you can see."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09117"
msgstr ""
"Now, it's about time for us\n"
"to leave Izumo Village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09118"
msgstr ""
"Yes, indeed! We're on\n"
"our way to Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09119"
msgstr "You're leaving so soon?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09120"
msgstr "We are in a great hurry."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09121"
msgstr ""
"Then you must return to\n"
"Izumo someday."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09122"
msgstr ""
"I'm sure we'll be back\n"
"once our mission\n"
"is completed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09123"
msgstr ""
"Excellent! I shall accept\n"
"that as your oath!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09124"
msgstr "...Oath?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09125"
msgstr ""
"Oh, by promising to return, we'll\n"
"be ensuring that our quest will\n"
"end successfully..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09126"
msgstr ""
"I understand... We must\n"
"vow to return, everyone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09127"
msgstr "We'll be waiting."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouHave"
msgid "09128"
msgstr ""
"If you have time, won't\n"
"you enjoy a little of our\n"
"celebratory festival?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSomedaySusaAnd"
msgid "09129"
msgstr ""
"Someday, Susa and I will have\n"
"a son, and we will name him\n"
"Takeru.{page_break}"
"When he goes to sleep at night,\n"
"I will tell him the story of your\n"
"great deeds and your quest."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMSureYou"
msgid "09130"
msgstr ""
"I'm sure you know the villagers\n"
"believe I beat the serpent.\n"
"Don't let me take all the glory!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfSDescendants"
msgid "09131"
msgstr ""
"If {actor_name:5}'s descendants\n"
"are ever in trouble, our\n"
"Takeru will rush to their aid."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMNo"
msgid "09132"
msgstr ""
"I'm no hero, but that shouldn't\n"
"stop anyone from treating me\n"
"like one."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAndWhatWere"
msgid "09133"
msgstr ""
"And what were you planning\n"
"to do, once you'd read my\n"
"mind, hm?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09134"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}, you read my\n"
"mind earlier, too, didn't you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09135"
msgstr ""
"You can't read my mind,\n"
"but if there is something you\n"
"want to know, I shall tell you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTryingAgainWhat"
msgid "09136"
msgstr ""
"Trying again, {actor_name:5}?\n"
"What a pest.{page_break}"
"You can see my mind, but\n"
"you are incapable of\n"
"peering into my heart."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWait2"
msgid "09137"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, wait!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09138"
msgstr ""
"It troubled me to let you\n"
"leave like this..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09139"
msgstr ""
"I owe you much for your help,\n"
"but I didn't have any way to\n"
"thank you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09140"
msgstr "And then I thought of something."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09141"
msgstr ""
"You're a warrior, and\n"
"warriors need weapons.\n"
"Wouldn't you agree?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09142"
msgstr ""
"Are you sure about that?\n"
"I was only hoping to show\n"
"you my appreciation."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgWouldYouBe"
msgid "09143"
msgstr ""
"Would you be willing\n"
"to accept a token\n"
"of my gratitude?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThisTokenIsn"
msgid "09144"
msgstr ""
"This token isn't something\n"
"I possess. It's a legend, one\n"
"that might be of use to you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09145"
msgstr ""
"Long ago, the Great Serpent of\n"
"Mikage would sleep with its body\n"
"crossing the river..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09146"
msgstr ""
"Where its tail fell, the\n"
"Cloud Brand lay hidden.\n"
"That's the legend, anyway."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09147"
msgstr ""
"The serpent was once the\n"
"sword's protector, but it lost\n"
"the sword many ages past."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09148"
msgstr ""
"Anyway, maybe you want\n"
"to go check out the dragon\n"
"again...{page_break}"
"I left something there\n"
"for you...just as a way\n"
"of saying thank you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09149"
msgstr ""
"Well, I've said what I came to\n"
"say. I'm going back to Kushinada."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09150"
msgstr ""
"I hope you are successful\n"
"in your quest."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheLegendSays"
msgid "09151"
msgstr ""
"The legend says that the Cloud\n"
"Brand is a powerful weapon\n"
"for fighting dragons.{page_break}"
"I trust you'll test the legend,\n"
"should the time come."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09152"
msgstr ""
"Times of peace are so dull.\n"
"It makes me want to do something\n"
"outrageous to shake things up."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgTheyVeBeen"
msgid "09153"
msgstr ""
"They've been saying that you\n"
"went into Mt. Mikage, too...\n"
"Is that true?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09154"
msgstr ""
"There's a legend about a doll\n"
"of mysterious power hidden\n"
"somewhere in the mountain.{page_break}"
"I'm sure Lady Uzume would\n"
"by very pleased if you\n"
"were to find it for her."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09155"
msgstr ""
"Oh... There's an old legend about\n"
"a dancing doll that has strange\n"
"powers hidden up there.{page_break}"
"Lady Uzume really wants that\n"
"doll. Maybe Susa will find it\n"
"and bring it back for her..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSupposedlyTheDoll"
msgid "09156"
msgstr ""
"Supposedly, the doll has the\n"
"power to move the statues that\n"
"block light inside the mountain."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLadyUzumeHas"
msgid "09157"
msgstr ""
"Lady Uzume has grown quite\n"
"fond of this odd creature she\n"
"found... She's taken it as a pet."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLadyUzumeSNew"
msgid "09158"
msgstr ""
"Lady Uzume's new pet affects\n"
"her powers in weird ways. It\n"
"doesn't do anything to us..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhyDoesLadyUzume"
msgid "09159"
msgstr ""
"Why does Lady Uzume want\n"
"that dancing doll so badly?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderWhatSort"
msgid "09160"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what sort of dance\n"
"the doll does.{page_break}"
"I'd love to see what it\n"
"looked like someday."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHeardThat"
msgid "09161"
msgstr ""
"I heard that Lady Uzume's pet\n"
"sometimesi disappears into\n"
"thin air...{page_break}"
"Sound a little bit like that\n"
"cat I had when I was little."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDonTKnowWhatIt"
msgid "09162"
msgstr ""
"I don't know what it means\n"
"that Lady Uzume's pet\n"
"increases her power...{page_break}"
"But these kids have seen a\n"
"lot of things I've never seen.\n"
"Maybe they understand..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgAhCouldIt"
msgid "09163"
msgstr ""
"Ah... Could it be?\n"
"Is this the dancing doll\n"
"of Mt. Mikage?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09164"
msgstr ""
"You found this at the peak\n"
"of Mt. Mikage?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09165"
msgstr ""
"Don't lie to me. The style,\n"
"the craftsmanship... You must\n"
"have found this on Mt. Mikage."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAgainYouHave"
msgid "09166"
msgstr ""
"Again, you have done more\n"
"for me than I can properly\n"
"reward you for doing..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09167"
msgstr ""
"I think I may have something\n"
"that might please you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09168"
msgstr ""
"This is my pet. It's very\n"
"dear to me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09169"
msgstr ""
"I am unsure how it works,\n"
"but this fellow seems\n"
"to magnify our power..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09170"
msgstr ""
"Though it saddens me to part\n"
"with it, I would have you take\n"
"him, as he might help you..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09171"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} and his friends have\n"
"agreed to care for you\n"
"from now on."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09172"
msgstr "Please, accept this gift."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWithThisDancing"
msgid "09173"
msgstr ""
"With this dancing doll, I can\n"
"explore Mt. Mikage on my own.\n"
"Take care, {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09174"
msgstr ""
"I'm grateful for the dancing\n"
"doll, but I do wish you'd stop\n"
"trying to read my mind.{page_break}"
"If there is something you wish\n"
"to know, simply open your mouth\n"
"and ask."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouMustSee"
msgid "09175"
msgstr ""
"You must see many wonderful\n"
"things traveling across the\n"
"Eastern Sea.{page_break}"
"How I'd love to travel like you\n"
"and see such wonders."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyGoodsAre"
msgid "09176"
msgstr ""
"My goods are among the\n"
"best on the island.{page_break}"
"I'm sure there are things\n"
"the people on the mainland\n"
"would love to have."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDLoveTo"
msgid "09177"
msgstr ""
"I'd love to travel the Great\n"
"Eastern Sea and get things\n"
"I can't find here on the island."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThisMayBe"
msgid "09178"
msgstr ""
"This may be a small island, but\n"
"our craftsmanship is as good\n"
"as anything on the mainland.{page_break}"
"It may seem impossible now,\n"
"but one day I'll be trading with\n"
"the shops in all the big cities."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsFromChampa"
msgid "09179"
msgstr ""
"Briggs, from Champa, hasn't\n"
"been by selling much fish lately,\n"
"so our menu's suffered."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAsLadyUzume"
msgid "09180"
msgstr ""
"As Lady Uzume foretold, the\n"
"serpent was defeated without\n"
"returning to our village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfBriggsS"
msgid "09181"
msgstr ""
"If Briggs's ship doesn't come\n"
"soon, we won't be able to\n"
"get any seafood.{page_break}"
"Until then, all we'll have to\n"
"eat is freshwater fish."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIUnderstandNow"
msgid "09182"
msgstr ""
"I understand now!\n"
"I had no idea why we were\n"
"preparing all those barrels.{page_break}"
"If not for those barrels, the\n"
"serpent just might have\n"
"destroyed all of Izumo Village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNowThatPeace"
msgid "09183"
msgstr ""
"Now that peace has been\n"
"restored, our island is\n"
"flourishing once more.{page_break}"
"And I am most pleased\n"
"that we had no need of\n"
"any sacrifices!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNowThatTheSerpent"
msgid "09184"
msgstr ""
"Now that the serpent's been\n"
"defeated, we don't have to\n"
"sacrifice anyone!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouReA"
msgid "09185"
msgstr ""
"If you're a sacrifice, that\n"
"means you have to marry\n"
"the dragon, right?{page_break}"
"I'd hate to think what it\n"
"must be like, cooking for\n"
"a creature that big."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIThankThe"
msgid "09186"
msgstr ""
"I thank the powers that be\n"
"that I was not chosen as\n"
"a sacrifice."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMaybeNowKushinada"
msgid "09187"
msgstr ""
"Maybe now, Kushinada\n"
"can come out and play.\n"
"What should we do, though?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatDragonWanted"
msgid "09188"
msgstr ""
"That dragon wanted a new\n"
"wife each and every year!\n"
"He must really like girls."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaiaRockInside09"
msgid "09189"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} searched the slate.\n"
"There is an inscription.{page_break}"
"Wielder of Earth's might,\n"
"Lay your hands upon this stone.{page_break}"
"I shall grant thee the power\n"
"to melt into the earth, the\n"
"power of Sand!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09190"
msgstr ""
"Wielder of Earth's might...\n"
"That'd be you, {protagonist_name}.\n"
"Touch it. Go on, don't worry!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09191"
msgstr "{protagonist_name} touched the rock."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09192"
msgstr ""
"{protagonist_name} received\n"
"the power of Sand."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMSensing"
msgid "09193"
msgstr "I'm...sensing something..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgICanT"
msgid "09194"
msgstr "I can't feel anything..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgGaiaRockInside10"
msgid "09195"
msgstr ""
"I'm done for... That dragon\n"
"has finished me off..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa01"
msgid "09196"
msgstr ""
"Oh, I'm so hungry...\n"
"And there won't be anything\n"
"to eat until Briggs returns."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa02"
msgid "09197"
msgstr ""
"When is Briggs going to return\n"
"with food for the village?\n"
"We can't wait much longer."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa03"
msgid "09198"
msgstr ""
"How did you find your way\n"
"here, to the edge of Angara?\n"
"Champa is hidden by mountains.{page_break}"
"No one ever climbs over to\n"
"see us, except for the monks\n"
"of the Fuchin Temple."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa04"
msgid "09199"
msgstr ""
"Champa is impoverished, but\n"
"soon, we will prosper again.{page_break}"
"All our hopes rest on Briggs\n"
"returning with a ship filled\n"
"with treasures!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgChampa05"
msgid "09200"
msgstr ""
"You've the look of a traveler\n"
"about you... Have you been to\n"
"Ankohl Ruins?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09201"
msgstr ""
"Only those who have mastered\n"
"the powers of the earth can\n"
"enter the ruins."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09202"
msgstr ""
"My mistake... These old eyes\n"
"aren't what they used to be.{page_break}"
"Anyway, the ruins are just a\n"
"little ways northeast of here.\n"
"You should go see them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa06"
msgid "09203"
msgstr ""
"The ruins at Ankohl are all\n"
"that remains of a great\n"
"sanctum our ancestors built.{page_break}"
"They must have been quite\n"
"wealthy to build such a\n"
"massive building."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa07"
msgid "09204"
msgstr ""
"Eoleo, Briggs's son, has a\n"
"really strange ability...{page_break}"
"I'll bet if I keep practicing,\n"
"I'll be able to do it, too, so I'm\n"
"giving it my all."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa08"
msgid "09205"
msgstr ""
"Once Briggs comes back,\n"
"I can play with Eoleo again...\n"
"I hope they come back soon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa09"
msgid "09206"
msgstr ""
"The cliff caves are a lot\n"
"quieter with Briggs gone... It's\n"
"a little lonely without him here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa10"
msgid "09207"
msgstr ""
"Our matriarch is the last\n"
"successor of the Ankohl.{page_break}"
"She's a master of the forge.\n"
"It was the ancient gift of\n"
"the Ankohl... {page_break}"
"There's nothing\n"
"broken that they couldn't fix."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgChampa11"
msgid "09208"
msgstr ""
"The Champa sailors aren't...well\n"
"liked outside of here, are we?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09209"
msgstr ""
"Hey, that hurts... You could\n"
"at least lie to me, just to\n"
"be polite...{page_break}"
"If you keep spreading rumors\n"
"like that, you'll have a rough\n"
"time around here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09210"
msgstr ""
"Really? That's nice to hear.\n"
"But if you do hear anything,\n"
"don't believe a word of it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa12"
msgid "09211"
msgstr ""
"Where could Briggs be\n"
"wasting his time now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa13"
msgid "09212"
msgstr ""
"Briggs promised to bring\n"
"enough food for the whole\n"
"village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa14"
msgid "09213"
msgstr ""
"Champa is all alone on the\n"
"eastern edge of Angara. That's\n"
"why we took to the sea.{page_break}"
"We had to learn to fend for\n"
"ourselves... That's why we\n"
"are seafaring people today."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa15"
msgid "09214"
msgstr ""
"I bet Briggs has already\n"
"dug up the treasure and is\n"
"on his way back home."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa16"
msgid "09215"
msgstr ""
"I want someone to solve\n"
"the riddle of Ankohl Ruins\n"
"before I die... It's my one wish!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa17"
msgid "09216"
msgstr ""
"They say the chamber at the\n"
"top of the ruins is decorated\n"
"in the purest gold.{page_break}"
"Our ancestors must have\n"
"been wealthy to afford\n"
"such extravagent decor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa18"
msgid "09217"
msgstr ""
"If I could pick up things\n"
"without using my hands,\n"
"life would be so much easier."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa19"
msgid "09218"
msgstr ""
"Eoleo's so much younger than\n"
"I am, but I can't stop thinking\n"
"about him... Is that...love?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa20"
msgid "09219"
msgstr ""
"Why haven't Briggs and\n"
"his men returned yet?{page_break}"
"Obaba said not to go looking\n"
"for them, but what if they're\n"
"in trouble?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa21"
msgid "09220"
msgstr ""
"Obaba's locked herself in her\n"
"room until her grandson, Briggs,\n"
"returns from sea.{page_break}"
"She's so worried... She hasn't\n"
"even been eating. I hope\n"
"she's all right."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa22"
msgid "09221"
msgstr ""
"If Briggs would just bring the\n"
"treasure he found back to\n"
"Champa, we could all prosper.{page_break}"
"Then we could put this pirate\n"
"business behind us for good."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThereSNot"
msgid "09222"
msgstr ""
"There's not much space in the\n"
"cliff caves. That's why we have\n"
"to live out here on the boats."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEveryoneInChampa"
msgid "09223"
msgstr ""
"Everyone in Champa is poor,\n"
"but the poorest of us all live\n"
"on rafts... I want to live on land."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhenMyFather"
msgid "09224"
msgstr ""
"When my father heads out\n"
"to sea, he takes our home\n"
"with him and leaves us cold.{page_break}"
"But when he comes home\n"
"with an empty net, that\n"
"leaves us cold AND hungry."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyDadWent"
msgid "09225"
msgstr ""
"My dad went out to fish, but there\n"
"were no fish to be caught, so he\n"
"had to come back empty-handed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheseRaftsAre"
msgid "09226"
msgstr ""
"These rafts are all we have!\n"
"There's no place left for us\n"
"on dry land!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfDadHadn"
msgid "09227"
msgstr ""
"If Dad hadn't been opposed to\n"
"Briggs becoming a pirate, we'd\n"
"still be living on land..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHopeDad"
msgid "09228"
msgstr ""
"I hope Dad makes it back before\n"
"dark... I don't want to have to\n"
"sleep on shore with no shelter."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFatherWorriesSo"
msgid "09229"
msgstr ""
"Father worries so much\n"
"about the lack of fish...{page_break}"
"He used to come back with fish\n"
"jumping out of his nets. Why\n"
"can't he catch fish anymore?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheTidalWave"
msgid "09230"
msgstr ""
"The tidal wave was terrible...\n"
"It... It nearly swallowed me\n"
"whole!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItLookedTo"
msgid "09231"
msgstr ""
"It looked to me like the wave\n"
"came from the Sea of Time.\n"
"What's in there? What caused it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMostOfThe"
msgid "09232"
msgstr ""
"Most of the sailors here live in\n"
"the cliff dwellings, but I don't\n"
"like those caves. They're dank!{page_break}"
"And what's worse, the people\n"
"living in the harbor really\n"
"resent the cliff-dwellers."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheFishAre"
msgid "09233"
msgstr ""
"The fish are vanishing. I'm\n"
"sailing farther and farther\n"
"for fewer and fewer fish."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSomethingMustHave"
msgid "09234"
msgstr ""
"Something must have blown up\n"
"in the Sea of Time. That would\n"
"explain the tidal wave."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouHaveTo"
msgid "09235"
msgstr ""
"You have to be one of the\n"
"pirates to live in the cliffs...\n"
"I just can't do it..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeVeSeen"
msgid "09236"
msgstr ""
"We've seen a lot of traveling\n"
"warriors in Champa of late.{page_break}"
"We never used to... I wonder\n"
"if it's just a coincidence that\n"
"we've seen so many lately..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAGroupOf"
msgid "09237"
msgstr ""
"A group of travelers came here\n"
"looking for a {actor_name:5}.{page_break}"
"He seems to be a fairly\n"
"popular guy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMoreVisitorsMeans"
msgid "09238"
msgstr ""
"More visitors means more\n"
"money for our village... Maybe\n"
"we'll even get tourists soon!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNowThatI"
msgid "09239"
msgstr ""
"Now that I think about it,\n"
"someone else was looking\n"
"for a {actor_name:5}, too.{page_break}"
"I'll bet that guy is probably\n"
"still somewhere in town..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheOceanHas"
msgid "09240"
msgstr ""
"The ocean has been a lot\n"
"warmer lately, and the fish\n"
"population is decreasing.{page_break}"
"It's not natural for the\n"
"ocean to be so warm.\n"
"What's causing it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIVeHeardRumors"
msgid "09241"
msgstr ""
"I've heard rumors of a terrible\n"
"tidal wave striking the lands\n"
"south of us.{page_break}"
"I sure hope Briggs and his\n"
"men weren't engulfed by it..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeChampaRely"
msgid "09242"
msgstr ""
"We Champa rely entirely on the\n"
"ocean for our survival. It's all\n"
"we've ever known...{page_break}"
"I wish the Eastern Sea would\n"
"return to its bountiful days of\n"
"overflowing nets and smooth seas."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAllTheSailors"
msgid "09243"
msgstr ""
"All the sailors are saying\n"
"the tidal wave down south\n"
"was unbelievably huge.{page_break}"
"If Briggs were caught up in\n"
"it, I don't think he could\n"
"have survived."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgObabaSNot"
msgid "09244"
msgstr ""
"Obaba's not seeing anyone\n"
"right now.{page_break}"
"She's concerned about her\n"
"grandson, and she doesn't\n"
"want to be bothered."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgHasMyGrandson"
msgid "09245"
msgstr ""
"Has my grandson returned?\n"
"Has my Briggs come home?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09246"
msgstr ""
"You lie! If Briggs had truly\n"
"returned, he would have come\n"
"to see me first!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09247"
msgstr ""
"I asked not to be disturbed\n"
"until my grandson has returned\n"
"home! Now, let me be!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatPitIs"
msgid "09248"
msgstr ""
"That pit is Obaba's forge. She\n"
"uses it when she's working metal\n"
"into weapons and equipment."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBeforeHeLeft"
msgid "09249"
msgstr ""
"Before he left, Briggs ordered\n"
"me to keep watch in his absence.{page_break}"
"If Obaba is so worried about\n"
"Briggs, she ought to send\n"
"someone out to look for him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAllOfOurMen"
msgid "09250"
msgstr ""
"All of our men went to sea with\n"
"Briggs°even my sweetheart!\n"
"I hope they return soon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa23"
msgid "09251"
msgstr ""
"I bet you're wondering why only\n"
"sailors and their families get to\n"
"live in the cliff dwellings.{page_break}"
"Well, from up here on the cliffs,\n"
"families can look out to sea and\n"
"await the return of their sailors."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheChampaSailors"
msgid "09252"
msgstr ""
"The Champa sailors who don't\n"
"live in the cliffs are no better\n"
"than cowards.{page_break}"
"The ones living in the caves will\n"
"protect Briggs and Obaba\n"
"without a second thought."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMyHusbandWants"
msgid "09253"
msgstr ""
"My husband wants our children\n"
"to be sailors like him, but I\n"
"simply won't have it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSomedayIWant"
msgid "09254"
msgstr ""
"Someday, I want to be a sailor,\n"
"like my father before me. My\n"
"mother hates the idea, though.{page_break}"
"She'd rather have me study and\n"
"become a scholar or something."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMomSHad"
msgid "09255"
msgstr ""
"Mom's had it pretty rough. I hope\n"
"I meet a sailor with a future, so I\n"
"don't have to work so hard."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIVeNeverSeen"
msgid "09256"
msgstr ""
"I've never seen Obaba like\n"
"this before.{page_break}"
"She must be really worried\n"
"about Briggs..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderHow"
msgid "09257"
msgstr ""
"I wonder how deep this forge\n"
"goes. It's supposed to reach\n"
"right into the mountain's heart.{page_break}"
"Obaba must be a master of the\n"
"forge if she's the only one\n"
"who can call up its flames."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsMayBe"
msgid "09258"
msgstr ""
"Briggs may be our captain, but\n"
"at least he's not all full of\n"
"himself. I hate people like that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsIsThe"
msgid "09259"
msgstr ""
"Briggs is the greatest\n"
"among all our sailors.{page_break}"
"As long as he is leading our\n"
"men, they'll make it back to\n"
"Champa just fine."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa24"
msgid "09260"
msgstr ""
"Standing here, staring across the\n"
"sea from these cliffs, makes me\n"
"feel like I'm helping our sailors."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouLive"
msgid "09261"
msgstr ""
"If you live up in the cliffs, that\n"
"means you've proven that you\n"
"can travel far across the seas.{page_break}"
"If you call yourself a sailor\n"
"without ever going anywhere,\n"
"you're not worthy of the title."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhenIMarried"
msgid "09262"
msgstr ""
"When I married a sailor, I knew\n"
"how cruel the sea could be.{page_break}"
"I can't stop my husband from\n"
"sailing, but I don't want our\n"
"children to follow that path."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHasMomForgotten"
msgid "09263"
msgstr ""
"Has Mom forgotten that\n"
"I am my father's son?{page_break}"
"If she knew anything about\n"
"me, she'd never ask me to\n"
"give up the sailor's life."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEoleoIsThe"
msgid "09264"
msgstr ""
"Eoleo is the only boy in town\n"
"who will amount to anything...\n"
"He will be mine!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHaveSome"
msgid "09265"
msgstr ""
"I have some lovely artifacts,\n"
"but it's only because I've been\n"
"to the Ankohl Ruins."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouGo"
msgid "09266"
msgstr ""
"If you go to the Ankohl Ruins,\n"
"you might find some nice\n"
"artifacts for yourself."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOurProductsCost"
msgid "09267"
msgstr ""
"Our products cost what they cost\n"
"for a reason: they're all rare and\n"
"valuable treasures from Ankohl.{page_break}"
"If I risk my life to get something\n"
"nice, of course I'm going to ask\n"
"a higher price for it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheStuffIn"
msgid "09268"
msgstr ""
"The stuff in the ruins just sits\n"
"there waiting for someone to\n"
"come along and take it.{page_break}"
"But if it's broken, I'm the only\n"
"guy in town who can fix it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgListenIfYou"
msgid "09269"
msgstr ""
"Listen, if you came to Champa\n"
"looking for good seafood, you\n"
"came to the wrong place.{page_break}"
"We haven't had a decent\n"
"catch in months. It's like\n"
"all the fish are just...gone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeUsedTo"
msgid "09270"
msgstr ""
"We used to do good trade\n"
"with an island east of us. They\n"
"bought all our surplus fish.{page_break}"
"We don't have any surplus\n"
"anymore. We don't even have\n"
"enough for ourselves."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSA"
msgid "09271"
msgstr ""
"It's a shame that we can't\n"
"offer any fish to our customers.{page_break}"
"Ah, how I long for the days\n"
"when we had fish enough\n"
"for everyone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWatchingOurCatches"
msgid "09272"
msgstr ""
"Watching our catches dwindle\n"
"with every day... It's a nightmare!\n"
"Where have all the fish gone?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampaCaptainLastHope"
msgid "09273"
msgstr ""
"Briggs bears the weight\n"
"of hope for our struggling,\n"
"impoverished village.{page_break}"
"He must return home soon,\n"
"before all the villagers lose hope\n"
"and fall into despair."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampaNeedsCaptainTreasure"
msgid "09274"
msgstr ""
"I hope Briggs brings something\n"
"home for us... If not, it might\n"
"be the end of Champa..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa25"
msgid "09275"
msgstr ""
"I see you've caught up with\n"
"me again, {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09276"
msgstr "Alex!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09277"
msgstr "Alex? Who is Alex?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09278"
msgstr ""
"Alex is a Water Adept. We had\n"
"been traveling together, but he\n"
"left us when we landed on Indra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09279"
msgstr "A Water Adept?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09280"
msgstr ""
"Ah, and I see you've made\n"
"a new friend! You have been\n"
"busy, haven't you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09281"
msgstr ""
"And you've found yourself a\n"
"new Water Adept! Do you mean\n"
"to cast me away, like old trash?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09282"
msgstr ""
"Please... It's quite obvious that\n"
"you decided to replace me with\n"
"a new Water Adept.{page_break}"
"I expect you thought you'd\n"
"never see me again!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09283"
msgstr ""
"What do you want with us now,\n"
"Alex? Or did you forget you were\n"
"the one who abandoned US?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09284"
msgstr "My dear {actor_name:6}..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09285"
msgstr ""
"Have you come to despise me\n"
"so, after all we've been through?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09286"
msgstr ""
"That's right, {actor_name:5}! Why should\n"
"we care about someone who\n"
"just left us behind like that!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09287"
msgstr ""
"Duh! You're the one who left\n"
"us. It's pretty clear who\n"
"despises whom here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09288"
msgstr ""
"My, aren't we a bitter bunch?\n"
"And I was just trying to help\n"
"you with your little task."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09289"
msgstr ""
"We have no need of your help.\n"
"We can light the lighthouses\n"
"without you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09290"
msgstr "Oh... Can you really?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09291"
msgstr "Karst!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09292"
msgstr ""
"That's right, Karst! I'm\n"
"flattered that you remember!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09293"
msgstr ""
"What is this, Alex?\n"
"What's going on?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09294"
msgstr "Ah, how can I explain this..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09295"
msgstr ""
"What's going on is Alex is\n"
"demonstrating his remarkable\n"
"foresight once again!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09296"
msgstr ""
"Oh, have you not had the\n"
"pleasure of an introduction?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09297"
msgstr ""
"He stayed back at the ship\n"
"when I saw them in Madra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09298"
msgstr "I am Agatio."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09299"
msgstr ""
"Let's see... That guy's {actor_name:5},\n"
"and the girls are {actor_name:6} and {actor_name:7},\n"
"which makes him...Kraden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09300"
msgstr ""
"They look like an unreliable\n"
"bunch of ragamuffins."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09301"
msgstr ""
"Yes, they are rather useless,\n"
"aren't they? That's why I finally\n"
"had to abandon them, of course."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09302"
msgstr ""
"But now, I believe I may have\n"
"been...hasty in my judgment."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09303"
msgstr "You are {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09304"
msgstr "H-How do you know my name?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09305"
msgstr ""
"How soon they forget!\n"
"We met you before, when you\n"
"were being...detained."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09306"
msgstr ""
"Who could forget the amateur\n"
"Adept changing water to ice\n"
"in that strange little town?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09307"
msgstr ""
"Ah! You saw that! That must\n"
"be how you knew {actor_name:8}\n"
"was a Water Adept."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09308"
msgstr ""
"In fact, I was even thinking of\n"
"borrowing his ship at one point."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09309"
msgstr ""
"You would steal someone's\n"
"boat? That's so typical, Alex!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09310"
msgstr ""
"You wound me, {actor_name:6}...\n"
"I only meant to borrow it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09311"
msgstr ""
"Whatever you might have\n"
"meant, that doesn't make it right!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09312"
msgstr ""
"And just when I was about\n"
"to seize the opportunity,\n"
"you had to come back."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09313"
msgstr "You mean from Kibombo..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09314"
msgstr "I was mere moments too late."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09315"
msgstr "Isn't that a shame."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09316"
msgstr ""
"Still, because of that, I did\n"
"meet Karst and Agatio, so\n"
"perhaps it was my fate..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09317"
msgstr ""
"Can't you just stop talking about\n"
"yourself for one second, Alex?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09318"
msgstr ""
"Enough of your childish gibes!\n"
"Alex, I want to know what\n"
"makes these punks useful!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09319"
msgstr ""
"Because they brought us the orb\n"
"that Akafubu had taken. That\n"
"shows some resourcefulness."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09320"
msgstr "How so?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09321"
msgstr ""
"The Kibombo are quite warlike...\n"
"or were, at any rate. Recovering\n"
"the orb was most likely not easy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09322"
msgstr ""
"They were just typical villagers,\n"
"easily frightened with a small\n"
"display of Psynergy..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09323"
msgstr ""
"No... They would have used less\n"
"abrupt methods than those you\n"
"favor..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09324"
msgstr ""
"Oh? What methods would\n"
"those be?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09325"
msgstr ""
"Alex said it clearly enough.\n"
"We wouldn't terrorize people\n"
"into doing what we wanted."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09326"
msgstr "Enough of this!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09327"
msgstr ""
"Stop changing the subject!\n"
"When are you going to light\n"
"the remaining lighthouses?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09328"
msgstr ""
"Yes! Our patience is beginning\n"
"to wear thin!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09329"
msgstr ""
"If you waste much more of our\n"
"time, we'll take those Elemental\n"
"Stars and do it ourselves!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09330"
msgstr ""
"If we had a Wind Adept like\n"
"{actor_name:7} and the Elemental\n"
"Stars, we wouldn't need you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09331"
msgstr "Excuse me?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09332"
msgstr ""
"I am, of course, opposed\n"
"to their line of thinking."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09333"
msgstr ""
"My experience with Saturos\n"
"and Menardi suggests that,\n"
"while they were fierce warriors...{page_break}"
"They are somewhat lacking\n"
"when it comes to solving the\n"
"mysteries of the lighthouses..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09334"
msgstr ""
"You mean to say that they\n"
"failed to solve the riddles?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09335"
msgstr "Miserably..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09336"
msgstr ""
"Are you suggesting they were\n"
"simple brutes, incapable of\n"
"logic and intelligence?{page_break}"
"And are you saying the\n"
"same of us!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09337"
msgstr "I'm afraid so..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09338"
msgstr ""
"Alex... Whose side\n"
"are you on?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09339"
msgstr ""
"I am on no one's side. My only\n"
"concern is to see the lighthouse\n"
"beacons lit once again."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09340"
msgstr ""
"So you mean to leave the\n"
"task to {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09341"
msgstr ""
"Then why have we come all this\n"
"way looking for {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09342"
msgstr ""
"I merely wanted to confirm\n"
"that he and his companions\n"
"had not forgotten their quest."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09343"
msgstr "Is that truly all?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09344"
msgstr ""
"I also wanted to introduce\n"
"{actor_name:5} to the two of you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09345"
msgstr "Why would you want to do that?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09346"
msgstr ""
"With Saturos and Menardi gone,\n"
"you probably felt very little\n"
"pressure to complete your task.{page_break}"
"I cannot have that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09347"
msgstr "What do you mean by that!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09348"
msgstr ""
"With Saturos and Menardi gone,\n"
"I felt another pair might...\n"
"How shall I put this...{page_break}"
"Provide you with the proper\n"
"incentive to complete your task."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09349"
msgstr "Is that some kind of threat?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09350"
msgstr ""
"Take it as you wish. I just\n"
"wanted to provide you with\n"
"the proper encouragement."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09351"
msgstr ""
"So, what? You've used us to\n"
"your satisfaction, and now,\n"
"our role is done?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09352"
msgstr ""
"You only wanted us around to\n"
"flex a little muscle and scare\n"
"them into action? Fine."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09353"
msgstr ""
"I suppose we will let you\n"
"go today..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09354"
msgstr ""
"But we will always be nearby...\n"
"pushing you to make your way\n"
"to Jupiter Lighthouse swiftly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09355"
msgstr ""
"I look forward to seeing you\n"
"soon, {actor_name:5}, somewhere\n"
"very near Jupiter Lighthouse."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09356"
msgstr ""
"Kraden, am I right in recalling\n"
"that you pursue this quest on\n"
"the behalf of Tolbi's ruler, Babi?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09357"
msgstr ""
"This is true. I'm studying\n"
"Alchemy because Lord Babi\n"
"has ordered it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09358"
msgstr "What about it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09359"
msgstr ""
"Ah, what a pity. It would\n"
"seem all your studies...\n"
"have been for naught."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09360"
msgstr "What are you getting at, Alex?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09361"
msgstr ""
"Only that it seems your Lord\n"
"Babi has at last succumbed\n"
"to the ravages of time."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09362"
msgstr "Lord Babi is dead?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09363"
msgstr "Oh, so you didn't know?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09364"
msgstr ""
"Lord Babi? Dead? Could\n"
"that really be true?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09365"
msgstr ""
"Alex! How would you know\n"
"such a thing?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09366"
msgstr ""
"Do not mistake me! We had no\n"
"hand in Babi's passing."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09367"
msgstr ""
"However, the people of Tolbi\n"
"may be under the impression that\n"
"our presence led to his death."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09368"
msgstr ""
"Alex! Cut the melodrama\n"
"and get to the point for a\n"
"change!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09369"
msgstr ""
"Simply put, I would recommend\n"
"against traveling to north\n"
"Gondowan for a while."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09370"
msgstr ""
"I just thought it might be better\n"
"if you focused on your quest,\n"
"instead of exploration, for now..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09371"
msgstr "How kind of you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09372"
msgstr "Take it as you will..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09373"
msgstr "Very well. May we meet again."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09374"
msgstr ""
"So the only reason Alex came\n"
"here was to threaten us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09375"
msgstr ""
"And to bring us news of Babi's\n"
"death, despite the fact that we\n"
"asked for no such news!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09376"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps he had his own reasons\n"
"for telling Kraden..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09377"
msgstr "What do you mean, {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09378"
msgstr ""
"If Kraden undertook this quest\n"
"on behalf of Babi, then he no\n"
"longer has any need°"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09379"
msgstr ""
"Oh. Of course! I hadn't thought\n"
"of that. Your orders were to find\n"
"Lemuria, right, Kraden?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09380"
msgstr ""
"That's right. But if Babi really\n"
"has died, you're free to go\n"
"where you will, Kraden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09381"
msgstr "That's not true, {actor_name:7}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09382"
msgstr ""
"Certainly, my original reason\n"
"for researching Alchemy was\n"
"for Lord Babi..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09383"
msgstr ""
"\"Was for Lord Babi\"? That's\n"
"the past tense! What are your\n"
"reasons now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09384"
msgstr ""
"This is no longer solely for\n"
"research... I do this because of\n"
"what I've learned on this quest."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09385"
msgstr "Your research?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09386"
msgstr "What you learned on this quest?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09387"
msgstr "I'm not following you at all!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09388"
msgstr "I don't understand a word of this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09389"
msgstr ""
"Of course you don't! {actor_name:5}\n"
"is the only one I've spoken\n"
"to about any of this..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09390"
msgstr "What!? You knew!?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09391"
msgstr "That's not fair! Tell us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09392"
msgstr ""
"Please, {actor_name:5}... Let's not\n"
"say too much about it just yet."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09393"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} is right. Now is\n"
"not the time to tell you\n"
"about it all..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09394"
msgstr "It's...far too complicated."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09395"
msgstr "Well, when WILL you tell us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09396"
msgstr ""
"I am sure we will tell you once\n"
"we get to Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09397"
msgstr "Do you promise?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09398"
msgstr "I promise..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09399"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}? You don't\n"
"mind waiting?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09400"
msgstr ""
"I cannot read minds, like\n"
"{actor_name:7}, but I have a guess\n"
"at what you're thinking..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09401"
msgstr "A guess? What do you mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09402"
msgstr ""
"You are a great scholar,\n"
"Kraden, are you not?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09403"
msgstr ""
"I believe your theory is correct.\n"
"And to prove it, I want to return\n"
"to Lemuria as soon as possible."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09404"
msgstr "Getting Trident (TEMP)"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09405"
msgstr "It's the middle of three tines."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09406"
msgstr ""
"It reads: Search by the water's\n"
"edge where the letter had fallen."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09407"
msgstr ""
"It reads: Two Steps north of the\n"
"middle grave where the\n"
"letter had fallen."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa53"
msgid "09408"
msgstr "Champa ahead!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeyThatBlock"
msgid "09409"
msgstr ""
"Hey! That block on the\n"
"mast has disappeared!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09410"
msgstr ""
"Hey! Now, we can raise the mast\n"
"and use the sail again!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09411"
msgstr ""
"Hey, mate, let's go tell the\n"
"mayor the good news!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09412"
msgstr "Yeah, let's do that!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09413"
msgstr "Baba babubu!! "

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09414"
msgstr ""
"What is it, Eoleo? What\n"
"are you so excited about?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09415"
msgstr "Baba babubu!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09416"
msgstr ""
"It's true! The block that was\n"
"pinning the mast down is gone!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09417"
msgstr ""
"You were the ones who\n"
"did it, weren't you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09418"
msgstr ""
"I knew you would\n"
"do it someday."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09419"
msgstr ""
"But, of course, I also know that\n"
"you didn't do it for our benefit."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09420"
msgstr ""
"Still, Briggs will be pleased\n"
"when he hears about this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09421"
msgstr "Well then, let's go tell him!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIStillJust"
msgid "09422"
msgstr ""
"I still just can't quite believe\n"
"that the stone block on top of\n"
"the mast has totally vanished."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09423"
msgstr ""
"I'm telling you, Mayor, I saw\n"
"it with my own eyes! ...I mean,\n"
"I didn't see it! It's gone!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09424"
msgstr ""
"If you don't believe us, you\n"
"can go see for yourself!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09425"
msgstr "Huh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09426"
msgstr "What?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09427"
msgstr "Whoa, hey!!!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09428"
msgstr ""
"It's gone! That huge block\n"
"is really gone!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09429"
msgstr "Excellent news, Mayor!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09430"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately, the mayor of\n"
"Madra will probably try to\n"
"take it from us now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09431"
msgstr ""
"But that can wait. Who was\n"
"able to move the block?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09432"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09433"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}, did you do this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09434"
msgstr "Surprised to see us, Mayor?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09435"
msgstr "Did you do this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09436"
msgstr ""
"We left Alhafra some time ago,\n"
"but we just returned and\n"
"destroyed the stone block."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09437"
msgstr ""
"Exploring? What brought you\n"
"back to Alhafra right now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09438"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} had a hunch that\n"
"we might be needed here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09439"
msgstr ""
"Mayor, not to interrupt, but\n"
"shouldn't we begin repairs\n"
"on your ship now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09440"
msgstr "Yes, yes... You're right, of course."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09441"
msgstr ""
"Gather the townspeople and\n"
"get them to work on the mast."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09442"
msgstr "Yes, sir! We're on our way!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09443"
msgstr ""
"We shouldn't need too many\n"
"people to raise the mast!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09444"
msgstr "All right. I'm counting on you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09445"
msgstr ""
"Destroying that stone must\n"
"have been quite a challenge."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09446"
msgstr ""
"Why don't you come back to\n"
"my manor to get some rest?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09447"
msgstr ""
"We could use the rest,\n"
"{actor_name:5}. We should accept\n"
"the mayor's offer."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09448"
msgstr ""
"You're too kind, Mayor. We'd\n"
"be happy to..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor29"
msgid "09449"
msgstr ""
"Thank you again, Mayor.\n"
"You keep a fine house."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09450"
msgstr ""
"Don't be silly. You've done\n"
"us a great deed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09451"
msgstr ""
"It was the least\n"
"I could do."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09452"
msgstr ""
"Even if he gets the boat fixed,\n"
"I don't think he's going to hand\n"
"it over to Madra..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09453"
msgstr ""
"I agree... He's being way too\n"
"nice for me not to be a little\n"
"suspicious of him..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09454"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry, did you girls\n"
"have something you'd\n"
"like to share with us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09455"
msgstr "I see!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09456"
msgstr ""
"Jiya, how are the repairs coming\n"
"along? Things seem to be moving\n"
"slowly down there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09457"
msgstr "Milord, these things take time..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09458"
msgstr "Sir, there's a problem!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09459"
msgstr ""
"Calm down, man! You're a\n"
"soldier! What are you so\n"
"flustered about!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09460"
msgstr ""
"Briggs destroyed the prison\n"
"and escaped with his pirates!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09461"
msgstr ""
"What, were you asleep while\n"
"this was going on?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09462"
msgstr "Don't... Don't be silly!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09463"
msgstr ""
"How could Briggs possibly\n"
"break out of our prison? It's\n"
"one of the strongest in Osenia!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09464"
msgstr ""
"I don't know what happened,\n"
"but before I knew it, they'd\n"
"smashed a hole in the wall!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09465"
msgstr ""
"Mayor! The mast has been\n"
"raised!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09466"
msgstr "Hey, what's up?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09467"
msgstr ""
"Wait, you're supposed to\n"
"be guarding the prisoners...\n"
"What happened?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09468"
msgstr ""
"It appears that Briggs\n"
"has escaped."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09469"
msgstr "That's no good..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09470"
msgstr ""
"What are you standing around\n"
"for!? Search the area! Find\n"
"Briggs at once!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09471"
msgstr ""
"It...might not be quite\n"
"that easy..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09472"
msgstr ""
"He is a pirate, after all...\n"
"A famous one!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09473"
msgstr "Enough of that! Move it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09474"
msgstr ""
"Regardless, I'm going to go\n"
"inspect my boat..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09475"
msgstr ""
"Oh, and {actor_name:5} and his crew\n"
"were there, too, weren't they?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09476"
msgstr ""
"I treated you like an honored\n"
"guest in my home..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09477"
msgstr ""
"Usually, one feels a certain\n"
"obligation to those who do them\n"
"such a kind service, am I right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09478"
msgstr ""
"So, don't just stand there!\n"
"Return the favor and find\n"
"me Briggs!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09479"
msgstr ""
"Come on! Hurry up!\n"
"Let's go! Move it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09480"
msgstr "Let's go see the boat."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09481"
msgstr ""
"The mayor of Alhafra certainly\n"
"does know how to look out for\n"
"his own interest, doesn't he?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09482"
msgstr "That's one way of putting it!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09483"
msgstr ""
"Well, so what do we do? Do\n"
"we go after Briggs?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09484"
msgstr ""
"Don't feel like you have to\n"
"do them any favors!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09485"
msgstr ""
"That's right! Why should we\n"
"help the mayor, after the way\n"
"he treated you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09486"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} can decide for\n"
"himself what to do..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09487"
msgstr ""
"At the very least, I want to\n"
"go see the sailing ship\n"
"now that it's fixed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09488"
msgstr ""
"Let's just go outside and\n"
"take a quick look."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor30"
msgid "09489"
msgstr ""
"Everyone in town is talking\n"
"about how the boat's finally\n"
"been fixed! You should see it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra98"
msgid "09490"
msgstr ""
"The whole town is grateful to\n"
"you... Without your help, we\n"
"couldn't have fixed the mast!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra99"
msgid "09491"
msgstr ""
"I'm just standing guard, in\n"
"case Briggs decides to\n"
"attack the mayor's manor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra100"
msgid "09492"
msgstr ""
"Our sailboat looks fabulous\n"
"with its mast repaired! You\n"
"really must go check it out!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra101"
msgid "09493"
msgstr ""
"I wonder where Briggs and\n"
"his crew went... There's no sign\n"
"of them around here..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra102"
msgid "09494"
msgstr ""
"I heard you made it so we\n"
"could fix our sailboat! Is there\n"
"anything you CAN'T do?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra103"
msgid "09495"
msgstr ""
"Ever since we heard Briggs\n"
"broke out of jail, we've all\n"
"been a little nervous..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra104"
msgid "09496"
msgstr ""
"I don't know why everyone's so\n"
"excited about fixing the ship. We\n"
"promised it to Madra, didn't we?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra105"
msgid "09497"
msgstr ""
"Oh! It's you! Where have you\n"
"been? We haven't seen you\n"
"around Alhafra lately..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra106"
msgid "09498"
msgstr ""
"With that ship, Alhafra's going\n"
"to become a big, important\n"
"trading town... We'll all be rich!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra107"
msgid "09499"
msgstr ""
"Once that stone was taken\n"
"care of, it was really quite\n"
"easy to raise the mast again."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra108"
msgid "09500"
msgstr ""
"If Briggs is smart, he's\n"
"probably long gone from\n"
"Alhafra, if you ask me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra109"
msgid "09501"
msgstr ""
"I've been waiting for this day\n"
"for years! I can't wait to set\n"
"sail across the Eastern Sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra110"
msgid "09502"
msgstr ""
"The secret to harnessing the\n"
"wind's power is building a small\n"
"ship. Large ones can't do it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra111"
msgid "09503"
msgstr ""
"I'm sure it's just a coincidence,\n"
"but whenever you show up,\n"
"trouble happens."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra112"
msgid "09504"
msgstr ""
"The mayor was actually singing\n"
"and skipping when he went to\n"
"the dock. He seemed so pleased."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra113"
msgid "09505"
msgstr ""
"Weird... Have you ever had the\n"
"feeling that someone just\n"
"passed by? Maybe it's just me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra114"
msgid "09506"
msgstr ""
"Huge boats carry more, but\n"
"we need smaller ships to\n"
"catch the wind.{page_break}"
"The mayor just doesn't\n"
"understand this..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraManor31"
msgid "09507"
msgstr ""
"I don't know what the big\n"
"rush is. We can see the boat\n"
"whenever we want. It's ours!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra115"
msgid "09508"
msgstr ""
"Now that the boat is fixed,\n"
"who gets to keep it? Us? Or\n"
"the Madrans?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra116"
msgid "09509"
msgstr ""
"I'm supposed to be guarding\n"
"in case Briggs shows up. But\n"
"if he does, I'll probably just cry."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra117"
msgid "09510"
msgstr ""
"Who cares if the boat is fixed?\n"
"It's not like we'll be allowed on\n"
"board. The mayor's too selfish."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra118"
msgid "09511"
msgstr ""
"Why do I have to look for\n"
"Briggs? It's not my fault\n"
"he escaped..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra119"
msgid "09512"
msgstr ""
"I hate to tell {actor_name:5}, but\n"
"even though our mayor seems\n"
"nice, he's really a selfish jerk."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra120"
msgid "09513"
msgstr ""
"I'd bet that Briggs fled the\n"
"city at the first chance. I really\n"
"wonder if he'd still be here."

msgctxt "MsgAlhafra121"
msgid "09514"
msgstr ""
"Briggs paid a lot for a broken\n"
"boat, but now that it's fixed, it's\n"
"practically priceless!{end_wait} "

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra122"
msgid "09515"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} must have found himself\n"
"a boat... Isn't that what brought\n"
"him to Alhafra in the first place?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra123"
msgid "09516"
msgstr ""
"I'm certain the only person to\n"
"prosper from the boat will be\n"
"that oaf of a mayor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra124"
msgid "09517"
msgstr ""
"Now that all the debris\n"
"has been cleared away,\n"
"our harbor looks so nice."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra125"
msgid "09518"
msgstr ""
"The mayor said I had to look\n"
"for pirates... Where am I\n"
"supposed to be looking?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra126"
msgid "09519"
msgstr ""
"I'm probably too old for the\n"
"mayor to let me on the ship,\n"
"but I can still have my dreams."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra127"
msgid "09520"
msgstr ""
"Smaller ships use their sails\n"
"to steer a lot, but it must be\n"
"harder when your ship's so big."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra128"
msgid "09521"
msgstr ""
"It's been so busy around here...\n"
"Pirates, warriors, sailing ships,\n"
"natural disasters. What a week!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra129"
msgid "09522"
msgstr ""
"The mayor only had one thing\n"
"on his mind on his way to the\n"
"dock... Money, and lots of it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra130"
msgid "09523"
msgstr ""
"What if the pirates were\n"
"nearby... Maybe that was\n"
"them behind the building..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra131"
msgid "09524"
msgstr ""
"Without smaller ships, how\n"
"can we catch the fish we\n"
"need to eat?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOooogOw2"
msgid "09525"
msgstr "Oooog... Ow..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhyDoThese"
msgid "09526"
msgstr ""
"Why do these things\n"
"always happen to me?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgStupidBriggs2"
msgid "09527"
msgstr "Stupid Briggs..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsSPirates"
msgid "09528"
msgstr ""
"Briggs's pirates... They\n"
"attacked us and...\n"
"The ship... The ship..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIJustCame"
msgid "09529"
msgstr ""
"I just came down to see the\n"
"repaired mast, and they jumped\n"
"on me from out of nowhere."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsSaidTheBoat"
msgid "09530"
msgstr ""
"Briggs said the boat was\n"
"his... And, to be honest, they\n"
"had paid us for it, but..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggs2"
msgid "09531"
msgstr "Briggs!!!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09532"
msgstr ""
"Briggs, where are you\n"
"taking my boat?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09533"
msgstr ""
"He's attempting to steal it!\n"
"Thief! Thief!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09534"
msgstr "Did you call me a thief?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09535"
msgstr ""
"I paid for this boat, fair\n"
"and square. I'm no thief."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09536"
msgstr ""
"You're the thieves! You tried\n"
"to take our boat away, after\n"
"we paid you so much for it!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09537"
msgstr "... ..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09538"
msgstr ""
"You're the one who\n"
"stole OUR boat!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09539"
msgstr "Ahoy, Briggs!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09540"
msgstr "Uh-oh... It's {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09541"
msgstr ""
"You're not afraid of\n"
"them, are you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09542"
msgstr ""
"Look how far away they are...\n"
"There's no way they can\n"
"catch us now!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09543"
msgstr ""
"You're right... They're stuck on\n"
"the land, and we've got this boat!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09544"
msgstr ""
"They can't catch us...\n"
"What would they do, swim?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09545"
msgstr ""
"Hah! You're right! They can't\n"
"board us from way over there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09546"
msgstr ""
"Wasn't there something you\n"
"wanted to do the next time\n"
"you saw {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09547"
msgstr ""
"Don't tell me you forgot...\n"
"It's all you ever talked about\n"
"when you were in jail!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09548"
msgstr "Oh yeah... I almost forgot."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09549"
msgstr ""
"So now's your chance!\n"
"Do what you swore to do!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09550"
msgstr "Bleah!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09551"
msgstr ""
"Is that the best you could\n"
"come up with?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09552"
msgstr ""
"But, Chaucha, they're an\n"
"awfully tough bunch..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09553"
msgstr ""
"See? It's that attitude right\n"
"there! That's why you'll\n"
"never amount to anything!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09554"
msgstr "You know what? You're right!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09555"
msgstr ""
"Hey! {actor_name:5}!\n"
"You guys take care!{page_break}"
"And keep Alhafra safe\n"
"from thieves and pirates!\n"
"And politicians, too!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09556"
msgstr "What!?!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09557"
msgstr ""
"I doubt we'll ever meet\n"
"again, but if we do,\n"
"remember this!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09558"
msgstr ""
"Neener neener neener!\n"
"Neener neener neener!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09559"
msgstr "Neener neener bleah!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09560"
msgstr ""
"That may have been a bit much.\n"
"If you make him mad, he might\n"
"chase us right back to Champa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatYouLet"
msgid "09561"
msgstr ""
"What!!! You let Briggs\n"
"get away!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09562"
msgstr ""
"You and your friends talk a\n"
"good game, but when trouble\n"
"happens, where are you!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09563"
msgstr "Well, isn't this a fine mess!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09564"
msgstr ""
"My prize ship, stolen by a\n"
"bunch of filthy pirate scum!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09565"
msgstr "Get up!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09566"
msgstr ""
"They're gone, and you let\n"
"them escape!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09567"
msgstr ""
"You guys have royally botched\n"
"this one. This ruins everything!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09568"
msgstr ""
"You all ought to be ashamed! All\n"
"of you were cowering, while I was\n"
"the only one to stand up to them!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09569"
msgstr "All of you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09570"
msgstr "I'm going back to my manor!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09571"
msgstr ""
"And you, {actor_name:5}. I am\n"
"extremely disappointed in you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09572"
msgstr ""
"There will be no reward for\n"
"you, {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09573"
msgstr ""
"You let that Briggs steal MY\n"
"ship! You're lucky I don't lock\n"
"you up in his stead!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09574"
msgstr ""
"Bah! I've had enough of this!\n"
"Don't just stand there with your\n"
"mouths gaping! Get out of here!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09575"
msgstr ""
"We don't have a boat, so there's\n"
"no reason for anyone to be\n"
"here at the port. Return to town."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09576"
msgstr ""
"What an awful person.\n"
"Do you suppose he's always\n"
"this self-centered?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09577"
msgstr ""
"Yes, he's terribly irritating.\n"
"You're quite right, {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09578"
msgstr ""
"You can stay calm after\n"
"listening to that windbag?\n"
"That's quite mature of you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09579"
msgstr ""
"I'll wager Briggs is returning\n"
"to Champa, personally."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09580"
msgstr ""
"Well, it doesn't matter. I think\n"
"I've had enough of this town.\n"
"Shall we be leaving?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09581"
msgstr ""
"Ah, yes, well... If you still have\n"
"business to attend to here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09582"
msgstr ""
"All right. But the sooner we leave,\n"
"the better. Lead on, {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09583"
msgstr ""
"Great! Let's leave as soon\n"
"as possible, shall we?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra132"
msgid "09584"
msgstr ""
"Alhafra lost its ship. Now, we're\n"
"nothing but a big, boring town\n"
"in the middle of Osenia."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra133"
msgid "09585"
msgstr ""
"Even though we lost the big boat,\n"
"I'm not particularly upset.{page_break}"
"We'll be just fine if everyone\n"
"can work together and build\n"
"a fleet of smaller boats."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra134"
msgid "09586"
msgstr ""
"After we did all that work to\n"
"fix the mast, someone goes and\n"
"steals our boat.{page_break}"
"We never should have fixed\n"
"it in the first place."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra135"
msgid "09587"
msgstr ""
"It was great to see everyone\n"
"in town working to raise the\n"
"mast. Too bad the boat got stolen."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra136"
msgid "09588"
msgstr ""
"When they find that their boat was\n"
"stolen, I'm sure Madra's not going\n"
"to be too happy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra137"
msgid "09589"
msgstr ""
"It's not like the boat could\n"
"even move when the mast\n"
"was still broken...{page_break}"
"When you think of it that\n"
"way, it doesn't feel like we\n"
"really lost anything at all."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra138"
msgid "09590"
msgstr ""
"The repairs are coming along\n"
"pretty slowly, aren't they?{page_break}"
"Well, you wouldn't feel much\n"
"like working either if your last\n"
"major project was stolen!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra139"
msgid "09591"
msgstr ""
"When is this house going to be\n"
"finished once and for all!? The\n"
"repairs are taking forever!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra140"
msgid "09592"
msgstr ""
"It felt so great when the whole\n"
"town joined together to get\n"
"those boat repairs done."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra141"
msgid "09593"
msgstr ""
"Back before Briggs destroyed\n"
"the bridge to the west, it was\n"
"a lot easier to trade with Madra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra142"
msgid "09594"
msgstr ""
"We fixed the mast so we\n"
"could use that boat.{page_break}"
"Now, Briggs has taken the boat\n"
"and sailed off to Champa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra143"
msgid "09595"
msgstr ""
"If they caught a good breeze,\n"
"they're probably way off to the\n"
"north of us by now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra144"
msgid "09596"
msgstr ""
"If only we had that ship, Alhafra\n"
"could have been a powerful\n"
"trading town...and wealthy, too..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra145"
msgid "09597"
msgstr ""
"I hope trade doesn't make\n"
"Alhafra get all big. I like how\n"
"quiet things are around here...{page_break}"
"We should stay a small town,\n"
"with our small little boats."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra146"
msgid "09598"
msgstr ""
"It was Madra's boat. It\n"
"should have been Madra's\n"
"problem..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra147"
msgid "09599"
msgstr ""
"The mayor seemed so happy to\n"
"see us working on the boat...\n"
"That's kind of strange.{page_break}"
"After all, we were only fixing\n"
"it so we could give it to\n"
"Madra, weren't we?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra148"
msgid "09600"
msgstr ""
"The mayor of Madra seems like\n"
"a reasonable person. It's too\n"
"bad this had to happen."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra149"
msgid "09601"
msgstr ""
"We're all pulling together to fix\n"
"this house. At least everyone\n"
"is helping with the work."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra150"
msgid "09602"
msgstr ""
"If Mom would stop making all\n"
"these trifling little requests,\n"
"we'd be done a lot faster..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra151"
msgid "09603"
msgstr ""
"I know it's time to forget about\n"
"that boat and get back to work...\n"
"But I just can't let it go."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra152"
msgid "09604"
msgstr ""
"First, he steals a ship...then he\n"
"ruins a very important bridge...\n"
"Briggs is a real jerk."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra153"
msgid "09605"
msgstr ""
"Why worry about Briggs? It's\n"
"not as though we've got a boat\n"
"to chase him with..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra154"
msgid "09606"
msgstr ""
"If Briggs hadn't stolen that\n"
"boat, I'd be out on the open\n"
"sea right now, wind in my hair."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra155"
msgid "09607"
msgstr ""
"There's no point in worrying\n"
"about losing something we\n"
"never had to begin with."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors88"
msgid "09608"
msgstr ""
"I don't want to say this\n"
"out loud or anything, but...{page_break}"
"Briggs paid for that boat\n"
"fair and square. He didn't\n"
"steal it at all."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors89"
msgid "09609"
msgstr ""
"Briggs didn't commit any\n"
"crimes in Alhafra, did he?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors90"
msgid "09610"
msgstr ""
"Briggs paid for the boat and\n"
"then left in it. Why is everyone\n"
"treating him like a crook?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors91"
msgid "09611"
msgstr ""
"I don't believe for one second\n"
"that Briggs was a pirate,\n"
"raiding the towns of Indra."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors92"
msgid "09612"
msgstr ""
"Fixing that old guy's house is\n"
"starting to drive us all crazy.{page_break}"
"I, for one, will be ready for a\n"
"celebration once it's done."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors93"
msgid "09613"
msgstr ""
"The repairs on our neighbors'\n"
"house are moving slowly.{page_break}"
"The longer it takes, the longer\n"
"they live with us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors94"
msgid "09614"
msgstr ""
"My house is damaged more than\n"
"I thought. Looks like I'm still\n"
"stuck here with my neighbors."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors95"
msgid "09615"
msgstr ""
"My husband and I don't get\n"
"out much, and it's nice to\n"
"meet the neighbors...{page_break}"
"But we've been here for so\n"
"long, I don't think we'll be\n"
"going out for quite a while."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors96"
msgid "09616"
msgstr ""
"Will they ever get out of my\n"
"house? It's starting to worry\n"
"me a bit..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors97"
msgid "09617"
msgstr ""
"I don't have anything to say\n"
"to them, and I'm tired of being\n"
"the good hostess all the time!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors98"
msgid "09618"
msgstr ""
"I don't mind not being at\n"
"home, but my wife wants\n"
"her privacy back!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors99"
msgid "09619"
msgstr ""
"I hated this place at first, but it's\n"
"grown on me. I feel so much more\n"
"sociable now..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra156"
msgid "09620"
msgstr ""
"That guy's house isn't fixed,\n"
"and he won't help out on our\n"
"house until his is done."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra157"
msgid "09621"
msgstr ""
"The mayor's been handing out\n"
"free food to help us all through\n"
"these difficult times.{page_break}"
"The way things have been\n"
"going, though, I bet everyone\n"
"just hoards it all."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra158"
msgid "09622"
msgstr ""
"We have to store what food we get\n"
"from the mayor and only eat a\n"
"little bit of it at a time."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra159"
msgid "09623"
msgstr ""
"We could use some help with\n"
"the house, but it looks like\n"
"we're on our own for now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra160"
msgid "09624"
msgstr ""
"I don't know what will happen\n"
"if the repairs aren't done before\n"
"winter hits..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra161"
msgid "09625"
msgstr ""
"I've seen Father trying to do some\n"
"repairs, but it's too much work\n"
"for him to do on his own."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra162"
msgid "09626"
msgstr ""
"Even if we fix it, the columns\n"
"and the walls will collapse...\n"
"They always do..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra163"
msgid "09627"
msgstr ""
"With everyone's help, we were\n"
"somehow able to avoid the wind\n"
"and rain at least.{page_break}"
"You know, after all this, I now\n"
"understand how difficult it\n"
"is to be a carpenter."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra164"
msgid "09628"
msgstr ""
"Mom was happy to hear that\n"
"the repairs were coming along\n"
"nicely. The thing is, they're not."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra165"
msgid "09629"
msgstr ""
"There are a lot of houses in\n"
"need of repair. Until the others\n"
"are finished, I'll wait quietly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra166"
msgid "09630"
msgstr ""
"This is just too much work\n"
"for one man to get done.{page_break}"
"I need to stop and get some\n"
"rest, but I promised I'd finish..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra167"
msgid "09631"
msgstr ""
"He's never going to get\n"
"finished with that terrible\n"
"attitude of his.{page_break}"
"Until he feels like working,\n"
"nothing much is going to\n"
"get done around here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra168"
msgid "09632"
msgstr ""
"There's no way Dad can fix\n"
"this house up all by himself.\n"
"It's a mess!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra169"
msgid "09633"
msgstr ""
"Carrying these things all over has\n"
"gotten my hands all torn up.\n"
"I feel so...rugged!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra170"
msgid "09634"
msgstr ""
"Everyone's saying that Briggs\n"
"probably escaped by tunneling\n"
"through the mayor's manor."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra171"
msgid "09635"
msgstr ""
"Supposedly, the cave under the\n"
"mayor's manor is treacherous.{page_break}"
"You'd have to be pretty tough\n"
"to make it out of there alive."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra172"
msgid "09636"
msgstr ""
"So, Briggs stole Madra's ship\n"
"right out from under our\n"
"own greedy mayor?{page_break}"
"Ah, 'tis an ill wind that...\n"
"that...um... Oh, I forget how it\n"
"goes. But it's bad, trust me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra173"
msgid "09637"
msgstr ""
"I don't know... I never really\n"
"thought the mayor would give\n"
"that boat to Madra anyway.{page_break}"
"Our mayor's far too greedy to\n"
"pass up an opportunity like\n"
"this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors100"
msgid "09638"
msgstr ""
"The bridge to the west of\n"
"us is all fixed now, just so\n"
"you know."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors101"
msgid "09639"
msgstr ""
"People will start traveling again,\n"
"and they'll need to buy equipment...\n"
"My equipment!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors102"
msgid "09640"
msgstr ""
"We're still recovering from the\n"
"damage the tidal wave caused.{page_break}"
"Once the reconstruction is\n"
"complete, Alhafra will be the\n"
"perfect town... Indestructible!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors103"
msgid "09641"
msgstr ""
"The mayor used the money\n"
"he got from Madra to pay\n"
"for all our food.{page_break}"
"Everything was looking good,\n"
"until the boat got stolen...\n"
"That sort of killed morale."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors104"
msgid "09642"
msgstr ""
"It seems that Briggs broke\n"
"out of jail with the help\n"
"of his wife, Chaucha."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors105"
msgid "09643"
msgstr ""
"Briggs might have had a\n"
"key, but I think he used\n"
"a different escape route...{page_break}"
"I mean, walking out the\n"
"front door of our jail would\n"
"have been really stupid!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors106"
msgid "09644"
msgstr ""
"A bigger boat could haul in\n"
"more fish, but right now, just\n"
"about anything will do!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors107"
msgid "09645"
msgstr ""
"I just want a house where\n"
"we can all live together\n"
"without fighting!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors108"
msgid "09646"
msgstr ""
"Someone said my son and my\n"
"grandchildren are fixing the\n"
"house. They're so considerate..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors109"
msgid "09647"
msgstr ""
"So that Alex fellow left already,\n"
"did he? He's such a rogue... Is\n"
"he running from something?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors110"
msgid "09648"
msgstr ""
"After the tidal wave, it was\n"
"one complaint after another,\n"
"but things have quieted down.{page_break}"
"Everyone's been pulling together\n"
"to get this work done, and we've\n"
"set our differences aside."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors111"
msgid "09649"
msgstr ""
"The mayor may have pulled\n"
"through the tidal wave just\n"
"fine, but his town didn't!{page_break}"
"How could he even {text_effect:2}consider{reset_text_style}\n"
"punishing me for trying to feed\n"
"all these unfortunate souls?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors112"
msgid "09650"
msgstr ""
"Briggs and his wife were\n"
"totally planning this jailbreak\n"
"when she saw him there...{page_break}"
"What was the guard doing?\n"
"Wasn't he watching his\n"
"prisoner? Was he napping?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors113"
msgid "09651"
msgstr ""
"If I had a key, I would have\n"
"used it. That's for sure...{page_break}"
"Briggs escaped through the\n"
"caves, though... That pirate's\n"
"a wily one."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors114"
msgid "09652"
msgstr ""
"So what if trade brings people\n"
"here? Things are so bad, we\n"
"can't even offer a decent meal!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors115"
msgid "09653"
msgstr ""
"I'd really like to have a pet, but\n"
"I know better. Things are too\n"
"tough right now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors116"
msgid "09654"
msgstr ""
"Isn't anyone helping my family\n"
"with the house? I'm an old man,\n"
"and it'll take them years to finish!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors117"
msgid "09655"
msgstr ""
"He was just my type... Aloof,\n"
"strong, blue haired...{page_break}"
"But he was a little too aloof.\n"
"He... He never even said\n"
"good-bye..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors118"
msgid "09656"
msgstr ""
"I heard you were there when\n"
"Briggs escaped on the sailing\n"
"ship.{page_break}"
"A villain like Briggs should\n"
"never have been allowed to\n"
"escape. It's a terrible thing."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafraInteriors119"
msgid "09657"
msgstr ""
"They were so confident when\n"
"they caught him before, but they\n"
"were careless and let him escape!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBeforeIKnew"
msgid "09658"
msgstr ""
"Before I knew it, Chaucha stole\n"
"the keys to the jail, and Briggs\n"
"and his crew had them.{page_break}"
"I never looked away! Not once!\n"
"I never let my guard down!\n"
"How did this happen?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNoMatterHow"
msgid "09659"
msgstr ""
"No matter how many times I go\n"
"over it, nothing seems right.\n"
"I'm just not convinced...{page_break}"
"Wait a sec... Did Eoleo have a\n"
"hand in this? He was standing\n"
"behind me the entire time..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra174"
msgid "09660"
msgstr ""
"The mayor of Alhafra does\n"
"not wish to meet with you.\n"
"Please step back."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra175"
msgid "09661"
msgstr ""
"You really made a mess of\n"
"things. Letting Briggs get\n"
"away? What's wrong with you!?{page_break}"
"The mayor trusted you! You\n"
"were his favorites°but not\n"
"anymore!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra176"
msgid "09662"
msgstr ""
"The mayor was so mad at us\n"
"for letting Briggs reach the\n"
"boat.{page_break}"
"How were we to know he\n"
"was going to steal it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra177"
msgid "09663"
msgstr ""
"One thing's for sure... We're not\n"
"going to be hearing about how\n"
"great {actor_name:5} is anymore!{page_break}"
"Now it's my turn to show\n"
"the mayor what I can do!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra178"
msgid "09664"
msgstr ""
"Briggs came through here and\n"
"disappeared into the forest.\n"
"Scared the pants clean off me!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAlhafra179"
msgid "09665"
msgstr ""
"The poor guard was blindfolded\n"
"when Briggs escaped, so he\n"
"didn't see a thing.{page_break}"
"He's smart, that Briggs,\n"
"covering his escape\n"
"route like that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa26"
msgid "09666"
msgstr ""
"Briggs came back with a\n"
"giant load of food! I've never\n"
"been so full! It feels great!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa27"
msgid "09667"
msgstr ""
"Don't talk to me about food...\n"
"I feel like I'm gonna be sick."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa28"
msgid "09668"
msgstr ""
"Let's see them call Champa\n"
"poor now!{page_break}"
"Ever since Briggs came back\n"
"with a cargo of gems, we've\n"
"been filthy stinking rich!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgChampa29"
msgid "09669"
msgstr ""
"Hey, you just came to Champa\n"
"not too long ago, didn't you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09670"
msgstr ""
"You'll be pleased to know that\n"
"Briggs found ancient pirate\n"
"treasure and bought us all food!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09671"
msgstr ""
"Well, you wouldn't know it to\n"
"look at us now, but Champa\n"
"was quite poor until recently.{page_break}"
"Now, thanks to Briggs, we're\n"
"all so wealthy, it's disgusting!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgChampa30"
msgid "09672"
msgstr ""
"Briggs took a long time\n"
"to return to us. You want\n"
"to know why?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09673"
msgstr ""
"He was being held by an evil\n"
"man who stole his money and\n"
"made him a prisoner!{page_break}"
"They were probably trying\n"
"to find Briggs's jewels...\n"
"The sea is a rough place."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09674"
msgstr ""
"Briggs overcame great\n"
"danger to return home to us.\n"
"I admire him. I really do."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa31"
msgid "09675"
msgstr ""
"Briggs looks so reliable,\n"
"so sure of himself. I've never\n"
"seen him like this before."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa32"
msgid "09676"
msgstr ""
"Those bags are full of food\n"
"for the people of Champa.\n"
"Briggs gave them to us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa33"
msgid "09677"
msgstr ""
"I want to play with Eoleo,\n"
"but he never comes down\n"
"to the harbor anymore."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa34"
msgid "09678"
msgstr ""
"Briggs fought the odds to\n"
"bring us jewels and food!\n"
"He's an amazing leader!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa35"
msgid "09679"
msgstr ""
"Obaba is the last possessor of\n"
"the ancient secrets of Ankhol,\n"
"a long-lost civilization...{page_break}"
"There's nothing she can't fix,\n"
"no matter how broken it is.\n"
"She's quite the blacksmith!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa36"
msgid "09680"
msgstr ""
"You'd think Obaba would be\n"
"glad that Briggs was back.\n"
"She acts like nothing's changed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa37"
msgid "09681"
msgstr ""
"Now, nobody has to do anything\n"
"he or she doesn't want to do!\n"
"We owe Briggs a lot of thanks."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa38"
msgid "09682"
msgstr ""
"Briggs is so generous!\n"
"He told me to eat and eat\n"
"and eat, so I did!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa39"
msgid "09683"
msgstr ""
"Errrrg... I was so full, and I\n"
"just kept eating. I think I'm\n"
"going to explode now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa40"
msgid "09684"
msgstr ""
"Gosh... How much are all\n"
"those jewels worth? More\n"
"than I can figure, I know that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa41"
msgid "09685"
msgstr ""
"Things are going to be different\n"
"around here. Things are going\n"
"to be better. I can't wait."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa42"
msgid "09686"
msgstr ""
"We're lucky Briggs hadn't\n"
"found the jewels when he\n"
"was caught.{page_break}"
"That would have been\n"
"the end of Champa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa43"
msgid "09687"
msgstr ""
"Briggs was always such\n"
"a brat, but now he's saved the\n"
"village! What a turnaround!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa44"
msgid "09688"
msgstr ""
"All of our stockhouses are\n"
"so full of food that they've\n"
"just left the extra out here..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa45"
msgid "09689"
msgstr ""
"Eoleo said he couldn't play\n"
"with us anymore, even though\n"
"he's younger than we are..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa46"
msgid "09690"
msgstr ""
"If Champa gets enough money,\n"
"maybe we can stop with the\n"
"looting and pillaging..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa47"
msgid "09691"
msgstr ""
"Is Obaba in a good mood now,\n"
"or what? I noticed the change\n"
"as soon as Briggs returned.{page_break}"
"If you've got something to ask\n"
"her, now's the time to ask."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa48"
msgid "09692"
msgstr ""
"Nobody really likes to play the\n"
"role of a pirate.{page_break}"
"I'm sure everyone is glad they\n"
"don't have to anymore."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeDonT"
msgid "09693"
msgstr ""
"We don't need to live off\n"
"fish anymore, so we don't\n"
"need any fishermen, do we?{page_break}"
"That does it. I'm not\n"
"working anymore. What\n"
"would be the point?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSTrue"
msgid "09694"
msgstr ""
"It's true! It's true! Briggs did\n"
"return with the jewels!{page_break}"
"He's really going to have more\n"
"friends than he did before!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgFatherSActing"
msgid "09695"
msgstr ""
"Father's acting like a child, and it\n"
"seems he quit his job. He plans\n"
"on lounging around at home..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhenBriggsReturned"
msgid "09696"
msgstr ""
"When Briggs returned with the\n"
"jewels, the adults quit working.\n"
"I hope I don't become like them."

msgctxt "MsgIDRather"
msgid "09697"
msgstr ""
"I'd rather spend my time sleeping\n"
"than passing it chasing fish that\n"
"can't be caught.{page_break}"
"Why go after food, when Briggs\n"
"can give it to you?{end_wait} "

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsIsA"
msgid "09698"
msgstr ""
"Briggs is a hero for saving the\n"
"village. But will Father lose his\n"
"motivation to be productive?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfFatherSits"
msgid "09699"
msgstr ""
"If Father sits around the house, he\n"
"will lose all respectability. It's\n"
"better to fish than to do nothing."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgQuittingTheirJobs"
msgid "09700"
msgstr ""
"Quitting their jobs makes the\n"
"adults just like us kids. It's\n"
"getting really weird around here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHearThat"
msgid "09701"
msgstr ""
"I hear that Briggs sold the\n"
"jewels he found for cash and\n"
"then acquired a boat."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhileIM"
msgid "09702"
msgstr ""
"While I'm grateful for the food,\n"
"it's somewhat annoying knowing\n"
"that Briggs saved the day."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsReallySaved"
msgid "09703"
msgstr ""
"Briggs really saved our hides\n"
"this time, but I'm not about to\n"
"join his crew!{page_break}"
"Yeah, maybe I do owe him for\n"
"this, but I'll find a way to\n"
"pay him back legitimately."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheNerveOf"
msgid "09704"
msgstr ""
"The nerve of that Briggs!\n"
"He's gone for a bit, and he\n"
"comes back in a bigger boat!{page_break}"
"I'll bet he only did it\n"
"to show us up, too!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIShouldJust"
msgid "09705"
msgstr ""
"I should just sign up with\n"
"Briggs's crew and stop all\n"
"my complaining.{page_break}"
"Oh, but my shipmates would\n"
"never forgive me if I bailed\n"
"on them like that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIRefuseTo"
msgid "09706"
msgstr ""
"I refuse to live in the cliffs, and\n"
"therefore I am against Briggs.{page_break}"
"I have accepted his food, but that\n"
"is as far as I will let myself slip."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIVeBeenWondering"
msgid "09707"
msgstr ""
"I've been wondering about\n"
"finding a chief for Champa,\n"
"since we don't have one.{page_break}"
"If so, then Briggs would be the\n"
"favorite, since he's given\n"
"so much to the village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeVillageElders"
msgid "09708"
msgstr ""
"We village elders have guided\n"
"Champa for so many years...{page_break}"
"Yes, times are changing. Perhaps\n"
"it's time Champa's leadership\n"
"was given to the sailors."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgANewImage"
msgid "09709"
msgstr ""
"A new image for Champa will\n"
"reflect the time we live in...\n"
"Any new visitors will like it..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgObservingBriggsRecently"
msgid "09710"
msgstr ""
"Observing Briggs recently,\n"
"the limits of Champa as a\n"
"village are very apparent.{page_break}"
"From now on, the village will\n"
"develop through trade. I guess\n"
"that's the era we've come to."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSeemsThe"
msgid "09711"
msgstr ""
"It seems the elders are\n"
"considering appointing Briggs\n"
"the first-ever chief of Champa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIForOne"
msgid "09712"
msgstr ""
"I, for one, think a person who can\n"
"bring the people of Champa\n"
"together will do us some good."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSureBriggsSaved"
msgid "09713"
msgstr ""
"Sure, Briggs saved the village.\n"
"But saving it from despair is not\n"
"the same as governing it..."

msgctxt "MsgSupportingAnEntire"
msgid "09714"
msgstr ""
"Supporting an entire village\n"
"through fishing from the sea\n"
"is next to impossible.{page_break}"
"We need new sources of income.\n"
"Briggs is on the right path, finding\n"
"us all those lovely jewels.{end_wait} "

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa49"
msgid "09715"
msgstr "Whoa! You... You're {actor_name:5}!"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09716"
msgstr ""
"What? Really?\n"
"It's {actor_name:5}?{end_wait} "

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09717"
msgstr ""
"You're awfully persistent,\n"
"aren't you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09718"
msgstr ""
"Briggs, get outta here!\n"
"{actor_name:5} is here to\n"
"finish you off!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09719"
msgstr ""
"What was that!?\n"
"{actor_name:5}? Here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09720"
msgstr ""
"Oh no! It's really him! I've\n"
"got to get out of here!!!"

msgctxt "MsgWhyDoYou"
msgid "09721"
msgstr ""
"Why do you have to be so\n"
"stubborn? Quit following\n"
"us, you big bully!{end_wait} "

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAllRightI"
msgid "09722"
msgstr ""
"All right, I surrender! I'll\n"
"go back to Alhafra...but\n"
"only if Briggs is going."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDRatherFight"
msgid "09723"
msgstr ""
"I'd rather fight than go\n"
"back to jail.\n"
"Bring it on, sissyboy!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLeaveTheWomen"
msgid "09724"
msgstr ""
"Leave the women and\n"
"children alone. They've\n"
"got nothing to do with this."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouReAren"
msgid "09725"
msgstr ""
"You're {actor_name:5}, aren't you?\n"
"You've come to bring in\n"
"Briggs, haven't you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgDidYouReally"
msgid "09726"
msgstr ""
"Did you really think you could\n"
"come storming into Champa,\n"
"Briggs's home, without a fight?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAwComeOn"
msgid "09727"
msgstr ""
"Aw, come on! I'm not doing\n"
"anything! Leave me alone!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgWhatYouWant"
msgid "09728"
msgstr "What, you want to come in?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09729"
msgstr ""
"As if! I'm a nice girl, and I'm\n"
"not about to let some masher\n"
"come storming into my room!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09730"
msgstr ""
"Yeah? So what do you want?\n"
"You're wasting my time."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhySEveryone"
msgid "09731"
msgstr ""
"Why's everyone so scared of\n"
"you? You don't look so tough."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouSo"
msgid "09732"
msgstr ""
"If you so much as {text_effect:2}touch{reset_text_style} me,\n"
"I'll bite your nose off!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMaybeIfI"
msgid "09733"
msgstr ""
"Maybe if I pretend he's not there,\n"
"he'll go away. I don't want to fight\n"
"him... He's got creepy powers!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeSAfter"
msgid "09734"
msgstr ""
"He's after our ship, isn't he?\n"
"That no-good thief mayor\n"
"must have sent him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItWouldBe"
msgid "09735"
msgstr ""
"It would be so much easier just\n"
"to go back to jail. Yeah... They\n"
"can't beat me up if I surrender!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatAreThey"
msgid "09736"
msgstr ""
"What are they doing here?\n"
"Do they mean to capture us?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsSaidThe"
msgid "09737"
msgstr ""
"Briggs said the guy who\n"
"captured him was some amazingly\n"
"tough thug named {actor_name:5}.{page_break}"
"But I don't know... If this really\n"
"is him, he doesn't look like the\n"
"bad guy Briggs said he was."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhyWouldBriggs"
msgid "09738"
msgstr ""
"Why would Briggs run away\n"
"like a little baby just because\n"
"this guy showed up?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsIsPretty"
msgid "09739"
msgstr ""
"Briggs is pretty tough. This guy\n"
"must be a serious monster if he\n"
"beat the captain..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgToughOrNot"
msgid "09740"
msgstr ""
"Tough or not, he's not getting\n"
"past me without a beating."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeSNot"
msgid "09741"
msgstr ""
"He's not so tough! Why's everyone\n"
"running away? Just thump him\n"
"good and be done with it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatSHe"
msgid "09742"
msgstr ""
"What's he staring at? Sheesh!\n"
"This guy's a total lech!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHoldItRight"
msgid "09743"
msgstr "Hold it right there!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09744"
msgstr "So, {actor_name:5}, you've come."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09745"
msgstr ""
"Don't assume I'll go so\n"
"easy on you this time!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09746"
msgstr ""
"Is that boy him? The \"mighty\n"
"warrior\" you told me about?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09747"
msgstr ""
"I told you he didn't look\n"
"like much, Grandma..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09748"
msgstr ""
"Weren't you even\n"
"listening to me?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09749"
msgstr ""
"All you told me is that his name\n"
"is {actor_name:5} and that he is\n"
"a \"mighty warrior.\" Hmph."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09750"
msgstr ""
"He doesn't look like the sort\n"
"of person who's interested in\n"
"stealing our jewels, though."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09751"
msgstr ""
"But that's not the\n"
"point, Grandma!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09752"
msgstr ""
"If you don't destroy him now,\n"
"he's going to take me far away,\n"
"and you won't ever see me again!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09753"
msgstr ""
"Oh, now he doesn't look like the\n"
"kind of boy who would do that..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09754"
msgstr ""
"If he takes me away, poor\n"
"Eoleo will be so sad! What\n"
"do you say about that, huh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09755"
msgstr ""
"Oh, that's just not fair.\n"
"You know I can't deny my\n"
"darling great-grandson!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09756"
msgstr ""
"I don't see why I should be the\n"
"one to get you out of this mess,\n"
"but I can't bear to see Eoleo sad."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09757"
msgstr "Grandma, please!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgOhAllRightListen"
msgid "09758"
msgstr ""
"Oh, all right. Listen, you have no\n"
"idea what you're getting into.\n"
"I think you'd better leave."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09759"
msgstr ""
"Ah, you've made a good decision.\n"
"You seem like a reasonable boy.\n"
"Reasonable boys live longer."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09760"
msgstr ""
"Stubborn, are you? Ah, well.\n"
"If that's the way it's going to\n"
"be, get ready for your medicine!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09761"
msgstr ""
"Heart of the earth, fury of the\n"
"forge's flames, grant me power!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHaveYouLearned"
msgid "09762"
msgstr ""
"Have you learned your\n"
"lesson, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09763"
msgstr ""
"Ah, such a bright lad. Now then,\n"
"don't you ever try to take my\n"
"Briggs away ever again!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBackForMore"
msgid "09764"
msgstr "Back for more?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09765"
msgstr ""
"I wouldn't be doing this if it\n"
"weren't for Eoleo, you know."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09766"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry. You look like quite a\n"
"nice boy, but I just can't allow\n"
"you to take my Briggs away."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMySalamanderYou"
msgid "09767"
msgstr ""
"My salamander! You...\n"
"beat my salamander..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09768"
msgstr ""
"I thought he was unbeatable...\n"
"How could this be?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09769"
msgstr ""
"How did you do that?\n"
"What... What are you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09770"
msgstr ""
"Grandma, what's going on!?\n"
"I thought you were going\n"
"to protect me!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09771"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean, what am I\n"
"doing? I've done everything I can!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09772"
msgstr ""
"Grandma!!! He's going to take\n"
"me away! He's a bad guy! You\n"
"have to do {text_effect:2}something{reset_text_style}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09773"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry, Briggs, but you'll\n"
"have to fight him yourself."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09774"
msgstr "Wha-What!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09775"
msgstr ""
"You heard me. I'm through\n"
"pampering you. You have to\n"
"get out of this yourself!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09776"
msgstr ""
"But...Grandma... Look at him!\n"
"I mean, look what he can do!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09777"
msgstr ""
"I know, dear, but there's nothing\n"
"I can do to help. You don't want\n"
"him to take you away, do you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09778"
msgstr "But...what about poor Eoleo?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09779"
msgstr ""
"*Sigh*\n"
"All right, all right."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09780"
msgstr ""
"Um. Excuse me... There seems\n"
"to be a small misunderstanding."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09781"
msgstr ""
"Yeah! I don't like standing here\n"
"listening to a pirate call {text_effect:2}us{reset_text_style}\n"
"the bad guys!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09782"
msgstr "Pirate! My Briggs?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09783"
msgstr ""
"He stole a ship from Alhafra\n"
"and escaped from their jail!\n"
"A ship {text_effect:2}we{reset_text_style} helped fix!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09784"
msgstr "Briggs, is this true?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09785"
msgstr "Aw... But, Grandma, they..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09786"
msgstr ""
"We should tell you, we're\n"
"not here to take Briggs\n"
"back to Alhafra."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09787"
msgstr ""
"So you've decided you don't\n"
"want to run errands for the\n"
"mayor of Alhafra?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09788"
msgstr ""
"Good. That greedy bag of hot\n"
"air can do his own dirty work,\n"
"for all I care."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09789"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}, I know you can't\n"
"mean that. We didn't come to\n"
"Champa for that bloated gasbag."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09790"
msgstr "Briggs... Piracy? Why?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09791"
msgstr ""
"Grandma, it's not what you\n"
"think! These guys, they..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09792"
msgstr ""
"Briggs, you just hush up!!!\n"
"{pause_20_skippable}...It all makes sense now. The\n"
"gems, the food, your absence..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09793"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean?\n"
"What makes sense?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09794"
msgstr ""
"They're telling the truth! And\n"
"you, Briggs! You've been\n"
"lying to me this whole time!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09795"
msgstr ""
"You're going to take their word\n"
"over your own grandson's?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09796"
msgstr ""
"You got that right! I should\n"
"have known better than to\n"
"believe you, you scoundrel!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09797"
msgstr "He only did it for Champa!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09798"
msgstr "Chaucha!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09799"
msgstr "You came!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09800"
msgstr ""
"I heard {actor_name:5} had shown\n"
"up looking for you. I was\n"
"worried..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09801"
msgstr ""
"What did you mean, Briggs\n"
"did it for Champa?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09802"
msgstr ""
"All of that food...\n"
"Stolen goods?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09803"
msgstr ""
"No, we paid for everthing we\n"
"brought back with us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09804"
msgstr ""
"But you stole a boat to\n"
"do it, didn't you?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09805"
msgstr ""
"Grandma, we found those jewels\n"
"ourselves, and we paid Alhafra\n"
"well for that ship, didn't we?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09806"
msgstr ""
"Your story has the\n"
"ring of truth to it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09807"
msgstr ""
"Thank you, {actor_name:5}. Your\n"
"honesty speaks well of you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09808"
msgstr "So he's lying again?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09809"
msgstr ""
"Dang it, {actor_name:5}, I'm\n"
"not lying!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09810"
msgstr ""
"We...were pirates, for a short\n"
"while. Until we found the jewels."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09811"
msgstr ""
"But if not for our efforts,\n"
"Champa would have starved\n"
"away long ago."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09812"
msgstr ""
"But that doesn't excuse\n"
"resorting to piracy!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09813"
msgstr ""
"Hey, it's not like we were\n"
"doing it for the money! We\n"
"wanted to save Champa!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09814"
msgstr ""
"Those jewels we found are very\n"
"valuable. We intend to repay\n"
"each town we...borrowed from."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09815"
msgstr "Isn't that true?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09816"
msgstr ""
"What's the matter with you!?\n"
"You said on the boat that we\n"
"would repay every last town!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09817"
msgstr ""
"Oh yeah... You're right...\n"
"We really ought to try to make\n"
"amends for what we've done."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09818"
msgstr ""
"That's the truth, Grandmother.\n"
"Can you find it in your heart\n"
"to forgive your only grandson?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09819"
msgstr ""
"All right, all right. I'm too old for\n"
"grudges. But what about {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09820"
msgstr ""
"What do you say, {actor_name:5}?\n"
"Can you forgive my husband?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09821"
msgstr ""
"I agree, {actor_name:5}. If each\n"
"town is repaid what was stolen,\n"
"I see no reason for complaint."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09822"
msgstr ""
"I don't know, {actor_name:5}.\n"
"We didn't come to capture\n"
"Briggs. Why should we care?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09823"
msgstr ""
"Do you hear that? They forgive\n"
"you, too. That means you can\n"
"leave Eoleo with nothing to fear."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09824"
msgstr "I... I don't know what to say..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09825"
msgstr ""
"You know, you look a\n"
"little strange..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09826"
msgstr "Oh... Oh, really?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09827"
msgstr ""
"You haven't caught a\n"
"cold, have you? Do you\n"
"have a fever?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09828"
msgstr "What are you talking about?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09829"
msgstr ""
"No, I'm positive... You look\n"
"flush, too... You'd better lie\n"
"down before it gets worse."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09830"
msgstr "She...worries about me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09831"
msgstr ""
"Hurry up and get into bed\n"
"so you can get some rest!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09832"
msgstr ""
"Oh, for goodness' sake! You\n"
"don't want to give them your\n"
"cold, do you? Come on!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09833"
msgstr ""
"So...what brings you\n"
"to Champa?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09834"
msgstr ""
"I mean, you didn't come here\n"
"to catch Briggs, from what\n"
"I gathered..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09835"
msgstr ""
"Ah, well... To be young and\n"
"foolish again.{page_break}"
"If you ever need to consult with\n"
"me on any number of subjects,\n"
"you're welcome anytime."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMeanIt"
msgid "09836"
msgstr ""
"I mean it. If there's ever\n"
"anything you need, just\n"
"call on me. I'm always here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNowIVe"
msgid "09837"
msgstr ""
"Now I've done it. I said I'd help\n"
"them with anything, but I'm only\n"
"good at fixing broken things..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThisLooksLike"
msgid "09838"
msgstr "This looks like a weapon!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09839"
msgstr ""
"It looks like part of a trident,\n"
"but it's only one third of the\n"
"whole thing, it seems..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09840"
msgstr ""
"Why... Could it be? Is this\n"
"the legendary trident of\n"
"Ankohl?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09841"
msgstr ""
"I'll hold on to this for you. It\n"
"won't do you any good like\n"
"this, and I'll keep it safe here."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09842"
msgstr ""
"You seem unsure... You don't\n"
"think I'll pull a fast one on you,\n"
"do you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09843"
msgstr "Kids today. So mistrustful."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09844"
msgstr ""
"Ah, that's nice.\n"
"Don't you worry!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09845"
msgstr ""
"If you bring me the other\n"
"two pieces, I'll be happy\n"
"to rebuild it for you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheLegendSaysThat"
msgid "09846"
msgstr ""
"The legend says that anyone\n"
"who holds the whole lance has\n"
"nothing to fear from the sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAllOfMy"
msgid "09847"
msgstr ""
"All of my smithing knowledge and\n"
"training was solely so that I might\n"
"rebuild the legendary trident.{page_break}"
"I can't wait to get all three\n"
"pieces and repair the ancient\n"
"weapon of Ankohl."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAhHaveYou"
msgid "09848"
msgstr ""
"Ah, have you found the\n"
"second piece, dear?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09849"
msgstr "It's magnificent!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09850"
msgstr ""
"I'll hold on to this as well.\n"
"Wouldn't want it getting lost,\n"
"now would we? Only one to go!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYesThereS"
msgid "09851"
msgstr ""
"Yes, there's no doubt about it.\n"
"Those must truly be fragments\n"
"of the legendary trident."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSoonILl"
msgid "09852"
msgstr ""
"Soon, I'll have the chance to\n"
"test my skills to their fullest\n"
"extent! I can hardly wait!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWellDoneYou"
msgid "09853"
msgstr ""
"Well done! You found all\n"
"three pieces of the trident!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09854"
msgstr ""
"That means I can begin\n"
"work reforging the ancient\n"
"trident of Ankohl! At last!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09855"
msgstr ""
"We'll just toss all three\n"
"pieces in here, shall we?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09856"
msgstr "Just leave it to me..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09857"
msgstr ""
"There's nothing to be afraid\n"
"of, dear. Just leave it to me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09858"
msgstr ""
"Heart of the earth, fury of the\n"
"forge's flames, grant me power!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09859"
msgstr "That's funny... Nothing happened."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09860"
msgstr "What's going on?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09861"
msgstr ""
"Something's happening!\n"
"Is that...the legendary trident?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09862"
msgstr ""
"After all these years, the trident\n"
"is complete again. But what's\n"
"making it float like that?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09863"
msgstr ""
"Regardless, the trident has\n"
"been fixed. It belongs to you\n"
"now, {actor_name:5}. Use it well."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheTridentSeems"
msgid "09864"
msgstr ""
"The trident seems to have some\n"
"amazing power... The legends\n"
"must be true...{page_break}"
"No matter what you encounter\n"
"at sea, no monster can stand\n"
"against you with that trident."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouGuysDon"
msgid "09865"
msgstr ""
"You guys don't look much like\n"
"warriors, but you sure are\n"
"brave to fight your way in here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhyDidYou"
msgid "09866"
msgstr ""
"Why did you have to go and tell\n"
"Obaba that we were pirates?\n"
"I'll bet that really upset her."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgArenTYou"
msgid "09867"
msgstr ""
"Aren't you the ones who caught\n"
"Briggs in Alhafra? You don't\n"
"look it, but you're pretty tough."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa50"
msgid "09868"
msgstr ""
"When Briggs set sail, we\n"
"thought we'd never see him\n"
"again.{page_break}"
"Now, all of a sudden, he shows\n"
"up, and with enough food to\n"
"save our town forever!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIThinkThose"
msgid "09869"
msgstr ""
"I think those guys down in\n"
"the harbor wanted to come\n"
"up here and join us...{page_break}"
"All they have to do is ask,\n"
"but I think they're chicken..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeHaveSo"
msgid "09870"
msgstr ""
"We have so much food\n"
"everywhere now!{page_break}"
"I hope Briggs goes off\n"
"soon to bring us even\n"
"more jewels and treats!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsCameDown"
msgid "09871"
msgstr ""
"Briggs came down with a\n"
"cold. I guess that means he\n"
"won't be sailing for a while."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEoleoStillWon"
msgid "09872"
msgstr ""
"Eoleo still won't come down\n"
"and play with us. I'm getting\n"
"really cheesed off at him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOnceIM"
msgid "09873"
msgstr ""
"Once I'm over my cold, I'm setting\n"
"out to get more jewels and make\n"
"amends with Madra and Daila."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderWhatS"
msgid "09874"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what's wrong with\n"
"Briggs. He was feeling so\n"
"healthy and happy.{page_break}"
"He doesn't have a fever, and\n"
"he's not coughing, but he says\n"
"he's too weak to go out."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBabuBaBubabu"
msgid "09875"
msgstr "Babu ba bubabu..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeReGoing"
msgid "09876"
msgstr ""
"We're going to wait until\n"
"Briggs feels better before\n"
"we go out to sea again."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThereWerePlenty"
msgid "09877"
msgstr ""
"There were plenty of treasures\n"
"on that island in the middle of\n"
"the sea.{page_break}"
"If we get tired of waiting\n"
"for Briggs, maybe you\n"
"could come with us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeReallyWant"
msgid "09878"
msgstr ""
"We really want to make\n"
"amends. We just need\n"
"Briggs to get better."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSAll"
msgid "09879"
msgstr ""
"It's all my fault. If I hadn't\n"
"messed with that switch,\n"
"we'd have gotten everything."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAllOfMyTraining"
msgid "09880"
msgstr ""
"All of my training was for the\n"
"single purpose of reforging\n"
"the ancient trident."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMustBeIncredibly"
msgid "09881"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} must be incredibly\n"
"strong to get Briggs all\n"
"worked up like that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIJustKnow"
msgid "09882"
msgstr ""
"I just know she's going to\n"
"yell at us. The waiting is the\n"
"worst part. Next to the yelling."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThatSureComes"
msgid "09883"
msgstr ""
"That {actor_name:5} sure comes off\n"
"kind of high and mighty. I hate\n"
"those self-righteous types."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampa51"
msgid "09884"
msgstr ""
"I was just gazing out at sea,\n"
"and then I saw Briggs's\n"
"ship... I got all choked up."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAllThoseSailors"
msgid "09885"
msgstr ""
"All those sailors who didn't\n"
"join Briggs said they didn't\n"
"want to be pirates.{page_break}"
"Now that Briggs's going\n"
"straight, they want to join him.\n"
"I think they're just cowards."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsSaysHe"
msgid "09886"
msgstr ""
"Briggs says he's sick and\n"
"can't go to sea right now.{page_break}"
"But how can he not go? He\n"
"has to make up for all of\n"
"his evil deeds..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsSNever"
msgid "09887"
msgstr ""
"Briggs's never been sick\n"
"a day in his life. I wonder how\n"
"he caught a cold now..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEoleoIsYounger"
msgid "09888"
msgstr ""
"Eoleo is younger than I am,\n"
"but he acts like he's a lot\n"
"older."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMCertain"
msgid "09889"
msgstr ""
"I'm certain that there are\n"
"even more jewels back in\n"
"that cave!{page_break}"
"If only I'd had the chance to\n"
"grab a few more before that\n"
"trap blocked our way!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThereIsAbsolutely"
msgid "09890"
msgstr ""
"There is absolutely nothing\n"
"wrong with Briggs.{page_break}"
"I just know he's hiding\n"
"something from me..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOneOfPapa"
msgid "09891"
msgstr ""
"One of Papa's men touched a\n"
"trap, and that's why Papa\n"
"couldn't get all the jewels.{page_break}"
"Papa, I think you should\n"
"tell {actor_name:5} about that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSupposeWeWent"
msgid "09892"
msgstr ""
"Suppose we went to get the\n"
"jewels... How would we gather\n"
"them, with that trap in the way?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsIsJust"
msgid "09893"
msgstr ""
"Briggs is just pretending to\n"
"be sick because he doesn't\n"
"want to follow up on his promise."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWasAs"
msgid "09894"
msgstr ""
"I was as shocked as the next\n"
"guy that we couldn't reach\n"
"those treasure chests..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAtLeastWe"
msgid "09895"
msgstr ""
"At least we got some of\n"
"the jewels before that stupid\n"
"switch blocked us off."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheJewelsBriggs"
msgid "09896"
msgstr ""
"The jewels Briggs found\n"
"are truly remarkable.{page_break}"
"I wonder if there are any\n"
"more like these in that cave."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThanksToBriggs"
msgid "09897"
msgstr ""
"Thanks to Briggs, the Champa\n"
"can eat again!{page_break}"
"Unfortunately, all that food is\n"
"going to run out someday.\n"
"Then, what do we do?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBriggsSMen"
msgid "09898"
msgstr ""
"Briggs's men said they found\n"
"amazing weapons and things\n"
"in the cave, too...{page_break}"
"I wish I'd been there. I would\n"
"like to have seen them..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNowSThe"
msgid "09899"
msgstr ""
"Now's the time we ought to\n"
"be working hardest. While we\n"
"can eat, Champa can flourish."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeStillHaven"
msgid "09900"
msgstr ""
"We still haven't been able\n"
"to catch any fish for dinner.{page_break}"
"Not to worry, though. We'll\n"
"serve up the meat that\n"
"Briggs bought for us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSNice"
msgid "09901"
msgstr ""
"It's nice not having to\n"
"work, but it gets a little\n"
"boring after a while."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMostPeopleHere"
msgid "09902"
msgstr ""
"Most people here would love\n"
"a nice fish meal, but having\n"
"red meat is a nice change."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheOnlyWay"
msgid "09903"
msgstr ""
"The only way to find your\n"
"special purpose in life\n"
"is to work hard."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampaTreasureEncouragesLaziness"
msgid "09904"
msgstr ""
"Briggs's jewels have turned\n"
"this poor town into a wealthy\n"
"place, but he brought too many.{page_break}"
"Now, the hardworking people of\n"
"Champa have learned to be\n"
"lazy louts."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgChampaVillagersStoppedWorking"
msgid "09905"
msgstr ""
"All the people in town think\n"
"they can live without ever\n"
"having to work again.{page_break}"
"They've quit their jobs,\n"
"and they rely too heavily\n"
"on Briggs's find."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHoldOnTo"
msgid "09906"
msgstr ""
"Hold on to that tiller!\n"
"Do you want us to get\n"
"swallowed by the waves!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09907"
msgstr ""
"I know you're worried,\n"
"{actor_name:7}, but he's doing\n"
"the best he can..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09908"
msgstr ""
"That was an incredibly strong\n"
"whirlpool, but I doubt it could\n"
"sink us or destroy the ship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09909"
msgstr ""
"See, {actor_name:7}? There's nothing to\n"
"worry about. Even if we hit a\n"
"whirlpool, we should be fine."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09910"
msgstr ""
"But still... {actor_name:8}, can't you show\n"
"{actor_name:5} how to get past the\n"
"whirlpools and into Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09911"
msgstr "Er, yes, well..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09912"
msgstr ""
"What's wrong, {actor_name:8}?\n"
"Lemuria's just beyond these\n"
"whirlpools, isn't it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09913"
msgstr "Yeah, I...think so..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09914"
msgstr "You...\"think so\"!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09915"
msgstr ""
"Aren't you...{text_effect:2}from{reset_text_style} Lemuria?\n"
"Shouldn't you know exactly\n"
"where it is?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09916"
msgstr ""
"Yes, I'm from Lemuria... I've\n"
"never had to get back {text_effect:2}into{reset_text_style}\n"
"it before!{page_break}"
"And besides, the tidal wave\n"
"carried me out of Lemuria.\n"
"I didn't come through here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09917"
msgstr ""
"Oh, I see. So that must mean...\n"
"You don't actually know which\n"
"direction Lemuria is in, do you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09918"
msgstr ""
"Don't be silly! I mean...\n"
"I just need to get my bearings."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09919"
msgstr "Hm... That doesn't sound good."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09920"
msgstr ""
"If Lemuria really is beyond those\n"
"currents, then we'll need to find\n"
"a way to get through them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09921"
msgstr "And until we do..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09922"
msgstr "We won't be getting into Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaRecognizePsynergy"
msgid "09923"
msgstr ""
"Why, that was Psynergy,\n"
"wasn't it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09924"
msgstr "Are they Adepts?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09925"
msgstr "Who {text_effect:2}are{reset_text_style} you!?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09926"
msgstr ""
"Are you the ones who\n"
"defeated Poseidon?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09927"
msgstr ""
"That's quite something! Who\n"
"are you, that you could\n"
"defeat that leviathan?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09928"
msgstr ""
"But clearly, you are here,\n"
"and the beast is gone..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09929"
msgstr ""
"If you are strong enough to\n"
"defeat Poseidon, you are too\n"
"dangerous to enter Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09930"
msgstr ""
"The king's orders are clear!\n"
"We cannot grant you entry."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09931"
msgstr "King? Who is your king?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09932"
msgstr ""
"His Highness, King Hydros,\n"
"of course..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09933"
msgstr ""
"His Majesty has ruled over\n"
"Lemuria for centuries."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09934"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros has decreed that\n"
"Lemuria must be kept safe\n"
"from dangerous outsiders."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09935"
msgstr ""
"You say that we are dangerous,\n"
"but do you include me as well?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09936"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09937"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09938"
msgstr ""
"Did you join them in battle\n"
"against Poseidon?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09939"
msgstr ""
"Impossible! Everyone knows\n"
"you possess great courage, but\n"
"you still are a mere Lemurian!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09940"
msgstr ""
"Such comments do us all a\n"
"great disservice! I battled\n"
"fiercely alongside my friends!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09941"
msgstr "Leave our landing to me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09942"
msgstr ""
"You have my word that we\n"
"shall create no problems\n"
"during our stay.{page_break}"
"Will you not permit us to enter?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09943"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}, I know you are a\n"
"man of your word, but the king's\n"
"orders must stand!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09944"
msgstr ""
"You understand that we cannot\n"
"simply ignore the king's orders,\n"
"don't you, {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09945"
msgstr "What is King Hydros doing..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09946"
msgstr ""
"So, you people really take your\n"
"kings seriously, don't you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09947"
msgstr ""
"Insolent pup! Do not dishonor\n"
"the king of Lemuria! We are\n"
"peaceful, but quick to anger!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09948"
msgstr ""
"Pup? I must be twice your\n"
"age! Who are you calling\n"
"\"pup\"?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09949"
msgstr ""
"You wish to see Lemuria, and yet\n"
"you know so little of us! I am far\n"
"older than you. Show respect!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09950"
msgstr ""
"Pah! Older than me?!\n"
"Inconceivable!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09951"
msgstr ""
"Er... Actually, Kraden, these\n"
"two are perhaps older than\n"
"all of you combined..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09952"
msgstr ""
"Babi must have spoken of this\n"
"to you. In Lemuria, time passes\n"
"quite slowly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09953"
msgstr ""
"Ah... Well... I suppose I recall\n"
"something of that sort or\n"
"another... Maybe...{page_break}"
"But to imagine for a moment\n"
"that these two gentlemen are\n"
"older than I am? It's a bit much!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09954"
msgstr ""
"But perhaps I was rude, and\n"
"I hope you accept my apology.\n"
"My ignorance misled me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09955"
msgstr ""
"Well, just so long as we're\n"
"clear on that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09956"
msgstr ""
"But if your fighting is as skilled\n"
"as your wordplay, then perhaps\n"
"you aren't so dangerous to us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09957"
msgstr ""
"I agree. Perhaps His Majesty\n"
"will provide an exception in\n"
"their case."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09958"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros might be willing\n"
"to reverse his order if we\n"
"confer with him, wouldn't he?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09959"
msgstr ""
"We shall speak with\n"
"him at once!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09960"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros has been seeking\n"
"news from beyond the Sea of\n"
"Time. He will want to see you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09961"
msgstr "Wait here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09962"
msgstr ""
"How long do you think\n"
"we'll be waiting?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09963"
msgstr ""
"Good point. Time means little\n"
"to most Lemurians.{page_break}"
"Mere moments to us could\n"
"seem like a lifetime to outsiders."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09964"
msgstr ""
"You seem young to me, and\n"
"yet you are probably an old\n"
"man among your people...{page_break}"
"I would imagine that you have\n"
"probably done enough waiting\n"
"in your lifetime."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09965"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros instructed us to be\n"
"kind to the elderly at all times."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09966"
msgstr ""
"They seem trustworthy enough...\n"
"Shall we let them in?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09967"
msgstr ""
"I can see no reason not to.\n"
"We won't get in trouble, will we?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09968"
msgstr ""
"I will be with them! Now,\n"
"please, let me walk the streets\n"
"of my home once more!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09969"
msgstr "I beseech you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09970"
msgstr ""
"Then we place our trust in\n"
"each of you. You may enter.\n"
"But...don't do anything rash!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09971"
msgstr ""
"If you cause any trouble, we'll\n"
"hunt you down and exact\n"
"swift and terrible vengeance."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09972"
msgstr "Do we have your word?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09973"
msgstr ""
"Ooo! Ooo! Finally! What could\n"
"be waiting for me in Lemuria?\n"
"I can't wait another moment!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09974"
msgstr ""
"We've come a long way\n"
"to see Lemuria. I won't have\n"
"anything ruin it for me now!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09975"
msgstr ""
"But thank you for speaking\n"
"honestly. Sometimes, you can\n"
"say the weirdest things...{page_break}"
"I was actually a little bit\n"
"worried, to tell you truly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09976"
msgstr ""
"What!? Are you INSANE!? Or\n"
"maybe you think you're funny?\n"
"Because you're not!{page_break}"
"Maybe this whole quest is\n"
"just a game to you, but it's\n"
"not to me! Are you bored!?{page_break}"
"Do you want to go home!?\n"
"FINE! That's it! Then let's\n"
"go home!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09977"
msgstr ""
"Oh, hush. I'll keep a close\n"
"eye on them. You have\n"
"nothing to fear."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09978"
msgstr ""
"Very well, {actor_name:8}. We place\n"
"our faith in you, then.\n"
"Enter freely and peacably."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09979"
msgstr ""
"You must already be aware of\n"
"this, but you are not permitted\n"
"to enter the palace."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09980"
msgstr ""
"If the king were to find out about\n"
"this, we'd be in big trouble."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09981"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry! I won't let\n"
"that happen."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09982"
msgstr ""
"Is this Hydros really\n"
"so fearsome?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09983"
msgstr ""
"Fearsome isn't the right word...\n"
"King Hydros has lived longer\n"
"than anyone. He is most wise."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09984"
msgstr ""
"While everyone respects\n"
"him and holds him in great\n"
"reverence...{page_break}"
"It would be a mistake to\n"
"call it fear."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09985"
msgstr ""
"I certainly do not fear him.\n"
"The king... He..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09986"
msgstr "He what?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09987"
msgstr ""
"You will understand once you\n"
"meet the king yourself."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09988"
msgstr ""
"But that does not matter\n"
"now. Let's go!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09989"
msgstr ""
"To Lemuria... The city you've\n"
"all been longing to see..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaStayExploring"
msgid "09990"
msgstr ""
"Lost already, {actor_name:5}? That's\n"
"the way to the boat dock! You\n"
"can't want to return already!{page_break}"
"We've only just gotten to\n"
"Lemuria. We can't leave yet!\n"
"There's still so much to see!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaStayExploringAlternate"
msgid "09991"
msgstr ""
"Lost already, {actor_name:5}? That's\n"
"the way to the boat dock! You\n"
"can't want to return already!{page_break}"
"We've only just gotten to\n"
"Lemuria. We can't leave yet!\n"
"There's still so much to see!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThisPlaceIs"
msgid "09992"
msgstr ""
"This place is remarkable...\n"
"Truly remarkable..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09993"
msgstr ""
"Who goes there! I've not\n"
"seen you in Lemuria before!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09994"
msgstr "Wait a moment..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09995"
msgstr ""
"You must be the travelers\n"
"who arrived with {actor_name:8}. Is\n"
"your name {actor_name:5}, perchance?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09996"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}?\n"
"You mean {actor_name:8},\n"
"the Lost One?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09997"
msgstr ""
"Have I earned a title in my\n"
"absence? Well, worry not!\n"
"{actor_name:8} is lost no more!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09998"
msgstr ""
"I seek counsel with King Hydros.\n"
"Has His Highness been\n"
"told of my return?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "09999"
msgstr ""
"Word was sent, but I do not\n"
"know if it has reached the king."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10000"
msgstr "What do you mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10001"
msgstr ""
"Lord Conservato is meeting\n"
"with His Highness as we speak."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10002"
msgstr "Not Conservato..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10003"
msgstr ""
"What's wrong, {actor_name:8}? You\n"
"don't look pleased to hear\n"
"that name..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10004"
msgstr ""
"Kraden... What do you think of\n"
"what you have seen of Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10005"
msgstr ""
"It is a magnificent city!\n"
"Or do you mean the castle?\n"
"Both are magnificent!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10006"
msgstr ""
"And you, {actor_name:5}?\n"
"Do you agree?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10007"
msgstr ""
"Any newcomer to our town\n"
"would doubtless feel the\n"
"same at first."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10008"
msgstr ""
"Ah! Yes, you marvel not at its\n"
"present condition, but at the\n"
"greater splendor of its past!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10009"
msgstr ""
"In ages past, Lemuria was a\n"
"far lovelier, more grand, and\n"
"more lively city."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10010"
msgstr ""
"His Highness, the king, tells of\n"
"days gone by, of a more brilliant\n"
"Lemuria long before my birth."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10011"
msgstr ""
"Over the countless years,\n"
"our people have lost vigor,\n"
"enthusiasm, creativity...{page_break}"
"Lemuria has fallen into\n"
"slow collapse, a city that\n"
"has lost its spark..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10012"
msgstr ""
"Lemuria as you see it\n"
"is only a shadow of the\n"
"city of legend."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10013"
msgstr ""
"If only I had the chance to see\n"
"the city in all its splendor. But\n"
"how does Conservato figure in?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10014"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros believes that our\n"
"decay is related in some way\n"
"to Alchemy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10015"
msgstr "Alchemy!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10016"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros wants to find a\n"
"way to stop the ruin of\n"
"Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10017"
msgstr ""
"If there were anything we\n"
"could do to help stop it,\n"
"we would."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10018"
msgstr ""
"But the senators are unwilling\n"
"to take action! They're stubborn,\n"
"and they fear any change..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10019"
msgstr "Senate? What is a senate?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10020"
msgstr ""
"The senate is the group of\n"
"elders who determine policy\n"
"in Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10021"
msgstr ""
"Lord Conservato holds the\n"
"highest office in the senate."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10022"
msgstr ""
"The senate usually opposes\n"
"any new ideas or proposals\n"
"introduced before it..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10023"
msgstr ""
"Word of our arrival will never\n"
"reach the king as long as\n"
"Conservato has his ear."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10024"
msgstr ""
"And his conversations with the\n"
"king are incredibly long."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10025"
msgstr ""
"We have no choice but\n"
"to wait patiently here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10026"
msgstr ""
"Why don't we spend our\n"
"time looking around Lemuria\n"
"until then..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheKingIs"
msgid "10027"
msgstr ""
"The king is holding counsel with\n"
"Lord Conservato right now.{page_break}"
"It might be a while before\n"
"you can see him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheKingWill"
msgid "10028"
msgstr ""
"The king will be thrilled to hear\n"
"his trusted {actor_name:8} has\n"
"returned."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHowMuchLongerWill"
msgid "10029"
msgstr ""
"How much longer will Conservato\n"
"be in there? They've been talking\n"
"for ages now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHadHeard"
msgid "10030"
msgstr ""
"I had heard {actor_name:8} was\n"
"back, but I didn't believe it until\n"
"now...{page_break}"
"You seem much more confident,\n"
"{actor_name:8}. Everyone has been\n"
"noticing it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgICannotRemember"
msgid "10031"
msgstr ""
"I cannot remember the last\n"
"time we had visitors in Lemuria.\n"
"Not in a great while, certainly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaHasNo"
msgid "10032"
msgstr ""
"Lemuria has no disease, no\n"
"war... Anyone who saw it would\n"
"think it a paradise.{page_break}"
"And yet...all who come to our\n"
"city seek to leave soon after\n"
"arriving. I, too, wish to leave."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgInLemuriaWe"
msgid "10033"
msgstr ""
"In Lemuria, we do not grow old.\n"
"It must seem quite odd to\n"
"those from the outside world."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLifeNeverChanges"
msgid "10034"
msgstr ""
"Life never changes here in\n"
"Lemuria. It can get rather\n"
"dull, you'll find."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIOughtTo"
msgid "10035"
msgstr ""
"I ought to feel surprised to\n"
"see outsiders here, but I can't\n"
"remember how to be surprised."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHowOldAm"
msgid "10036"
msgstr ""
"How old am I again? I quit\n"
"counting after I turned two\n"
"hundred, and that was long ago."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItHasBeen"
msgid "10037"
msgstr ""
"It has been many, many years\n"
"since a new child was born\n"
"in Lemuria.{page_break}"
"Lemurians love children, but\n"
"they only remain children for\n"
"such a short time."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeAreThe"
msgid "10038"
msgstr ""
"We are the only children in\n"
"Lemuria. I often wish there were\n"
"other children to play with."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMeowMrrrfle2"
msgid "10039"
msgstr "Meow... Mrrrfle..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWoofRrrrrroof2"
msgid "10040"
msgstr "Woof! ...rrrrrROOF!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMoo2"
msgid "10041"
msgstr "Moo."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBukbukbuk2"
msgid "10042"
msgstr "Bukbukbuk..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBlank4"
msgid "10043"
msgstr "..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMoreOfThe"
msgid "10044"
msgstr ""
"More of the same, today and\n"
"every day. Nothing around\n"
"here ever changes."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIHavenT"
msgid "10045"
msgstr ""
"I haven't been surprised in\n"
"ages. I don't know what I'd\n"
"do if something happened."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIVeAged"
msgid "10046"
msgstr ""
"I've aged so slowly, I no longer\n"
"fear death, but at the same time,\n"
"I have no motivation at all."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSometimesIThink"
msgid "10047"
msgstr ""
"Sometimes, I think the buildings\n"
"fall apart faster than we age."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLongAgoA"
msgid "10048"
msgstr ""
"Long ago, a man named Lunpa\n"
"drifted to our island. That was\n"
"quite a surprise.{page_break}"
"Someone else came with him,\n"
"but he fled so quickly.\n"
"What was his name again?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgKingHydrosIs"
msgid "10049"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros is far older\n"
"even than I am...\n"
"How old is he?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEveryoneSpoilsMe"
msgid "10050"
msgstr ""
"Everyone spoils me so much...\n"
"I don't ever want to grow up!{page_break}"
"But in another 20 or 30 years,\n"
"I will be an adult. Oh well. At\n"
"least it's some kind of change."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAreThereOther"
msgid "10051"
msgstr ""
"Are there other children in the\n"
"lands beyond the Sea of Time?\n"
"Are there other people?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNoOneIn"
msgid "10052"
msgstr ""
"No one in Lemuria feels any\n"
"passion for anything. They're\n"
"lazier than a cat in a sunbeam."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgThereSSo"
msgid "10053"
msgstr ""
"There's so much treasure buried\n"
"here that you could dig almost\n"
"anywhere and find something...{page_break}"
"So why doesn't anybody\n"
"here dig?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriansAreSo"
msgid "10054"
msgstr ""
"Lemurians are so lazy that\n"
"they make me look like a\n"
"dynamo. And they live so long!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfItWeren"
msgid "10055"
msgstr ""
"If it weren't for the people in\n"
"the castle, the Lemurians would\n"
"probably let themselves starve."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgMotherWhyHave"
msgid "10056"
msgstr ""
"Mother... Why have you\n"
"left me..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors01"
msgid "10057"
msgstr ""
"I have never been outside of\n"
"Lemuria. I don't know what the\n"
"rest of the world is like.{page_break}"
"If there weren't laws prohibiting\n"
"us from leaving, I would be gone\n"
"in an instant."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors02"
msgid "10058"
msgstr ""
"Now that {actor_name:8} has returned,\n"
"maybe he'll share his tales\n"
"of the outside world with me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors03"
msgid "10059"
msgstr ""
"Who knows what wonders lie\n"
"across the Sea of Time... I'd\n"
"love to know, but...{page_break}"
"I can't stand places with\n"
"little culture and no advanced\n"
"civilization."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors04"
msgid "10060"
msgstr ""
"The senate passed the law that\n"
"prohibits us from leaving...{page_break}"
"But {actor_name:8} was carried out\n"
"to sea by the tidal wave. He\n"
"can't be blamed for that..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors05"
msgid "10061"
msgstr ""
"Are you the travelers that came\n"
"here with {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10062"
msgstr ""
"No? Ah, interesting. I wonder\n"
"when {actor_name:8} will come to\n"
"see me."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors06"
msgid "10063"
msgstr ""
"I was°what is the word?°\n"
"surprised when I heard\n"
"{actor_name:8} had returned.{page_break}"
"I hope that I get to\n"
"see him soon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors07"
msgid "10064"
msgstr ""
"I am sorry it has taken\n"
"me so long to visit, Uncle."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10065"
msgstr "{actor_name:8}! You are alive!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10066"
msgstr ""
"Yes, I've managed to survive\n"
"against a great many trials."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10067"
msgstr ""
"What a fascinating coincidence!{page_break}"
"We've stumbled across {actor_name:8}'s\n"
"uncle's house!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10068"
msgstr ""
"I must thank you all for\n"
"looking after my nephew."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10069"
msgstr ""
"This is {actor_name:5} and Kraden.\n"
"They are my friends, and\n"
"have aided me tremendously."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10070"
msgstr ""
"If my sister could only hear\n"
"how timid young {actor_name:8}\n"
"has become a mighty warrior..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10071"
msgstr ""
"Where is my mother? We've been\n"
"so busy since we arrived that I\n"
"haven't had a chance to see her."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10072"
msgstr ""
"Now that I think about it, this\n"
"place is a mess. What happened?\n"
"Mother is always so neat..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10073"
msgstr ""
"...No! She hasn't...fallen ill\n"
"again, has she?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10074"
msgstr ""
"There is still illness\n"
"in Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10075"
msgstr ""
"My mother was born with\n"
"a weak heart..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10076"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8}... I'm sorry... Your return\n"
"comes too late..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10077"
msgstr ""
"After the tidal wave washed\n"
"you to sea, your mother\n"
"suddenly fell ill..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10078"
msgstr ""
"The shock of losing you was\n"
"too great for her poor heart."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10079"
msgstr ""
"She held out hope for your\n"
"safe return until the very end."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10080"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps your mother gave\n"
"herself up to ensure your\n"
"survival..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10081"
msgstr ""
"Does that not sound like\n"
"your mother?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10082"
msgstr "Where is she now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10083"
msgstr ""
"She rests in the cemetery now.\n"
"Check the headstones... You\n"
"will find her."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10084"
msgstr ""
"What should we do, {actor_name:5}?\n"
"Should we follow {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10085"
msgstr ""
"After all we've been through,\n"
"the least we can do is offer\n"
"{actor_name:8} our condolences."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10086"
msgstr ""
"You're right. {actor_name:8} probably\n"
"needs some time alone right now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors08"
msgid "10087"
msgstr ""
"I am so relieved that {actor_name:8}\n"
"has returned to me alive.{page_break}"
"He is the last of my relatives.\n"
"Without him, I would be alone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors09"
msgid "10088"
msgstr ""
"Poor {actor_name:8}...\n"
"Being born in Lemuria and\n"
"gifted with long life...{page_break}"
"Only to lose his father in his youth\n"
"and his mother now. He faces\n"
"many long years of loneliness."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors10"
msgid "10089"
msgstr "Wait..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10090"
msgstr ""
"I ask that you leave {actor_name:8}\n"
"to his mourning for now..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10091"
msgstr ""
"Now he is struggling with\n"
"the loss of his mother.\n"
"He needs time."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10092"
msgstr ""
"You came to Lemuria to learn\n"
"more of Alchemy, did you not?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10093"
msgstr ""
"I suspected as much. {actor_name:8}\n"
"was right to bring you here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10094"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8} told me his secret...\n"
"The mission he was given\n"
"by His Highness the king."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10095"
msgstr ""
"Even had the tidal wave not\n"
"carried {actor_name:8} off, he would\n"
"have left us... Such was his fate."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10096"
msgstr ""
"You look confused...\n"
"{actor_name:8} told you about\n"
"this, did he not?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10097"
msgstr ""
"Of course... He must trust\n"
"you a great deal."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10098"
msgstr ""
"Curious... I can't understand\n"
"why he would do that..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10099"
msgstr ""
"If Lord Conservato had not led\n"
"the senate to oppose him,\n"
"he would have left sooner."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10100"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what news {actor_name:8}\n"
"has brought with him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10101"
msgstr ""
"Either way, I do know why\n"
"he has brought you here."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10102"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}... Don't tell me that\n"
"he hasn't at least told you\n"
"that much!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10103"
msgstr ""
"You say he's told you, but\n"
"you look rather confused."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10104"
msgstr ""
"Did {actor_name:8} tell you nothing\n"
"before bringing you here\n"
"to Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10105"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately, I know little\n"
"more than that..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10106"
msgstr ""
"While {actor_name:8} confronts his\n"
"sorrow over the loss of his\n"
"mother, you have some time..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10107"
msgstr "I shall write you a letter..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10108"
msgstr "So that you can see Lunpa..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10109"
msgstr ""
"Lunpa has locked himself in his\n"
"tower and rarely comes out, but\n"
"if I send him this, he will see you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10110"
msgstr ""
"All I need is a bird to carry\n"
"it to him in his tower."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10111"
msgstr ""
"There. You should be able\n"
"to see him now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors11"
msgid "10112"
msgstr ""
"Go to Lunpa's tower. He\n"
"will see you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors12"
msgid "10113"
msgstr ""
"Lunpa has given the king\n"
"tremendous aid on this matter.\n"
"He will have much to tell them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHouseOfThe"
msgid "10114"
msgstr "House of the Senate"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors13"
msgid "10115"
msgstr ""
"Are you the warriors from\n"
"beyond the Sea of Time who\n"
"returned with {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10116"
msgstr ""
"What can you uncivilized louts\n"
"hope to bring to Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10117"
msgstr ""
"Only savages and barbarians are\n"
"wont to tell lies when confronted\n"
"with uncomfortable situations."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors14"
msgid "10118"
msgstr ""
"Long ago, the power of Alchemy\n"
"was abused in ways that might\n"
"bring about the end of the world.{page_break}"
"Because it was sealed away, the\n"
"king claims, the world has begun\n"
"to wither and decay."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors15"
msgid "10119"
msgstr ""
"And now, rumors abound of a\n"
"group of fools who are actually\n"
"attempting to restore Alchemy.{page_break}"
"It is only because Alchemy\n"
"was sealed away that the world\n"
"has enjoyed this lasting peace."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors16"
msgid "10120"
msgstr ""
"Come what may, I cannot\n"
"approve of anyone setting\n"
"Alchemy loose on the world."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors17"
msgid "10121"
msgstr ""
"Has Lemuria fallen into decay,\n"
"I ask you!? Nay!{page_break}"
"Only by casting aside Alchemy\n"
"has the world been saved\n"
"from itself!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors18"
msgid "10122"
msgstr ""
"Do you seek to know more\n"
"about the draughts that provide\n"
"us with such longevity?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10123"
msgstr ""
"Once, Lemurians bottled special\n"
"draughts to leave here and\n"
"travel through Weyard...{page_break}"
"A man named Babi stole\n"
"the remainder of our precious\n"
"draughts and fled Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10124"
msgstr ""
"Then I shall tell you this:\n"
"So long as we drink of the\n"
"Lemurian Spring, we live long.{page_break}"
"We no longer leave our home,\n"
"so we have no need to make\n"
"our draughts of old."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors19"
msgid "10125"
msgstr ""
"Was that some form\n"
"of Psynergy?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10126"
msgstr ""
"Ho ho ho! We Lemurians are\n"
"masters of Psynergy all! Your\n"
"powers are not special here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10127"
msgstr ""
"No? Curious. But it does not\n"
"matter. Lemurians are masters\n"
"of Psynergy. It is of no import."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors20"
msgid "10128"
msgstr ""
"What does Hydros think will\n"
"happen if he sets Alchemy\n"
"loose on the world again!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors21"
msgid "10129"
msgstr ""
"Ever since Alchemy was sealed,\n"
"time itself has seemed frozen.{page_break}"
"In my mind's eye, I do not\n"
"see anyone who will go along\n"
"with the king's plan."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors22"
msgid "10130"
msgstr ""
"If Alchemy were loosed upon the\n"
"world, people would fight again\n"
"to control the Stone of Sages.{page_break}"
"Alchemy must remain sealed\n"
"away, if for no other reason\n"
"than to avoid this strife."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors23"
msgid "10131"
msgstr ""
"All of the members of the\n"
"senate must remain opposed\n"
"to breaking the seal.{page_break}"
"As long as we remain united,\n"
"King Hydros cannot take any\n"
"action to complete his plan."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors24"
msgid "10132"
msgstr ""
"Certainly, Lemuria has lost\n"
"some of the splendor that\n"
"once filled its streets.{page_break}"
"But to think that Alchemy\n"
"could restore this is\n"
"madness itself!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors25"
msgid "10133"
msgstr ""
"Even though we no longer\n"
"prepare the draught, the water\n"
"of our spring sustains us..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheDoorDoesn"
msgid "10134"
msgstr "The door doesn't want to open."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAreYouKids"
msgid "10135"
msgstr ""
"Are you kids {actor_name:8}'s\n"
"traveling companions?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10136"
msgstr ""
"The door's broken,\n"
"I'm afraid."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10137"
msgstr ""
"But I opened up a window\n"
"just above the door."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10138"
msgstr ""
"Sorry about this, but you'll\n"
"have to climb through there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaInteriors26"
msgid "10139"
msgstr ""
"Honestly, I'm amazed that\n"
"anyone can travel so far\n"
"across the world in this age."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10140"
msgstr ""
"Say, {actor_name:8} isn't with\n"
"you! Er...why not?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10141"
msgstr ""
"His mother passed away...\n"
"He's gone to visit her grave."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10142"
msgstr ""
"Of course... His mother... He\n"
"loved her dearly. A terrible\n"
"loss... It must be hard on him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10143"
msgstr ""
"Well, {actor_name:8} may not be here, but\n"
"we still have much to discuss."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10144"
msgstr ""
"If {actor_name:8} brought you,\n"
"you must be working to break\n"
"the seal on Alchemy, right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10145"
msgstr ""
"Ah, {actor_name:8} has done quite\n"
"well in finding you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10146"
msgstr ""
"That doesn't make sense... He\n"
"wouldn't have brought you to\n"
"Lemuria if you weren't helping."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10147"
msgstr ""
"What mission could the good\n"
"King Hydros have assigned\n"
"to {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10148"
msgstr ""
"What? {actor_name:8} has told you\n"
"nothing of his mission?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10149"
msgstr "...Really?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10150"
msgstr ""
"So you actually have nothing\n"
"at all to do with Alchemy!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10151"
msgstr ""
"Our parents were kidnapped by\n"
"the Fire Clan, far to the north.{page_break}"
"We are only firing the lighthouse\n"
"beacons to gain their freedom..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10152"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros told me that Venus\n"
"and Mercury have been ignited\n"
"once again. Was that your doing?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10153"
msgstr ""
"I'm afraid I know nothing of\n"
"any northern \"Fire Clan.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10154"
msgstr ""
"But that doesn't explain you, sir.\n"
"You're clearly not related to\n"
"these two. What are your goals?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10155"
msgstr ""
"Kraden joined us on this quest\n"
"on behalf of Lord Babi of Tolbi."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10156"
msgstr "...Babi?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10157"
msgstr ""
"I only know of one man named\n"
"Babi... But it couldn't..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10158"
msgstr ""
"Master Lunpa, the Babi we\n"
"speak of is the same man\n"
"you knew long ago."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10159"
msgstr ""
"Ah! So...he's still out there,\n"
"living in the outside world?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10160"
msgstr ""
"Well, that might not be the\n"
"most accurate way of putting it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10161"
msgstr ""
"Most...accurate? My, you\n"
"certainly have an odd way\n"
"of turning a phrase..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10162"
msgstr ""
"He was living, yes...\n"
"Until recently, that is..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10163"
msgstr ""
"So, Babi passed away...\n"
"But only recently, you say?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10164"
msgstr ""
"When he finally ran out of\n"
"his mystic draughts, his spirit\n"
"began to wane."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10165"
msgstr ""
"Then...I no longer know anyone\n"
"in the world outside."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10166"
msgstr ""
"But... Aren't you Lunpa, the\n"
"Righteous Thief?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10167"
msgstr ""
"I was called that once, long,\n"
"long ago. Why do you ask?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10168"
msgstr ""
"I'll bet there's at least one\n"
"person in the outside world\n"
"whom you still know."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10169"
msgstr "Who would that be?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10170"
msgstr ""
"There's a town called Lunpa\n"
"in northern Angara. A man\n"
"named Donpa lives there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10171"
msgstr ""
"I settled that village! And\n"
"Donpa... He is my son..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10172"
msgstr ""
"Now, your grandson, Dodonpa,\n"
"rules over your village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10173"
msgstr ""
"Rules? Rules is an ill-\n"
"sounding word."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10174"
msgstr ""
"But it's an accurate one, Lunpa.\n"
"Dodonpa is an evil thief, who has\n"
"caused much trouble in Angara."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10175"
msgstr ""
"What has become of my son?\n"
"How could he permit such\n"
"a thing to happen?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10176"
msgstr ""
"Master Lunpa, don't you have any\n"
"idea how old Donpa is?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10177"
msgstr ""
"He is as I am. An old man...\n"
"He may be older even than I."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10178"
msgstr ""
"If this news outrages you,\n"
"why don't you go and set\n"
"Dodonpa straight?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10179"
msgstr "If only I could..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10180"
msgstr ""
"Is this the only reason we're\n"
"here? To bring news of the\n"
"outside world?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10181"
msgstr ""
"You are kind, {actor_name:5}, but\n"
"there are much more important\n"
"matters at hand."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10182"
msgstr ""
"Yes, yes... I am sorry we were\n"
"sidetracked. We have much\n"
"more to discuss..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10183"
msgstr ""
"But before we begin, there is\n"
"one thing I must say..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10184"
msgstr ""
"You don't mind, do\n"
"you, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10185"
msgstr ""
"Clearly, your judgment on this\n"
"matter is fogged, {actor_name:5}.\n"
"I must speak."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10186"
msgstr "I knew you'd agree."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10187"
msgstr ""
"I have discussed this with\n"
"none but {actor_name:5}, but...I have\n"
"my own reasons for this quest."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10188"
msgstr "What do you mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10189"
msgstr ""
"Only that I have my own\n"
"reasons for wanting to see\n"
"the beacons lit again..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10190"
msgstr ""
"Why are you telling us\n"
"all of this now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10191"
msgstr ""
"Because I feel this quest\n"
"is deeply linked to Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10192"
msgstr ""
"I thought it odd that Lord Babi\n"
"should order me to research\n"
"Alchemy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10193"
msgstr ""
"Hey, wait a minute... Is this\n"
"what you promised to tell us\n"
"once we reached Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10194"
msgstr "Yes, yes... May I continue?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10195"
msgstr ""
"Long ago, before Alchemy's\n"
"power was sealed...{page_break}"
"There were many civilizations\n"
"as advanced and cultivated\n"
"as Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10196"
msgstr ""
"At the moment that Alchemy\n"
"was sealed away, most of those\n"
"civilizations began to wane...{page_break}"
"Until eventually, they vanished."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10197"
msgstr ""
"I have formed certain theories\n"
"now, suggesting that this may\n"
"be related to the seal on Alchemy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10198"
msgstr ""
"Let me get this straight...\n"
"You felt you couldn't tell us\n"
"this until we were in Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10199"
msgstr ""
"And you only wanted to come\n"
"to Lemuria to test your theories\n"
"and see if they were true..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10200"
msgstr ""
"But even if everything you\n"
"said {text_effect:2}is{reset_text_style} true, what does\n"
"it all mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10201"
msgstr ""
"If your theories are correct,\n"
"the world itself will wane and\n"
"vanish... Won't it, Kraden?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10202"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:8} never spoke of\n"
"this to you, did he?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10203"
msgstr ""
"If you came to this theory\n"
"on your own, you are indeed\n"
"a wise scholar.{page_break}"
"We would do well to trust you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10204"
msgstr "What do you mean?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10205"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros and I, as well as\n"
"others in Lemuria, hold the same\n"
"beliefs that you do, Kraden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10206"
msgstr "You do!?!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10207"
msgstr ""
"Civilizations thrive by building\n"
"upon the knowledge of the past."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10208"
msgstr ""
"Knowledge gained in one\n"
"generation should be taken\n"
"even further by the next.{page_break}"
"Thus, knowledge and learning\n"
"continue to grow. This is the\n"
"natural course of civilization."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10209"
msgstr "But where is the world today?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10210"
msgstr ""
"The great civilizations of old have\n"
"all withered and vanished. We\n"
"are all isolated and alone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10211"
msgstr ""
"You have encountered many\n"
"cultures in your travels.{page_break}"
"Are any of them capable of\n"
"building the great sanctums\n"
"and lighthouses you have seen?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10212"
msgstr ""
"No, they are not... But this\n"
"is not the only sign of the\n"
"decay you have theorized..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10213"
msgstr ""
"I think it best that you hear\n"
"the rest directly from His\n"
"Majesty, King Hydros."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10214"
msgstr ""
"Yes, Kraden! We shall go\n"
"to visit the king!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10215"
msgstr ""
"Ah, but King Hydros is in\n"
"counsel with Lord Conservato.\n"
"We might not be allowed in."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10216"
msgstr ""
"Conservato? That fool. He\n"
"refuses to acknowledge what\n"
"he can see with his own eyes!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10217"
msgstr ""
"I will meet with the king and\n"
"press our evidence upon\n"
"Conservato. Come with me!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10218"
msgstr "Gah! Stupid door!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10219"
msgstr "{text_effect:2}HAHHH-AHH!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10220"
msgstr "Pah! At last, you are open!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10221"
msgstr "To the king's chambers!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10222"
msgstr ""
"Lunpa ought to be as old as\n"
"Lord Babi was, but he has so\n"
"much energy!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10223"
msgstr "He's got a fire in him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10224"
msgstr ""
"I do wish I could have heard\n"
"more about Lord Babi, though."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10225"
msgstr ""
"But come, {actor_name:5}!\n"
"To the king's palace we go!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgKingHydrosAwaits"
msgid "10226"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros awaits you.\n"
"You are free to enter."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHisHighnessThe"
msgid "10227"
msgstr ""
"His Highness, the king, has\n"
"instructed that we let you\n"
"pass. You are welcome here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheyAreClearly"
msgid "10228"
msgstr ""
"They are clearly using Psynergy,\n"
"which makes them Adepts...{page_break}"
"But are they so important that\n"
"His Highness must make time\n"
"for them right away?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatDoesHis"
msgid "10229"
msgstr ""
"What does His Highness have\n"
"in mind? {actor_name:8}, his\n"
"friends, and Lunpa are all here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace01"
msgid "10230"
msgstr ""
"He is still in chambers with\n"
"Lord Conservato. Why is he\n"
"granting them entrance?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace02"
msgid "10231"
msgstr ""
"If you seek the counsel of His\n"
"Highness, the king, follow this\n"
"passage to the doors at the end."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace03"
msgid "10232"
msgstr ""
"His Highness never leaves a\n"
"meeting with Conservato in a\n"
"good mood. Good luck."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace04"
msgid "10233"
msgstr ""
"Conservato and the king were\n"
"yelling so loudly that I could\n"
"hear them from out here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace05"
msgid "10234"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros is the wisest of\n"
"all the Lemurian kings...{page_break}"
"But I understand why\n"
"Conservato and his senate\n"
"oppose the king's plans."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheSenateHolds"
msgid "10235"
msgstr ""
"The senate holds King Hydros in\n"
"poor regard because he favors\n"
"Lunpa's wisdom over their own."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace06"
msgid "10236"
msgstr ""
"Lord Conservato holds the\n"
"most power in Lemuria after\n"
"the king.{page_break}"
"I don't think he'll take\n"
"kindly to the advice of\n"
"outworlders like these."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace07"
msgid "10237"
msgstr ""
"Oh, dear! Using Psynergy in the\n"
"palace of the good King Hydros!?\n"
"What ill-mannered buffoons!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace08"
msgid "10238"
msgstr ""
"His Highness, the king, is most\n"
"temperamental, which is a rare\n"
"trait in Lemurians.{page_break}"
"Lord Conservato is calm and\n"
"collected, like a true Lemurian."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace09"
msgid "10239"
msgstr ""
"Lord Conservato only raises his\n"
"voice when he speaks with the\n"
"king.{page_break}"
"Their debates frighten me.\n"
"I can't stand the yelling."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace10"
msgid "10240"
msgstr ""
"His Highness is worried that\n"
"Lemuria will wither away.\n"
"What a ridiculous notion!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgITrustThe"
msgid "10241"
msgstr ""
"I trust the king. If His Majesty\n"
"is wrong, the fault lies with\n"
"Lunpa, not with him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10242"
msgstr ""
"I cannot let the secret of our\n"
"mystical draught ever reach\n"
"the outside world."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10243"
msgstr ""
"If the world knew our mystic\n"
"draughts were nothing but\n"
"spring water, we'd be overrun!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace11"
msgid "10244"
msgstr "You are Lord {actor_name:5}, correct?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10245"
msgstr ""
"Then you have no business here!\n"
"His Majesty is involved in a most\n"
"important meeting right now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10246"
msgstr ""
"It would seem the warriors of\n"
"which you spoke have arrived."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10247"
msgstr ""
"So it would, Your Highness.\n"
"I shall call them to us\n"
"immediately."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10248"
msgstr ""
"There is no need, Lunpa.\n"
"Let us go to them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10249"
msgstr ""
"Hydros! Would you see me\n"
"dishonored thus? They ought\n"
"to present themselves to us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10250"
msgstr ""
"I do not go to present myself\n"
"to them, Conservato. I am\n"
"merely going to where they are.{page_break}"
"I have something that I\n"
"wish to show everyone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10251"
msgstr ""
"Regardless of your reasons,\n"
"sire, I will not go to them!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10252"
msgstr "Do as you will, Conservato."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10253"
msgstr "However, {text_effect:2}we{reset_text_style} shall go."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10254"
msgstr ""
"I heard of your arrival. It is\n"
"quite remarkable that you were\n"
"able to reach Lemuria. Welcome."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10255"
msgstr ""
"Allow me to introduce my\n"
"companions. This is {actor_name:7}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10256"
msgstr "{actor_name:6}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10257"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10258"
msgstr "...And Kraden."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10259"
msgstr ""
"Kraden is the one who told\n"
"me of the outside world's\n"
"civilizations, of their condition..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10260"
msgstr ""
"Ah, Kraden! Lunpa describes\n"
"you as a remarkable scholar.\n"
"Your research impressed us."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10261"
msgstr "Thank you, Your Highness."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10262"
msgstr ""
"Your theories are correct.\n"
"Our world is now on a path\n"
"to destruction."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10263"
msgstr ""
"And who has decided this?\n"
"You, Hydros?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10264"
msgstr ""
"Some civilizations have\n"
"vanished, surely, but that is\n"
"the way of the outside world.{page_break}"
"Look around you: Lemuria\n"
"remains unchanged!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10265"
msgstr ""
"Don't delude yourself. Lemuria\n"
"has been in slow decline for\n"
"ages now, but that can wait."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10266"
msgstr ""
"My most trusted scholars have\n"
"reached this conclusion after\n"
"extensive research."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10267"
msgstr ""
"I sent {actor_name:8} to confirm\n"
"this for me..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10268"
msgstr ""
"So you admit it, Hydros!\n"
"You violated the directive\n"
"of the senate!{page_break}"
"You used the tidal wave as\n"
"your chance to send {actor_name:8}\n"
"away, despite our commands!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10269"
msgstr ""
"You are incorrect. The tidal\n"
"wave carried me away\n"
"by chance alone."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10270"
msgstr ""
"Conservato, you must know\n"
"that the tidal wave was caused\n"
"by Poseidon's return!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10271"
msgstr ""
"Only a fool would have chosen\n"
"to send a man to sea if he knew\n"
"that this would have happened."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10272"
msgstr ""
"What was it that you intended\n"
"to have {actor_name:8} confirm?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10273"
msgstr ""
"This map shows the ancient world,\n"
"when Lemuria still traded with\n"
"people on the many continents."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10274"
msgstr ""
"It was a great age...\n"
"A time when the world\n"
"shined brightly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10275"
msgstr ""
"And this...is the map Lunpa had\n"
"with him when he arrived in\n"
"Lemuria 150 years ago..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10276"
msgstr ""
"I used this map to sail around\n"
"the world. It is quite accurate."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10277"
msgstr "In-Incredible!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10278"
msgstr "You understand, Kraden..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10279"
msgstr "What do you understand?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10280"
msgstr ""
"Well, unless my eyes deceive\n"
"me, the continents have shrunk\n"
"since the golden age..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10281"
msgstr "That's insane!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10282"
msgstr "It is not insane! It is true!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10283"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps this will make the\n"
"point more clearly. Look at\n"
"these two maps side by side."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10284"
msgstr ""
"There's no mistaking it.\n"
"The continents on Lunpa's\n"
"map are clearly smaller..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10285"
msgstr "Lies! Nothing but lies!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10286"
msgstr ""
"What do you hope to gain\n"
"from foisting these lies\n"
"upon our people?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10287"
msgstr ""
"You know well that I hope\n"
"to gain nothing more than\n"
"the truth, Conservato."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10288"
msgstr ""
"And who do you expect will\n"
"believe such nonsense?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10289"
msgstr ""
"If you do not believe the\n"
"evidence before your eyes,\n"
"what do you believe?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10290"
msgstr ""
"Do you believe the Lemurian\n"
"map to be accurate to this day?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10291"
msgstr ""
"Tell me, {actor_name:8}... You were\n"
"able to investigate this\n"
"matter, were you not?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10292"
msgstr ""
"Thanks to {actor_name:5} and my\n"
"companions, I was able to travel\n"
"much of the Eastern Sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10293"
msgstr "And what did you find?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10294"
msgstr ""
"I found, in truth, that Lunpa's map\n"
"is the more accurate of the two."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10295"
msgstr ""
"However, the world seems even\n"
"smaller now than it appears on\n"
"Lunpa's map..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10296"
msgstr "What are you saying?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10297"
msgstr "Time itself has stopped..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10298"
msgstr ""
"Think of Weyard as a living,\n"
"breathing being, possessing\n"
"its own life force..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10299"
msgstr ""
"The four elements are the\n"
"nourishment needed to sustain\n"
"this being."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10300"
msgstr ""
"Kraden... This is exactly what\n"
"King Hydros himself has said\n"
"to me!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10301"
msgstr ""
"Ever since Alchemy was sealed\n"
"away, the world has been cut off\n"
"from its nourishment.{page_break}"
"It has gone into a state\n"
"akin to hibernation."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10302"
msgstr ""
"By using less energy, Weyard\n"
"prolongs its life..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10303"
msgstr ""
"Yet when hibernating, the being\n"
"has only stopped its own clock...\n"
"not the flow of time around it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10304"
msgstr ""
"When a bear sleeps through\n"
"the winter, it needs only wait\n"
"for spring to come...{page_break}"
"When it awakens, it can nourish\n"
"its weakened body again..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10305"
msgstr ""
"But if spring never comes,\n"
"the bear will eventually die..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10306"
msgstr ""
"Weyard is wasting away, its\n"
"continents shrinking, because\n"
"its spring has never come."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10307"
msgstr ""
"Hydros, how can you make such\n"
"outrageous claims? The world\n"
"is not alive..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10308"
msgstr ""
"Tell me, Conservato, why do you\n"
"think Poseidon has returned?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10309"
msgstr "Do you have the answer, Hydros?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10310"
msgstr "The elemental lighthouses..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10311"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} and his companions\n"
"have lit the beacons on both\n"
"Mercury and Venus Lighthouse."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10312"
msgstr ""
"What!? Have you any idea what\n"
"will happen if you set that evil\n"
"loose upon the world again?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10313"
msgstr ""
"You know that it could bring\n"
"about the destruction of the\n"
"world, and yet you did it anyway?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10314"
msgstr ""
"When the four beacons are fired,\n"
"Alchemy will be released, and\n"
"our world, destroyed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10315"
msgstr ""
"My lord, you cannot possibly\n"
"intend for these people to light\n"
"the remaining beacons!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10316"
msgstr ""
"I do indeed, Conservato, and I\n"
"also fear the possibility that\n"
"Alchemy will destroy the world."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10317"
msgstr ""
"But I cannot stand by, knowing\n"
"as I do that the world will wither\n"
"and die if we do not act!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10318"
msgstr ""
"This is madness, Hydros! Does\n"
"the threat of Alchemy mean\n"
"so little to you?{page_break}"
"Would you put the world\n"
"in even greater danger to\n"
"satisfy your theories!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10319"
msgstr ""
"With only two of the beacons\n"
"lit, I assume you intend to send\n"
"{actor_name:8} out again?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10320"
msgstr ""
"And I will go, Lord Conservato.\n"
"{actor_name:5} has need of\n"
"my power!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10321"
msgstr ""
"Then go, {actor_name:8}...\n"
"But if you do, say farewell...for\n"
"you will never be able to return.{page_break}"
"You will be banished from\n"
"Lemuria forever."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10322"
msgstr ""
"You know our laws. Are you\n"
"prepared for the outcome?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10323"
msgstr ""
"I myself am disgusted by\n"
"the whole matter. I take\n"
"my leave of you, Hydros."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10324"
msgstr ""
"But I warn you... I will {text_effect:2}not{reset_text_style}\n"
"permit you to go through\n"
"with this madness!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10325"
msgstr "What will you do, Your Highness?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10326"
msgstr ""
"I knew this outcome was\n"
"inevitable."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10327"
msgstr ""
"But I could not sit silent while\n"
"our world drifted down the\n"
"path of its destruction."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10328"
msgstr ""
"I want you to light the\n"
"remaining beacons before\n"
"you return."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10329"
msgstr ""
"That's what we intend to do,\n"
"but we cannot leave the\n"
"Eastern Sea..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10330"
msgstr ""
"I have already heard of\n"
"this problem from {actor_name:8}..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10331"
msgstr ""
"This is something I found\n"
"by accident in some ruins\n"
"back in my days as a thief."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10332"
msgstr ""
"I'm not sure what it is,\n"
"but it seems to contain\n"
"some powerful Psynergy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10333"
msgstr ""
"Seems to? You are\n"
"not certain?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10334"
msgstr ""
"It is a Psynergy that we\n"
"Lemurians are unable to use."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10335"
msgstr ""
"I understand you travel with\n"
"many different kinds of Adepts,\n"
"do you not, {actor_name:5}?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10336"
msgstr ""
"If we include {actor_name:8} in our\n"
"numbers, we have one Adept\n"
"for each of the four elements."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10337"
msgstr ""
"Then at least one of you should\n"
"be able to use the Psynergy\n"
"that this contains."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10338"
msgstr ""
"King Hydros believes the item\n"
"can only be used by one who\n"
"wields Psynergy of the earth."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10339"
msgstr ""
"If I am not mistaken, it\n"
"is a powerful Psynergy\n"
"we call Grind."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10340"
msgstr ""
"If you master this Psynergy,\n"
"the reefs that block your way\n"
"shall pose no trouble anymore..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10341"
msgstr ""
"With Grind, you should be able\n"
"to create a path by which you\n"
"can sail into the Western Sea."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10342"
msgstr ""
"Go, brave Adepts! By your hands,\n"
"may the remaining lighthouses\n"
"burn bright once more!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10343"
msgstr ""
"That Psynergy is quite\n"
"powerful. It can only be\n"
"trusted to a very few people."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10344"
msgstr ""
"That His Highness has given\n"
"it to you should illustrate how\n"
"great his expectations are."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10345"
msgstr ""
"I have no doubt that your journey\n"
"will be fraught with ever-\n"
"increasing danger...{page_break}"
"But we are counting on\n"
"you, {actor_name:5}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIVeNever"
msgid "10346"
msgstr ""
"I've never seen Lord Conservato\n"
"so angry before..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLordConservatoHas"
msgid "10347"
msgstr ""
"Lord Conservato has ordered\n"
"us to prevent you from leaving\n"
"the island...{page_break}"
"But I cannot see why he would\n"
"do something like that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMSureThe"
msgid "10348"
msgstr ""
"I'm sure the senate has\n"
"something to say about this.\n"
"What's going on around here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHowCouldLord"
msgid "10349"
msgstr ""
"How could Lord Conservato\n"
"expect someone like me to\n"
"believe that King Hydros...{page_break}"
"Would order {actor_name:8} to\n"
"destroy the world?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace12"
msgid "10350"
msgstr ""
"Lord Conservato seemed very\n"
"angry. Maybe that's why he\n"
"called for a senate meeting."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace13"
msgid "10351"
msgstr ""
"Both Lord Conservato and the\n"
"king want peace for us, so why\n"
"must they fight all the time?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace14"
msgid "10352"
msgstr ""
"Maybe once you have left,\n"
"the king and Conservato\n"
"will come to an accord."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace15"
msgid "10353"
msgstr ""
"Today, His Highness and Lord\n"
"Conservato were arguing more\n"
"loudly than ever before!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace16"
msgid "10354"
msgstr ""
"If Hydros plans to unleash\n"
"Alchemy upon the world\n"
"again, then I am against it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouAnd"
msgid "10355"
msgstr ""
"If you and Lunpa were all to\n"
"leave Lemuria, I think we'd have\n"
"peace and quiet here again."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace17"
msgid "10356"
msgstr ""
"The senate's reports usually\n"
"tend to influence the popular\n"
"opinion in Lemuria.{page_break}"
"I'll bet that is a constant\n"
"annoyance to the king..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace18"
msgid "10357"
msgstr ""
"The king's leadership is too\n"
"progressive... It's as though he\n"
"invites opposition.{page_break}"
"Of course he doesn't get along\n"
"with the senate. It's their duty\n"
"to protect the laws of old!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace19"
msgid "10358"
msgstr ""
"Whenever outsiders arrive\n"
"in Lemuria, it means trouble.{page_break}"
"{actor_name:8} has done\n"
"nothing but stir up trouble\n"
"by bringing them here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace20"
msgid "10359"
msgstr ""
"What will happen to us? Will\n"
"Lord Conservato be able to\n"
"stop the king's plans?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace21"
msgid "10360"
msgstr ""
"As long as I can live in peace,\n"
"I am happy. I suppose that is a\n"
"sign of growing old..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIKnowWhy"
msgid "10361"
msgstr ""
"I know why Lemuria ended\n"
"all its dealings with the\n"
"outside world...{page_break}"
"Lemurians want peace.\n"
"We desire no change."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace22"
msgid "10362"
msgstr ""
"Do not listen to Conservato.\n"
"We cannot let the world\n"
"wither and die.{page_break}"
"Go, brave Adepts! By your hands,\n"
"may the remaining lighthouses\n"
"burn bright once more!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace23"
msgid "10363"
msgstr ""
"You must sail to the Western Sea.\n"
"Do not worry about Lemuria.\n"
"Ignite the elemental beacons.{page_break}"
"Conservato lacks the conviction\n"
"to discuss these matters with\n"
"the people of Lemuria."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace24"
msgid "10364"
msgstr ""
"I think I overheard something\n"
"I shouldn't have... I'll forget\n"
"everything."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace25"
msgid "10365"
msgstr ""
"My people may not desire\n"
"change, but I cannot let that\n"
"stop me.{page_break}"
"I do this not for myself, but\n"
"for all those yet to be born\n"
"throughout Weyard."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace26"
msgid "10366"
msgstr ""
"His Majesty has come to this\n"
"decision on his own, without\n"
"the counsel of his advisors.{page_break}"
"This is why I must remain\n"
"by his side and support his\n"
"decision."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgLemuriaPalace27"
msgid "10367"
msgstr ""
"The actions of King Hydros\n"
"are treasonous. They betray\n"
"the will of his people."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheDoorIs"
msgid "10368"
msgstr ""
"The door is locked... It sounds\n"
"as if there's a raucous caucus\n"
"going on inside..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgFieldAddressCompanion"
msgid "10369"
msgstr "Umm... {actor_name:8}?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10370"
msgstr "Yes, {actor_name:7}? What is it?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10371"
msgstr ""
"There's something I've{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"been meaning to ask you...\n"
"Something I{pause_20_skippable} have to ask you..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10372"
msgstr "Ask me, {actor_name:7}."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10373"
msgstr ""
"You and I look roughly\n"
"the same age, but {pause_20_skippable}how\n"
"old are you, really?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10374"
msgstr ""
"Is that your question,\n"
"{actor_name:7}? It's not important!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10375"
msgstr ""
"It is to me. If you are much older\n"
"than us, then I'm afraid we've not\n"
"shown you the proper respect."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10376"
msgstr "She's got a point."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10377"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry about such things.\n"
"Please, treat me as you have\n"
"all along."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10378"
msgstr ""
"No, that won't do.\n"
"You have to tell us."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10379"
msgstr ""
"What!? Come now!\n"
"This is silly!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10380"
msgstr "No, {actor_name:8}! Tell me!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10381"
msgstr ""
"You're afraid you haven't shown\n"
"me the proper respect, and yet\n"
"you make demands of me?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10382"
msgstr ""
"Come on, {actor_name:8}...\n"
"You can tell us.\n"
"How old are you really?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10383"
msgstr ""
"This has nothing to do with\n"
"respect! You just want to know\n"
"how old I am, don't you!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10384"
msgstr "Hee hee!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10385"
msgstr "Heh heh!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10386"
msgstr "Oh ho ho ho!!!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10387"
msgstr ""
"I knew it! Come on,\n"
"{actor_name:5}! Can't you get\n"
"them off my back?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10388"
msgstr "... ..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10389"
msgstr ""
"You're in this too, aren't you,\n"
"{actor_name:5}? I've had it with your\n"
"conspiracies! I will not tell you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOh2"
msgid "10390"
msgstr "Oh!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10391"
msgstr "Goodness!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10392"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}! Look over here!\n"
"This palace is magnificient!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhereAreYou"
msgid "10393"
msgstr ""
"Where are you going, {actor_name:5}?\n"
"Let's take a longer look around!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgAreWeSetting"
msgid "10394"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}, are we setting\n"
"off now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10395"
msgstr "Then, to sea we go!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10396"
msgstr ""
"Please don't rush on my\n"
"account. Let's enjoy our stay."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWhatSThe"
msgid "10397"
msgstr ""
"What's the matter?\n"
"Can't you climb up?\n"
"...Fine. Just a moment."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10398"
msgstr ""
"You came all this way and\n"
"then got stuck here? You\n"
"can't be very bright."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10399"
msgstr ""
"There! Is that better?\n"
"Now climb up here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgDrinkingFromThis"
msgid "10400"
msgstr ""
"Drinking from this spring\n"
"restores vigor and vitality!\n"
"Want a sip?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheseTurtlesHave"
msgid "10401"
msgstr ""
"These turtles have lived in\n"
"the spring forever... It must be\n"
"the water that does it..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAndTheOthers"
msgid "10402"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} and the others\n"
"drank of the spring.{page_break}"
"Their HP and PP were\n"
"fully replenished!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgReadTheSignThe"
msgid "10403"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} read the sign:{page_break}"
"The Spring of Lemuria\n"
"Face away and toss in a\n"
"coin to test your luck."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgReadTheSign"
msgid "10404"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} read the sign:{page_break}"
"The Spring of Lemuria\n"
"Toss in a Lucky Medal\n"
"to improve your luck."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIfYouFace"
msgid "10405"
msgstr ""
"If you face away from the spring,\n"
"toss in a coin, and land it in the\n"
"target, good fortune will come.{page_break}"
"You've traveled a long way\n"
"to be here. You should give\n"
"it a try."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDLove"
msgid "10406"
msgstr ""
"I'd love to test my luck, but\n"
"I've used up all my coins. Maybe\n"
"I'll take one out of the spring!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIRememberAn"
msgid "10407"
msgstr ""
"I remember an outsider who came\n"
"to Lemuria and then spent {text_effect:2}days{reset_text_style}\n"
"testing his luck at the spring!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHeHadSuch"
msgid "10408"
msgstr ""
"He had such a good time, he\n"
"said he was going to build a\n"
"spring like this in his hometown."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgDoYouWish"
msgid "10409"
msgstr ""
"Do you wish to test your luck\n"
"at the Spring of Lemuria?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10410"
msgstr ""
"Well, then, I'll just take\n"
"a turn...{page_break}"
"If you change your mind,\n"
"let me know, and I will give\n"
"you a chance."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10411"
msgstr ""
"Go ahead.\n"
"Test your luck!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgYouLookLike"
msgid "10412"
msgstr ""
"You look like you're in for\n"
"a spell of good luck.{page_break}"
"After all, your aura glows\n"
"brightly about you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNoOneIs"
msgid "10413"
msgstr ""
"No one is luckier than him\n"
"who believes in his luck and\n"
"has friends who believe in him."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgSettlements01"
msgid "10414"
msgstr ""
"Don't tell me, you're here to\n"
"solve the riddle of the rock!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10415"
msgstr ""
"I don't want to scare you but,\n"
"I think you should reconsider.{page_break}"
"Even the warriors who survive\n"
"to make it back do so by the\n"
"skin of their teeth."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10416"
msgstr ""
"Just passing through? Here's\n"
"some advice for you:\n"
"Steer clear of the mountain.{page_break}"
"I don't know what kind of\n"
"treasure's up there, but it's\n"
"not worth your life."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements02"
msgid "10417"
msgstr ""
"I hear Kibombo has finally\n"
"chosen a new witch doctor.{page_break}"
"Maybe now, they'll calm down\n"
"and not be so aggressive..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements03"
msgid "10418"
msgstr ""
"There was a giant explosion\n"
"on the rock the other night...\n"
"I couldn't get back to sleep at all."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements04"
msgid "10419"
msgstr ""
"The mountain is called Magma\n"
"Rock, and it's cursed... No one's\n"
"supposed to go up there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements05"
msgid "10420"
msgstr ""
"We're lucky the river floods\n"
"over every season. That's what\n"
"keeps the Kibombo away.{page_break}"
"We were fine this year, though.\n"
"They still hadn't chosen a new\n"
"witch doctor, so they stayed put."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements06"
msgid "10421"
msgstr ""
"The explosions within Magma\n"
"Rock are called magma balls.{page_break}"
"They're formed naturally\n"
"near the mouth of the\n"
"volcano. Scary, huh?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements07"
msgid "10422"
msgstr ""
"You must be very brave to\n"
"come all the way here by boat."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements08"
msgid "10423"
msgstr ""
"There's a place called Shaman\n"
"Village in the middle of\n"
"the continent.{page_break}"
"Supposedly, one of the rivers\n"
"leads to it. I have no idea\n"
"which one, though."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements09"
msgid "10424"
msgstr ""
"The people of Shaman Village\n"
"are very wary of strangers. Be\n"
"careful if you ever meet them."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements10"
msgid "10425"
msgstr ""
"For a continent as desolate\n"
"as this one, there sure have\n"
"been a lot of boats here lately."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements11"
msgid "10426"
msgstr ""
"I think there's a cave down\n"
"at the end of the river. That's\n"
"the way into Shaman Village.{page_break}"
"I wonder if I should tell them\n"
"what the legends say... Nah,\n"
"they look like a smart group."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements12"
msgid "10427"
msgstr ""
"Long ago, Shaman was\n"
"ravaged by outsiders.\n"
"It was terrible.{page_break}"
"From that day on, they simply\n"
"have not trusted strangers\n"
"in their village."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements13"
msgid "10428"
msgstr ""
"If you want to cross the glaciers\n"
"of the Northern Sea, you'll need\n"
"magma balls...{page_break}"
"They come from volcanoes, but\n"
"the best place to get them is\n"
"Magma Rock, to the south."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements14"
msgid "10429"
msgstr ""
"A long time ago, we used to\n"
"trade with a village named Prox\n"
"to the north of us.{page_break}"
"But the sea freezes in winter,\n"
"and over time, it just became\n"
"impossible to get there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements15"
msgid "10430"
msgstr ""
"The people of Loho have a\n"
"legendary weapon called a\n"
"cannon that fires magma balls.{page_break}"
"That's supposed to be how\n"
"they crossed the frozen wastes,\n"
"but it sounds like a tall tale."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements16"
msgid "10431"
msgstr ""
"The Northern Sea is thick with\n"
"icebergs in the winter. They\n"
"can sink a boat in an instant!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements17"
msgid "10432"
msgstr ""
"There's nothing to the west of\n"
"here. AND it's really dangerous.\n"
"You shouldn't go that way."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements18"
msgid "10433"
msgstr ""
"The sea west of here spills\n"
"over a massive waterfall.{page_break}"
"You'll really start to appreciate\n"
"the grandeur of nature if you\n"
"see that, I can tell you."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements19"
msgid "10434"
msgstr ""
"The currents are so strong\n"
"near the falls that any boat\n"
"caught in it is doomed."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSettlements20"
msgid "10435"
msgstr ""
"My buddy thinks I'm nuts\n"
"to risk my life for a look\n"
"at the falls.{page_break}"
"Actually, I just want to get\n"
"my hands on some treasure\n"
"I saw on the way there."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeVeMade"
msgid "10436"
msgstr ""
"We've made these wings and\n"
"carried them here just to\n"
"fulfill a great prophecy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeMustBe"
msgid "10437"
msgstr ""
"We must be prepared to\n"
"attach these wings to\n"
"the sacred vessel.{page_break}"
"It is said that we will know\n"
"the time has come when\n"
"Mt. Jupiter is in flames."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeBroughtThese"
msgid "10438"
msgstr ""
"We brought these wings from\n"
"Contigo, and now we're guarding\n"
"them.{page_break}"
"If they were damaged or\n"
"broken, the prophecy might\n"
"never be fulfilled."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIWonderIfThese"
msgid "10439"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if these giant wings\n"
"will really make it fly... I'd\n"
"like to see that."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWeFirstHeard"
msgid "10440"
msgstr ""
"We first heard the prophecy\n"
"three years ago... The wings\n"
"have come a long way since then."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheseWingsAre"
msgid "10441"
msgstr ""
"These wings are so heavy\n"
"that they would sink an\n"
"ordinary ship.{page_break}"
"I wonder what kind of ship\n"
"the sacred vessel is."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIDoubtAnyone"
msgid "10442"
msgstr ""
"I doubt anyone could hurt\n"
"these sturdy wings, but we\n"
"must guard them just the same."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgItSKind"
msgid "10443"
msgstr ""
"It's kind of hard to imagine\n"
"what these wings would look\n"
"like actually flapping."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBlazeStoneEmber"
msgid "10444"
msgstr ""
"There's something burning\n"
"like an ember within the stone."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10445"
msgstr "Do you want to retrieve it?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10446"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} got\n"
"a Magma Ball."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgBlazeTabletInscription"
msgid "10447"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} checked the tablet...\n"
"There's something etched on it.{page_break}"
"Wielder of Flame's strength,\n"
"Lay your hands upon this stone.{page_break}"
"If th'art worthy, I will grant thee\n"
"the power to Blaze with fire."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10448"
msgstr ""
"Flame's strength? Hey, that must\n"
"mean it's finally my turn!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10449"
msgstr "{actor_name:6} touched the tablet."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10450"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:6} received the\n"
"fire Psynergy Blaze."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgContigo35"
msgid "10451"
msgstr ""
"Do you know anything about a\n"
"legend about these people who\n"
"could control the wind and air?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10452"
msgstr ""
"Well, the legend says that these\n"
"giants from Anemos built\n"
"Contigo with their wind powers."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10453"
msgstr ""
"That was the Anemos tribe.\n"
"They even had the power to\n"
"fly through the air!{page_break}"
"The people of Contigo inherited\n"
"some of their power, and now,\n"
"we rule over Atteka."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo36"
msgid "10454"
msgstr ""
"The beacon within Jupiter\n"
"Lighthouse will soon be lit.{page_break}"
"I know this because of a\n"
"strange premonition I had\n"
"three years ago."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo37"
msgid "10455"
msgstr ""
"I guess the people of Contigo\n"
"lost the power they inherited\n"
"from the Anemos tribe."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo38"
msgid "10456"
msgstr ""
"The people of Anemos possessed\n"
"power over the wind. They could\n"
"also see into the future."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo39"
msgid "10457"
msgstr ""
"When the power of Anemos is\n"
"lost, a group will come to light\n"
"the beacon against darkness.{page_break}"
"We had thought it was\n"
"nothing but legend, but\n"
"it is all coming true."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo40"
msgid "10458"
msgstr ""
"The Anemos geoglyphs show a\n"
"boat with wings sprouting from\n"
"its hull...{page_break}"
"The story goes that these\n"
"wings could make the boat\n"
"float in the air..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo41"
msgid "10459"
msgstr ""
"If you want to get a look at\n"
"the Anemos geoglyphs, you\n"
"ought to go to the ruins..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo42"
msgid "10460"
msgstr ""
"Our people have labored\n"
"for some time to build\n"
"the Wings of the Anemos."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo43"
msgid "10461"
msgstr ""
"The Anemos blood in our\n"
"veins often brings about\n"
"strange miracles."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo44"
msgid "10462"
msgstr ""
"Surely, someone will come\n"
"soon to light the beacon\n"
"atop the lighthouse."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo45"
msgid "10463"
msgstr ""
"The power of the wind is\n"
"not all that we've lost.{page_break}"
"We have lost much of\n"
"our culture, as well as the\n"
"technology to rebuild the ruins."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo46"
msgid "10464"
msgstr ""
"There were two siblings born in\n"
"Contigo. The older held great\n"
"power. Both are gone now...{page_break}"
"The younger was only a baby\n"
"when he left the village. I don't\n"
"know how strong he became."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo47"
msgid "10465"
msgstr ""
"I think Jupiter Lighthouse will\n"
"be lit soon. I don't know when,\n"
"but it will happen soon."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo48"
msgid "10466"
msgstr ""
"It's hard to believe, but the\n"
"Anemos really did have the\n"
"power to make ships fly."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo49"
msgid "10467"
msgstr ""
"The Anemos geoglyphs are\n"
"the most amazing carvings\n"
"I've ever seen..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo50"
msgid "10468"
msgstr ""
"We built the Wings of Anemos\n"
"out of materials we found in\n"
"the ruins of Anemos Sanctum."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo51"
msgid "10469"
msgstr ""
"The siblings who inherited the\n"
"powers of the Anemos aren't\n"
"in Contigo anymore.{page_break}"
"The younger brother was just\n"
"a baby when the merchant\n"
"known as Hammet took him away."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo52"
msgid "10470"
msgstr ""
"I'm sure the younger brother,\n"
"{actor_name:3}, must be grown up\n"
"by now... Is he still with Hammet?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo53"
msgid "10471"
msgstr ""
"My father doesn't approve of\n"
"the way I look up to Yegelos."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo54"
msgid "10472"
msgstr ""
"The families of children who\n"
"inherited those powers lived\n"
"lives of constant suffering.{page_break}"
"Eventually, they left Contigo to\n"
"make their fortunes elsewhere."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo55"
msgid "10473"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:3}'s mother left him in\n"
"the care of a kindly merchant.\n"
"She died shortly afterward.{page_break}"
"I think she died of sorrow at\n"
"sending {actor_name:3} away. She\n"
"wanted a better life for him."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo56"
msgid "10474"
msgstr ""
"I wish I could have inherited\n"
"the power of the Anemos.\n"
"Then I could be a hero."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo57"
msgid "10475"
msgstr ""
"Long ago, the people of\n"
"Hesperia attacked Atteka. Our\n"
"forefathers were not afraid.{page_break}"
"With the help of the great hero\n"
"Yegelos, we drove them off, and\n"
"they haven't invaded since."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo58"
msgid "10476"
msgstr ""
"A long time ago, the tribes\n"
"of Shaman and Contigo were\n"
"at constant war.{page_break}"
"Throughout their many battles,\n"
"the warriors Yegelos and\n"
"Hoabna formed a friendship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo59"
msgid "10477"
msgstr ""
"For a long time now, Contigo\n"
"has been without a hero. This\n"
"depresses our youth, I think."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo60"
msgid "10478"
msgstr ""
"Everybody thinks the people\n"
"of Contigo are strong, but\n"
"we just hate to fight.{page_break}"
"It's strange, because Yegelos\n"
"loved to fight, and Hoabna\n"
"was the stronger of the two."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo61"
msgid "10479"
msgstr ""
"Soon, the siblings with the\n"
"power of the Anemos will\n"
"return and fulfill the legend."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo62"
msgid "10480"
msgstr ""
"The power of the Anemos is\n"
"all but gone in Contigo.{page_break}"
"However, it sometimes happens\n"
"that a newborn suddenly\n"
"shows power over the wind."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo63"
msgid "10481"
msgstr ""
"I don't have any powers like\n"
"the Anemos did, but my sister,\n"
"Ahri, is different."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo64"
msgid "10482"
msgstr ""
"The baby's forehead is\n"
"furrowed, like it's thinking."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo65"
msgid "10483"
msgstr "Babu bawaba bibaw."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10484"
msgstr ""
"It sure is drafty in this\n"
"shabby old house."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10485"
msgstr ""
"When the Wings of Anemos are\n"
"complete, let's fix the house!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo66"
msgid "10486"
msgstr ""
"I just know {actor_name:3} became\n"
"big and manly, just like\n"
"Yegelos. I know he'll return..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo67"
msgid "10487"
msgstr ""
"A terrible misfortune fell on\n"
"the family of the siblings...\n"
"It's a terrible story."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo68"
msgid "10488"
msgstr ""
"Whenever my sister furrows\n"
"her brow like that, strange\n"
"things happen around here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo69"
msgid "10489"
msgstr ""
"Bawaba... It's hot...\n"
"I want cool wind, babu baba."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo70"
msgid "10490"
msgstr ""
"It was a longstanding tradition\n"
"that people in Atteka would take\n"
"a pilgrimage to Anemos Sanctum.{page_break}"
"Since we began construction\n"
"on the wings, everyone is\n"
"coming to Contigo to help."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo71"
msgid "10491"
msgstr ""
"Of course, they're here to work,\n"
"not to fight, so business is\n"
"still in the pits."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo72"
msgid "10492"
msgstr ""
"Mining materials in the ruins\n"
"is dangerous work, so my\n"
"armor is selling well."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo73"
msgid "10493"
msgstr ""
"Nothing else around here is\n"
"selling well, but at least I'm\n"
"pulling through all right."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo74"
msgid "10494"
msgstr ""
"The villagers are working their\n"
"hardest to complete the wings\n"
"and fulfill the prophecy."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo75"
msgid "10495"
msgstr ""
"Oh, how I want to see the\n"
"sunlight shining off these\n"
"wings up in the sky!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo76"
msgid "10496"
msgstr ""
"We've had so many people\n"
"coming to Contigo lately\n"
"that we're full, and I'm beat!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo77"
msgid "10497"
msgstr ""
"All the work on the wings\n"
"means that our inn is always\n"
"full! It's a good time for us!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo78"
msgid "10498"
msgstr ""
"Gotta make all the beds\n"
"before everyone returns\n"
"from Anemos Sanctum...{page_break}"
"Then, I've gotta get started\n"
"setting things up for dinner\n"
"before they come down to eat!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo79"
msgid "10499"
msgstr ""
"If I don't make dinner now,\n"
"it won't be ready in time for\n"
"all our guests to eat!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo80"
msgid "10500"
msgstr ""
"Did you just arrive in Contigo?{page_break}"
"Are you connected to the\n"
"prophecy, or are you here to\n"
"help build the wings?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo81"
msgid "10501"
msgstr ""
"The prophecies of the Anemos\n"
"tell that someday soon, a true\n"
"miracle will occur..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo82"
msgid "10502"
msgstr ""
"I worked myself half to death\n"
"yesterday. I feel miserable, but\n"
"I'll do it again tomorrow."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo83"
msgid "10503"
msgstr ""
"The Wings of Anemos are\n"
"nearly complete... I think I'll\n"
"take tomorrow off."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo84"
msgid "10504"
msgstr ""
"I'm afraid I'm too old to help in\n"
"the construction of the wings,\n"
"but I so want to see them fly..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo85"
msgid "10505"
msgstr ""
"When is that miracle of the\n"
"Anemos gonna hurry up and\n"
"happen? I can't wait forever!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo86"
msgid "10506"
msgstr ""
"I threw my back out helping with\n"
"the wings. I can't touch my toes.\n"
"I can barely touch my knees."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo87"
msgid "10507"
msgstr ""
"I want to see the boat\n"
"when it sails through the\n"
"air on our wings.{page_break}"
"But even more, I want to see\n"
"the hero of prophecy... Will he\n"
"be a real looker, like Yegelos?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo88"
msgid "10508"
msgstr ""
"The real miracle will be if\n"
"these wings actually make\n"
"a boat fly.{page_break}"
"However, I remain open-minded.\n"
"I hope we can see this miracle\n"
"of Anemos soon!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo89"
msgid "10509"
msgstr ""
"If I see the Wings of Anemos\n"
"make a boat fly through the\n"
"air, I too shall be a believer."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo90"
msgid "10510"
msgstr ""
"I've come a long way to\n"
"see the flying boat. I hope\n"
"the prophecies are right."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo91"
msgid "10511"
msgstr ""
"The wings are almost done.\n"
"We just need to get them to\n"
"the bay and await the ship."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo92"
msgid "10512"
msgstr ""
"The wings will be finished\n"
"shortly. Where is the ship\n"
"they're going to be attached to?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo93"
msgid "10513"
msgstr ""
"Which part goes where? Does\n"
"this metal feather connect\n"
"to that wooden post?{page_break}"
"It's like a puzzle, and it's\n"
"getting rather complicated."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo94"
msgid "10514"
msgstr ""
"You've gotta watch out, 'cause\n"
"you don't want to break\n"
"anything... It's delicate work!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo95"
msgid "10515"
msgstr ""
"Just a few more touches, and\n"
"the wings are done. All we have\n"
"left is to assemble them!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo96"
msgid "10516"
msgstr ""
"The guys carrying the other wing\n"
"haven't come back, and we're\n"
"almost ready to send this one!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo97"
msgid "10517"
msgstr ""
"I've been really busy lately,\n"
"but now that the second wing\n"
"is almost done, I can rest."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo98"
msgid "10518"
msgstr ""
"What do we do if we made\n"
"these wings, and then no boat\n"
"shows up for us to put them on?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo99"
msgid "10519"
msgstr ""
"There are too many parts!\n"
"I think I'm going insane from\n"
"all these stupid parts!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo100"
msgid "10520"
msgstr ""
"When I start getting irritated,\n"
"I just go nuts. I think I should\n"
"avoid getting irritated."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo101"
msgid "10521"
msgstr ""
"How long have we been\n"
"working on these stupid\n"
"wings?{page_break}"
"When I see that boat\n"
"soaring through the\n"
"skies, I think I'll cry."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgContigo102"
msgid "10522"
msgstr ""
"Have you taken a good look\n"
"at the Anemos geoglyph?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10523"
msgstr ""
"You can't see all of it right\n"
"now, because the wings are\n"
"covering up the picture..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10524"
msgstr ""
"Oh, that's really too bad.\n"
"The picture of the flying\n"
"boat looks so cool."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo103"
msgid "10525"
msgstr ""
"That sign has a translation of\n"
"the characters on the wall.{page_break}"
"If you're interested in studying\n"
"the sanctum, you should give it\n"
"a read."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo104"
msgid "10526"
msgstr ""
"I want to get a good look at\n"
"the inside of the sanctum, but\n"
"I can't get this door open.{page_break}"
"I'm hoping that deciphering\n"
"these characters on the wall\n"
"might give me the clue I need."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo105"
msgid "10527"
msgstr ""
"The merchant Hammet took\n"
"the gold in this room with\n"
"him when he left Contigo.{page_break}"
"He vowed to use the money\n"
"to raise {actor_name:3} properly\n"
"and give him a good life."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo106"
msgid "10528"
msgstr ""
"I can't even imagine how cool\n"
"it would be to see a boat like\n"
"the one in the geoglyph.{page_break}"
"But it's so big! I doubt\n"
"there's a boat that big\n"
"anywhere!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo107"
msgid "10529"
msgstr ""
"I don't know if anyone\n"
"in Contigo cares about\n"
"what I'm doing here.{page_break}"
"But I know that devoted\n"
"pilgrims will appreciate\n"
"having this translation."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo108"
msgid "10530"
msgstr ""
"Wouldn't that be terrible if\n"
"I got the door open and there\n"
"was nothing on the other side?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo109"
msgid "10531"
msgstr ""
"Someone told me that Hammet\n"
"went to a town called Kalay\n"
"and did quite well for himself."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo110"
msgid "10532"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} examined the wall.\n"
"There are characters carved\n"
"into it.{page_break}"
"Hmmm... I keep staring at it,\n"
"but it's not making any\n"
"more sense."

msgctxt "MsgContigo111"
msgid "10533"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} examined the sign.\n"
"The characters from the wall\n"
"are translated there.{page_break}"
"Some them are gates, and\n"
"some them are roads.{page_break}"
"Search with your heart to\n"
"find the truest path.{end_wait} "

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo112"
msgid "10534"
msgstr ""
"Turn the slot and get a prize!\n"
"The lottery slots are over here."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo113"
msgid "10535"
msgstr ""
"Drop some cash and double up!\n"
"The hi-lo dice are over here!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo114"
msgid "10536"
msgstr ""
"You never know what the\n"
"dice will do next! Come and\n"
"give our dice a toss!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo115"
msgid "10537"
msgstr ""
"It's good to have this much\n"
"business, but what happens to\n"
"us when the wings are done?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo116"
msgid "10538"
msgstr ""
"Once the wings are finished,\n"
"all these guests will leave.\n"
"Until then, I'll work my hardest."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo117"
msgid "10539"
msgstr ""
"I've got so much to do that\n"
"I don't even have time to\n"
"eat! I'm starving!!!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgContigo118"
msgid "10540"
msgstr ""
"I must be the greatest chef in\n"
"the world! Look at all this food\n"
"I've been making! I'm amazing!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanSilentVillager"
msgid "10541"
msgstr "... ..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanWaitForOutsidersToLeave"
msgid "10542"
msgstr ""
"Hm. Outsiders... I don't like\n"
"the looks of them. I'm just\n"
"going to wait until they leave."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanChiefForbidsTalkingToOutsiders"
msgid "10543"
msgstr ""
"Until the chief says otherwise,\n"
"nobody will talk to these\n"
"outsiders. It's the law."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanWhoInvitedOutsiders"
msgid "10544"
msgstr ""
"Who invited these foreigners\n"
"into our town?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanRefuseToTalkToOutsiders"
msgid "10545"
msgstr ""
"Ugh... Foreigners. I'm not\n"
"going to waste my time\n"
"even {text_effect:2}talking{reset_text_style} to them!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanAncestorsDistrustOutsiders"
msgid "10546"
msgstr ""
"Our ancestors learned a harsh\n"
"lesson... Shamans never lie, but\n"
"outsiders are never honest."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanTrustContigoFriends"
msgid "10547"
msgstr ""
"Our ancestors learned that we\n"
"can trust no one but the people\n"
"of Contigo, our longtime friends."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanDistrustFriendlyOutsiders"
msgid "10548"
msgstr ""
"These foreigners look\n"
"trustworthy, but I know\n"
"better...{page_break}"
"They may seem nice, but all\n"
"outsiders are wicked!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanShutDoorsAgainstOutsiders"
msgid "10549"
msgstr ""
"Shut your doors tight\n"
"when outsiders are in sight.{page_break}"
"If we want to protect ourselves,\n"
"our culture, we have to keep\n"
"outsiders {text_effect:2}out{reset_text_style}."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanEntranceLocked"
msgid "10550"
msgstr "It seems to be locked."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanTrialRoadPermissionSign"
msgid "10551"
msgstr ""
"Trial Road\n"
"None may enter without\n"
"permission from Moapa."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanEntranceClosed"
msgid "10552"
msgstr ""
"The entrance is closed.\n"
"You probably shouldn't go in."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanMoapaGiveMeRoom"
msgid "10553"
msgstr ""
"This is my house. If you're\n"
"looking for Moapa, here I am.\n"
"Back up. Give me some room."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10554"
msgstr ""
"Who have we here? Strangers\n"
"in Shaman Village? What is your\n"
"purpose in coming here?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10555"
msgstr ""
"Shaman Village does not\n"
"appreciate intruders."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10556"
msgstr ""
"You're not welcome here,\n"
"outlander. Leave now, and\n"
"never come back."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10557"
msgstr ""
"If there's something you want\n"
"to say, hurry up and say it.\n"
"I'll listen, but not for long!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanOutsidersLeaveTown"
msgid "10558"
msgstr ""
"What's wrong? Nothing to say?\n"
"Then what are you standing\n"
"around for? Get out of town!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanSpeakToMoapa"
msgid "10559"
msgstr ""
"If there's something you want\n"
"to say, say it to Moapa, not\n"
"to us. We don't want to hear it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanFearMoapaPower"
msgid "10560"
msgstr ""
"If you anger Moapa, you'll be\n"
"in for a little taste of his\n"
"awesome and terrible power."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanOutsidersAreNotContigo"
msgid "10561"
msgstr ""
"They don't look like they've\n"
"come from Contigo... There's\n"
"no reason for us to be nice."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanMoapaSparedOutsiders"
msgid "10562"
msgstr ""
"If it hadn't been for Moapa,\n"
"I'd have been glad to fling\n"
"these outlanders into the cold."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanContigoTempleTreasure"
msgid "10563"
msgstr ""
"Maybe they're looking for\n"
"treasure. They ought to be\n"
"looking in Contigo, not here.{page_break}"
"The temple near Contigo is\n"
"filled with treasures beyond\n"
"belief."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanShowMeSomething"
msgid "10564"
msgstr ""
"If you're here offering charity,\n"
"I won't have it... Or did you\n"
"want to show me something?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanShowItToMoapa"
msgid "10565"
msgstr ""
"What makes you think I would\n"
"be interested in this?{page_break}"
"Show it to Moapa if you\n"
"must, but I don't need it."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanCannotBuyGift"
msgid "10566"
msgstr ""
"Yes, yes. That's very nice.\n"
"Did you want to sell it? Because\n"
"I don't have any money."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanRecognizeShamanRod"
msgid "10567"
msgstr "That's the Shaman's Rod!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10568"
msgstr ""
"We thought it was lost\n"
"forever... It once belonged\n"
"to the great Hoabna."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10569"
msgstr ""
"Hoabna's staff was a gift from\n"
"his great friend in Contigo,\n"
"Yegelos.{page_break}"
"When Yegelos gave it to him,\n"
"Hoabna accepted a great\n"
"responsibility..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10570"
msgstr ""
"He vowed to care for the sacred\n"
"treasure of Contigo, the Hover\n"
"Jade...{page_break}"
"When the Shaman's Rod returns\n"
"to us, we are charged to give\n"
"the bearer the Hover Jade."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10571"
msgstr ""
"Have you outlanders come\n"
"to claim the Hover Jade?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10572"
msgstr "I suppose we have, yes."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10573"
msgstr ""
"That's a shame. We'll never\n"
"give the Hover Jade to you!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10574"
msgstr ""
"But...we brought you the\n"
"Shaman's Rod... What's stopping\n"
"you from giving us the jade?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10575"
msgstr ""
"Hoabna handed the Hover\n"
"Jade down from generation to\n"
"generation for our care."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10576"
msgstr ""
"We are to return it to the\n"
"descendants of Yegelos. And\n"
"you are clearly not from Contigo."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10577"
msgstr ""
"That's preposterous! We\n"
"returned your rod! We've come\n"
"so far already!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10578"
msgstr ""
"What difference does it make\n"
"if we're from Contigo or not!?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10579"
msgstr ""
"Make no mistake about it. We\n"
"are the intended recipients of\n"
"the stone of Yegelos."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10580"
msgstr ""
"Is there some way we can get\n"
"our hands on the Hover Jade?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10581"
msgstr "No. You ask the impossible."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10582"
msgstr ""
"What about...the test? Would\n"
"that be a bad idea, Moapa?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10583"
msgstr ""
"You know, Trial Road? Only\n"
"Yegelos could walk that path."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10584"
msgstr "The way of the vanishing sand!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10585"
msgstr ""
"Yes, if you outlanders intend\n"
"to claim the Hover Jade, you\n"
"must fetch it and bring it here!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10586"
msgstr ""
"If you people have the\n"
"courage, follow me! "

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10587"
msgstr ""
"If you'd told us there was a\n"
"test to begin with, we'd have\n"
"been out of your hair by now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10588"
msgstr "What kind of test is this?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10589"
msgstr ""
"I understand that you're a\n"
"little concerned, but unless\n"
"you try it, you'll never know!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10590"
msgstr "Give it your best, {actor_name:5}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanMoapaLeftDoorOpen"
msgid "10591"
msgstr ""
"Moapa left the door open, and\n"
"strangers got in... Ah, but they're\n"
"gone already..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanFatherNeverLoses"
msgid "10592"
msgstr ""
"The outlanders look like\n"
"warriors, but they're nothing\n"
"next to my father.{page_break}"
"He's the leader of Shaman\n"
"Village, but he's also just so\n"
"strong! He never loses!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanFirstForeignVisitors"
msgid "10593"
msgstr ""
"Those are the first foreigners\n"
"I've ever seen... They don't look\n"
"so different from us."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgShamanInnPaymentPrompt"
msgid "10594"
msgstr ""
"The card reads \"Put {argument_signed_number} coins\n"
"on the counter, and you can stay.\"{page_break}"
"Will you pay {argument_signed_number} coins?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanPayingStrangersMayStay"
msgid "10595"
msgstr ""
"I don't much like strangers,\n"
"but if they're willing to pay,\n"
"I'm willing to let them stay."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanMoapaAllowsStrangersToStay"
msgid "10596"
msgstr ""
"Moapa ordered us to let them\n"
"stay. I don't know why, though.\n"
"It's not like we lock the doors."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10597"
msgstr ""
"There's something written on\n"
"the card: \"If you don't have any\n"
"money, feel free to leave. Now.\""

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanTribeForbidsTalking"
msgid "10598"
msgstr ""
"Nothing personal, but nobody in\n"
"town will talk to you.{page_break}"
"It may seem weird, but it's\n"
"a law among the Shaman\n"
"tribe."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanVisitorsMustFindMoapa"
msgid "10599"
msgstr ""
"They'll need to find Moapa\n"
"if they want to talk to one\n"
"of the locals."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanYegelosSandChallenge"
msgid "10600"
msgstr ""
"To inherit the stone of Yegelos,\n"
"you must cause this sand\n"
"to disappear.{page_break}"
"If you can manage that feat,\n"
"then the blood of Contigo\n"
"runs through your veins."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanTrialRoadAncientBattle"
msgid "10601"
msgstr ""
"Just ahead lies Trial Road,\n"
"where Hoabna and Yegelos\n"
"fought their greatest battles.{page_break}"
"Only superior ones such as\n"
"they could have followed\n"
"the road to its end."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanAncientHeroesVanishedSand"
msgid "10602"
msgstr ""
"When Yegelos and Hoabna\n"
"waged their mighty battles here,\n"
"the sand suddenly vanished."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanRodWasStolen"
msgid "10603"
msgstr ""
"I know the truth. These\n"
"outlanders stole the rod\n"
"from Contigo.{page_break}"
"No matter. Their misdeeds\n"
"will be revealed to all when\n"
"they fail the Trial Road."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanNeedContigoOrShamanPower"
msgid "10604"
msgstr ""
"If they lack the power of Contigo\n"
"or the power of Shaman Village,\n"
"they will fail."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanSandChallengeWillFail"
msgid "10605"
msgstr ""
"They stand no chance of\n"
"making the sand vanish. They\n"
"will give up and go home."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanCheerForCompanion"
msgid "10606"
msgstr "You can do it, {actor_name:7}!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10607"
msgstr ""
"Leave it to me, {actor_name:6}.\n"
"This will be a breeze."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10608"
msgstr ""
"I don't believe it. They did\n"
"it! The sand vanished!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10609"
msgstr ""
"The legends... They were\n"
"all true!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10610"
msgstr ""
"She's the one! She must\n"
"have come from Contigo!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10611"
msgstr "Her?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10612"
msgstr ""
"She's the one that did it?\n"
"But she's...just a girl!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10613"
msgstr ""
"Well, you wanted the sand\n"
"to vanish, so..."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "10614"
msgstr ""
"Can we have the Hover\n"
"Jade now?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
