msgid "10763"
msgstr ""
"Your attacks showed skill\n"
"and speed, but if we meet\n"
"in battle again, I won't lose."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanVillagersBlameGuardDefeat"
msgid "10764"
msgstr ""
"I don't think the other villagers\n"
"will ever forgive us for losing\n"
"to you on Trial Road.{page_break}"
"If they had any idea how\n"
"strong you are, they wouldn't\n"
"be complaining."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgShamanClimbingTrialRoadIsHard"
msgid "10765"
msgstr ""
"Just climbing to the top of\n"
