"attributes and sometimes\n"
"even your class."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12246"
msgstr ""
"Each Djinni has different,\n"
"unique powers."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12247"
msgstr ""
"Once we have been set, you\n"
"can unleash us in battle to\n"
"use our powers."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12248"
msgstr ""
"So, {protagonist_name}, let me demonstrate\n"
"the power of my attack now."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12249"
msgstr ""
"See! What did I tell you? When\n"
"you unleashed me, I used my\n"
"special attack ability!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12250"
msgstr ""
"After being unleashed, we\n"
"Djinn will then stand by, ready\n"
"to be summoned back again..."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12251"
msgstr ""
"If you have multiple standby\n"
"Djinn, you can summon even\n"
"greater powers into battle!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12252"
msgstr ""
"Choose this command when\n"
"you want to unleash me in\n"
"battle, all right?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12253"
msgstr ""
"Then you can summon\n"
"even greater powers!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12254"
msgstr ""
"After a Djinni has been\n"
"used to summon, it must\n"
"spend time in recovery."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12255"
msgstr ""
"And once we've recovered,\n"
"we automatically set ourselves\n"
"again, so we're ready to attack!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12256"
msgstr ""
"That's all you have to do\n"
"to unleash a set Djinni!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgHey2"
msgid "12257"
msgstr "Hey!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12258"
msgstr ""
"You look like you already\n"
"know a little about us, huh?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgWellYouWeren"
msgid "12259"
msgstr ""
"Well, you weren't very surprised\n"
"when you saw me. Am I right?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12260"
msgstr ""
"No way! You? Surprised?\n"
"Nah, I can't believe that!{page_break}"
"I mean, look at you! You're\n"
"an Adept!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12261"
msgstr ""
"I thought so. I could tell\n"
"you were an Adept from\n"
"a mile away!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSeeYouKnow"
msgid "12262"
msgstr ""
"See, you know all about us,\n"
"so you must be an Adept."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgEvenIKnow"
msgid "12263"
msgstr "Even I know that!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12264"
msgstr ""
"You look like you're new around\n"
"here. Embarking on a dangerous\n"
"journey in a strange land?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12265"
msgstr ""
"I thought so... Well, I'm looking\n"
"for my companions... We were\n"
"parted when Mt. Aleph erupted."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12266"
msgstr ""
"Would you mind helping\n"
"me find my companions?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12267"
msgstr ""
"Come on, take me with\n"
"you. I'll even lend you and\n"
"your allies my powers!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12268"
msgstr ""
"You see, the more Djinn you\n"
