"and then unleash us in battle!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12270"
msgstr ""
"If you gather a bunch of us,\n"
"you'll have all that power\n"
"at your disposal!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12271"
msgstr ""
"So what do you say? Will\n"
"you be a pal and take me\n"
"with you?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgOhComeOn"
msgid "12272"
msgstr ""
"Oh, come on! I promise I won't\n"
"be a burden and eat all your\n"
"chips or anything!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12273"
msgstr ""
"But if I'm with you, you'll\n"
"be all kinds of strong!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12274"
msgstr ""
"Wait, that's not it... There's\n"
"more! Your allies will develop\n"
"{text_effect:4}exciting new abilities{reset_text_style}!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12275"
msgstr ""
"And I'll be your best friend ever\n"
"in combat! I'll be all over the\n"
"bad guys, I promise!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12276"
msgstr ""
"What, you want to see me\n"
"beg? Fine! I'm begging! PLEASE!\n"
"Let me join your group!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12277"
msgstr ""
"You just don't get it, do you?\n"
"I'm not used to being ignored,\n"
"you know. Take me with you!"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12278"
msgstr ""
"Don't be a meanie, OK? Nobody\n"
"likes a meanie. I'm serious\n"
"here.{page_break}"
"You don't really want to\n"
"leave me behind, do you?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgOhAllRight"
msgid "12279"
msgstr ""
"Oh, all right. If that's the way\n"
"you're gonna be, fine.{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"I'm coming with you anyway!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgIMSo"
msgid "12280"
msgstr ""
"I'm so happy! Oh, you won't\n"
"regret this, I promise!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgTheVenusDjinni"
msgid "12281"
