"The Venus Djinni {text_color:5}{argument_ability_name}{text_color:16}\n"
"has become {protagonist_name}'s pal."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12282"
msgstr ""
"While I'm here, would you like\n"
"me to give you a quick\n"
"explanation about Djinn?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgAfterBringingA"
