"set it to somebody."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgNextILl"
msgid "12284"
msgstr ""
"Next, I'll show you how you\n"
"can use us in battle."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSeeWeDjinn"
msgid "12285"
msgstr ""
"See! We Djinn can be\n"
"pretty useful, can't we?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12286"
msgstr "But...there's one more thing."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgSoWeGo"
