"to standby to recovery,\n"
"then back to set."

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12288"
msgstr ""
"That's just a simple little\n"
"explanation of how to use us."

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12289"
msgstr "Did you get all that?"

#, alchemy-end-now
msgctxt "MsgHmmmmDoYou"
msgid "12290"
msgstr ""
"Hmmmm...{pause_20_skippable} Do you want me to\n"
"explain it all to you again?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12291"
msgstr ""
"Well, then, I guess I'll go back\n"
"to the beginning, OK?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "MsgWellThatS"
msgid "12292"
msgstr ""
"Well, that's it. Now, we're\n"
"pals forever!"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12293"
msgstr ""
"Oh, yeah! If you want to\n"
"learn more about Djinn,\n"
"refer to the help, OK?"

#, alchemy-end-wait
msgctxt "message"
msgid "12294"
msgstr ""
"You and your friends should\n"
"make sure you get the most\n"
"out of us Djinn."

